# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Administrator-issued token:** The role mints a Gitea personal access token named ``gitea-mcp`` for the ``administrator`` account with the read-only scope set ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, and persists it in the token store MCP clients read. Every deploy asks the API whether the stored token still authenticates, revokes the stale entry under that name, and re-mints when the API rejects it. The deploy fails if the fresh token is rejected too."
msgstr "**Creideamh a eisíodh:** An ról mionts Gitea rochtain pearsanta chomhartha ainmnithe ``gitea-mcp`` do na ``administrator`` cuntas a thabhairt leis an tacar raon feidhme léamh amháin ``read:repository,read:issue,read:user,read:organization,read:notification``, agus leanann sé sa siopa chomhartha MCP cliaint léamh. Iarrann gach imscaradh an API cibé an fíoraíonn an dearbhán stóráilte fós, an iontráil stale faoin ainm sin a chúlghairm, agus ath-imní nuair a dhiúltaíonn an API é. theipeann ar an imscaradh má dhiúltaítear an dearbhán úr freisin."

