msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Tá Painéal na nIonstraimí Gníomhaire poiblí taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` agus `web-app-openclaw` lean an caighdeán `web-app-*` conradh: fearainn Canonical féin, ródú droim ar ais, SSO i bhfeidhm trí [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Úsáideann Hermes a tacaíocht OIDC dúchais féin-óstáil. OpenClaw OIDC dúchais unverified upstream: más rud é as láthair, suíonn an Painéal na nIonstraimí taobh thiar de na ardán patrún auth-proxy caighdeánach (SSO i bhfeidhm ag an seachfhreastalaí, dearbhán OpenClaw féin ag fanacht go hinmheánach-amháin). Níl dromchla poiblí admhaithe ar bhealach."

