# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**An agent can be provisioned with its own platform user account.** Creating an agent employee optionally provisions a dedicated identity through the platform's existing user mechanism (the `users` lookup, LDAP via [`svc-db-openldap`](../../roles/svc-db-openldap/), SSO via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/)); no new account system is built. The account is a **non-privileged standard user** by default (never administrator/service-account-with-mutating-tools). When enabled, the agent authenticates as its own user: OIDC login to its dashboard, a distinct mailbox/identity, and MCP calls made with `auth_subject: user` ([025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)) scoped to that account rather than a shared service account. The account is opt-in per agent; its password/token lives in the role's `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` block, never in README or env. An agent MUST also be deployable against an existing account (no forced account creation)."
msgstr "**Is féidir gníomhaire a sholáthar lena chuntas úsáideora ardán féin.** Gníomhaire a chruthú fostaí forálacha roghnacha féiniúlacht tiomanta tríd an ardán meicníocht úsáideora atá ann cheana féin (an `users` Lookup, LDAP via [`svc-db-openldap`](../../roles/svc-db-openldap/), SSO via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/)); Tá aon chóras cuntas nua tógtha. Is é an cuntas **neamh-privileged úsáideoir caighdeánach** riachtanais uisce: measartha (riamh riarthóir / seirbhís-cuntas-le-mutating-uirlisí). Nuair a chumasú, fíoraíonn an gníomhaire mar a úsáideoir féin: OIDC logáil isteach ar a Painéal na nIonstraimí, bosca poist ar leith / aitheantas, agus glaonna MCP a rinneadh le `auth_subject: user` ([025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)) raon feidhme leis an gcuntas sin seachas cuntas seirbhíse roinnte. Is é an cuntas rogha in aghaidh an ghníomhaire; a focal faire / cónaí comhartha sa ról `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` bloc, riamh i README nó env. Beidh gníomhaire MUST inscartha freisin i gcoinne cuntais reatha (aon chruthú cuntas éigean)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**An engine inside its consumer's project** — matrix with its own postgres, for instance — is started service by service rather than as a whole project, because bringing the project up would start the consumer and the chain refuses to replay while one runs. The discriminator is the dump's volume name against its project name: equal for the central engines (`postgres` in project `postgres`), different for a per-app one (`matrix_database` in project `matrix`)."
msgstr "**inneall taobh istigh de thionscadal an tomhaltóra** — Cuirtear maitrís lena iarchéim féin, mar shampla — tús le seirbhís de réir seirbhíse seachas mar thionscadal iomlán, toisc go dtosódh an tionscadal suas an tomhaltóir agus go ndiúltaíonn an slabhra athimirt agus ritheann sé ceann. Is é an discriminator ainm toirt an dump i gcoinne a ainm tionscadail: comhionann le haghaidh na n-inneall lárnach (`postgres` i dtionscadal `postgres`), difriúil le haghaidh ceann per-app (`matrix_database` i dtionscadal `matrix`)."

