# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Built-in Database Access:** Seamlessly interact with the underlying MariaDB for your Git service."
msgstr "**Tógtha-i Database Access:** Idirghníomhú gan staonadh leis an MariaDB bunúsacha do do sheirbhís Git."

