# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` exists."
msgstr "**Clár na dToghthóirí Elasticsearch:** Longa inneall cuardaigh leis an ról go dtí lárnach ``svc-db-elasticsearch`` ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Bundled Elasticsearch:** Search engine ships with the role until a central `svc-db-elasticsearch` exists."
msgstr "**Clár na dToghthóirí Elasticsearch:** Longa inneall cuardaigh leis an ról go dtí lárnach `svc-db-elasticsearch` ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN Cache (Cloudflare):** If your domain is proxied through Cloudflare, Cloudflare may cache your content at their edge servers and serve it from there, often without requests reaching your origin server."
msgstr "**Déan teagmháil linn (cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú):** Má tá do fearainn proxied trí Cloudflare, Is féidir Cloudflare taisce do ábhar ag a gcuid freastalaithe imeall agus é a sheirbheáil ó ann, go minic gan iarrataí a bhaint amach do fhreastalaí tionscnaimh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN-backed delivery:** Declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes."
msgstr "**CDN-aiseolas a sheachadadh:** Amharc ar gach eolas ``web-svc-cdn`` mar an sruthú a fhreastalaíonn ar na bytes CSS iarbhír."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CDN-backed delivery:** Declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes."
msgstr "**CDN-aiseolas a sheachadadh:** Amharc ar gach eolas `web-svc-cdn` mar an sruthú a fhreastalaíonn ar na bytes CSS iarbhír."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI DNS & Defaults:** Introduced CoreDNS-based *.localhost resolution (A/AAAA to loopback), set DOMAIN_PRIMARY to localhost, added DNS assertions and a strict default 404 vhost to stabilize early CI stages."
msgstr "**CI DNS & lochtanna:** CroíDNS-bhunaithe tugtha isteach *.localhost réiteach (A/AAAAA a lúbadh), leagtha DOMAIN_PRIMARY go localhost, Chuir dearbhuithe DNS agus mainneachtain dian 404 vhost a chobhsú céimeanna CI luath."

msgid "**CI Debugging:** Greatly improved CI diagnostics by dumping resolved docker compose configuration and environment data in debug mode, with optional unmasked .env output."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI Optimized:** Prevents GitHub Actions images from growing uncontrollably."
msgstr "**CI Optamaithe:** Cosc GitHub Gníomhaíochtaí íomhánna ó fás uncontrollably."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests**"
msgstr "**CI agus Tástáil**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and Tests:** New integration tests for portable python shebangs, forbid *sh -lc* with *pipefail*, and improved variable checks. CI stability improvements for per distro stacks and mirror resolver via venv Python, plus more robust package manager retries."
msgstr "**CI agus Tástáil:** tástálacha comhtháthú nua do shebangs python iniompartha, forbid *An bhfuil a fhios agat?* le *píopa tolgil*, agus seiceálacha athróg feabhsaithe. Feabhsuithe cobhsaíochta CI do gach stoic distro agus réiteoir scáthán trí venv Python, móide retries bainisteoir pacáiste níos láidre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI and diagnostics.** Deployment runs are planned separately per mode and divided into starred priority and regular lines, with branch-new roles scheduled first. Matrix entries serialize across branches, large lines serialize their deployment modes, and failed roles can be retriggered on the original distribution set; *--strict* limits this to hard failures. Cancelled runs can have their failed jobs rerun, and role failures on *main* open or update dedicated issues. Deployment stages are sourced from *categories.yml*."
msgstr "**CI agus diagnóisic.** Ritheann imscaradh atá beartaithe ar leithligh in aghaidh an mód agus roinnte i línte tosaíochta agus rialta starred, le rólanna brainse-nua sceidealta ar dtús. Iontrálacha Maitrís srathachú ar fud na brainsí, línte móra srathachú a modhanna imscaradh, agus is féidir róil theip a retriggered ar an sraith dáileadh bunaidh; *- Srianta* teorainneacha seo le teipeanna crua. Is féidir go mbeadh a gcuid post theip rerun, agus teipeanna ról ar *príomhthionscadal* saincheisteanna tiomnaithe oscailte nó cothrom le dáta. céimeanna imscaradh a fháil ó *categories.yml*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI deploys only the variants a change reaches.** An image bump in a provider no longer redeploys the variants of its consumers that switch that provider off. The diff-derived whitelist, used by the weekly update PRs, Dependabot and every other diff-driven run, narrows each affected role to the variants whose round closure still reaches a changed role, emitted as *role#0,2* selection tokens. A changed role and a role reached only through *run_after* keep every variant. A pinned token naming a role that discovery does not return now warns instead of aborting the run; role names are still checked against *roles/* before the run starts."
msgstr "**CI imscaradh ach na leaganacha sroicheann athrú.** An bump íomhá i soláthraí a thuilleadh redeploys na leaganacha a thomhaltóirí a athrú go soláthraí as. An diff-derived whitelist, a úsáidtear ag an PRs cothrom le dáta seachtainiúil, Spleáchas agus gach reáchtáil diff-tiomáinte eile, Cúng gach ról difear do na leaganacha a dúnadh bhabhta shroich fós ról athraithe, astaítear mar *ról # #0,2* tokens roghnú. Ról athraithe agus ról bainte amach ach amháin trí *run_after* a choinneáil ar gach leagan. A chomhartha pinned ainmniú ról nach bhfuil fionnachtain ar ais anois warns in ionad aborting an rith; ainmneacha ról a sheiceáil fós i gcoinne *Róil/róil* sula dtosaíonn an rith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI images are built natively per architecture and published as one tag per distro.** Each architecture builds on its own runner, and [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) pushes the result by digest only, so no per-architecture tag exists. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) then publishes the plain `<tag>` as a manifest list over every architecture's digest. Every consumer pulls the plain tag and gets the image matching its machine."
msgstr "**íomhánna CI tógtha ó dhúchas in aghaidh an ailtireacht agus a foilsíodh mar chlib amháin in aghaidh an distro.** Tógann gach ailtireacht ar a dara háit féin, agus [push.sh](../../../scripts/image/push.sh) pushes an toradh trí díolama amháin, mar sin níl aon chlib per-architecture ann. [manifest_all.sh](../../../scripts/image/manifest_all.sh) ansin a fhoilsiú ar an plain `<tag>` mar liosta follasach thar gach ailtireacht ar díolama. Gach tomhaltóir pulls an chlib plain agus faigheann an íomhá meaitseáil a meaisín."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runner-split.** The deploy-matrix discovery ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), wired via [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) gives every variant its own matrix entry (runner): a 5-variant role becomes five rows `0`…`4`, each carrying the deploy mode and tor state the sweep rotation assigned it. Each runner receives its variant through the `variant` env (consumed by `--variant`). Which rows a given run deploys is decided by the chunker ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py)), not by bundling."
msgstr "**CI dara háit-split.** An imscaradh-matrix fionnachtain ([axes.py](../../../utils/github/variant/axes.py), sreangaithe via [output_apps.sh](../../../scripts/github/resolve/output_apps.sh)) Tugann gach leagan a iontráil maitrís féin (dara háit): a 5- thiocfaidh chun bheith ról athraitheach cúig sraitheanna `0`...`4`, gach iompar an modh imscaradh agus tor stáit an rothlú sweep shanntar é. Faigheann gach dara háit a mhalairt tríd an `variant` an Ríocht Aontaithe (arna gcaitheamh ag `--variant`). Cé acu sraitheanna ar imscaradhs reáchtáil ar leith a chinneann an smután ([chunks.py](../../../cli/meta/ci/chunks.py)), ní ag bundling."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI runs a real Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` against the minted onion) with retry logic; unit tests remain the merge-blocking base."
msgstr "**Ritheann CI fíor Tor E2E** (`torsocks curl` i gcoinne an oinniún minted) le loighic retry; tástálacha aonaid fós an bonn chumasc-blocála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CI selects, resumes and proves.** A fourth deploy chunk stops a short priority chunk stranding budget, a manual run can set the chunk size the formula would derive, and a retrigger can override the chunk gate. Retriggering works by role and by what never got a verdict, resumes behind the green window rather than the deployed one, retires suites the source run already passed, and cancels the run before retriggering its failed roles. Each role's README instructions are replayed on its smallest deploy row, in the mode its *services.yml* declares. Distro images build concurrently on one runner, the matrix job folds into the image job, and the deploy chunks no longer wait on the DNS test."
msgstr "**Roghnaíonn CI, atosú agus a chruthaíonn.** Stadann smután ceathrú imscaradh buiséad stranding smután gearr tosaíochta, is féidir le reáchtáil láimhe a shocrú ar an méid smután mbeadh an fhoirmle a dhíorthaíonn, agus is féidir le retrigger override an geata smután. Retriggering oibreacha de réir ról agus ag an méid a riamh fuair fíorasc, atosú taobh thiar den fhuinneog glas seachas an ceann imscaradh, scor oireann an reáchtáil foinse a rith cheana féin, agus cuireann sé ar ceal an reáchtáil sula retriggering a róil theip. Tá gach ról treoracha README replayed ar a chéile imscaradh is lú, sa mhodh a *services.yml* a dhearbhú. íomhánna Distro thógáil i gcomhthráth ar rádala amháin, filleann an post maitrís isteach sa phost íomhá, agus an smután imscaradh a thuilleadh fanacht ar an tástáil DNS."

