# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP.** MCP Streamable HTTP runs server-to-server (the client role's backend connects to the server role), so a server role MUST NOT need a new browser `csp` `connect-src` entry for MCP. If an implementation does require a browser-side MCP fetch, the added `connect-src` source MUST be documented in the role README."
msgstr "**CSP.** Ritheann MCP Streamable HTTP freastalaí-go-freastalaí (nascann an ról cliant ar backend leis an ról freastalaí), mar sin de ról freastalaí NACH gá bhrabhsálaí nua `csp` `connect-src` iontráil do MCP. Má dhéanann cur i bhfeidhm a cheangal ar bhrabhsálaí-taobh MCP beir, an breise `connect-src` MUST foinse a dhoiciméadú sa ról README."

# translated-by: libretranslate
