msgid "**Delete all emails in the queue**:"
msgstr "**Scrios gach ríomhphost sa scuaine**:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependencies**"
msgstr "**Ag brath ar**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works in conjunction with related roles for comprehensive backup management."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha i gcomhar le róil ghaolmhara le haghaidh bainistíochta cúltaca cuimsitheach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) roles."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha seamlessly leis an [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) agus [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) róil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ roles."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha seamlessly leis an `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ agus `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ róil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Imlonnú.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) athdhearbhú an plean céanna trí `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (is feidhm íon é an pleanálaí a roinntear idir init agus imscaradh) agus ritheann imscaradh amháin in aghaidh an fillteán. **I measc gach babhta a leagan-aware iomlán a leagtar.** Babhta R Tosaíonn ó óstach glan (san áireamh an bhabhta roimhe íonaithe sula dtosaíonn R cruinn, féach pointe 5), mar sin gach dep go cruinn R riachtanais MUST a ath-imlonnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Déan iniúchadh ar Freastalaí Criptithe** tú SHOULD shuiteáil Infinito.Nexus ar fhreastalaí criptithe chun cosc a chur soláthraithe óstáil ó rochtain sonraí úsáideora deiridh. Le haghaidh treoir phraiticiúil maidir le freastalaí criptithe a bhunú, féach ar an [Hetzner Arch stór LUKS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Foghlaim tuilleadh faoi [criptithe diosca](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) ar Vicipéid.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."
msgstr "**Inis dúinn, le do thoil...** an A ligean ar Criptithe dúshlán-agus-atreorú snippet ó ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."
msgstr "**Inis dúinn, le do thoil...** an A ligean ar Criptithe dúshlán-agus-atreorú snippet ó `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**fondúireachtaí imscaradh agus pacáistiú.** Tagann modh imscaradh óstáil isteach i Múiríniú agus Swarm san uirlis imlonnaithe. An t-iar *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí*, *taiseachas aeir: fliuch* agus *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* cuireadh in ionad róil le dáileadh-neamhspleách clárlann pacáiste. Úsáideann meiteashonraí Imleabhar anois scéimre Canonical amháin, mounts aon-comhaid bheith Swarm configs, agus socrúchán seirbhíse, comhaireamh macasamhail, dependencies, seoltaí agus probes sláinte réiteach trí imscaradh-aware lookups."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Deploys agus ar chumas seirbhís úsáideora córasach** le haghaidh ``ssh-agent``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for `ssh-agent`."
msgstr "**Deploys agus ar chumas seirbhís úsáideora córasach** le haghaidh `ssh-agent`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** ACME client for automated Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificate issuance and renewal via webroot or DNS-01 challenges"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** cliant ACME le haghaidh uathoibrithe A ligean ar Criptiú SSL / TLS deimhniú eisiúint agus athnuachan trí webroot nó DNS-01 dúshláin"

msgid "**Description:** AI-first code editor installed on the workstation, whose endpoint override stays an operator step"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate NGINX sub-filter injector adding Matomo tracking, global theming, iFrame and JS snippets by feature flag"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhiomlán NGINX fo-scagaire instealladh ag cur Matomo rianú, ainmniú domhanda, iFrame agus JS snippets de réir gné bratach"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate desktop environment bundling caffeine, shell extensions, and terminal into a complete GNOME setup on Linux"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhiomlán timpeallacht deisce bundling Caiféin, síntí sliogáin, agus críochfort i thus GNOME iomlán ar Linux"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Ansible helper role for idempotent persistence and lookup of per-user application tokens in a local YAML store"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról cúntóir do mharthanacht idempotent agus lookup de tokens iarratas in aghaidh an-úsáideoir i siopa áitiúil YAML"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Arch Linux driver bundle for Epson multifunction printing and scanning via escpr and imagescan"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Arch Linux bundle tiománaí do Epson priontáil multifunction agus scanadh trí escpr agus imagecan"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automated recovery service restarting exited or unhealthy Docker Compose stacks and resolving port conflicts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seirbhís a ghnóthú Uathoibrithe atosú scoir nó unhealthy Docker Compose stacks agus coinbhleachtaí calafoirt a réiteach"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automation role for reverse DNS (PTR) records on Hetzner Cloud servers, primary IPs, floating IPs, and load balancers"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról Uathoibriú do DNS droim ar ais (PTR) taifid ar fhreastalaithe Hetzner Cloud, IPanna bunscoile, IPanna snámh, agus iarmhéideoirí ualach"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base development environment for software engineers on Linux, with core editors and language-agnostic tooling"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Timpeallacht forbartha bonn d'innealtóirí bogearraí ar Linux, le heagarthóirí lárnacha agus tooling teanga-agnostic"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base role for systemd manager configuration via drop-ins, default settings, and unit validation"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról bonn le haghaidh cumraíocht bainisteoir córasach trí titim-orlach, socruithe réamhshocraithe, agus bailíochtú aonad"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-based spinning wheel app for decision making, random selection, and gamification"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Brabhsálaí-bhunaithe aip roth sníomh le haghaidh cinnteoireachta, roghnú randamach, agus gamification"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-facing admin interface for the shared LLM gateway, published on its own domain behind the front proxy"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Brabhsálaí-facing comhéadan admin don gheata LLM roinnte, a foilsíodh ar a bhfearann féin taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí tosaigh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Build-time tool for simulating root-owned file operations without elevated privileges during package builds"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Tógáil-am uirlis chun insamhladh oibríochtaí comhad fréamh-úinéireacht gan pribhléidí ardaithe le linn tógála pacáiste"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central Dockerized search engine shared by multiple apps with per-consumer scoped API keys"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár inneall cuardaigh Dockerized roinnte ag apps il le per-tomhaltóir raon feidhme eochracha API"

msgid "**Description:** Central document extraction engine that turns uploaded files into text for retrieval-augmented chat"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central in-memory caching engine with per-consumer key-prefix isolation, usable centrally or as an embedded sidecar"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár in-seomra inneall caching le in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir eochair-prefix aonrú, inúsáidte go lárnach nó mar sidecar leabaithe"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central loader role for ordered shared-service preloading and queued post-load role inclusions across the deployment"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról lódála lárnach le haghaidh réamhluchtú seirbhíse comhroinnte ordaithe agus cuimsithe ról iar-ualach scuaine ar fud an imscaradh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central logout proxy for single-action sign-out across all OIDC-connected apps, with Nginx snippets and a live status UI"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** seachfhreastalaí logála lárnach le haghaidh comharthaí aon-gníomh ar fud gach apps OIDC-nasctha, le snippets Nginx agus UI stádas beo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central mail orchestration layer routing host mail through Mailu, msmtp, or an optional local SMTP relay"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ríomhphost lárnach ciseal orchestration ródú phost óstach trí Mailu, msmtp, nó sealaíochta áitiúil roghnach SMTP"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver on a static IP for consumer stacks to target as their DNS"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár Athchúrsach / aghaidh réiteoir DNSSEC ar IP statach do chairn tomhaltóra chun díriú mar a n- DNS"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central search and analytics engine with per-consumer index namespaces isolating tenants in a shared Docker deployment"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** inneall cuardaigh agus Analytics le gach-tomhaltóir innéacs namespaces isolating tionóntaí in imscaradh Docker roinnte"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central vector database engine for storing and searching per-consumer embeddings shared across the stack"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** inneall bunachar sonraí veicteoir lárnach a stóráil agus a chuardach in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir embeddings roinnte ar fud an chairn"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Centralized MariaDB or PostgreSQL database service shared across applications via Docker Compose"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lárnaigh MariaDB nó PostgreSQL seirbhís bunachar sonraí roinnte ar fud na n-iarratas Docker Compose"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Certbot-driven ACME service for Let's Encrypt single-domain and wildcard TLS certificates on NGINX domains"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seirbhís ACME Certbot-tiomáinte do A ligean ar Criptithe aonair-domain agus wildcard teastais TLS ar fearainn NGINX"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for deprecated domains, removing Nginx configs and revoking their Certbot certificates"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Glanadh gnáthamh le haghaidh réimsí dímheasta, a bhaint Nginx configs agus a chúlghairm a gcuid deimhnithe Certbot"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for reclaiming disk space from temp files, package caches, optional Docker data and old backups"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cleanup ghnáthamh do reclaiming spás diosca ó chomhaid teocht, taisce pacáiste, sonraí Docker roghnach agus cúltacaí d'aois"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side NFS setup for mounting a remote server export on every swarm node, with a deploy-time reachability probe"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cliant-taobh thus NFS le haghaidh gléasta onnmhairithe freastalaí iargúlta ar gach nód swarm, le probe inrochtaineacht imscaradh-am"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side WireGuard VPN role for stable connectivity with a systemd service and script that tune interface MTU"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cliant-taobh WireGuard VPN ról le haghaidh nascacht cobhsaí le seirbhís córasach agus script go comhéadan tune MTU"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Clipboard manager with editable history, custom actions, and scripting support"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Clipboard bainisteoir le stair eagarthóireachta, gníomhaíochtaí saincheaptha, agus tacaíocht script"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cloudflare DNS bootstrap role for apex and wildcard A/AAAA records (and optional CAA) across a web stack's base domains"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cloudflare buataisítrap DNS ról do apex agus taifid cárta fiáin A / AAAA (agus CAA roghnach) ar fud an Stack gréasáin fearainn bonn"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local container image registry for serving custom-built images to Docker Swarm worker nodes"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cluster-áit áitiúil coimeádán íomhá clár le haghaidh freastal ar íomhánna saincheaptha a tógadh go Docker Swarm oibrí nóid"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local pull-through cache for shared Docker Hub base-image pulls, cutting duplicate transfers and rate limits"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cluster-áitiúil taisce tarraingt-trí do pulls bonn Docker Hub roinnte, a ghearradh aistrithe dúblach agus teorainneacha ráta"

# translated-by: libretranslate
