# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm as a second deployment mode.** Roles can now be deployed across multiple hosts instead of being limited to a single Compose stack. New *svc-swarm-node* initializes the cluster, while *svc-swarm-manager* marks the Raft managers in the inventory. Shared state is provided through *svc-storage-nfs-server* and *svc-storage-nfs-client*. *svc-registry-docker* distributes locally built images, and *svc-registry-cache* provides a Docker Hub pull-through cache so additional nodes do not multiply external pulls and rate-limit usage. Deployment, dependency resolution, networking, health checks and role templates now understand both Compose and Swarm semantics. See the [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) and [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) READMEs."
msgstr "**Swarm Docker mar mhodh imscaradh dara.** Is féidir Róil a imscaradh anois ar fud hóstach éagsúla in ionad a bheith teoranta do chairn Ilchodach amháin. Nuashonraithe go deireanach *svc-swarm-node* tús a chur leis an braisle, agus *svc-swarm-manager* marcanna na bainisteoirí Raft san fhardal. Cuirtear stát roinnte ar fáil trí *svc-storage-nfs-server* agus *svc-storage-nfs-client*. *svc-registry-docker* íomhánna a tógadh go háitiúil a dháileadh, agus *svc-registry-cache* Soláthraíonn taisce tarraingt-trí Docker Hub mar sin ní gá nóid breise a iolrú pulls seachtrach agus úsáid ráta-teoranta. Imscaradh, réiteach spleáchas, líonrú, seiceálacha sláinte agus ról teimpléid a thuiscint anois araon Compose agus Shlogtar shéimeantacha. Féach an [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) agus [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) READMEanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Docker Swarm deployment mode** for any role whose own Ansible group lists more than one host. The cluster is bootstrapped by the `svc-swarm-node` group; per-role topology is derived from `groups[application_id]` directly. A role with one or zero hosts in its group stays on the existing Compose path and renders byte-identical output (no implicit migration). Adding additional hosts to a role's own group is the single trigger that promotes the role to a Swarm service."
msgstr "**Docker modh imscaradh Swarm** le haghaidh aon ról a liostaí grúpa Ansible féin níos mó ná óstach amháin. Tá an braisle bootstrapped ag an `svc-swarm-node` grúpa; per-role topology a dhíorthaítear ó `groups[application_id]` go díreach. Ról le hóstach amháin nó nialas ina ghrúpa fanann sé ar an gcosán múirín atá ann cheana féin agus déanann sé aschur fianúil (aon imirce intuigthe). Óstach breise a chur le grúpa ról féin é an truicir amháin a chuireann an ról chun seirbhís Swarm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
