# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embodied / dedicated-device mode moves the trust boundary to the whole device.** For an agent that owns and explores a single-purpose machine (a robot platform, a home-assistant appliance), the isolation boundary is the entire dedicated node, not a guest kernel inside it. Privileged/full host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network) is allowed **only** on a node that is dedicated, single-tenant, network-segmented, and explicitly opted in, with the blast radius documented in the role README. It is **forbidden on any shared cluster node**: agents on shared infrastructure always stay under Decision #4. This is the deliberate exception that keeps the general rule intact rather than a hole in it."
msgstr "**Bogann modh Embodied / tiomnaithe-feiste an teorainn muiníne don fheiste ar fad.** I gcás gníomhaire a bhfuil meaisín aon chuspóir aige agus a dhéanann iniúchadh air (ardán robot, fearas bhaile-cúnamhach), Is é an teorainn aonrú an nód tiomnaithe ar fad, ní eithne aoi taobh istigh air. Rochtain óstach Pribhléid / iomlán (`/dev`, GPIO, braiteoirí, ceamaraí, líonra óstach) a cheadaítear **ach amháin** ar nód atá tiomnaithe, singil-tionónta, líonra-segmented, agus roghnaigh go sainráite i, leis an ga soinneáin doiciméadaithe sa README ról. Is maith liom é **cosc ar aon nód braisle roinnte**: gníomhairí ar bhonneagar roinnte fanacht i gcónaí faoi Chinneadh #4. Is é seo an eisceacht d'aon ghnó a choimeádann an riail ghinearálta slán seachas poll ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** You MUST enable 2FA whenever possible. Many password managers (like KeePassXC) can generate [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) tokens, adding an extra layer of security even if your password is compromised. Synchronize your password database across devices using the [Nextcloud Client](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."
msgstr "**Cumasaigh Dhá-Factor Fíordheimhniú (2FA EN)** MUST tú ar chumas 2FA aon uair is féidir. Go leor bainisteoirí phasfhocal (maith liom KeePassXC) Is féidir a ghiniúint [Déan teagmháil linn](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) comharthaí, ag cur sraith breise slándála fiú má tá do phasfhocal gcontúirt. Synchronize do bhunachar sonraí phasfhocal ar fud feistí ag baint úsáide as an [Nextcloud cineál gas: in airde](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."

