# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Faster gates.** Per-host setup runs once per host instead of once per application, a role's volumes are answered from its own file instead of a whole-tree build, the Keycloak RBAC root group resolves once rather than once per app, the Playwright fixture copy the tree copy already made is dropped, logout helpers wait for a control instead of sleeping, and the OIDC login helper stops waiting out probes that cannot match. Onion timeouts scale by tor flavor instead of a flat multiplier, and every Playwright timeout has one source."
msgstr "**geataí níos tapúla.** Ritheann an thus Per-óstach uair amháin in aghaidh an óstach in ionad uair amháin in aghaidh an iarratais, tá ról ar imleabhair freagra óna comhad féin in ionad a thógáil crann ar fad, réitíonn an grúpa fhréamh Keycloak RBAC uair amháin in áit aon uair amháin in aghaidh an app, tá an chóip fixture Playwright a rinneadh cheana féin thit, cúntóirí logála amach fanacht le haghaidh rialú in ionad codlata, agus stopann an OIDC logáil isteach cúntóir ag fanacht amach probes nach féidir a mheaitseáil. scála timeouts oinniún ag blas tor ionad iolraitheora cothrom, agus tá gach timeout Playwright foinse amháin."

