# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice is dashboard-only.** The first implementation wires each agent through its web dashboard only. Chat-platform connectors (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), which need operator-supplied bot tokens, are deferred to a follow-up and MUST NOT block the first green deploy."
msgstr "**Is é an chéad slice Painéal na nIonstraimí-amháin.** Na sreanga chéad chur i bhfeidhm gach gníomhaire trína Painéal na nIonstraimí gréasáin amháin. chónaisc Chat-ardán (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), Cé acu is gá tokens bot oibreoir-sholáthar, a iarchur chuig leanúint-suas agus NACH MUST bloc an chéad imscaradh glas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end migration is `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, bridges `ldap` to `svc-db-openldap`), because it already exercises the bridge rule and the service-flag enablement path."
msgstr "**An chéad slice.** Is é an chéad imirce deireadh-le-deireadh `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, droichid `ldap` go dtí `svc-db-openldap`), toisc go bhfeidhmíonn sé cheana féin riail an droichid agus an cosán ar chumas seirbhíse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end slice is `web-app-baserow` (server) plus `web-app-openwebui` (client)."
msgstr "**An chéad slice.** Is é an chéad slice deireadh le deireadh `web-app-baserow` (freastalaí freastalaí) móide móide `web-app-openwebui` (cliant)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First-party asset delivery:** Browsers never contact third-party CDNs directly; the deployment fetches and caches assets server-side."
msgstr "**Seachadadh sócmhainní an chéad pháirtí:** Brabhsálaithe riamh teagmháil CDNs tríú páirtí go díreach; an t-imscaradh fetches agus sócmhainní taisce freastalaí-taobh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Five-distro coverage:** Supports the five default CI distros (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) without duplicated task code."
msgstr "**clúdach cúig-distro:** Tacaíonn an cúig réamhshocraithe CI distros (cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú) gan cód tasc dhúbailte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed Moodle redeploy failures** by stripping the trailing slash from *CFG->wwwroot* to prevent health check issues"
msgstr "**teipeanna redeploy Moodle Seasta** trí stripping an Slais trailing ó *Naisc go dtí suíomhanna eile* cosc a chur ar shaincheisteanna seiceáil sláinte"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Seasta Seasta**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Seasta:** imircí OpenProject chobhsaithe (céim imirce simplithe; réamhlódáil *Comhthéacs an Chustaim* roimh *db: imirce*). Nextcloud LDAP config cruaite agus apps neamh-chomhoiriúnach faoi mhíchumas i dtáirgeadh. XWiki síneadh a shuiteáil cruaite agus Cinntíonn síol am amháin *Main.WebHome* ann. Buaileann buataisí Matomo go tapa ar chúis fhréamh. Feabhsuithe TLS agus CA (unified féin sínithe env CA le haghaidh seirbhísí sláinte, retries do giniúint override iontaobhais CA, Nix TLS CA). *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* feabhsaithe ar Fedora. Amharc ar gach eolas *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú* prerequisites a thógáil agus fallback header refactored; in aghaidh an úsáideora *password_update* Chuir policy leis. Cúltaca agus ops fixes (OnlyOffice aon atosú le linn cúltacaí; bhaile cúltaca agus tascanna ACL níos iontaofa). Socrú coimeádán cruaite (Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí5 repo chur leis, Debian buildx coimhlint shocrú, ullmhacht Docker agus feabhsúcháin SSH atosú)."

msgid "**Flavor selectable:** one setting switches between Code - OSS, VSCodium and the Microsoft build."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Authentication:** Integrated support for OpenID Connect (OIDC) simplifies user login and enhances security."
msgstr "**Fíordheimhniú Solúbtha:** Tacaíocht chomhtháite do OpenID Connect (OIDC) shimpliú logáil isteach úsáideora agus cuireann sé slándáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Client Support:** Access Matrix services via modern web clients like Element, plus integrated Element Call and Jitsi video conferencing."
msgstr "**Tacaíocht do Chliaint Solúbtha:** Rochtain ar Fhaisnéis Matrix seirbhísí trí chliaint gréasáin nua-aimseartha cosúil le Element, chomh maith le comhtháite Element Call agus Jitsi video giveencing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Solúbtha:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:**   Adjust settings such as SSL options, port numbers, and server credentials through environment variables and templated configuration files."
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Solúbtha:** Coigeartaigh suímh ar nós roghanna SSL, uimhreacha calafoirt, agus dintiúir freastalaí trí athróg comhshaoil agus comhaid chumraíocht teimpléad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:** Customize cache sizes, domain settings, and authentication options via environment variables and templated configuration files."
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Solúbtha:** Saincheaptha méideanna taisce, suímh fearainn, agus roghanna fíordheimhnithe trí athróg comhshaoil agus comhaid chumraíocht teimpléad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:** Easily customize settings such as database connections, admin credentials, and server configurations via a TOML file."
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Solúbtha:** Saincheapadh go héasca suímh ar nós naisc bunachar sonraí, dintiúir admin, agus cumraíochtaí freastalaí trí comhad TOML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Control:** Supports for `MODE_CLEANUP` for cert cleanup operations."
msgstr "**Rialú Solúbtha:** Tacaíochtaí do `MODE_CLEANUP` le haghaidh oibríochtaí glantacháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Control:** Supports for ``MODE_CLEANUP`` for cert cleanup operations."
msgstr "**Rialú Solúbtha:** Tacaíochtaí do ``MODE_CLEANUP`` le haghaidh oibríochtaí glantacháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform's central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**DB Solúbtha:** Bain úsáid as lárnach MariaDB ardán nó DB app-áitiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform’s central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**DB Solúbtha:** Bain úsáid as lárnach MariaDB ardán nó DB app-áitiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Deployment:** Easily scale and customize using Docker Compose, with configurable settings for networking, storage, and external services."
msgstr "**Imlonnú Solúbtha:** Scála go héasca agus shaincheapadh ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose, le suímh configurable le haghaidh líonrú, stóráil, agus seirbhísí seachtracha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Environment Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Chomhshaoil solúbtha:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Environment Configuration:**   Customize your installation using environment variables and templated configuration files to match your infrastructure needs."
msgstr "**Cumraíocht Chomhshaoil solúbtha:** Saincheap do shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as athróg timpeallacht agus comhaid chumraíocht teimpléad a mheaitseáil do riachtanais bonneagair."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Notification:** Supports handler notification for post-install actions (e.g., Docker Compose builds)."
msgstr "**Fógra Solúbtha:** Tacaíochtaí fógra láimhseálaí do ghníomhaíochtaí iar-shuiteáil (e.g., Tógann Docker Compose)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Scheduling:** Supports configuration of parameters such as OnCalendar and RandomizedDelaySec for precise control over task timing."
msgstr "**Scoláireacht Solúbtha:** Tacaíochtaí cumraíocht na paraiméadair ar nós OnCalendar agus RandomizedDelaySec le haghaidh rialú beacht thar uainiú tasc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Schema Support:** Customize and extend directory schemas to meet diverse organizational requirements."
msgstr "**Tacaíocht Schema Solúbtha:** Saincheap agus a leathnú schemas eolaire chun freastal ar riachtanais eagrúcháin éagsúla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible vHost templates**: *basic* and *ws_generic* flavours cover standard HTTP and WebSocket applications."
msgstr "**Solúbtha vHost teimpléid**: *bhunúsach* agus *ws_generic* clúdaíonn blasanna iarratais HTTP caighdeánach agus WebSocket."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise cross-agent supervisor is Phase 2, deferred.** The supervisor (Flowise as MCP client delegating to Hermes' MCP-server mode v0.6.0+ and OpenClaw's MCP-server, chaining cross-agent pipelines) is a separate later slice, not the first implementation. Rationale: it depends on the young hermes MCP-server mode and adds a second orchestration tier. The first slice ships each agent standalone; the supervisor design below is retained as the Phase 2 target. Single-agent use MUST always work without Flowise."
msgstr "**Is é an maoirseoir tras-ghníomhaire Flowise Céim 2, siar.** An Maoirseoir (Flowise mar MCP cliant delegating do Hermes ' MCP-freastalaí mód v0.6.0+ agus MCP-freastalaí OpenClaw, píblínte tras-ghníomhaithe slabhraithe) Is slice ar leith ina dhiaidh sin, ní an chéad chur i bhfeidhm. Rationale: braitheann sé ar an mód MCP-freastalaí óga agus cuireann sraith dara orchestration. Coinnítear an dearadh maoirseachta thíos mar Chéim 2 sprioc. MUST úsáid aonair i gcónaí ag obair gan Flowise."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise's role-local LiteLLM is refactored into the shared role.** The role-local LiteLLM config and container in `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, its compose service, related env) are removed; Flowise consumes `svc-ai-litellm` instead. No duplicated LiteLLM deployment remains. Flowise stays green after the refactor."
msgstr "**Tá ról-LiteLLM áitiúil Flowise ar refactored isteach sa ról roinnte.** An ról-áitiúil LiteLLM config agus coimeádán i `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, a sheirbhís a chumadh, env gaolmhar) a bhaint; ithe Flowise `svc-ai-litellm` ina ionad sin. Níl aon imscaradh LiteLLM dhúbailte fós. Fanann Flowise glas tar éis an refactor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise** is a visual builder for AI workflows. Create, test, and publish chains that combine LLMs, your documents, tools, and vector search, without writing glue code."
msgstr "**Flowise** is tógálaí amhairc le haghaidh sreabhadh oibre AI. Cruthaigh, tástáil, agus slabhraí a fhoilsiú a chur le chéile LLMs, do dhoiciméid, uirlisí, agus cuardaigh veicteoir, gan scríobh cód gliú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Folder navigation:** The sidebar mirrors the repository tree and highlights the current page and heading."
msgstr "**Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** An sidebar scátháin an crann stór agus béim ar an leathanach reatha agus ceannteideal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Follow hashtags, accounts, or trends** across multiple Mastodon-compatible servers."
msgstr "**Lean hashtags, cuntais, nó treochtaí** trasna freastalaithe il Mastodon-comhoiriúnach."

