# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**For searching file contents, use the Grep tool.** If shelling out is unavoidable, use a single `grep` invocation with multiple file arguments (e.g. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) or a recursive call with a path/glob (e.g. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)."
msgstr "**Chun ábhar comhaid a chuardach, bain úsáid as an uirlis Grep.** Mura féidir a sheachaint, bain úsáid as ceann amháin `grep` invocation le hargóintí comhad il (e.g. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) nó glao athchúrsach le cosán / glob (e.g. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When `MODE_CLEANUP=true`, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr "**Mód Forghníomhú Fórsa:** Nuair a bheidh `MODE_CLEANUP=true`, Tá cleanup fhorghníomhú láithreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When ``MODE_CLEANUP=true``, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr "**Mód Forghníomhú Fórsa:** Nuair a bheidh ``MODE_CLEANUP=true``, Tá cleanup fhorghníomhú láithreach."

msgid "**Fork identity** for the operator's CI-redeploy shortcuts: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (defaults to the local OS username) and `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (composed as `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), both set by handlers under `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). The fork repository name itself lives in `default.env` as `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Foundation for Further Stacks:** Ideal starting point for Flask, Django, scientific computing, and automation."
msgstr "**Fondúireacht do Bhreise Stacks:** Pointe tosaigh Ideal do Flask, Django, ríomhaireachta eolaíochta, agus uathoibriú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú tosaigh-proxy:** Foilsithe ar an app tríd ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` do TLS fhoirceannadh agus per-domain routing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through `sys-stk-front-proxy` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú tosaigh-proxy:** Foilsithe ar an app tríd `sys-stk-front-proxy` do TLS fhoirceannadh agus per-domain routing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full Docker Prune:** Executes ``container system prune -a -f`` to reclaim space."
msgstr "**Iomlán Docker Prune:** Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí ``container system prune -a -f`` spás a aiséileamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full Docker Prune:** Executes `container system prune -a -f` to reclaim space."
msgstr "**Iomlán Docker Prune:** Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `container system prune -a -f` spás a aiséileamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full Unicode support**: `utf8mb4` is the only MySQL/MariaDB character set that fully implements 4‑byte UTF‑8, allowing storage of emojis, supplementary symbols, and all global scripts without data loss."
msgstr "**Tacaíocht Iomlán Unicode**: `utf8mb4` Is é an t-aon sraith carachtar MySQL / MariaDB a chuireann i bhfeidhm go hiomlán 4Ag an am céanna8, ag ligean stóráil emojis, siombailí forlíontacha, agus gach scripteanna domhanda gan caillteanas sonraí."

msgid "**Full extraction set:** the `-full` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Full extraction set:** the ``-full`` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full onion node**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = node `.onion`; entire stack shifts together. No web/identity split, no domain-transform lookup."
msgstr "**Iomlán nód onion**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = nód `.onion`; shifts Stack ar fad le chéile. Aon scoilt gréasáin / gné, aon cuma fearainn-transform."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full onion node:** `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` becomes the node `.onion`; the entire stack shifts to Tor with no domain-transform logic."
msgstr "**nód oinniún iomlán:** `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` thiocfaidh chun bheith ar an node `.onion`; aistríonn an chairn ar fad chuig Tor gan aon loighic fearainn-transform."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full onion node:** ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` becomes the node ``.onion``; the entire stack shifts to Tor with no domain-transform logic."
msgstr "**nód oinniún iomlán:** ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` thiocfaidh chun bheith ar an node ``.onion``; aistríonn an chairn ar fad chuig Tor gan aon loighic fearainn-transform."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Automated Setup:** The role handles all tasks, including pulling the source repository, building the Docker image, and serving the presentation through a web server."
msgstr "**Socraigh go hiomlán Uathoibrithe:** Láimhseálann an ról gach tasc, lena n-áirítear tarraingt an stór foinse, thógáil an íomhá Docker, agus ag freastal ar an gcur i láthair trí fhreastalaí gréasáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized Deployment:** Simplifies installation using Docker Compose for the Nextcloud application and its MariaDB backend."
msgstr "**Imscaradh hiomlán Dockerized:** Simplíonn suiteáil ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose don iarratas Nextcloud agus a chúlchríoch MariaDB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``confluence_data``) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Go hiomlán Dockerized:** Ilchodach Stack le toirt sonraí tiomnaithe (``confluence_data``) agus íomhá forleagan caol le haghaidh breiseán sa todhchaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``jira_data``) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Go hiomlán Dockerized:** Ilchodach Stack le toirt sonraí tiomnaithe (``jira_data``) agus íomhá overlay íosta a chur ar chumas plugins / rúin sa todhchaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`confluence_data`) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Go hiomlán Dockerized:** Ilchodach Stack le toirt sonraí tiomnaithe (`confluence_data`) agus íomhá forleagan caol le haghaidh breiseán sa todhchaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`jira_data`) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Go hiomlán Dockerized:** Ilchodach Stack le toirt sonraí tiomnaithe (`jira_data`) agus íomhá overlay íosta a chur ar chumas plugins / rúin sa todhchaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Future‑proof:** Modern applications and standards have converged on UTF‑8; using `utf8mb4` avoids migration challenges later."
msgstr "**Todhchaí-cruthúnas:** iarratais nua-aimseartha agus caighdeáin a bheith converged ar UTF-8; ag baint úsáide `utf8mb4` a sheachaint dúshláin imirce níos déanaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Game Visibility:** Matches and moves can appear in social timelines."
msgstr "**Visibility Cluiche:** Is féidir le matches agus bogann le feiceáil i línte ama sóisialta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gantt Charts & Timelines:** Visualize project schedules and dependencies using intuitive Gantt charts and timeline views, enabling effective planning and resource allocation."
msgstr "**Cairteacha agus Amlínte:** Amharcléiriú sceidil tionscadail agus spleáchais ag baint úsáide as cairteacha Gantt iomasach agus tuairimí amlíne, a chumasú pleanáil éifeachtach agus leithdháileadh acmhainní."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway backend:** The LiteLLM Gateway publishes those aliases, which are the names Ollama serves too, so the same model name routes to whichever local backend a deployment runs."
msgstr "**Deireadh geata:** An bhfuil LiteLLM Gateway foilsíonn na ailiasanna sin, arb iad na hainmneacha iad Ollama feidhmíonn sé freisin, mar sin na bealaí ainm samhail céanna a cibé áit áitiúil siar ritheann imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway credentials:** Without Keycloak, access is gated by the LiteLLM UI username and password that the LiteLLM Gateway provisions. That pair keeps working alongside SSO as a break-glass login."
msgstr "**Dintiúirí geata:** Gan Keycloak, tá rochtain gated ag an LiteLLM Chomhéadain ainm úsáideora agus focal faire go bhfuil na forálacha LiteLLM Gateway. Coinníonn an péire ag obair in éineacht le SSO mar logáil isteach sos-gloine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway token:** A generated gateway token guards the Control UI and the API, and the Control UI accepts the canonical domain as its only allowed origin."
msgstr "**Token geata:** gardaí chomhartha geata a ghintear an Chomhéadain Rialú agus an API, agus an Chomhéadain Rialú Glacann an fearann Canonical mar a thionscnamh ceadaithe amháin."

msgid "**Gateway-backed:** `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` and `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` point the agent at the platform gateway."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gateway-backed:** ``ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`` and ``ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`` point the agent at the platform gateway."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gateway-backed:** one provider entry, no vendor credentials on the machine."
msgstr ""

