msgstr "**Téitheoir Domhanda** An ról instealladh nasc CSS domhanda le haghaidh theming comhsheasmhach ar fud do shuíomh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group revocation is not reliable, in both directions.** Open WebUI removes a user from a synced group only while the groups claim is non-empty, so a user who loses their last role keeps stale membership until a later login carries a non-empty claim. Conversely, a non-empty claim removes the user from *every* local group the claim does not name, including groups an administrator created by hand. Reconciling either from the deploy would mean a second writer for group membership, competing with the login-time sync and able to evict accounts the platform's own user list does not know about, so both are left to an external reconciler or an upstream fix."
msgstr "**Níl an chúlghairm Grúpa iontaofa, sa dá threo.** Cuireann Open WebUI úsáideoir ó ghrúpa synced ach amháin nuair a bhíonn an t-éileamh grúpaí neamh-empty, mar sin úsáideoir a chailleann a ról deireanach Coinníonn ballraíocht stale go dtí go ndéanann logáil isteach níos déanaí éileamh neamh-empty. Os a choinne sin, cuireann éileamh neamh-empty an t-úsáideoir as *gach rud* grúpa áitiúil nach bhfuil an t-éileamh ainm, lena n-áirítear grúpaí riarthóir cruthaithe de láimh. Bheadh athchomhdú ceachtar as an imscaradh chiallaíonn an dara scríbhneoir do bhallraíocht ghrúpa, in iomaíocht leis an sync logáil isteach-am agus in ann a cuntais evict nach bhfuil an t-ardán liosta úsáideora féin a fhios faoi, mar sin tá an dá fágtha le réiteach seachtrach nó a shocrú sruth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group revocation is not reliable, in both directions.** Open WebUI removes a user from a synced group only while the groups claim is non-empty, so a user who loses their last role keeps stale membership until a later login carries a non-empty claim. Conversely, a non-empty claim removes the user from *every* local group the claim does not name, including groups an administrator created by hand. Reconciling either from the deploy would mean a second writer for group membership, competing with the login-time sync and able to evict accounts the platform’s own user list does not know about, so both are left to an external reconciler or an upstream fix."
msgstr "**Níl an chúlghairm Grúpa iontaofa, sa dá threo.** Cuireann Open WebUI úsáideoir ó ghrúpa synced ach amháin nuair a bhíonn an t-éileamh grúpaí neamh-empty, mar sin úsáideoir a chailleann a ról deireanach Coinníonn ballraíocht stale go dtí go ndéanann logáil isteach níos déanaí éileamh neamh-empty. Os a choinne sin, cuireann éileamh neamh-empty an t-úsáideoir as *gach rud* grúpa áitiúil nach bhfuil an t-éileamh ainm, lena n-áirítear grúpaí riarthóir cruthaithe de láimh. Bheadh athchomhdú ceachtar as an imscaradh chiallaíonn an dara scríbhneoir le haghaidh ballraíocht ghrúpa, in iomaíocht leis an sync logáil isteach-am agus in ann a cuntais evict nach bhfuil an t-ardán liosta úsáideora féin a fhios faoi, mar sin tá an dá fágtha le réiteach seachtrach nó a shocrú sruth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group-mapped RBAC:** The Keycloak ``groups`` claim binds to OpenBao external identity groups carrying the ``administrator``, ``operator`` and ``reader`` policies. Authenticating on its own grants only ``default``."
msgstr "**RBAC Group-mapped:** An Keycloak ``groups`` Ceanglaíonn éileamh ar ghrúpaí aitheantais seachtracha OpenBao a dhéanann na ``administrator``, ``operator`` agus ``reader`` beartais. Fíordheimhniú ar a deontais féin amháin ``default``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Group-mapped RBAC:** The Keycloak `groups` claim binds to OpenBao external identity groups carrying the `administrator`, `operator` and `reader` policies. Authenticating on its own grants only `default`."
msgstr "**RBAC Group-mapped:** An Keycloak `groups` Ceanglaíonn éileamh ar ghrúpaí aitheantais seachtracha OpenBao a dhéanann na `administrator`, `operator` agus `reader` beartais. Fíordheimhniú ar a deontais féin amháin `default`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest MCP probe:** A Playwright spec asserts that an unauthenticated request to the MCP endpoint is never answered with a 2xx."
msgstr "**Aoi probe MCP:** Dearbhaíonn spec Playwright go bhfuil iarraidh authenticated chun an endpoint MCP fhreagair riamh le 2xx."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI's own password form when it is off."
msgstr "**Tástáil deataigh aoi:** Dearbhaíonn spec Playwright go bhfreagraíonn an Chomhéadain taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí agus geataí cuairteoirí unauthenticated: tá sé ag súil leis an handover le Keycloak nuair a bhíonn SSO ar agus foirm phasfhocal an Chomhéadain féin nuair a bhíonn sé as."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Guest smoke test:** A Playwright spec asserts that the UI answers behind the proxy and gates unauthenticated visitors: it expects the handover to Keycloak when SSO is on and the UI’s own password form when it is off."
msgstr "**Tástáil deataigh aoi:** Dearbhaíonn spec Playwright go bhfreagraíonn an Chomhéadain taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí agus geataí cuairteoirí unauthenticated: tá sé ag súil leis an handover le Keycloak nuair a bhíonn SSO ar agus foirm phasfhocal an Chomhéadain féin nuair a bhíonn sé as."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP API:** Simple, predictable HTTP API for application developers."
msgstr "**HTTP API:** Simplí, intuartha API HTTP d'fhorbróirí iarratais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP Status Verification:** HEAD-requests each domain and compares the response against per-domain expected codes."
msgstr "**Fíorú Stádas HTTP:** HEAD-requests gach fearann agus comparáid a dhéanamh ar an freagra i gcoinne cóid súil per-domain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP admin and BOSH:** Expose the ejabberd web admin and BOSH/WebSocket bindings on the role's HTTP port for browser-based interaction."
msgstr "**HTTP admin agus BOSH:** Nochtadh an ejabberd gréasáin admin agus BOSH / WebSocket ceangailteacha ar an ról port HTTP do idirghníomhaíocht bhrabhsálaí-bhunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP admin and BOSH:** Expose the ejabberd web admin and BOSH/WebSocket bindings on the role’s HTTP port for browser-based interaction."
