# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP serving** with MIME types, gzip compression, caching, and custom `NGINX.conf` templating."
msgstr "**HTTP ag freastal** le cineálacha MIME, comhbhrú gzip, caching, agus saincheaptha `NGINX.conf` templating."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP serving** with MIME types, gzip compression, caching, and custom ``NGINX.conf`` templating."
msgstr "**HTTP ag freastal** le cineálacha MIME, comhbhrú gzip, caching, agus saincheaptha ``NGINX.conf`` templating."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTPS** enforced via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "**HTTPS** i bhfeidhm trí seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler Integration**"
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Handler**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler Integration**   Restart handler ensures the Docker daemon is reloaded when necessary."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Handler** Cinntíonn Restart láimhseálaí go bhfuil an Daemon Docker athluchtaithe nuair is gá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handler-safe**: automatically triggers an NGINX reload when templates change."
msgstr "**Láimhseáil sábháilte**: triggers go huathoibríoch athlódáil NGINX nuair a athrú teimpléid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers for Runtime Control:** Automatically builds, sets up, or restarts containers based on handlers. Notify ``compose up`` when rendered files or the service spec changed; notify ``container recreate`` when only in-container or in-database state changed and the process must reload it — the latter force-recreates in compose mode and forces a task recreation in swarm mode, where ``docker stack deploy`` alone would leave the running task untouched."
msgstr "**Láimhseálaithe do Rialú Runtime:** Tógann sé go huathoibríoch, leagann sé suas, nó restarts coimeádáin bunaithe ar láimhseálaithe. Fógraí ``compose up`` nuair a rinneadh comhaid nó an spec seirbhíse athrú; fógra a thabhairt ``container recreate`` nuair a athrú ach amháin i-coimeádán nó in-sonraí agus ní mór an próiseas a athluchtú - an fórsa deiridh sin a athchruthú i mód agus fórsaí caitheamh aimsire tasc i mód swarm, i gcás ``docker stack deploy`` bheadh ina n-aonar a fhágáil ar an tasc ag rith untouched."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers for Runtime Control:** Automatically builds, sets up, or restarts containers based on handlers. Notify `compose up` when rendered files or the service spec changed; notify `container recreate` when only in-container or in-database state changed and the process must reload it — the latter force-recreates in compose mode and forces a task recreation in swarm mode, where `docker stack deploy` alone would leave the running task untouched."
msgstr "**Láimhseálaithe do Rialú Runtime:** Tógann sé go huathoibríoch, leagann sé suas, nó restarts coimeádáin bunaithe ar láimhseálaithe. Fógraí `compose up` nuair a rinneadh comhaid nó an spec seirbhíse athrú; fógra a thabhairt `container recreate` nuair a athrú ach amháin i-coimeádán nó in-sonraí agus ní mór an próiseas a athluchtú - an fórsa deiridh sin a athchruthú i mód agus fórsaí caitheamh aimsire tasc i mód swarm, i gcás `docker stack deploy` bheadh ina n-aonar a fhágáil ar an tasc ag rith untouched."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handlers:** Automatic reload/restart of services when definitions change."
msgstr "**Láimhseálaithe:** Athlódáil uathoibríoch / atosú seirbhísí nuair a athraíonn sainmhínithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handles sendmail compatibility:** Installs ``msmtp-mta`` where available, otherwise provisions a compatible sendmail symlink."
msgstr "**Láimhseálann sheoladh comhoiriúnacht ríomhphoist:** soilse loingseoireachta E ``msmtp-mta`` i gcás ina bhfuil sé ar fáil, forálacha eile siompóisearach seol ríomhphost ag luí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handles sendmail compatibility:** Installs `msmtp-mta` where available, otherwise provisions a compatible sendmail symlink."
msgstr "**Láimhseálann sheoladh comhoiriúnacht ríomhphoist:** soilse loingseoireachta E `msmtp-mta` i gcás ina bhfuil sé ar fáil, forálacha eile siompóisearach seol ríomhphost ag luí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handshake verified against the sidecar:** After minting, the deploy sends a JSON-RPC ``initialize`` to ``http://giteamcpupstream:8080/mcp`` with that bearer and fails when the endpoint does not answer."
msgstr "**Handshake fhíorú i gcoinne an sidecar:** Tar éis minting, cuireann an imscaradh JSON-RPC ``initialize`` go dtí ``http://giteamcpupstream:8080/mcp`` leis an settings sin agus go mainneoidh nuair nach bhfuil an endpoint freagra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Handshake verified against the sidecar:** After minting, the deploy sends a JSON-RPC `initialize` to `http://giteamcpupstream:8080/mcp` with that bearer and fails when the endpoint does not answer."
msgstr "**Handshake fhíorú i gcoinne an sidecar:** Tar éis minting, cuireann an imscaradh JSON-RPC `initialize` go dtí `http://giteamcpupstream:8080/mcp` leis an settings sin agus go mainneoidh nuair nach bhfuil an endpoint freagra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Harassment and Discrimination:** Any form of harassment, hate speech, or discriminatory behavior will not be tolerated."
msgstr "**Ciapadh agus Idirdhealú:** Ní ghlacfar le haon chineál ciaptha, fuathchaint, nó iompar idirdhealaitheach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Hardened CA trust, health, and repair logic** with *soft-fail* behavior, improved diagnostics, and safe handling of one-shot containers"
msgstr "**Hardened CA muinín, sláinte, agus loighic a dheisiú** le *bog-fail* iompar, diagnóisic feabhsaithe, agus láimhseáil shábháilte coimeádáin aon-lámhaigh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Hardware access is declared, not blanket-by-accident.** The role exposes a device allowlist (`/dev/*`, GPIO, I2C/SPI, video/camera, serial) that the operator sets; \"full access\" is an explicit, documented opt-in, not the silent default. The README documents the blast radius: the agent can do anything the granted devices allow."
msgstr "**Fógraítear rochtain crua-earraí, ní blaincéad-ar-thimpiste.** Léiríonn an ról an deisliosta gléas (`/dev/*`, GPIO, I2C/SPI, físeán/ceamara, sraitheach) go leagann an t-oibreoir; \"cineál gas: in airde\" is follasach, doiciméadaithe rogha-i, ní an réamhshocraithe adh. Na doiciméid README an ga soinneáin: Is féidir leis an gníomhaire aon rud a dhéanamh ar chumas na feistí a deonaíodh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Headless Provisioning:** The administrator is seeded from the role's credential and the first-boot wizard is completed over the API, so no manual click-through is required."
msgstr "**Soláthar gan uaim:** Tá an riarthóir síolaithe ó dintiúir an ról agus tá an draoi chéad-boot críochnaithe thar an API, mar sin níl aon láimhe cliceáil-trí ag teastáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Headless Provisioning:** The administrator is seeded from the role’s credential and the first-boot wizard is completed over the API, so no manual click-through is required."
msgstr "**Soláthar gan uaim:** Tá an riarthóir síolaithe ó dintiúir an ról agus an draoi chéad-boot i gcrích thar an API, mar sin níl aon láimhe cliceáil-trí ag teastáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health Checks & Logging:** Integrates with Infinito.Nexus health checking and journald logging 📈"
msgstr "**Seiceálacha Sláinte & Logáil:** Comhtháthú le Infinito.Nexus seiceáil sláinte agus logáil irisithe 📈"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health Checks & Logging:** Monitor service health and logs with built-in checks and journald 📈"
msgstr "**Seiceálacha Sláinte & Logáil:** Monatóireacht a dhéanamh ar shláinte agus logs seirbhíse le seiceálacha tógtha agus irisithe 📈"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health Checks:** Container healthcheck for quicker failure detection and stable automation."
msgstr "**Seiceáil Sláinte:** Coimeádán healthcheck le haghaidh bhrath teip níos tapúla agus uathoibriú cobhsaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health Checks:** Curl-based container healthcheck for early failure detection."
msgstr "**Seiceáil Sláinte:** Curl-bhunaithe coimeádán healthcheck do bhrath teip luath."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health endpoint:** A `/health` endpoint reports the runtime status and backs the container healthcheck."
msgstr "**Críochphointe sláinte:** Amharc ar gach eolas `/health` tuarascálacha endpoint an stádas runtime agus backs an healthcheck coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health endpoint:** A ``/health`` endpoint reports the runtime status and backs the container healthcheck."
msgstr "**Críochphointe sláinte:** Amharc ar gach eolas ``/health`` tuarascálacha endpoint an stádas runtime agus backs an healthcheck coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Health-probe friendly:** Redirects the canonical CSS hostname to the CDN so HTTP probes return a valid response."
msgstr "**Sláinte-probe cairdiúil:** Atreoraíonn an t-óstach Canonical CSS chuig an CDN sin probes HTTP ar ais freagra bailí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Healthchecks & Networking:** Includes Docker healthchecks and network setup logic."
msgstr "**Healthchecks & Líonrú:** Lena n-áirítear Docker healthchecks agus loighic thus líonra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Helpdesk ticketing:** Multi-channel agent and customer surface for email, web and (optionally) chat tickets."
msgstr "**ticéadú deisce cabhrach:** gníomhaire il-chainéil agus dromchla do chustaiméirí le haghaidh r-phost, gréasáin agus (roghnach) ticéid comhrá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**High Performance and Scalability:** Designed to handle large-scale deployments with rapid lookup and authentication response times."
msgstr "**Ardfheidhmíochta agus Scalability:** Deartha chun déileáil imscaradh ar scála mór le cuma tapa agus amanna freagartha fíordheimhnithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**High Performance:** Optimized for handling large-scale mailing lists and newsletters with rapid processing."
msgstr "**Ardfheidhmíochta:** Optamaithe chun freastal ar liostaí poist ar scála mór agus nuachtlitreacha le próiseáil tapa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Highly Portable:** Works out-of-the-box with minimal variables."
msgstr "**Inaistrithe Ard:** Oibríonn amach-de-an-bhosca le hathróga íosta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Home Directory Configuration:** Sets secure permissions on the administrator’s home directory and script folder."
msgstr "**Baile Eolaire Cumraíocht:** Leagann ceadanna slán ar eolaire bhaile an riarthóra agus fillteán script."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Home automation joins the platform.** *web-app-homeassistant* deploys the automation hub, exposes it as an MCP server so agents can drive it, persists the token it mints, and is reachable over tor. See [web-app-homeassistant](roles/web-app-homeassistant/README.md)."
msgstr "**Uathoibriú Baile théann an t-ardán.** *web-app-homeassistant* imscaradh an mol uathoibriú, nochtann sé mar fhreastalaí MCP ionas gur féidir le gníomhairí tiomáint, Leanann an dearbhán air mints, agus tá sé reachable thar tor. Féach ar [web-app-homeassistant](roles/web-app-homeassistant/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Host-mode front proxy:** The role renders an OpenResty virtual host that terminates TLS and forwards to the gateway's local HTTP port, without deploying a container."
msgstr "**Host-mode seachfhreastalaí tosaigh:** Tugann an ról ina óstach fíorúil OpenResty a chuireann deireadh le TLS agus cuireann sé ar aghaidh chuig calafort áitiúil HTTP na tairsí, gan coimeádán a imscaradh."

