# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Fillteáin Fardal.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) Glaoigh orainn [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), a chruthaíonn fillteán amháin in aghaidh an bhabhta ag `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (nó díreach `<inventory-dir>` nuair a bhíonn babhta amháin). Do gach fillteán, `build_dev_inventory` réitíonn an babhta pálasta in aghaidh an-app agus bácálann sé isteach san fhardal `host_vars` mar atá `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` róródaí. Is é an fardal dá bhrí sin, malairt réiteach ar diosca; Níl aon roghnóir runtime ag teastáil."

