# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP federation** — when ``svc-db-openldap`` is present, Frappe’s LDAP Settings doctype is auto-configured. End-to-end LDAP login (auto-create Frappe user from LDAP bind) is deferred to a follow-up requirement; v1 ships the Settings doctype only. The LDAP-login Playwright specs are intentionally absent for v1."
msgstr "**Cothú LDAP** — nuair— ``svc-db-openldap`` i láthair, tá Socruithe LDAP Frappe ar doctype uathoibríoch-chumraithe. Deireadh le deireadh a chur le logáil isteach LDAP (auto-create Frappe úsáideoir ó LDAP ceangal) a iarchur chuig ceanglas leantach; v1 longa an Doctype Socruithe amháin. Tá na specs LDAP-login Playwright as láthair d'aon ghnó le haghaidh v1."

