# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Local models reach the gateway again.** Upstream re-pushed the *svc-ai-lmstudio* CPU image with a server that listens on loopback only, so the role stayed green while litellm could not connect and the AI features of Mattermost, Matrix, xWiki, Moodle and Zammad failed their warm-up. The server binds the container network again and stays unpublished. The model preload now waits until the daemon has finished starting, so a slow host no longer ends up with a daemon that fails every later model load, and the readiness probe is capped per attempt so a silent peer cannot hang it. See [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."
msgstr "**Samhlacha áitiúla teacht ar an tairseach arís.** Ath-sruthú sruth an *svc-ai-lmstudio* íomhá LAP le freastalaí a éisteann ar ais ach amháin, mar sin d'fhan an ról glas cé nach bhféadfadh litellm ceangal agus na gnéithe AI de Mattermost, Matrix, xWiki, Moodle agus Zammad theip ar a te-suas. Ceanglaíonn an freastalaí an líonra coimeádán arís agus fanann sé gan foilsiú. Fanann an réamhlódáil múnla anois go dtí go bhfuil an daemon críochnaithe ag tosú, mar sin ní féidir le óstach mall a thuilleadh suas le daemon go mainneoidh gach ualach múnla ina dhiaidh sin, agus tá an probe ullmhacht capped in aghaidh an iarracht sin ní féidir le piaraí adh hang sé. Féach ar [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."

