msgid "**Named state:** the configuration and cache directories the image declares as volumes are pinned to named volumes, so no anonymous volume is left behind."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Narrow:** it configures name resolution and nothing else, so callers that only need resolution do not also change the system hostname"
msgstr "**Caol:** cumraithe sé rún ainm agus rud ar bith eile, mar sin callairí nach gá ach réiteach a athrú freisin ar an hostname córas"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native Keycloak SSO:** Sit a ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar sidecar in front of the broker so unauthenticated visitors are redirected to Keycloak before they ever reach the web client."
msgstr "**Keycloak Dúchasach SSO:** Sit a ``web-app-keycloak``\\ s SSO-proxy sidecar i os comhair an bhróicéir mar sin cuairteoirí unauthenticated atreorú chuig Keycloak sula sroicheann siad riamh ar an gcliant gréasáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native Keycloak SSO:** Sit a `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar sidecar in front of the broker so unauthenticated visitors are redirected to Keycloak before they ever reach the web client."
msgstr "**Keycloak Dúchasach SSO:** Sit a `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar sidecar os comhair an bhróicéir mar sin cuairteoirí unauthenticated atreorú chuig Keycloak sula sroicheann siad riamh ar an gcliant gréasáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native LDAP:** A central-OpenLDAP connection supplies user records, roles, and contact groups; the header user (Keycloak ``preferred_username``) resolves to a real Checkmk user."
msgstr "**LDAP Dúchasach:** A lárnachOpenLDAP soláthairtí nasc taifid úsáideora, róil, agus grúpaí teagmhála; an t-úsáideoir header (Keycloak ``preferred_username``) réiteach ar fíor Checkmk úsáideoir."

