# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project's SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by `web-app-keycloak`) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO trí SSO-proxy sidecar:** Geata an Chomhéadain gréasáin FusionDirectory tríd an tionscadal SSO-proxy sidecar (dá bhforáiltear `web-app-keycloak`) le haghaidh iontráil OIDC-éilitheach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project’s SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by ``web-app-keycloak``) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
