# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the ``oic-auth`` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO:** Úsáideoirí barántúla in aghaidh Keycloak tríd an ``oic-auth`` breiseán, cumraithe ag JCasC ag tosaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the `oic-auth` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO:** Úsáideoirí barántúla in aghaidh Keycloak tríd an `oic-auth` breiseán, cumraithe ag JCasC ag tosaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin, with ``?fallback=local`` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO:** úsáideoirí fíordheimhnithe i gcoinne Keycloak tríd an in-ról ``plg_system_keycloak`` breiseán, le ``?fallback=local`` mar haiste éigeandála env-toggleable."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin, with `?fallback=local` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO:** úsáideoirí fíordheimhnithe i gcoinne Keycloak tríd an in-ról `plg_system_keycloak` breiseán, le `?fallback=local` mar haiste éigeandála env-toggleable."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Semaphore renders its own \"Sign in with Keycloak\" button via `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; the Keycloak client is auto-provisioned by `web-app-keycloak`."
msgstr "**OIDC Dúchasach SSO:** Déanann Semaphore a chuid féin \"Cláraigh le Keycloak\" cnaipe via via `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; Is é an cliant Keycloak uathoibríoch-sholáthar ag `web-app-keycloak`."

