# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA muinín (TLS féin-sínithe amháin):** nuair a bhíonn `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, an t-ordú ar chúl (i `templates/compose.yml.j2`) allmhairí an CA inmheánach isteach in ritable `cacerts` cóip agus pointí an JVM ag sé tríd `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. An roinnte `with-ca-trust.sh` Clúdaíonn an pointe iontrála OS/NSS/env siopaí iontaobhais ach nach bhfuil an siopa muinín JVM, mar sin gan an bhfreastalaí-taobh Penpot ar OIDC token / úsáideoirí info glaonna a Keycloak theipeann le `PKIX path building failed`. Tá an override gated taobh thiar mód féin-sínithe (tá sé ina aon-uair i dtáirgeadh, i gcás ina bhfuil deimhnithe iarbhír CA-sínithe muinín cheana féin) agus tá an cosán CA cruachódaithe mar gheall ar an creat ar CA-override ath-sagairt an t-ordú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
