# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Persistent:** ``nftables.service`` loads every fragment at boot, so rules outlive a reboot without a unit of this project’s own. The ruleset it reads is a distribution decision, so the path follows ``os_family``: RedHat reads ``/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf``, the others ``/etc/nftables.conf``."
msgstr "**Freastal:** ``nftables.service`` ualaí gach ilroinnt ag tosaithe, mar sin rialacha outlive atos gan aonad an tionscadail seo féin. Is cinneadh dáilte é na rialacha a léann sé, mar sin leanann an cosán ``os_family``: RedHat léann ``/etc/sysconfig/nftables.conf``, na daoine eile ``/etc/nftables.conf``."

