# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Queue clock.** GitHub cancels a job that sat queued for ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. With ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` runners free and every job assumed to burn its full ``timeout-minutes``, a chunk drains in waves, and the last wave that still starts inside the queue window is ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. A chunk therefore holds at most ``concurrency * waves`` jobs. Assuming every job runs to its timeout is deliberately pessimistic -- no job can outlast it -- so the drain estimate can only overshoot, never undershoot."
msgstr "**Tráth na gCeist.** Cealaigh GitHub post a shuigh scuaine do ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. Le ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` dara háit saor in aisce agus gach post glacadh chun sruthán a iomlán ``timeout-minutes``, draenacha smután i dtonnta, agus tá an tonn deireanach a thosaíonn fós taobh istigh den fhuinneog scuaine ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. Tá smután dá bhrí sin, ag an chuid is mó ``concurrency * waves`` poist. Ag glacadh le gach post a ritheann go dtí a timeout é pessimistic d'aon ghnó - ní féidir aon phost outlast sé - mar sin is féidir leis an meastachán draein overshoot amháin, riamh undershoot."

