# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse-proxy muinín:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` le ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, agus an tionscadal ar fud iontaofa-proxy CIDRs atá liostaithe i ``trusted_proxies``. I swarm théann an mol overlay an seachvótálaí féin, mar sin tagann an t-iarratas ar aghaidh ón líonra sin seachas ó na mol ar, agus trusting ach a dhéanann subnet an mol Home Assistant freagra a thabhairt ar gach iarratas proxied le HTTP 400."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse-proxy muinín:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` le `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, agus an tionscadal ar fud iontaofa-proxy CIDRs atá liostaithe i `trusted_proxies`. I swarm théann an mol overlay an seachvótálaí féin, mar sin tagann an t-iarratas ar aghaidh ón líonra sin seachas ó na mol ar, agus trusting ach a dhéanann an subnet mol Home Assistant freagra a thabhairt ar gach iarratas proxied le HTTP 400."

