# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO trí Keycloak:** cumraithe go huathoibríoch ar an gcéad imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy le uathoibríoch-sholáthar:** VV VV1 geataí gach rochtain tríd an cliant OIDC Keycloak roinnte (riachtanais uisce: measartha2-proxy). openresty ar aghaidh an chéannacht fíordheimhnithe go n8n mar iontaofa `Remote-Email` ceanntásc (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script script (`files/hooks.js`, oiriúnaithe ó [PavelSozonov / nó8n-community-so](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) léann go header, auto-provisions n áitiúil8n úsáideoir ar an gcéad síniú isteach, agus saincheisteanna n8n fianán seisiún féin - mar sin gach tailte úsáideoir Keycloak go díreach sa eagarthóir sreabhadh oibre, gan aon dara, n8n-áit logála isteach céim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted ``Remote-Email`` header (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); an ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adapted from `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n’s own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy le uathoibríoch-sholáthar:** VV VV1 geataí gach rochtain tríd an cliant OIDC Keycloak roinnte (riachtanais uisce: measartha2-proxy). openresty ar aghaidh an chéannacht fíordheimhnithe go n8n mar iontaofa ``Remote-Email`` ceanntásc (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script script (``files/hooks.js``, oiriúnaithe ó `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) léann go header, auto-provisions n áitiúil8n úsáideoir ar an gcéad síniú isteach, agus saincheisteanna n8n fianán seisiún féin - mar sin gach tailte úsáideoir Keycloak go díreach sa eagarthóir sreabhadh oibre, gan aon dara, n8n-áit logála isteach céim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** Is Logáil isteach SAML féin SuiteCRM i gcoinne Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` i [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), ní seachfhreastalaí os a chomhair. Iarrataí unauthenticated bhuail an Symfony firewall ar pointe iontrála SAML, a a atreorú chuig Keycloak; Tagann an dearbhú ar ais go dtí `/saml/acs` agus bunaítear seisiún SuiteCRM fíor, mar sin déanann an app a Chomhéadain fhíordheimhnithe féin lena n-áirítear a rialú logout. Cruthaítear cuntais ar an gcéad logáil isteach ón dearbhú (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), agus tá an deimhniú sínithe IdP léamh ó thuairisceoir fíor Keycloak ag [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) ag tosaithe, thar an seachfhreastalaí Tor SOCKS aon uair a bhfuil an t-eisitheoir oinniún, mar gheall ar `.onion` Níl an t-eisitheoir inréitithe go díreach. `/auth` tréimhsí reachable mar an login sos-gloine áitiúil."

