# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm and proxy operation.** Convergence gates read one budget sized for a real stack, print every task row when a stack fails to converge, and give up on a terminal task; the deployment mode a stack was deployed with is resolved instead of assumed. OpenResty reloads a vhost, lua or redirect config instead of redeploying the task. GitLab ships its config trees as swarm configs rather than host binds, and role templates expand through a lookup instead of inline Jinja."
msgstr "**Swarm agus oibríocht seachfhreastalaí.** Léigh geataí Convergence meánmhéide buiséad amháin le haghaidh Stack fíor, clóigh gach sraith tasc nuair a theipeann ar Stack a converge, agus a thabhairt suas ar an tasc teirminéil; an modh imscaradh a bhí imscaradh Stack le réiteach in ionad glacadh leis. OpenResty reloads a vhost, gnó nó atreorú config ionad ath-imlonnú an tasc. GitLab longa a crainn configs mar configs Swarm seachas ceanglóirí óstach, agus teimpléid ról leathnú trí lookup in ionad inline Jinja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm default runtime:** ``docker stack deploy`` drops the per-service ``runtime:`` key, so a swarm worker carries the sandbox as its daemon-wide ``default-runtime`` instead. The stack host keeps the shared kernel for the platform’s own services."
msgstr "**tréimhse de chuid eile: aon** ``docker stack deploy`` titeann an per-seirbhíse ``runtime:`` eochair, mar sin déanann oibrí swarm an bosca gainimh mar a daemon-leathan ``default-runtime`` ina ionad sin. Coinníonn an óstach Stack an eithne roinnte do sheirbhísí an ardán féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm default runtime:** `docker stack deploy` drops the per-service `runtime:` key, so a swarm worker carries the sandbox as its daemon-wide `default-runtime` instead. The stack host keeps the shared kernel for the platform's own services."
msgstr "**tréimhse de chuid eile: aon** `docker stack deploy` titeann an per-seirbhíse `runtime:` eochair, mar sin déanann oibrí swarm an bosca gainimh mar a daemon-leathan `default-runtime` ina ionad sin. Coinníonn an óstach Stack an eithne roinnte do sheirbhísí an ardán féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm deploys no longer abort on a network that already exists.** Some networks are created before their application's stack, as Prometheus does for every application it scrapes. Those networks now carry the stack label, so the application's own deploy uses the existing network instead of failing with \"network with name <entity> already exists\"."
msgstr "**Swarm imscaradh a thuilleadh abort ar líonra atá ann cheana.** Tá roinnt líonraí a cruthaíodh roimh a n-iarratas Stack, mar a dhéanann Prometheus do gach iarratas scrapes sé. Déanann na líonraí sin an lipéad cruach anois, mar sin úsáideann an t-iarratas féin an líonra atá ann cheana féin in ionad teip le \"líonra le ainm <entity> ann cheana féin\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm parity via node-default runtime.** `docker stack deploy` ignores the compose `runtime:` key. The isolating runtime is therefore installed and set as the daemon-wide default on placement-labelled agent nodes; the agent services are pinned there via placement constraint, and every other service is kept off those nodes by the inverse constraint, because a node-wide default runtime applies to whatever is scheduled on it. Compose mode uses the compose `runtime:` key directly on the same image. Both modes MUST reach a running isolated agent, and the deploy MUST refuse to label a node whose daemon still defaults to the shared kernel. A dedicated provisioning role (`svc-virt-kata`) installs the runtime, re-renders the daemon configuration, and labels the node."
msgstr "**parity Swarm trí nód-réamhshocrú runtime.** `docker stack deploy` neamhaird a dhéanamh ar an chumadh `runtime:` eochair. Tá an runtime isolating dá bhrí sin suiteáilte agus a leagtar mar an réamhshocraithe daemon-leathan ar nóid gníomhaire socrúcháin-lipéadaithe; na seirbhísí gníomhaire pinned ann trí srianta socrúcháin, agus tá gach seirbhís eile a choinneáil amach na nóid ag an srian inbhéartach, mar gheall ar feidhm runtime réamhshocraithe node-leathan le cibé atá sceidealta ar sé. Úsáideann modh múirín an chumadh `runtime:` eochair go díreach ar an íomhá chéanna. An dá modhanna MUST a bhaint amach gníomhaire scoite ag rith, agus an MUST imscaradh dhiúltú a lipéad nód a bhfuil a demon mainneachtainí fós leis an eithne roinnte. Ról soláthair tiomnaithe (`svc-virt-kata`) installs an runtime, ath-renders an chumraíocht daemon, agus lipéid an nód."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm, measured rather than assumed.** The deploy waits for its own update instead of guessing after it, refuses to call a stack converged while it is still updating, survives a task that failed and came back, reports what converged rather than only what did not, and says why the convergence probe refused. Placement is constrained to a role's declared platform arch, redis and memcached sidecars get a deploy block, and a run-once service no longer strands the stack deploy waiting for a replica it never has. The rescue dump captures the contents of the state volumes. In the test lab, workers are labelled kata-capable only when the app is sandboxed, NFS detaches before the node containers die, and the sandbox tier gets a second node."
msgstr "**Swarm, tomhaiste seachas glacadh.** Na Waits imscaradh le haghaidh a thabhairt cothrom le dáta féin in ionad guessing tar éis é, diúltaíonn chun glaoch ar Stack converged cé go bhfuil sé fós a thabhairt cothrom le dáta, Maireann tasc gur theip agus tháinig ar ais, tuarascálacha cad converged seachas ach cad nach raibh, agus deir cén fáth ar dhiúltaigh an cóineasú probe. Tá Socrú srianta le róil ar áirse ardán dearbhaithe, redis agus sidecars memcached a fháil bloc imscaradh, agus seirbhís reáchtáil-amháin a thuilleadh snáitheanna an chairn imscaradh ag fanacht le macasamhail riamh sé. Gabhann an dumpáil tarrthála ábhar na méideanna stáit. Sa saotharlann tástála, tá oibrithe lipéadaithe kata-capable ach amháin nuair a bhíonn an app sandboxed, díormaí NFS roimh na coimeádáin nód bás, agus faigheann an sraith bosca gainimh an dara nód."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Swarm:** single replica, ``placement: manager``, ``nfs: false`` on the raft volume, ``service_update_order = stop-first``. Raft’s BoltDB store is mmap + ``fsync`` based, so it must stay node-local and must never have two tasks writing one directory."
msgstr "**taiseachas aeir: fliuch** macasamhail aonair, ``placement: manager``, ``nfs: false`` ar an méid rafta, ``service_update_order = stop-first``. Tá siopa BoltDB Raft ar mmap + ``fsync`` bunaithe, mar sin ní mór é fanacht nód-áitiúil agus ní mór go mbeadh dhá tascanna scríobh eolaire amháin."

