# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``external.sh`` — real job-pickup smoke test (optional).** Uses ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` to confirm the runners registered and are online via the GitHub API, dispatches a smoke workflow, and polls it to completion. Skipped automatically when no token is present."
msgstr "**``external.sh`` - fíor-tástáil deataigh poist (roghnach).** Úsáidí ``RUNNER_API_TOKEN`` na rádóirí atá cláraithe a dheimhniú agus tá siad ar líne tríd an API GitHub, seoltar sreabhadh oibre deataigh, agus vótaíochtaí é a chríochnú. Scipeáil go huathoibríoch nuair nach bhfuil aon chomhartha i láthair."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``images/``** opts into NFS (``nfs: true`` in the ``compose_volumes`` call from ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). The volume is shared across all swarm nodes so the MediaWiki application service can be rescheduled freely."
msgstr "**``images/``** roghnaigh isteach NFS (``nfs: true`` sa ``compose_volumes`` glaoch ó ``templates/compose.yml.j2``). Tá an toirt roinnte ar fud na nóid swarm ionas gur féidir leis an tseirbhís iarratais MediaWiki a athsceidealú faoi shaoirse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**``local.sh`` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then ``container cp``\\ s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys ``web-app-dashboard`` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner’s network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**``local.sh`` — go hiomlán áitiúil, gan aon GitHub seachtrach.** Tá na coimeádáin rádala sláintiúil agus oibríonn soicéad DooD, ansin ``container cp``\\ s an repo isteach sa dara háit, **Tógann an íomhá Infinito go háitiúil**, agus imscaradh ``web-app-dashboard`` (gach seirbhís eile faoi mhíchumas) taobh istigh de **séalaithe, throwaway Docker daemon** go scaireanna an dara háit ar líonra namespace. Tá an bosca gainimh torn síos ar an slí amach, mar sin tá an Stack óstach riamh i dteagmháil léi agus **Níl gá le rochtain GitHub / GHCR**. Ar an tástáil async pas a fháil go bhfuil an imscaradh trom skipped (tá sé bailíochtaithe uair amháin ar an pas info)."

