msgid "A clean `down && up` is required after the change: `make compose-up` alone recreates the bridge but compose then re-attaches existing containers with dynamic IPs instead of the static `default.env` ones, which breaks CoreDNS."
msgstr "glan `down && up` ag teastáil tar éis an athraithe: `make compose-up` ina n-aonar recreates an droichead ach a chumadh ansin ath-ionsaithe coimeádáin atá ann cheana féin le IP dinimiciúil in ionad an statach `default.env` cinn, a bhriseann CoreDNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A client MUST NOT treat an unreachable provider as fatal while the play is still running. Roles deploy in dependency order, so a client that probes during its own role can run before a provider exists at all, and aborting there prevents that provider from ever deploying. This is the same exemption `credential_missing` already carries, and it ends the same way: the reconciliation stage probes with `MCP_RECONCILE_STRICT` once every provider has run, and a provider still unreachable there is a real failure."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR cliant a chóireáil soláthraí unreachable mar marfach cé go bhfuil an spraoi ag rith fós. Róil imscaradh in ord dependency, mar sin is féidir le cliant a probes le linn a ról féin a reáchtáil sula bhfuil soláthraí ar chor ar bith, agus aborting ann cosc a chur ar an soláthraí ó riamh imscaradh. Is é seo an díolúine chéanna `credential_missing` cheana féin, agus críochnaíonn sé ar an mbealach céanna: an chéim athmhuintearais probes le `MCP_RECONCILE_STRICT` uair amháin tá gach soláthraí reáchtáil, agus soláthraí fós unreachable tá teip fíor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A client declares what it can present instead of what it serves:"
