msgstr "A MUST cúntóir nua beo san fhofhillteán a oireann a fhreagracht. Freagrachtaí nua MAY spreagadh subfolder nua, ach NÍ MÓR leacaithe ar ais isteach sa leibhéal barr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A new key MUST be placed in `RESOLUTION_ORDER` after every key it depends on, and the administrator key table MUST be updated to document the new field."
msgstr "A MUST eochair nua a chur i `RESOLUTION_ORDER` tar éis gach eochair braitheann sé ar, agus an riarthóir MUST tábla eochair a thabhairt cothrom le dáta chun an réimse nua a dhoiciméadú."

