msgid "A new shared service MUST:"
msgstr "Seirbhís chomhroinnte nua MUST:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A no-variant `mode=reinstall` as the reaction to a failed variant or a code change. Only rows 1 and 4 omit `variant=`. To retry one failing variant, pin it with row 2; never restart the whole matrix to retry a single variant."
msgstr "Níl aon athrú `mode=reinstall` mar an imoibriú le malairt theip nó athrú cód. Níl ach sraitheanna 1 agus 4 Déan teagmháil `variant=`. Chun retry leagan amháin ag teip, bioráin sé le chéile 2; riamh atosú an maitrís ar fad a retry leagan amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A number is that many rows; anything else is a selection token (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`) and the start is the first regular row it names. Resuming at a role beats counting rows by hand: the ranking shifts whenever a variant is added, so the index that meant 'carry on behind nextcloud' yesterday means something else today, while the token still says it."
msgstr "Tá roinnt go sraitheanna go leor; Is rud ar bith eile a token rogha (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`) agus is é an tús an chéad tsraith rialta ainmneacha sé. Ag glacadh leis ag róil buillí comhaireamh sraitheanna de láimh: na shifts rangú aon uair a mhalairt leis, mar sin an t-innéacs a chiallaigh 'carradh ar chúl nextcloud' Ciallaíonn inné rud éigin eile lá atá inniu ann, cé go deir an chomhartha fós é."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A parsed README: everything before the first H2, then its H2 blocks."
msgstr "A README parsed: gach rud roimh an chéad H2, ansin a H2 bloic."

# translated-by: libretranslate
