msgstr "iompórtáil MAY modúl per-tool ó `utils.cache` (le haghaidh `PROJECT_ROOT`) agus ó stdlib."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A per-tool module MUST NOT import another per-tool module. Shared logic flows through `utils.install.primitives`, `utils.install.pip`, `utils.install.npm`, `utils.install.github_release`, and `utils.install.system_pkg` only."
msgstr "A modúl in aghaidh an-ol NACH allmhairiú eile in aghaidh an-ol modúl. Sreabhadh loighic roinnte trí `utils.install.primitives`, `utils.install.pip`, `utils.install.npm`, `utils.install.github_release`, agus `utils.install.system_pkg` ach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A persona scenario MUST fail loudly when its contracted journey cannot execute end-to-end. A silent `test.skip(...)` on runtime detection of \"no logout button\", \"no authenticated surface\", or \"no admin UI marker\" is FORBIDDEN. Silent skips hide real regressions (broken OIDC mapping, removed logout button, misconfigured oauth2-proxy, drifted UI selectors) behind a green deploy."
msgstr "Teipeann ar chás persona go hard nuair nach féidir a thuras conradh a fhorghníomhú deireadh le deireadh. A adh `test.skip(...)` ar bhrath runtime \"aon cnaipe logáil isteach\", \"aon dromchla fíordheimhnithe\", nó \"aon marcóir Chomhéadain admin\" Is FORBIDDEN. Scipeanna Silent cheilt aischéimnithe fíor (mapáil OIDC briste, cnaipe logála amach a bhaint, oauth a mhaolú2-proxy, roghnóir Chomhéadain drifted) taobh thiar de glas imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A persona scenario that only logs in and logs out is NOT enough. After the auth chain settles (or directly on the role surface when no auth is required), every persona MUST drive a real, app-specific interaction so the spec proves the role is responsive to user input, not just reachable."
msgstr "Tá cás persona go logs ach amháin i agus logs amach NACH leor. Tar éis Socraíonn an slabhra auth (nó go díreach ar an dromchla ról nuair nach bhfuil aon auth ag teastáil), gach persona MUST tiomáint idirghníomhaíocht fíor, app-sonrach mar sin go gcruthóidh an spec an ról atá freagrach as ionchur úsáideora, ní reachable."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A personal digital sovereignty stack for individuals controlling their own data."
msgstr "Stack ceannasachta digiteach pearsanta do dhaoine aonair a rialú a gcuid sonraí féin."

