msgid "A value segment interpolates its input through a ``format()`` placeholder and opens with the format string up to ``{0}``. A marker segment carries no value at all: its literal shows only that the input was set, and its absence is the other state."
msgstr "A deighleog luach interpolates a ionchur trí ``format()`` placeholder agus osclaíonn leis an teaghrán formáid suas go dtí ``{0}``. Déanann deighleog marcóir aon luach ar chor ar bith: léiríonn a litriú ach amháin go raibh leagtha an t-ionchur, agus is é a bheith as láthair an stát eile."

