# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "API reference: `iter_project_files(extensions=…, exclude_tests=…, exclude_dirs=…)` yields absolute paths, the walk is cached once per process. `iter_project_files_with_content(…)` yields `(path, content)` with both layers cached. `read_text(path)` returns cached UTF-8 content. The walker automatically prunes `.git`, `.cache`, `.pytest_cache`, `.ruff_cache`, `.venv`, `venv`, `__pycache__`, and `node_modules`."
msgstr "Tagairt API: `iter_project_files(extensions=…, exclude_tests=…, exclude_dirs=…)` torthaí cosáin iomlán, tá an siúlóid i dtaisce uair amháin in aghaidh an phróisis. `iter_project_files_with_content(…)` torthaí `(path, content)` leis an dá sraitheanna i dtaisce. `read_text(path)` tuairisceáin i dtaisce UTF-8 ábhar. An siúlóir prunes huathoibríoch `.git`, `.cache`, `.pytest_cache`, `.ruff_cache`, `.venv`, `venv`, `__pycache__`, agus `node_modules`."

