msgstr "Ní dhearbhaítear cead isteach anseo. Marcanna cliant féin uair amháin, ina chuid féin ``meta/services.yml`` féin-iontráil, mar ``mcp_consumer: true``; imíonn soláthraí trí iompar ``mcp_consumer: false`` ar iontráil an chliaint sin ina chuid féin ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` réitíonn an péire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "Saol iontrála i `meta/services.yml`, ní anseo. Leagann cliant `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` ina ról féin; diúltaíonn soláthraí amháin trí shuíomh `mcp_consumer: false` ar iontráil an chliaint. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) Éilíonn gach soláthraí a dhéanamh `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`iontráil -gated do gach cliant dearbhaithe, mar sin soláthraí pleananna cruinn agus cliant le chéile."

