# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Amended after implementation: the deployed Hermes version serves a bearer API rather than a browser dashboard, so its native-OIDC support cannot be used. It is gated at the auth proxy instead, like OpenClaw and Flowise, admitting the role's `administrator` and `mcp` groups. Holding `API_SERVER_KEY` alone was the whole boundary before, which put every MCP provider Hermes is admitted to behind one shared deployment secret. The cost of the proxy is deliberate: an OpenAI-compatible client presenting only a bearer no longer reaches Hermes through its public vhost, and has to come from inside the container network."
msgstr "Molta tar éis a chur i bhfeidhm: feidhmíonn an leagan Hermes imscaradh API settings seachas Painéal na nIonstraimí bhrabhsálaí, mar sin ní féidir a tacaíocht dúchais-OIDC a úsáid. Tá sé gated ag an seachfhreastalaí auth ina ionad sin, cosúil le OpenClaw agus Flowise, a ligean isteach an ról ar `administrator` agus `mcp` grúpaí. Amharc ar gach eolas `API_SERVER_KEY` ina n-aonar a bhí an teorainn iomlán roimh, a chur ar gach soláthraí MCP é Hermes isteach taobh thiar amháin rúnda imscaradh roinnte. Is é an costas an seachfhreastalaí d'aon ghnó: cliant OpenAI-comhoiriúnach i láthair ach bearer sroicheann a thuilleadh Hermes trína vhost poiblí, agus tá le teacht ón líonra coimeádán."

