msgid "Among the hosts in `svc-swarm-node`, the cluster manager is identified by additional membership in `svc-swarm-manager`. v1 scope: exactly ONE host. Workers are derived as `svc-swarm-node − svc-swarm-manager` — no duplicated list in `group_vars`."
msgstr "I measc na hóstach i `svc-swarm-node`, aithnítear an bainisteoir braisle le comhaltas breise i `svc-swarm-manager`. v1 raon feidhme: óstach AMHÁIN go díreach. Oibrithe a dhíorthaítear mar `svc-swarm-node − svc-swarm-manager` — gan aon liosta dúblach a bheith ann `group_vars`."

