# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An explicit `tor` input still wins over the full coverage: `enforced`, `exclusive` and `disabled` are operator narrowings, and a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` to false never gets an onion run regardless."
msgstr "Gan a bheith ráite `tor` ionchur Bhuaigh fós thar an clúdach iomlán: `enforced`, `exclusive` agus `disabled` Tá cúnguithe oibreoir, agus leagan go bioráin `services.tor.enabled` a bréagach riamh faigheann oinniún reáchtáil beag beann ar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An explicit per-domain allowlist is required because the wildcard form `WebFetch(domain:*)` is **inert**: observed empirically, the permission prompt still fires for every new host despite the wildcard being present, so the wildcard buys nothing. Contributors who need a new origin MUST extend this list (and the sandbox `allowedDomains` in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) explicitly."
msgstr "Tá an deisitheoir follasach in aghaidh an-domain ag teastáil mar gheall ar an bhfoirm cárta fiáin `WebFetch(domain:*)` Is maith liom **taiseachas aeir: fliuch**: faoi deara empirically, an cead go pras fós tinte do gach óstach nua in ainneoin an cárta fiáin a bheith i láthair, mar sin ceannaíonn an wildcard rud ar bith. Sínitheoirí a dteastaíonn MUST tionscnaimh nua uathu an liosta seo a leathnú (agus an bosca gainimh `allowedDomains` i [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) go sainráite."

