# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Ansible forks a fresh worker process for every task. The in-process cache inside `get_merged_applications` therefore never survives from one task to the next, and every task that touches the lookup would render the full tree again (about 16 to 23 seconds per task on a CI runner, measured on the workspace jobs)."
msgstr "Forks Ansible próiseas oibrí úr do gach tasc. An taisce in-próiseáil taobh istigh `get_merged_applications` dá bhrí sin, ní mhaireann ó tasc amháin go dtí an chéad cheann eile, agus gach tasc a bhaineann leis go mbeadh an Lookup dhéanamh ar an crann iomlán arís (thart faoi 16 go dtí 23 soicind in aghaidh an tasc ar dara háit CI, thomhas ar na poist spás oibre)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Ansible forks a fresh worker process per task, so the in-process `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. The constructor stage renders once and parks the payload plus its cache key in the host fact named by `APPLICATIONS_RENDERED_FACT`; every later worker inherits that fact at fork time and `get_merged_applications` serves it instead of rendering. Ansible-free at import time like the rest of the package."
msgstr "Forks Ansible próiseas oibrí úr in aghaidh an tasc, mar sin an in-próiseas `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` Tosaíonn folamh i ngach oibrí. Déanann an chéim tógálaí uair amháin agus páirceanna an pálasta móide a eochair taisce sa fhíoras óstach ainmnithe ag `APPLICATIONS_RENDERED_FACT`; gach oibrí ina dhiaidh sin hoidhreacht an bhfíric ag am forc agus `get_merged_applications` feidhmíonn sé in ionad a dhéanamh. Ansible-saor in aisce ag am allmhairiú cosúil leis an chuid eile den phacáiste."

