msgid "Any `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` installs a persistent commit-signing identity an attacker could use to impersonate the operator on signed commits; `delete` can lock the operator out of signed-commit policies; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Aon duine `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` d'fhéadfadh ionsaitheoir a úsáid chun an t-oibreoir a dhícháiliú ar chimiú sínithe; `delete` féadfaidh sé an t-oibreoir a ghlasáil as polasaithe sínithe; `list` sceitheadh an fhardal eochair-fingerprint. Bainistíocht eochair seachtrach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/`remove` mutate CI secrets under the operator's identity; `list` leaks secret names, the exact same risk class as the `gh api * /actions/secrets*` deny (\"Even GETs leak secret names\"). Out-of-band secret management only."
msgstr "Aon duine `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/ Baile`remove` rúin CI mutate faoi chéannacht an oibreora; `list` sceitheadh ainmneacha rúnda, an rang riosca céanna cruinn mar an `gh api * /actions/secrets*` taiseachas aeir: fliuch (\"Fiú GETs leak ainmneacha rúnda\"). Bainistíocht rúnda seachtrach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is a persistent auth backdoor giving shell-equivalent push access until revoked; `delete` can lock the operator out; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Aon duine `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is backdoor auth leanúnach a thabhairt rochtain bhrú sliogánach comhionann go dtí go chúlghairm; `delete` Is féidir glas an t-oibreoir amach; `list` sceitheadh an fhardal eochair-fingerprint. Bainistíocht eochair seachtrach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh variable` subcommand. Mirror of the `gh secret *` rule for Actions variables. Variables are unencrypted secrets-lite; even `list` exposes their values directly, so the entire namespace is blocked and managed out-of-band."
msgstr "Aon duine `gh variable` subcommand. Scáthán an `gh secret *` riail le haghaidh Athróg Gníomhartha. Tá éagsúlachtaí neamhchriptithe rúin-lite; fiú `list` nochtann a luachanna go díreach, mar sin tá an t-ainmspás ar fad bac agus a bhainistiú as-de-bhanna."

