# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "As an operator of a self-hosted deployment, I want every role whose application ships a native AI feature to reach the platform's own LiteLLM gateway instead of a third-party provider, so that prompts, documents and telemetry never leave the deployment and one credential rotation covers every application."
msgstr "Mar oibreoir imscaradh féin-óstach, ba mhaith liom gach ról a bhfuil longa iarratas gné AI dúchais chun teacht ar an ardán féin LiteLLM geata in ionad soláthraí tríú páirtí, ionas go mbeidh leideanna, doiciméid agus teiliméadracht riamh fhágáil ar an imscaradh agus clúdach rothlú dintiúir amháin gach iarratas."

