msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure in swarm and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from inspecting the live cluster in-container: reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour on the running services. Never redeploy on a guess — a swarm redeploy costs tens of minutes."
msgstr "Roimh gach ath-imlonnú tú MUST réiteach go hiomlán ar an teip i swarm agus teacht ar a laghad **95% muinín a shocraíonn do shocrú iarbhír é**. Go MUST muinín teacht ó iniúchadh a dhéanamh ar an mbraisle beo in-tainer: atáirgeadh an teip, siúl ar an cosán a shocrú, agus an t-iompar ceartaithe ar na seirbhísí ag rith. Ná ath-imlonnú ar buille faoi thuairim - a redeploy swarm costais deich nóiméad."

