# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. Fediwall is a read-only public wall: ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``logout.enabled: false``, and the container is a plain nginx image serving the pre-built upstream tarball. There is no account model, no login form and no logout control."
msgstr "An dá fhíordheimhnithe personas Playwright atá bac. Is balla poiblí é Fediwall: ``meta/services.yml`` bioráin ``sso.enabled: false`` agus ``logout.enabled: false``, agus is íomhá nginx plain é an coimeádán a fhreastalaíonn ar an tarball réamh-thionscanta. Níl aon samhail cuntais, aon fhoirm logáil isteach agus aon rialú logála amach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. Fediwall is a read-only public wall: `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `logout.enabled: false`, and the container is a plain nginx image serving the pre-built upstream tarball. There is no account model, no login form and no logout control."
msgstr "An dá fhíordheimhnithe personas Playwright atá bac. Is balla poiblí é Fediwall: `meta/services.yml` bioráin `sso.enabled: false` agus `logout.enabled: false`, agus is íomhá nginx plain é an coimeádán a fhreastalaíonn ar an tarball réamh-thionscanta. Níl aon samhail cuntais, aon fhoirm logáil isteach agus aon rialú logála amach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``logout.enabled: false``: Bridgy Fed has no local user table, no in-app authorisation tier, and no logout button, and placing it behind the SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic."
msgstr "An dá fhíordheimhnithe personas Playwright atá bac. ``meta/services.yml`` bioráin ``sso.enabled: false`` agus ``logout.enabled: false``: Tá Bridgy Fed aon tábla úsáideora áitiúil, gan aon sraith údarú in-app, agus ní bheadh aon cnaipe logout, agus é a chur taobh thiar de na sidecar SSO-proxy briseadh tráchta chónaidhmthe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `logout.enabled: false`: Bridgy Fed has no local user table, no in-app authorisation tier, and no logout button, and placing it behind the SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic."
msgstr "An dá fhíordheimhnithe personas Playwright atá bac. `meta/services.yml` bioráin `sso.enabled: false` agus `logout.enabled: false`: Tá Bridgy Fed aon tábla úsáideora áitiúil, gan aon sraith údarú in-app, agus ní bheadh aon cnaipe logout, agus é a chur taobh thiar de na sidecar SSO-proxy briseadh tráchta chónaidhmthe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both bring their own agent logic and internal sandboxing. This requirement adds the **isolation and scaling substrate** around them plus a **Flowise supervisor** for cross-agent coordination. Model routing is the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; the MCP tool contract is [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)."
msgstr "An dá a thabhairt ar a gcuid loighic gníomhaire féin agus sandboxing inmheánach. Cuireann an ceanglas seo na **aonrú agus foshraith scálú** timpeall orthu móide **Flowise maoirseoirí** le haghaidh comhordú trasghníomhaireachta. Is é an ródú múnla an [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) geata; Is é an conradh uirlis MCP [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)."

