# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both deploy modes get the bridge: a Tor node runs the same dnsmasq listener in compose and in swarm, so both resolve onions alike."
msgstr "An dá modhanna imscaradh a fháil ar an droichead: Ritheann nód Tor an t-éisteoir dnsmasq céanna i chumadh agus i swarm, mar sin an dá oinniúin réiteach araon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both events carry a `labeled` trigger, so applying the `🛡️ Trusted` label starts fresh runs that already observe it: the `pull_request_target` build switches to the PR head and the `pull_request` orchestrator skips the wait — no extra push is needed. (Re-running an existing run does not pick up a new label, because GitHub replays the original event payload.) The trade-off is that any label change starts a fresh PR CI run."
msgstr "An dá imeacht a dhéanamh `labeled` spreagadh, mar sin a chur i bhfeidhm ar an `🛡️ Trusted` Tosaíonn lipéad Ritheann úr a bhreathnú cheana féin: an `pull_request_target` aistriú a thógáil chuig an ceann PR agus an `pull_request` orchestrator skips an fanacht - níl aon bhrú breise ag teastáil. (Ní Re-reáchtáil reáchtáil atá ann cheana féin a phiocadh suas lipéad nua, mar gheall ar GitHub replays an pálasta ócáid bunaidh.) Is é an trádáil-uaire go dtosaíonn aon athrú lipéad reáchtáil CI PR úr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both extensions are force-installed through Firefox Enterprise Policies; each addon's `config.xpi_url` is read by [`templates/policies.json.j2`](./templates/policies.json.j2) into `policies.Extensions.Install[]`. They carry no cross-role dependency, so no `bridges:` key is present."
msgstr "Tá an dá síntí suiteáilte i bhfeidhm trí Pholasaithe Fiontar Firefox; gach addon ar `config.xpi_url` a léamh ag [`templates/policies.json.j2`](./templates/policies.json.j2) isteach i `policies.Extensions.Install[]`. Déanann siad aon spleáchas tras-ról, mar sin aon `bridges:` Tá eochair i láthair."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both extensions are force-installed through Firefox Enterprise Policies; each addon’s ``config.xpi_url`` is read by ```templates/policies.json.j2`` <./templates/policies.json.j2>`__ into ``policies.Extensions.Install[]``. They carry no cross-role dependency, so no ``bridges:`` key is present."
msgstr "Tá an dá síntí suiteáilte i bhfeidhm trí Pholasaithe Fiontar Firefox; gach addon ar ``config.xpi_url`` a léamh ag ```templates/policies.json.j2`` <./templates/policies.json.j2>`__ into ``policies.Extensions.Install[]``. They carry no cross-role dependency, so no ``bridges:`` Tá eochair i láthair."

