msgid "Both fields live on the role's **primary entity** in `meta/services.yml`, where `<primary_entity> = get_entity_name(role_name)`:"
msgstr "An dá réimsí beo ar an ról ar **an t-aonán bunscoile** i `meta/services.yml`, i gcás `<primary_entity> = get_entity_name(role_name)`:"

