# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Breaks native apps (they authenticate with API tokens, cannot run the browser OIDC flow). Not suitable as the sole gate for a media server."
msgstr "Sosanna apps dúchais (fíordheimhnithe siad le comharthaí API, ní féidir a reáchtáil ar an bhrabhsálaí OIDC sreabhadh). Níl sé oiriúnach mar an geata aonair do fhreastalaí meán."

