# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cached value: the **list of documents** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returns for that file. Single-document YAML files cache as a 1-element list, so a callsite that asks for the single doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) and a callsite that asks for the multi-doc list (``load_yaml_all``) share **the same parse**. The same list / dict instances are returned to every caller, so callers that mutate the result MUST `copy.deepcopy()` it first. Treat the value as read-only."
msgstr "Luach Cached: an **liosta doiciméad** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` tuairisceáin don chomhad sin. Aonair-doiciméad comhaid YAML taisce mar 1-element liosta, mar sin callite a iarrann an doc amháin (``load_yaml`` / Baile ``load_yaml_any``) agus callite a iarrann an liosta il-doic (``load_yaml_all``) sciar **an parse chéanna**. An liosta céanna / cásanna deachúla ar ais chuig gach glaoiteoir, mar sin glaoiteoirí go mutate an toradh MUST `copy.deepcopy()` sé ar dtús. Caitheamh an luach mar a léamh-amháin."

