msgid "Candidates are read shallowest first, because a depth-1 job records the orchestrator's own inputs while a deeper one records what its caller forwarded. Skipped jobs are passed over: they never upload a log blob, so their log endpoint answers ``BlobNotFound`` as a bare HTTP 404 -- and a force-cancelled run can leave every depth-1 job skipped, which is why the deeper jobs are read at all rather than treated as inputs-free."
msgstr "Léann iarrthóirí an chéad cheann éadomhain, mar gheall ar dhoimhneacht-1 taifid poist ionchuir an orchestrator féin agus taifid níos doimhne amháin cad a glaoiteoir ar aghaidh. Poist Skipped a rith thar: siad riamh uaslódáil blob logáil, mar sin a gcuid freagraí log endpoint ``BlobNotFound`` mar HTTP lom 404 -- agus is féidir a reáchtáil ar ceal fórsa a fhágáil gach doimhneacht-1 post skipped, cén fáth go bhfuil na poist níos doimhne a léamh ar chor ar bith seachas mar ionchuir-saor in aisce."

