msgstr "Laghdaíonn leideanna soiléire athbhrí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click \"Sign in with Keycloak\" — Keycloak chain completes, lands on the Semaphore dashboard."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo \"Cláraigh le Keycloak\" — Críochnaíonn slabhra Keycloak, tailte ar an Painéal na nIonstraimí Semaphore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **Continue to summary** and then **Create Token**."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Leanúint ar aghaidh go hachomair** agus ansin **Cruthaigh comhartha**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **Generate new token → Generate new token (classic)**."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Gin comhartha nua → Gin comhartha nua (clasaiceach)**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **Join Group**, search for the target role name, and join the group at the full path shown above."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Member Grúpa**, cuardach a dhéanamh ar an ainm ról sprioc, agus páirt a ghlacadh sa ghrúpa ag an cosán iomlán a thaispeántar thuas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **New repository secret** and add `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` with the App's Client ID (shown on the App's General page under **About**, in the `Iv…` format — *not* the numeric App ID)."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Stór rúnda nua** agus cuir `BOT_APP_CLIENT_ID` leis an App ID Cliant (a thaispeántar ar leathanach Ginearálta an App faoi **Maidir le**, sa `Iv…` formáid — *bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin* an ID App uimhriúil)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **New repository secret** and add `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` with the complete PEM content, including the `-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----` and `-----END PRIVATE KEY-----` lines."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Stór rúnda nua** agus cuir `BOT_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` leis an ábhar iomlán PEM, lena n-áirítear `-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----` agus `-----END PRIVATE KEY-----` línte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **New repository variable**."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **athróg stór nua**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click **Purge Cache**."
msgstr "Cliceáil anseo **Caitheamh Aimsire**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click a logout control rendered on the role's currently authenticated surface (link or button whose accessible name matches `logout` / `sign out` / `sign-out` / `abmelden`)."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar rialú logout a rinneadh ar an ról dromchla fíordheimhnithe faoi láthair (nasc nó cnaipe a oireann ainm inrochtana `logout` / Baile `sign out` / Baile `sign-out` / Baile `abmelden`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click the \"Login with Keycloak\" SSO button — Keycloak login flow completes, user lands on the ERPNext desk (`/app`)."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar an \"Logáil isteach le Keycloak\" Cnaipe SSO — Críochnaíonn sreabhadh logála Keycloak, tailte úsáideora ar an deasc ERPNext (`/app`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Click your profile icon (top right) → **My Profile**"
msgstr "Cliceáil ar do deilbhín próifíl (ceart barr) → → **Mo Phróifíl**"

