# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client roles such as `web-app-openwebui` and `web-app-flowise` MUST discover enabled shared MCP server roles through the merged applications data. They MUST NOT hard-code the candidate list in templates."
msgstr "Róil Cliant ar nós `web-app-openwebui` agus `web-app-flowise` MUST amach ar chumas Róil freastalaí MCP roinnte trí na sonraí iarratais cumaisc. NÍ MÓR siad crua-cód an liosta iarrthóirí i teimpléid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client secret, MUST come from the inventory (`OIDC_OVERRIDE.CLIENT.SECRET`)"
msgstr "Cliant rúnda, MUST teacht as an fardal (`OIDC_OVERRIDE.CLIENT.SECRET`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client shape"
msgstr "cruth Cliant"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client to adapter: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, owned by ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. The adapter refuses any request that does not present it, so a caller on the container network is no longer implicitly trusted."
msgstr "Cliant a adapter: ``credentials.mcp_bearer``, ar úinéireacht ag ``mcp-web-app-baserow``. Diúltaíonn an adapter aon iarratas nach bhfuil i láthair é, mar sin tá glaoiteoir ar an líonra coimeádán a thuilleadh muinín intuigthe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client to adapter: `credentials.mcp_bearer`, owned by `mcp-web-app-baserow`. The adapter refuses any request that does not present it, so a caller on the container network is no longer implicitly trusted."
msgstr "Cliant a adapter: `credentials.mcp_bearer`, ar úinéireacht ag `mcp-web-app-baserow`. Diúltaíonn an adapter aon iarratas nach bhfuil i láthair é, mar sin tá glaoiteoir ar an líonra coimeádán a thuilleadh muinín intuigthe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client transport"
msgstr "Iompar Cliant"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client-side NFS setup for mounting a remote server export on every swarm node, with a deploy-time reachability probe"
msgstr "Cliant-taobh thus NFS le haghaidh gléasta onnmhairithe freastalaí iargúlta ar gach nód swarm, le probe inrochtaineacht imscaradh-am"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client-side WireGuard VPN role for stable connectivity with a systemd service and script that tune interface MTU"
msgstr "Cliant-taobh WireGuard VPN ról le haghaidh nascacht cobhsaí le seirbhís córasach agus script go comhéadan tune MTU"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Client-side configuration bind-mounted into the `infinito` runner so that pip, npm, and apt route through the Sonatype Nexus 3 OSS pull-through proxy."
msgstr "Cliant-taobh chumraíocht ceangal-mounted isteach sa `infinito` rádala ionas go pip, npm, agus bealach apt trí Sonatype Nexus 3 OSS tarraingt-trí seachfhreastalaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients do not read the server list directly. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes the intersection of the provider's admitted clients, resolved by `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), with the calling client's `supported_transports` and `supported_auths`, resolves each provider's declared credential, and returns:"
msgstr "Ní dhéanann cliaint léamh ar an liosta freastalaí go díreach. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes an áit a dtrasnaíonn na cliaint admhaigh an soláthraí, arna réiteach ag `derive_allowed_consumers` i [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), leis an gcliant glaoch ar `supported_transports` agus `supported_auths`, réitíonn gach soláthraí dintiúir dearbhaithe, agus tuairisceáin:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Cliaint i láthair Gitea rochtain pearsanta chomhartha mar `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Eisítear an dearbhán i gcoinne an chuntais riarthóra agus coimeádtar ann `sys-token-store`. A `auth_subject` Is maith liom `administrator`, mar sin glaonna MCP reáchtáil le cearta riarthóir seachas mar an t-úsáideoir iarraidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Cliaint i láthair Gitea rochtain pearsanta chomhartha mar ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Eisítear an dearbhán i gcoinne an chuntais riarthóra agus coimeádtar ann ``sys-token-store``. A ``auth_subject`` Is maith liom ``administrator``, mar sin glaonna MCP reáchtáil le cearta riarthóir seachas mar an t-úsáideoir iarraidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Cliaint i láthair ar chomhartha rochtain fada-cónaí mar `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Déantar an dearbhán a mhionú uair amháin in aghaidh an imscaradh agus coimeádtar i `sys-token-store` faoi na `administrator` úsáideoir, ní sa ról ar `credentials:` bloc. Tá iarratas admhálacha freagra le 404: Ní Baile Cúnta nochtann an deireadhphointe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Cliaint i láthair ar chomhartha rochtain fada-cónaí mar ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Déantar an dearbhán a mhionú uair amháin in aghaidh an imscaradh agus coimeádtar i ``sys-token-store`` faoi na ``administrator`` úsáideoir, ní sa ról ar ``credentials:`` bloc. Tá iarratas admhálacha freagra le 404: Ní Baile Cúnta nochtann an deireadhphointe."

