msgid "Disabled the *email* service in the *web-app-pihole* role by pinning *services.email* to a static *enabled: false* / *shared: false* with the matching *dynamic-flag* and *email* nocheck suppressions, removing the now-static email overrides from *meta/variants.yml*, and adding *javascript* true/false variant pins to keep the dynamic-flag matrix-coverage guard green."
msgstr "Daoine faoi Mhíchumas an *duille dath: glas* seirbhís sa *web-app-pihole* ról ag pinning *services.email* go statach *cumasaithe: bréagach* / Baile *roinnte: bréagach* leis an meaitseáil *dinimiciúil - brada* agus *duille dath: glas* cosc nocheck, deireadh a chur leis an overrides ríomhphost anois statach ó *meta/variants.yml*, agus cur *cineál gas: in airde* fíor / bioráin malairt bradaíl a choinneáil ar an dinimiciúil maitrís-clúdach garda glas."

