# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Doiciméid a dhéanamh `services.matomo.track: false` rogha amach i `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Coinníonn an ról `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (mar sin fanann an conradh ról-leithne sásta) ach amháin `roles_with_service('matomo')` titeann sé ó `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` agus an rianaitheoir matomo e2e contract. Cúlchiste le haghaidh statach-comhad (autoindex) agus 301-redirect vhosts a dhéanann aon úsáideoir-facing leathanach HTML fiú `_paq` tracker. Gabhann an marcóir na `track:` bratach sonraí onóracha Lookup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Doiciméid a dhéanamh `services.prometheus.scrape: false` rogha amach i `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Coinníonn an ról `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (mar sin fanann an conradh ról-leithne sásta) ach amháin `roles_with_service('prometheus')` titeann sé ó `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Cúltaca le haghaidh 301-redirect-amháin vhosts riamh a sheirbheáil ar iarratas trí lua-resty-prometheus, mar sin astaíonn siad aon `app=\"<role>\"` lipéad agus nach bhfuil aon sprioc scrape. Gabhann an marcóir na `scrape:` bratach sonraí onóracha Lookup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Doiciméid an `unsafe-*: true` bratach i `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST a péireáilte le `Reason:` ar an líne chéanna a ainmniú cad a bhriseann gan an scíthe. `unsafe-inline` ath-admits an fhorghníomhú inlíne riachtanais XSS agus `unsafe-eval` ath-admits teaghrán-go-cód, mar sin tá an bhratach a fhíorú i gcoinne an app ag rith, ní chóipeáil ó ról eile."

