msgid "Each case pins one half of the contract: a snapshot is taken **only** where it would be faithful, and where it would not be, `auto` degrades silently to the live copy while a stated kind fails the run loudly."
msgstr "Gach cás bioráin leath amháin den chonradh: tógtar léargas **ach amháin** i gcás go mbeadh sé dílis, agus i gcás nach mbeadh sé, `auto` degrades go ciúin leis an gcóip beo agus go mainneoidh de chineál luaite ar an rith os ard."

