# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one IAM surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Generic OIDC-redirect URI checks and domain rules live under [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); port allocations live under `tests/integration/ports/` once introduced."
msgstr "Gach eolaire leanbh bioráin amháin IAM dromchla; féach ar an README per-directory do raon feidhme. Seiceálacha OIDC-atreorú URI agus rialacha fearainn beo faoi [`meta/domains/`](../meta/domains/); leithdháiltí calafoirt beo faoi `tests/integration/ports/` nuair a tugadh isteach é."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one infrastructure surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Ansible-native artefacts (filters, lookups, playbooks) live under [`ansible/`](../ansible/); IAM concerns under [`iam/`](../iam/); per-role structural rules under [`roles/`](../roles/)."
msgstr "Gach eolaire leanbh pins dromchla bonneagair amháin; féach ar an README per-directory do raon feidhme. Déantúsóirí inláimhsithe (scagairí, lookups, leabhair súgartha) beo faoi [`ansible/`](../ansible/); IAM imní faoi [`iam/`](../iam/); rialacha struchtúrtha per-role faoi [`roles/`](../roles/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each child directory pins one meta surface; see the per-directory README for scope. Per-role structural rules (`meta/main.yml`, `meta/services.yml`, includes) live under [`roles/`](../roles/); infrastructure layout lives under [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/)."
msgstr "Gach eolaire leanbh pins dromchla meta amháin; féach ar an README per-directory do raon feidhme. Rialacha struchtúracha Per-ról (`meta/main.yml`, `meta/services.yml`..) beo faoi [`roles/`](../roles/); saol leagan amach bonneagair faoi [`infrastructure/`](../infrastructure/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each compose service that needs static configuration owns a sub-directory whose name matches the service. New service-specific config MUST go into the matching sub-directory rather than at the `compose/` root."
msgstr "Gach seirbhís a chumadh a riachtanais chumraíocht statach úinéireacht fo-eolaire a oireann a ainm an tseirbhís. Seirbhís Nua-shonrach MUST config dul isteach san fho-eolaire meaitseáil seachas ag `compose/` fréamh."

