msgstr "Seiceálann an `locale-gen` ordú (Éilíonn méadú phribhléid)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Executes the script with the provided swapfile size to create a swapfile."
msgstr "Executes an script leis an méid swapfile ar fáil a chruthú swapfile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Executing the installation command to create/update repository command wrappers."
msgstr "Executing an t-ordú a shuiteáil a chruthú / dáta fillteáin ordú stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` line in `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` from the \"must be gated in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`\" check."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` líne i `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` ó na \"Ní mór a gated i `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`\" seiceáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` collection from the requirement to also carry a `type: git` entry in `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Reserved for collections that publish no usable git remote; without the git entry a `galaxy.ansible.com` outage fails `make install`, because the fallback in `scripts/install/ansible.sh` cannot resolve the collection either."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` bailiúchán ón gceanglas freisin a dhéanamh `type: git` iontráil i `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Cúlchiste le haghaidh bailiúcháin nach bhfoilsíonn aon iargúlta git inúsáidte; gan iontráil git `galaxy.ansible.com` go mainneoidh outage `make install`, mar gheall ar an fallback i `scripts/install/ansible.sh` Ní féidir a réiteach an bailiúchán ceachtar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` healthcheck flavor from the requirement that the role's `files/Dockerfile` install the binary the probe runs, when the service sits on a `-slim` image. MUST name where the binary comes from instead. A `-slim` tag carries the runtime and nothing around it, so `curl` is absent and the probe fails from the first beat; under swarm the task is then reaped with exit 137 and every deployment holding the service in its closure fails on the convergence wait, naming the service rather than the missing binary."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe `roles/*/meta/services.yml` blas sláinte seiceáil ón gceanglas go bhfuil an ról `files/Dockerfile` shuiteáil an dénártha ritheann an probe, nuair a suíonn an tseirbhís ar `-slim` íomhá. MUST ainm nuair a thagann an dénártha ó ionad. Amharc ar gach eolas `-slim` Déanann tag an runtime agus rud ar bith timpeall air, mar sin `curl` go bhfuil sé as láthair agus go mainneoidh an probe ón gcéad buille; faoi swarm tá an tasc reaped ansin le scoir 137 agus gach imscaradh a bhfuil an tseirbhís ina dúnadh theipeann ar an fanacht cóineasú, ainmniú an tseirbhís seachas an dénártha ar iarraidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` line, or the whole file (head marker), from the canonical compose skeleton: base-include header, `{{ service_name }}:` service keys each preceded by their `{% set service_name %}`, all per-service `{% set %}` knobs on two-space-indented dash-free lines above the key, `{% include %}` at four spaces inside the service body, and column-0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` at the tail. The layout renders correctly because the `stack_host_template` action plugin sets `lstrip_blocks=True` for `compose.yml.j2`. Reserved for legitimate deviations that genuinely cannot follow the skeleton."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` líne, nó an comhad iomlán (marcóir ceann), ón gcnámharlach canónach a chumadh: ceanntábla san áireamh, `{{ service_name }}:` eochracha seirbhíse gach ceann roimh a n- `{% set service_name %}`, gach per-service `{% set %}` knobs ar línte dhá-spás-aitheanta Fleasc-saor in aisce os cionn an eochair, `{% include %}` ag ceithre spás taobh istigh den chomhlacht seirbhíse, agus colún-0 `compose_volumes` / Baile `compose_networks` ag an eireaball. Tugann an leagan amach i gceart mar gheall ar an `stack_host_template` Leagann breiseán gníomh `lstrip_blocks=True` le haghaidh `compose.yml.j2`. Cúlchiste le haghaidh diallais dlisteanach nach féidir a leanúint i ndáiríre an creatlach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` value that legitimately carries `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserved for genuine edge cases; the default path is a bare expression. Per-item render/apply data guards belong on a `condition:` data field (honored by the sys-svc-compose render helper and `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), not `when:`."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe `when` / Baile `failed_when` / Baile `changed_when` / Baile `until` luach a dhéanann dlisteanach `{{ }}` / Baile `{% %}`. Cúlchiste le haghaidh cásanna imeall fíor; Is é an cosán réamhshocraithe léiriú lom. Per-item rindreáil / infheidhme gardaí sonraí a bhaineann ar `condition:` réimse sonraí (onóir ag an sys-svc-compose a dhéanamh cúntóir agus `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), Níl, `when:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a database-backed `web-app-*` role from the requirement to declare a seaweedfs object-store service. Place in the head of `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Use only when the application genuinely needs no object storage."
msgstr "Eisiamh bunachar sonraí-aiseolas `web-app-*` ról as an gceanglas seirbhís siopa réadúil feamainn a dhearbhú. Áit i gceann `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Úsáid ach amháin nuair a riachtanais an t-iarratas fíor aon stóráil réad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a deprecated `add_header` / `Header set/add` line for `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Security-Policy via the role's `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."
msgstr "Díolmhaíonn díluacháil `add_header` / Baile `Header set/add` líne le haghaidh `X-Frame-Options` / Baile `X-XSS-Protection` / Baile `X-Download-Options` / Baile `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Ábhar-Security-Policy tríd an ról `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / Baile `csp.whitelist`)."

msgid "Exempts a domain-serving role (`web-`/`svc-db-` prefix or explicit `domains.canonical`) from the \"must declare a `tor:` block in `meta/services.yml`\" contract. Reserved for roles with no onion surface, e.g. pure redirect helpers."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated `services.<client-entity>` entry for every role declaring `mcp_consumer: true`\" check. Reserved for a provider that legitimately owns no co-deploy edge to its clients."
msgstr "Díolmhaíonn freastalaí `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` ó na \"ní mór a dhéanamh `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated `services.<client-entity>` iontráil do gach ról dhearbhú `mcp_consumer: true`\" seiceáil. Cúlchiste le haghaidh soláthraí go bhfuil úinéireacht dlisteanach aon ciumhais comh-imscartha dá chliaint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must ship one `meta/variants.yml` entry enabling every admitted consumer, with `sso` pinned on, and pulling in a consumer variant that does not pin `sso: false`\" check. Reserved for a provider whose pairing is genuinely proven elsewhere."
msgstr "Díolmhaíonn freastalaí `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` ó na \"ní mór long amháin `meta/variants.yml` iontráil ar chumas gach tomhaltóir a ligtear isteach, le `sso` pinned ar, agus ag tarraingt i malairt tomhaltóra nach bhfuil bioráin `sso: false`\" seiceáil. Cúlchiste le haghaidh soláthraí a bhfuil a pairing cruthaithe go fírinneach in áiteanna eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a top-level key in `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` or `group_vars/**/*.yml` from the \"must be referenced\" check. Use when the consumer is non-YAML/Jinja (Python plugins, external tools)."
msgstr "Díolmhaíonn eochair ardleibhéil i `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` nó `group_vars/**/*.yml` ó na \"ní mór tagairt\" seiceáil. Úsáid nuair a bhíonn an tomhaltóir neamh-YAML / Jinja (Python plugins, uirlisí seachtracha)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a top-level service in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` from the \"must be registered as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" check."
msgstr "Seirbhís barrleibhéil a Dhíolmhú `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` ó na \"ní mór a bheith cláraithe mar `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` i `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" seiceáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts an auth-isolated variant entry in `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (one that enables exactly one of LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) from the rule that every non-auth service-key in the role's variant union must be pinned to literal `false`. Place on the leading `- services:` line of the variant or on the line above. Use only when the broader closure is intentional."
msgstr "Exempts iontráil leagan auth-isolated i `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (ceann a chuireann ar chumas ceann amháin de LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) ón riail go gcaithfidh gach seirbhís neamh-auth-eochair sa ról aontas athraitheach a pinned go litriúil `false`. Cuir ar an rá `- services:` líne an athraithe nó ar an líne thuas. Úsáid ach amháin nuair a bhíonn an dúnadh níos leithne ar intinn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts one `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin from the one-local-provider-variant limit for a service whose base `meta/services.yml` uses literal `enabled: true` and dynamic `shared`. Place on the extra `shared: false` line or service key line. Place above the service key in `meta/services.yml` to exempt the service."
msgstr "Díolmhuithe amháin `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` bioráin ón teorainn aon-áitiúil-sholáthar-athrú le haghaidh seirbhíse a bhfuil a bonn `meta/services.yml` úsáidí litriúil `enabled: true` agus dinimiciúil `shared`. Cuir ar an breise `shared: false` líne nó príomhlíne seirbhíse. Cuir os cionn an eochair seirbhíse i `meta/services.yml` an tseirbhís a dhíolmhú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exhaustive Application-ID Audit"
msgstr "Iniúchóireacht Iarratais Feabhsaithe"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Existing inventory values are preserved (no double-encryption, no overwrite of operator-supplied secrets)."
msgstr "Luachanna fardal atá ann cheana a chaomhnú (aon dúbailte- Criptiú, aon overwrite na rúin oibreoir-ar fáil)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Existing per-plugin task logic MUST be moved under `tasks/addons/` so the schema is uniform across roles (superseding ad-hoc locations such as the former per-plugin hook directories)."
msgstr "MUST loighic tasc atá ann faoi láthair in aghaidh an plugin `tasks/addons/` mar sin tá an scéimre aonfhoirmeach ar fud róil (ionad ad-hoc superseding cosúil leis na heolairí Hook iar per-plugin)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Existing scenarios MUST NOT be deleted when \"optimising\" a spec. Rewrite them to satisfy the rules above or strengthen assertions; do not shrink coverage. Deletions are only acceptable when the underlying behaviour was removed from the role itself."
msgstr "cásanna atá ann cheana NACH MUST a scriosadh nuair \"optimising\" a spec. Athscríobh iad a shásamh na rialacha thuas nó a neartú dearbhuithe; ná Laghdaigh clúdach. Ní ghlactar le hábhar ach amháin nuair a baineadh an t-iompar bunúsach as an ról féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exists so shell and workflow steps can compose the same reference the env layer composes, instead of spelling ``ghcr.io/...`` out a second time."
msgstr "Is féidir le rannpháirtithe céimeanna sliogáin agus sreabhadh oibre an tagairt chéanna a chumann an ciseal env, in ionad litriú ``ghcr.io/...`` amach an dara huair."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exists so workflow steps can ask for the matrix, and for the distro behind a matrix entry, without embedding a python one-liner per question."
msgstr "Is féidir le rannpháirtithe céimeanna sreabhadh oibre a iarraidh ar an maitrís, agus don distro taobh thiar de iontráil maitrís, gan cur le python aon-liner in aghaidh na ceiste."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Déan Teagmháil Linn"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit 0 when every pinned collection is present at its pinned version."
msgstr "Déan Teagmháil Linn 0 nuair a bhíonn gach bailiúchán pinned i láthair ag a leagan pinned."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit code is ``0`` if the file was already sorted (no write), ``0`` after a successful rewrite, ``1`` on read/parse failure."
msgstr "Tá cód exit ``0`` má bhí an comhad curtha in eagar cheana féin (aon scríobh), ``0`` tar éis athscríobh rathúil, ``1`` ar theip a léamh / a ullmhú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit codes as a module: 0 with one ``<volume>\\t<engine>`` line per undumped database volume, 2 when the generation carries no manifest, 64 on bad usage."
msgstr "Cuir cóid mar mhodúl: 0 le ceann amháin ``<volume>\\t<engine>`` líne in aghaidh an méid bunachar sonraí míchuí, 2 nuair a dhéanann an ghlúin aon léiriú, 64 ar drochúsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit non-zero if `K` ranges of size `N` cannot be fit within the band."
msgstr "Exit neamh-zero má `K` raonta de mhéid `N` Ní féidir a bheith oiriúnach laistigh den bhanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit non-zero if the requested count cannot be satisfied within the band."
msgstr "Éist neamh-zero mura féidir an comhaireamh iarrtha a shásamh laistigh den bhanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exit the shell:"
msgstr "Déan an bhlaosc:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
