msgid "Expose the status codes that prove a domain is served to templates."
msgstr "Nochtadh na cóid stádas a chruthú go bhfuil fearann sheirbheáil ar teimpléid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exposes ``tasks/utils/debug.yml`` as the canonical Ansible wrapper around that script."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas ``tasks/utils/debug.yml`` mar an fillteán Canonical Ansible timpeall an script."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exposes `tasks/utils/debug.yml` as the canonical Ansible wrapper around that script."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas `tasks/utils/debug.yml` mar an fillteán Canonical Ansible timpeall an script."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exposes changes to all repository collaborators and CI."
msgstr "Athruithe nochta do gach comhoibrithe stór agus CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exposes the discovered registry and ordered provider list to Ansible"
msgstr "Nochtadh an clárú amach agus liosta soláthraí ordaigh go Ansible"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exposure"
msgstr "Nochtadh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend `_SCALAR_USER_PLACEHOLDERS` (or call sites) when new scalar group-vars appear in `roles/user-*/meta/users.yml` fields like `firstname`, `lastname`, or `description`."
msgstr "Leathnú `_SCALAR_USER_PLACEHOLDERS` (nó glaoch láithreáin) nuair a thagann grúpa nua scalar-vars i `roles/user-*/meta/users.yml` réimsí ar nós `firstname`, `lastname`, nó `description`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend `roles/web-app-nextcloud/files/javascript/javascript.js` (exposed to the login page through the injected `javascript.js.j2` template) with a small guard that detects the \"user does not exist\" Nextcloud error message and retries the OIDC handshake once after a short delay, giving the LDAP plugin time to provision the account."
msgstr "Leathnú `roles/web-app-nextcloud/files/javascript/javascript.js` (nochta don leathanach logáil isteach tríd an instealladh `javascript.js.j2` teimpléad teimpléad) le garda beag a bhraitheann ar an \"Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil\" Nextcloud teachtaireacht earráide agus retries an OIDC handshake uair amháin tar éis moill ghearr, ag tabhairt an t-am breiseán LDAP chun an cuntas a sholáthar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend a shared service, package, timer, or maintenance workflow"
msgstr "Seirbhís chomhroinnte, pacáiste, lasc ama, nó sreabhadh oibre cothabhála a leathnú"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend bootstrap or deployment behavior for a server-facing application"
msgstr "Leathnú buataisítrap nó iompar imscaradh le haghaidh iarratas freastalaí-teip"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend desktop integration, shell tooling, or user defaults"
msgstr "Leathnú comhtháthú deisce, tooling bhlaosc, nó teipeanna úsáideora"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend the `roles_with_service` lookup for `direction` filtering and endpoint metadata so client roles can discover servers."
msgstr "Leathnú an `roles_with_service` lookup do `direction` scagadh agus meiteashonraí endpoint ionas gur féidir le róil cliant a fháil amach freastalaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extend the provisioned test inventory with host-topology placements plus the dep-walked ``placement: manager`` set, so the static validator (running before ansible) finds every group the swarm deploy will use."
msgstr "Leathnú an fardal tástála ar fáil le socrúcháin ósta-topology móide an dep-siúlóid ``placement: manager`` a leagtar, mar sin an bailíochtóir statach (ag rith roimh inláimhsithe) faigheann gach grúpa úsáidfidh an swarm imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Extended Docker image version handling to support ghcr.io, depth-aware comparisons, and flavored semver tags such as 5.4.5-php8.3-apache"
msgstr "Leathnaigh láimhseáil leagan íomhá Docker chun tacaíocht a thabhairt ghcr.io, comparáidí doimhneacht-aware, agus clibeanna semver blas, mar shampla 5.4.5-php8.3cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú"

