# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "Ní féidir le Fork PRs pacáistí scáthán a fhoilsiú go díreach, mar sin fanann a gcuid ritheann ar an `pull_request_target` scáthán léiritheoir roimh leanúint ar aghaidh. scátháin an táirgeora leis na dintiúir Docker Hub ach amháin le haghaidh PRanna iontaofa ([🛡️ Iontaobhas](#trusted-fork-prs-)); forcanna untrusted scáthán gan ainm (aon rúin eagraíochta). Féach [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) don ailtireacht scáthán agus coinbhinsiún ainmniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish packages themselves, so their untrusted `pull_request` runs wait in `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` until a trusted producer run has published the required refs."
msgstr "Ní féidir Fork PRs pacáistí a fhoilsiú iad féin, mar sin a n-neamhiontaofa `pull_request` Ritheann fanacht i `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` go dtí go bhfuil reáchtáil táirgeoir iontaofa a foilsíodh na refs ag teastáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs run under the `pull_request` event without write permissions. Privileged steps (image builds, package writes) run via `pull_request_target`. The fork CI waits for those privileged images before proceeding. See [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) for the contributor-facing fork workflow."
msgstr "Fork PRs reáchtáil faoi na `pull_request` imeacht gan ceadanna a scríobh. céimeanna Pribhléid (tógáil íomhá, scríobhann pacáiste) reáchtáil via `pull_request_target`. Fanann an forc CI do na híomhánna phribhléid roimh dul ar aghaidh. Féach ar [tarraingt-request.md](pull-request.md) don sreabhadh oibre forcing ranníocóir."

