# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) agus a mhúineadh an nginx cuachta a láimhseáil GCP Artifact Clárlann URLanna atreorú (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Faoi láthair `gcr.io` blob pulls a sheachbhóthar trí `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` i [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), atá ina workaround go disables caching do na clárlanna. Fadtéarma: athbhunú srutha `proxy.conf` / Baile `sub_filter` rialacha a aithint an cruth atreorú nua, long an shocrú in ár forc, pointe `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (nó a chlib íomhá) ag an forc, agus scaoil an `NO_PROXY` seachbhóthar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `pull_request` Ritheann a fháil i gcónaí léamh-amháin dearbhán (GitHub-bhfeidhm); an lipéad riamh deontais scríobh comharthaí nó rúin chuig an ócáid untrusted."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Fork príomh-brainse sync: an sreabhadh oibre iontrála bhrú synchronizes anois an stór reatha ar *príomhthionscadal* ó stór foinse cumraithe (cineál gas: in airde *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú*) roimh raon feidhme CI agus a reáchtáil fionnachtana imscaradh, mar sin feiceann bhrú brainse forc ach a chuid athruithe féin i gcoinne bonn suas le dáta. Is é an fhoinse overridable nó disablable tríd an *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* stór athróg, agus an bhfeidhm-overwrites sync *príomhthionscadal*, mar sin ní mór stór synced a úsáid mar bhrainse oibre. Féach ar [tagairt chumraíocht na Gnímh](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork, PR, release, or scheduled paths affected:"
msgstr "Fork, PR, scaoileadh, nó cosáin sceidealta difear:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Fork-PR CI cruaite (lean-suas go dtí an 11.1.0 sreabhadh iontaofa-fork): an phribhléid *pull_request_target* léiritheoir íomhá agus scáthán leagtha anois *cead-neamhshábháilte-pr-seiceáil* amhlaidh *gníomhaíochtaí / Seiceáil amach* stadanna diúltú an logh cumaisc a bhí tús curtha sé ag diúltú. Tógann forc neamhiontaofa reáchtáil gan rúin eagraíocht - fhíordheimhniú siad go GHCR leis an in aghaidh an-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* ach agus scáthán Docker Hub gan ainm - cé go gcoinníonn an cosán chothabháil-iontaofa dintiúir iomlán agus cuireann an ceann PR amh. An t-athrú muinín ar athraíodh a ionad go dtí an *🛡️ Iontaobhas* lipéad. Féach ar [an píblíne forc-PR](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) agus [an tagairt fíordheimhnithe GHCR](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

