# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub Actions cannot generate a variable number of jobs, so the chunk blocks are written out in the orchestrator. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` must equal how many exist there — `slots` plans a sweep against that key, and a sweep planned larger than the chain silently drops its tail. Declare one block more than `available` fills (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`): the split receives every declared block, so after a short priority chunk the regular rows still fill the rest of the budget. Blocks whose slice comes back empty skip themselves and cost nothing."
msgstr "Ní féidir GitHub Gníomhartha ghiniúint líon athraitheach de phoist, mar sin tá na bloic smután scríofa amach sa orchestrator. `INFINITO_CI_MAX_CHUNKS` ní mór cothrom cé mhéad ann ansin — `slots` pleananna sweep i gcoinne an eochair, agus sweep pleanáilte níos mó ná an slabhra titeann go ciúin a eireaball. Laghdú bloc amháin níos mó ná `available` Líonta (`ceil(available / chunk size) + 1`): Faigheann an scoilt gach bloc dearbhaithe, mar sin tar éis smután tosaíochta gearr na sraitheanna rialta a líonadh fós an chuid eile den bhuiséad. Bloicí a thagann a slice ar ais folamh skip iad féin agus costas rud ar bith."

