# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub cancels a job that has sat queued for 24 hours. That clock starts when the job is queued, not when the run starts, and a `needs:` edge delays queueing until the dependency completes. A run that queues its whole matrix at once leaves the tail waiting past the cut, where it dies unrun. Deploying in chunks chained on `needs:` restarts the clock per chunk."
msgstr "Cealaigh GitHub post a shuigh scuaine do 24 uair an chloig. Tosaíonn an clog nuair a bhíonn an post scuaine, ní nuair a thosaíonn an rith, agus `needs:` moilleanna imeall scuaine go dtí go gcríochnaíonn an spleáchas. A reáchtáil go scuainí a maitrís ar fad ag an am céanna fágann an eireaball ag fanacht leis an gearrtha, nuair a fhaigheann sé bás unrun. Deploying i smután chained ar `needs:` restarts an clog in aghaidh smután."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub cuts ``display_title`` at 512 UTF-8 bytes (measured on two runs, both exactly 512) and closes it with a literal ``...``. The run-name template renders ``priority`` second-to-last and ``whitelist`` last, and on the ``--failed`` path the whitelist is empty, so the cut always lands inside the priority list: measured 21 of 69 roles survived, the 21st a half-token. A CJK display name costs 3 bytes per character, so the budget is ~22 display names against ~28 bare role ids. Every job of the *called* workflow opens its log with an ``##[group] Inputs`` block holding the full values, so that is the SPOT for anything the title cannot hold."
msgstr "Gearrthóga GitHub ``display_title`` ag an 512 UTF-8 bytes (thomhas ar dhá Ritheann, araon go díreach 512) agus dúnann sé le litriúil ``...``. Tugann an teimpléad a reáchtáil-ainm ``priority`` dara-le-last agus ``whitelist`` deireanach, agus ar an ``--failed`` cosán go bhfuil an whitelist folamh, mar sin an gearrtha tailte i gcónaí taobh istigh den liosta tosaíochta: tomhaiste 21 de 69 róil mhair, an 21st leath-chomhartha. Costais ainm taispeáint CJK 3 bytes in aghaidh an carachtar, mar sin tá an buiséad ~22 ainmneacha taispeáint i gcoinne ~28 ids ról lom. Gach post an *ar a dtugtar* osclaíonn sreabhadh oibre a logáil le ``##[group] Inputs`` bloc a bhfuil na luachanna iomlána, ionas go mbeidh an t-iomlán le haghaidh aon rud nach féidir leis an teideal a shealbhú."

