msgstr "Más rud é `*.infinito.test` Ní réiteach i gceart, seiceáil Windows-taobh [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System) nó ina hóstach chumraíocht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `false`, the local-form fallback at `/administrator?fallback=local` is disabled (Modus 1 in effect)."
msgstr "Más rud é `false`, an fallback áitiúil-formáid ag `/administrator?fallback=local` Is maith liom é (taiseachas aeir: fliuch 1 in éifeacht)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `make network-trust-ca` fails due to missing root permissions, you MUST use the alternative syntax `curl -k` (or `wget --no-check-certificate`) to skip certificate validation when checking URLs from the command line instead of fixing the trust store."
msgstr "Más rud é `make network-trust-ca` go mainneoidh mar gheall ar cheadanna fréimhe ar iarraidh, MUST tú úsáid a bhaint as an syntax malartach `curl -k` (nó `wget --no-check-certificate`) a skip bailíochtú deimhniú nuair a sheiceáil URLanna ón líne ordú in ionad a shocrú ar an siopa iontaobhais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If `true`, skip TLS verification on outbound calls (for local CA)."
msgstr "Más rud é `true`, skip fíorú TLS ar ghlaonna outbound (do CA áitiúil)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a CI run is still progressing and the user has not asked you to change course, you MUST wait for it to finish before starting triage."
msgstr "Má tá reáchtáil CI ag dul chun cinn go fóill agus nach bhfuil an t-úsáideoir d'iarr tú cúrsa a athrú, MUST tú ag fanacht chun é a chríochnú roimh thús tríille."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a Keycloak user is not present in OpenLDAP, OpenCloud auto-provisions the user on first login using the `preferred_username` claim. To keep usernames stable across Nextcloud, OpenCloud, and OpenTalk, all three apps share the same `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` and the same `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` source."
msgstr "Mura bhfuil úsáideoir Keycloak i láthair i OpenLDAP, OpenCloud auto-provisions an t-úsáideoir ar an chéad logáil isteach ag baint úsáide as an `preferred_username` éileamh. A choinneáil ainmneacha úsáideoirí cobhsaí ar fud Nextcloud, OpenCloud, agus OpenTalk, gach trí apps a roinnt ar an gcéanna `OIDC.CLIENT.REALM` agus an gcéanna `LDAP.DN.OU.USERS` foinse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a [Playwright](https://playwright.dev/) job fails, you MUST also download the Playwright assets, store them in `/tmp/`, and analyze them together with the logs."
msgstr "Má tá [Seinnteoir](https://playwright.dev/) go mainneoidh post, MUST tú a íoslódáil freisin na sócmhainní Playwright, iad a stóráil i `/tmp/`, agus anailís a dhéanamh orthu mar aon leis na logs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a backup validation fails due to infrastructure problems (for example timeouts or a missing validation tool), the cleanup service exits with a non-zero status. This allows systemd OnFailure handlers or monitoring systems to react accordingly."
msgstr "Má theipeann ar bhailíochtú cúltaca mar gheall ar fhadhbanna bonneagair (mar shampla timeouts nó uirlis bailíochtaithe ar iarraidh), fágann an tseirbhís glantacháin le stádas neamh-zero. Ligeann sé seo láimhseálaithe OnFailure córasach nó córais monatóireachta chun freagairt dá réir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a brand-new deployment must pass the `biber` end-to-end scenario on its first run, either:"
msgstr "Más gá imscaradh branda-nua pas a fháil sa `biber` deireadh-le-deireadh scéal ar a chéad reáchtáil, ceachtar:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a contributor needs to tighten network policy locally (e.g. running on an untrusted network), they SHOULD do so via `.claude/settings.local.json` rather than weakening the project-level defaults that other contributors depend on."
msgstr "Más gá do ranníocóir polasaí líonra a dhéanamh go háitiúil (e.g. ag rith ar líonra neamhiontaofa), a dhéanann siad SHOULD sin trí `.claude/settings.local.json` seachas na mainneachtainí ar leibhéal an tionscadail a lagú go bhfuil rannchuiditheoirí eile ag brath ar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a criterion is ambiguous, you MUST ask the user to clarify before proceeding."
