# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a new test is created or an existing test has been changed since the last test run, you MUST rerun it after every subsequent action until it passes."
msgstr "Má tá tástáil nua cruthaithe nó má tá tástáil atá ann cheana athraithe ó rith na tástála seo caite, MUST tú rerun sé tar éis gach gníomh ina dhiaidh sin go dtí go Gabhann sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a push to GHCR fails with `denied: denied`:"
