msgid "If a reuse target aborts with \"inventory not found\", you MUST add `variant=<idx>` and re-run; do NOT work around the error by re-creating the unsuffixed folder by hand."
msgstr "Má tá sprioc athúsáid aborts le \"fardal le fáil\", tú MUST cuir `variant=<idx>` agus ath-reáchtáil; NACH obair ar fud an earráid trí ath-cruthú an fillteán unsuffixed de láimh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role cannot answer those questions, it is probably doing too much."
msgstr "Mura féidir le ról na ceisteanna sin a fhreagairt, is dócha go bhfuil sé ag déanamh an iomarca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a role uses another service around the application but the addon does not talk to that service directly, the service MUST stay in `meta/services.yml` and MUST NOT be listed in the addon's `bridges:`. Friendica's oauth2-proxy-backed `sso` service is such a front-door auth gate for `ldapauth`."
msgstr "Má úsáideann ról seirbhís eile ar fud an t-iarratas ach ní chuireann an addon labhairt leis an tseirbhís sin go díreach, an tseirbhís MUST fanacht i `meta/services.yml` agus NÍ MÓR a liostú sa addon ar `bridges:`. Oidéil Friendica2-proxy-backed `sso` Is seirbhís den sórt sin tosaigh-door geata auth do `ldapauth`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a service can be removed without rewriting the whole stack, the design is usually healthy. If removing one part breaks everything else, the boundaries are probably too weak."
msgstr "Más féidir seirbhís a bhaint gan athscríobh an chairn ar fad, tá an dearadh de ghnáth sláintiúil. Má tá cuid amháin a bhriseadh gach rud eile, is dócha go bhfuil na teorainneacha ró-lag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a single role defines the same credential key in both a schema definition and a runtime value, the loader MUST stop and surface the collision instead of silently merging."
msgstr "Má shainmhíníonn ról amháin an eochair credential céanna sa dá sainmhíniú scéimre agus luach runtime, an MUST ualach stad agus dromchla an imbhualadh in ionad a chumasc go ciúin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a vaulted key exists → reuse (idempotent, address stability is the contract)."
msgstr "Má tá eochair boghtach ann → athúsáid (idempotent, aghaidh a thabhairt ar chobhsaíocht an chonartha)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If a warning points to an intentional exception, make the exception explicit and keep the follow-up visible."
msgstr "Má tá pointí rabhaidh le heisceacht intinneach, déan an eisceacht sainráite agus coinnigh an obair leantach le feiceáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If agent instructions change mid-conversation (AGENTS.md or any file referenced from it), the agent might not reload them automatically. Trigger a reload with:"
msgstr "Má athraíonn treoracha gníomhaire lár-comhrá (AGENTS.md nó aon chomhad tagairt uaidh), ní fhéadfadh an gníomhaire iad a athlódáil go huathoibríoch. Trigger reload le:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If any `make swarm-*` target aborts at **Set up job** with `mkdirat var/run...` on a recent Docker engine, point act at a fixed runner image per [Workflow Loop](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."
msgstr "Má tá aon `make swarm-*` sprioc aborts ag **Socraigh post** le `mkdirat var/run...` ar inneall Docker le déanaí, gníomhú pointe ag íomhá rádala seasta in aghaidh an [Sreabhadh Oibre](workflow.md#act-fails-at-set-up-job-on-recent-docker)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If any precondition fails, you MUST return to [Compose Loop](compose.md) and re-establish the baseline before continuing."
msgstr "Má theipeann ar aon réamhchoinníoll, MUST tú ar ais chuig [Naisc ábhartha eile](compose.md) agus an bonnlíne a athbhunú roimh leanúint ar aghaidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If automation logic is not shell-based, it MUST live outside `scripts/` and be called from a `.sh` wrapper when needed."
msgstr "Más rud é nach bhfuil loighic uathoibriú bhlaosc-bhunaithe, MUST sé beo taobh amuigh `scripts/` agus a dtugtar ó `.sh` fillteán nuair is gá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Má iompar coimeádán nó thus slándála difriúil ná ar Linux, an WSL2 Clúdaíonn an treoir is gnách [Tógáil Docker](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), agus [Amharc ar gach eolas](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Má tá spás diosca daingean, tú SHOULD bogadh Sonraí Docker, caches, agus do eolaire ag obair leis an SSD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If inventory_file is provided, also removes the provider role for each service from the inventory (devices.yml)."
msgstr "Más rud é inventory_file a chur ar fáil, freisin cuireann an ról soláthraí do gach seirbhís ón bhfardal (devices.yml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If lifecycles is provided, only roles whose galaxy_info.lifecycle is in the set are included. Missing lifecycle is treated as \"not matching\"."
msgstr "Má tá saolré ar fáil, ach róil a bhfuil galaxy_info.lifecycle Tá sa tsraith san áireamh. Déileáiltear le saolré ar iarraidh mar \"gan a mheaitseáil\"."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If mem_limit (container cgroup RAM) is smaller than ``min_mb`` an exception is raised, to prevent Node's heap from exceeding the cgroup and being OOM-killed."
msgstr "Más rud é mem_limit (coimeádán RAM) níos lú ná ``min_mb`` eisceacht a ardú, chun cosc a chur ar charn Node ó níos mó ná an cgroup agus a bheith OOM-killed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If multiple roles share the same root cause, you MUST first deploy them together via the `apps=\"<role-a> <role-b>\"` form described in [Compose Loop](../iteration/compose.md), then run the alphabetically first role of the batch individually as the exemplary single-app deploy."
msgstr "Má roinneann róil éagsúla an chúis fhréamh céanna, MUST tú iad a imscaradh ar dtús le chéile tríd an `apps=\"<role-a> <role-b>\"` foirm cur síos ar [Naisc ábhartha eile](../iteration/compose.md), ansin reáchtáil an chéad ról aibítreach an bhaisc ina n-aonar mar an eiseamláir aonair-app imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If multiple runs across multiple branches share the same external failure, you MUST link all of them in the issue body or comment."
msgstr "Má ritheann il ar fud na brainsí éagsúla a roinnt ar an teip seachtrach céanna, MUST tú nasc go léir iad sa chomhlacht eisiúna nó trácht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If needed, also update the local part (username):"
msgstr "Más gá, tabhair an chuid áitiúil cothrom le dáta freisin (ainm úsáideora):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If neither step finds a logout control, the test MUST fail. The role's authenticated surface MUST expose an in-app logout button; navigating to a logout URL as a workaround is forbidden."
msgstr "Má fhaigheann ceachtar céim rialú logout, theipeann ar an MUST tástála. MUST dromchla fíordheimhnithe an ról a nochtadh cnaipe logout in-app; Tá navigating le URL logout mar workaround forbidden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no '--' is present: inventory_args = [], deploy_args = all rest."
msgstr "Más rud é nach '--' i láthair: inventory_args = = = [], deploy_args = gach chuid eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the role can configure a local Postfix-based SMTP relay via ``sys-svc-mail-smtp``."
msgstr "Más rud é nach ``web-app-mailu`` i láthair, is féidir leis an ról a chumrú áitiúil iar-shocrú-bhunaithe sealaíochta SMTP via ``sys-svc-mail-smtp``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no `web-app-mailu` is present, the role can configure a local Postfix-based SMTP relay via `sys-svc-mail-smtp`."
msgstr "Más rud é nach `web-app-mailu` i láthair, is féidir leis an ról a chumrú áitiúil iar-shocrú-bhunaithe sealaíochta SMTP via `sys-svc-mail-smtp`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
