msgstr "Mura bhfaightear aon chluiche nó má tharlaíonn earráid agus comhaid á léamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If no matching issue exists, you MUST file a new one via `gh issue create --title <title> --body-file <body-file> --label <labels>`. The YAML issue form [bug_report.yml](../../../../.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml) cannot be populated headlessly through `--template`, so `<title>`, `<labels>`, and the section structure inside `<body-file>` MUST mirror exactly what that template prescribes. You MUST place the relevant log excerpt under the section that template dedicates to logs and link the full GitHub Actions run URL for every affected job."
msgstr "Mura bhfuil aon cheist meaitseáil ann, MUST tú comhad ceann nua trí `gh issue create --title <title> --body-file <body-file> --label <labels>`. An fhoirm cheist YAML [bug_report.yml](../../../../.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml) Ní féidir a daonra headlessly trí `--template`, mar sin `<title>`, `<labels>`, agus an struchtúr alt taobh istigh `<body-file>` MUST scáthán go díreach cad a fhorordaíonn teimpléad. MUST tú áit an excerpt logáil ábhartha faoin alt sin dedicates teimpléad a logs agus nasc an GitHub Gníomhaíochtaí iomlán a reáchtáil URL do gach post difear."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If security impact is present, explain:"
msgstr "Má tá tionchar slándála i láthair, mínigh:"

