msgid "If similar logic exists elsewhere in the project, you SHOULD refactor it toward a shared implementation."
msgstr "Má tá loighic den chineál céanna in áiteanna eile sa tionscadal, tú SHOULD refactor sé i dtreo chur i bhfeidhm roinnte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If systemd is configured but not yet active, prints instructions to restart WSL2"
msgstr "Má tá systemd cumraithe ach nach bhfuil fós gníomhach, priontaí treoracha atosú WSL2"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If systemd is not configured at all, appends the `[boot]` section to `/etc/wsl.conf` and triggers `wsl --shutdown` to apply the change"
msgstr "Más rud é nach bhfuil systemd cumraithe ar chor ar bith, na foscríbhinní `[boot]` alt chuig `/etc/wsl.conf` agus triggers `wsl --shutdown` iarratas a dhéanamh ar an athrú"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If that validation fails, you MUST run `make clean` and rerun it."
msgstr "Má theipeann ar an bailíochtú sin, MUST tú reáchtáil `make clean` agus rerun sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the **compose** step failed, switch to the [Compose Loop](compose.md): reproduce with `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<app>`, inspect via `make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`, apply the real fix in the repository, then re-run the roundtrip."
msgstr "Má tá an **a chumadh** céim theip, athrú go dtí an [Naisc ábhartha eile](compose.md): atáirgeadh le `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<app>`, iniúchadh via `make compose-exec` / Baile `make compose-inner-run`, iarratas a dhéanamh ar an shocrú fíor sa stór, ansin re-reáchtáil an roundtrip."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the **swarm** step failed, the cluster is left up (fail-fast skips the release). Inspect it with `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` or `make swarm-shell name=<app>` per the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), confirm the fix on the live cluster, then re-run. Release it manually with `make swarm-down name=<app>` when done."
msgstr "Má tá an **tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil** céim theip, tá an braisle fágtha suas (theipeann-tapa skips an scaoileadh). Iniúchadh é le `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` nó `make swarm-shell name=<app>` in aghaidh an [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](swarm.md), an socrú a dhaingniú ar an mbraisle beo, ansin re-reáchtáil. Scaoileadh sé de láimh le `make swarm-down name=<app>` nuair a rinneadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the app explicitly disables a token on the *base* (e.g. style-src.unsafe-inline: false), that token is removed from the merged base even if present in elem/attr."
