# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the application's primary background is dark or black, you MUST use `--color-01-00` as the default theme color. If it is light or white, you MUST use `--color-01-99`. All other application colors MUST be mapped to one of these two anchors. Colors from categories `02`–`09` MUST be derived from and kept in visual relation to the chosen anchor."
msgstr "Má tá cúlra príomhúil an iarratais dorcha nó dubh, MUST tú úsáid `--color-01-00` mar an dath téama réamhshocraithe. Má tá sé solas nó bán, MUST tú úsáid `--color-01-99`. Gach dathanna iarratais eile MUST a mapáilte le ceann de na dhá anchors. Dathanna ó chatagóirí `02`– – – –`09` MUST a dhíorthaítear ó agus a choimeád i ndáil amhairc ar an ancaire roghnaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change adds or removes a repository variable, also update [configuration.md](configuration.md)."
msgstr "Má chuireann an t-athrú nó cuireann athróg stór, chomh maith le nuashonrú [configuration.md](configuration.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects **more than one role**, you MUST ask the user before proceeding:"
msgstr "Má théann an t-athrú i bhfeidhm **níos mó ná ról amháin**, MUST tú a iarraidh ar an úsáideoir roimh dul ar aghaidh:"

