msgstr "Má théann an t-athrú i bhfeidhm ar ról Ansible, MUST tú refactor agus a bharrfheabhsú an **Ról iomlán**, ní hamháin na comhaid a athraíodh go díreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects the CI flow (stages, gates, order), also update [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Má théann an t-athrú i bhfeidhm ar shreabhadh CI (céimeanna, geataí, ordú), freisin cothrom le dáta [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects user-visible behavior, you MUST add or update the matching end-to-end coverage in [Role `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."
msgstr "Má théann an t-athrú i bhfeidhm ar iompar úsáideora-invisible, MUST tú a chur leis nó a thabhairt cothrom le dáta an meaitseáil deiridh-le-deireadh clúdach i [Ról na Gaeilge `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the code is easy to explain, it is likely a good idea."
msgstr "Má tá an cód éasca a mhíniú, is dócha smaoineamh maith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the code is hard to explain, rework it before merging."
msgstr "Má tá an cód deacair a mhíniú, rework sé roimh chumasc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the current branch is `main` or `master`, before any debug iteration begins you MUST file a tracking issue for every observed failure using the [External Failures](#external-failures) procedure (search first, comment if matched, otherwise create new). For branch-caused failures, the resulting issue number MUST be used as `<ticket-id>` when creating the working branch with the `fix/` prefix per [branch.md](../../../contributing/artefact/git/branch.md). All iteration work, commits, and the push at the end MUST happen on that fix branch."
msgstr "Má tá an brainse reatha `main` nó `master`, sula dtosaíonn aon iteration debug tú MUST comhad ceist rianú do gach teip breathnaithe ag baint úsáide as an [Teipeanna Seachtracha](#external-failures) nós imeachta (cuardach a dhéanamh ar dtús, comment má mheaitseáil, a chruthú ar shlí eile nua). I gcás teipeanna brainse-caused, an uimhir eisiúna mar thoradh ar MUST a úsáid mar `<ticket-id>` nuair a chruthú an brainse oibre leis an `fix/` réimír in aghaidh [branch.md](../../../contributing/artefact/git/branch.md). Gach obair atriall, tiomantas, agus an bhrú ag an deireadh MUST tarlú ar an brainse a shocrú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the failure needs a change **outside** `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` (role tasks, templates, vars, config, `javascript.js`, `style.css`, or any other role asset the deploy materializes), go to [Escape](#escape)."
msgstr "Más gá an teip athrú **taobh amuigh** `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` (tascanna ról, teimpléid, vars, config, `javascript.js`, `style.css`, nó aon sócmhainn ról eile materializes an imscaradh materializes), téigh go dtí [Escape](#escape)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the failure says `service \"infinito\" is not running`, restart the stack with [Development Environment Setup](../../contributing/environment/setup.md) and retry the validation."
msgstr "Má deir an teip `service \"infinito\" is not running`, atosú an chairn le [Forbairt Comhshaol Socrú](../../contributing/environment/setup.md) agus an bailíochtú a athbheochan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is **not** running Mailu, it:"
msgstr "Má tá an óstach **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** ag rith Mailu, sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is part of the ``web-app-mailu`` group, it:"
msgstr "Má tá an t-óstach cuid den ``web-app-mailu`` grúpa, sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the host is part of the `web-app-mailu` group, it:"
msgstr "Má tá an t-óstach cuid den `web-app-mailu` grúpa, sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the last test run for a test failed, you MUST rerun it after every change until it succeeds."
msgstr "Má ritheann an tástáil dheireanach le haghaidh tástála theip, MUST tú rerun sé tar éis gach athrú go dtí go n-éireoidh sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the local inventory and stack already exist, you SHOULD reuse them:"
msgstr "Má tá an fardal áitiúil agus Stack ann cheana féin, tú SHOULD athúsáid iad:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the logout control sits behind a user / account menu, click the menu trigger first, then click the logout control inside it."
msgstr "Má shuíonn an rialú logout taobh thiar de roghchlár úsáideora / cuntas, cliceáil ar an roghchlár truicir ar dtús, ansin cliceáil ar an rialú logout taobh istigh de."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the new domain does not exist yet, insert it into the `domain` table:"
msgstr "Mura bhfuil an bhfearann nua ann go fóill, cuir isteach é isteach sa `domain` tábla:"

