msgid "If the new variant relies on cleanup steps that the standard inter-round entity purge does not cover, extend the role's purge handling. The matrix wrapper invokes the standard purge between rounds for every app whose variant changed."
msgstr "Má bhíonn an t-athrú nua ag brath ar chéimeanna glanta nach gclúdaíonn an t-eintiteas caighdeánach idir babhta, leathnaigh an ról ar láimhseáil purge. Agairt an fillteán maitrís an purge caighdeánach idir babhtaí do gach app a bhfuil athrú a leagan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
