# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the upstream is HTTP-only and inner-`dockerd` builds need it, also add it to `_CACHE_HTTP_HOSTNAMES` in [compose.py](../../../roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py) so the per-app `compose.cache.override.yml` includes it in `build.extra_hosts`."
msgstr "Má tá an sruth an HTTP-amháin agus istigh-`dockerd` Tógann gá é, freisin é a chur leis `_CACHE_HTTP_HOSTNAMES` i [compose.py](../../../roles/sys-svc-compose/files/python/compose.py) mar sin an per-app `compose.cache.override.yml` folaíonn sé i `build.extra_hosts`."

