msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (the SPOT for the deployment domain; defined in ``default.env`` and exported by ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; the development inventory reads the same env var for the play's ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (optional; address the domains map to, default ``127.0.0.1``)."
msgstr "Ionchuir (an Ríocht Aontaithe): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (an phatrún don fhearann imscaradh; a shainmhínítear i ``default.env`` agus a onnmhairiú ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; léann an fardal forbartha an var céanna don dráma ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (roghnach; aghaidh a thabhairt ar léarscáil na bhfearann, réamhshocraithe ``127.0.0.1``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``). Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (consumed by ``derive_includes``)."
msgstr "Ionchuir (an Ríocht Aontaithe): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (cineál gas: in airde ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``). Rogha ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (arna gcaitheamh ag ``derive_includes``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``INV_DIR`` — inventory dir holding ``host_vars/*.yml`` (default ``/tmp/inv``)."
msgstr "Ionchuir (an Ríocht Aontaithe): ``INV_DIR`` — dir fardal gabháltas ``host_vars/*.yml`` (cineál gas: in airde ``/tmp/inv``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). A second ed25519 keypair is generated at ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) and its public half lands in ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` so the DR drill's backup host can pull over the ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. The ``applications`` block written into the extras file carries the ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source device paths, which is all the DR drill reads back from it. The deploy-facing overrides, including ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (derived per round from ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), are baked by the matrix orchestrator into the provisioner's host_vars merge (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NOT into the extras file: extra-vars replace the whole inventory ``applications`` dict and would strip every generated credential. ``users`` carries the same hazard for the same reason, and its authorized_keys travel the same merge channel. The deploy-facing twin ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` therefore carries everything except ``applications`` and ``users``."
msgstr "Ionchuir (an Ríocht Aontaithe): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (cineál gas: in airde ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (cineál gas: in airde ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). Tá an dara ceann25519 Tá keypair a ghintear ag ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (Plandaí faoi dhíon default.env) agus a leath-thailte poiblí ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` mar sin is féidir leis an óstach cúltaca druil DR a tharraingt thar an ``user-backup`` ssh-fillteán. An bhfuil ``applications`` bloc scríofa isteach an comhad extras ndéanann an ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source bealaí gléas, a bhfuil an druil DR go léir léann ar ais uaidh. An overrides imscaradh-facing, lena n-áirítear ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (díorthaithe in aghaidh an bhabhta ó ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), atá bhácáilte ag an orchestrator maitrís isteach an soláthróir host_vars chumasc (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NACH isteach sa chomhad extras: extra-vars ionad an fardal iomlán ``applications`` deach agus bheadh stiall gach dintiúir a ghintear. ``users`` Déanann an ghuaise céanna ar an gcúis chéanna, agus a authorized_keys taisteal ar an cainéal merge céanna. An cúpla imscaradh-facing ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` dá bhrí sin, déanann gach rud ach amháin ``applications`` agus ``users``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs come from the merged application config (``services.<key>.image`` and ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` and ``version=`` keyword overrides bypass those values for ad-hoc references (e.g. side-car init containers that do not appear in the services map)."
msgstr "Ionchuir a thagann as an iarratas cumaisc config (``services.<key>.image`` agus ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` agus ``version=`` overrides eochairfhocal seachbhóthar na luachanna le haghaidh tagairtí ad-hoc (e.g. coimeádáin init taobhcharr nach bhfuil le feiceáil sa léarscáil seirbhísí)."

