# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for cross-role variable and defaults hygiene: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` uniqueness across `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, and `group_vars/**`; and the prohibition against overriding Ansible facts via `vars:` or `set_fact:`."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú le haghaidh athróg tras-ról agus riachtanais sláinteachais: `TOP_LEVEL_CONSTANT` uathúlacht ar fud `roles/*/vars/**`, `roles/*/defaults/**`, agus `group_vars/**`; agus an toirmeasc i gcoinne overriding fíricí Ansible trí `vars:` nó `set_fact:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for custom Jinja filter plugins under `plugins/filter/` and `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: every filter referenced in templates MUST be defined, and filters MUST behave correctly end-to-end (e.g. `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú le haghaidh breiseán scagaire Jinja saincheaptha faoi `plugins/filter/` agus `roles/*/filter_plugins/`: gach scagaire tagairt i teimpléid MUST a shainiú, agus scagairí MUST féin a iompar i gceart deireadh-le-deireadh (e.g. `strong_password`, `dotenv_quote`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for identity and access surfaces: OAuth2 / OIDC configuration invariants (mutual exclusion, ACL shape, proxy port allocation, RBAC group-path declarations) and password / secret quoting rules."
msgstr "Tástálacha comhtháite le haghaidh dromchlaí aitheantais agus rochtana: OAuth2 / OIDC chumraíocht ivariants (eisiamh frithpháirteach, cruth ACL, leithdháileadh calafort seachfhreastalaí, dearbhuithe grúpa RBAC) agus focal faire / rialacha luaite rúnda."

