msgid "Integration tests for playbook-level wiring: `tasks/stages/**`, invokable-path coverage, and the dispatch between them."
msgstr "Tástálacha comhtháite le haghaidh sreangú ar leibhéal súgartha: `tasks/stages/**`, clúdach invokable-path, agus an seolta eatarthu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `cli/` package: subcommand discovery and `--help` smoke tests for every invokable CLI entrypoint."
msgstr "Tástálacha comhtháite le haghaidh `cli/` pacáiste: fionnachtain subcommand agus `--help` tástálacha deataigh do gach iontráil CLI invokable."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `run_once_<role_name>` fact pattern: flag suffixes MUST match their role folder name, flags MUST be defined before use, and inclusion of `utils/once/flag.yml` MUST follow the schema."
msgstr "Tástálacha comhtháite le haghaidh `run_once_<role_name>` patrún fíricí: iarmhíreanna bratach MUST mheaitseáil a n-ainm fillteán ról, bratacha MUST a shainiú roimh úsáid, agus cuimsiú na `utils/once/flag.yml` MUST lean an scéimre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the custom Ansible lookup plugins under `plugins/lookup/`: config-path validation against role schemas and runtime caching performance."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú le haghaidh na plugins Lookup saincheaptha Ansible under `plugins/lookup/`: bailíochtú config-path i gcoinne schemas ról agus feidhmíocht caching runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the deployment substrate that every role shares: Docker Compose templates, Docker image consistency, container networks, the shared service registry, and the backups contract."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú le haghaidh an tsubstráit imscaradh go bhfuil gach ról scaireanna: Docker Compose teimpléid, comhsheasmhacht íomhá Docker, líonraí coimeádán, an chlár seirbhíse roinnte, agus an conradh cúltacaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce contracts between tasks and handlers. One file per contract, no second opinion on the same rule:"
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann conarthaí i bhfeidhm idir cúraimí agus láimhseálaithe. Comhad amháin in aghaidh an chonartha, gan aon dara tuairim ar an riail chéanna:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce every `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target referenced from role tasks (and other project YAML) resolves to an existing file."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú gach `include_tasks` / Baile `import_tasks` / Baile `include_role` / Baile `import_role` sprioc tagairt ó chúraimí ról (agus tionscadal eile YAML) réitíonn sé le comhad atá ann cheana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of `galaxy_info.run_after` in each role's `meta/main.yml`: every referenced name MUST resolve to an existing role directory, no role MUST list itself in `run_after`, and the resulting ordering graph MUST be acyclic."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants `galaxy_info.run_after` i ngach ról ar `meta/main.yml`: gach ainm tagairt MUST réiteach eolaire ról atá ann cheana féin, gan aon ról MUST liosta féin i `run_after`, agus MUST graf a ordú mar thoradh air sin a bheith timthriallach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/main.yml`: the file MUST exist for every role under `roles/`, and `galaxy_info` MUST carry the fields the Sphinx generator expects (non-empty `description`, no `None` values)."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants de gach ról ar `meta/main.yml`: an MUST comhad ann do gach ról faoi `roles/`, agus `galaxy_info` MUST a dhéanamh ar na réimsí an gineadóir Sphinx súil (gan a bheith díolmhaithe `description`, aon `None` luachanna)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/services.yml`: the dynamic-flag form (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) MUST be used wherever a service entry depends on a sibling role's deployment, and a role's `services.yml` MUST NOT reference itself as a sibling provider."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants de gach ról ar `meta/services.yml`: an fhoirm dinimiciúil-lag (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) MUST a úsáid cibé áit a mbraitheann iontráil seirbhíse ar ról siblín ar imscaradh, agus ról ar `services.yml` NÍ MÓR tagairt féin mar sholáthraí deartháireacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/variants.yml`: the matrix-deploy variant list MUST exercise every dynamic flag declared in the role's `meta/services.yml` on both polarities, every service key referenced under `services:` in a variant MUST exist in `services.yml`, and the auth matrix (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) MUST cover the LDAP-only branch."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants de gach ról ar `meta/variants.yml`: an maitrís-diúscairt liosta athraitheach MUST fheidhmiú gach bratach dinimiciúil dearbhaithe sa ról `meta/services.yml` ar an dá polaraíocht, gach eochair seirbhíse tagairt faoi `services:` i malairt MUST ann i `services.yml`, agus an maitrís auth (`oidc` / Baile `oauth2` / Baile `ldap`) MUST chlúdach an LDAP-amháin brainse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of repository declarations in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: every `git clone`-style URL referenced from a role MUST be declared as an entity with a `repository:` key, and any entity that declares `repository:` MUST also pin a `ref:`."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann invariants dearbhuithe stór i bhfeidhm `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: gach `git clone`-style URL tagairt ó ról MUST a dhearbhú mar eintiteas le `repository:` eochair, agus aon eintiteas a dhearbhaíonn `repository:` MUST freisin bioráin `ref:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the `server:` block in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Content-Security-Policy structure (whitelist / flags / hashes), supported directives, valid URL / Jinja / wildcard entries."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants na `server:` bloc i `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Ábhar-Security-Policy structure (whitelist / bratacha / hashes), treoracha tacaíocht, URL bailí / Jinja / iontrálacha cárta fiáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the prometheus integration: every web-app/svc role declares the shared `prometheus` service entry, the prometheus role's own nginx + docker-health wiring is intact, and the native-metrics scrape contract (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` ⇔ `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holds across the roles tree."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann invariants an comhtháthú prometheus i bhfeidhm: Dearbhaíonn gach ról gréasáin-app / Svc an comhroinnt `prometheus` iontráil seirbhíse, tá an ról prometheus nginx féin + sreangú docker-shláinte slán slán, agus an conradh scrape ó dhúchas (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` Déan Teagmháil Linn `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) Tá ar fud an crann róil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the role dependency graph expressed via `meta/main.yml`: declared `dependencies:` targets MUST exist, the `dependencies:` graph MUST be acyclic, and meta dependencies MUST NOT be declared when a guarded `include_role` / `import_role` would suffice."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann invariants an graf spleáchais ról in iúl trí `meta/main.yml`: dearbhaithe `dependencies:` spriocanna MUST ann, an `dependencies:` graf MUST bheith timthriallach, agus meta dependencies MUST NACH a dhearbhú nuair cosanta `include_role` / Baile `import_role` bheadh suffice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce per-role invariants of the unified ``services.sso`` block across roles, including normalization of ``allowed_groups`` paths and allocation of per-consumer SSO-proxy ports."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants in aghaidh an-ról an aontaithe ``services.sso`` bloc trasna róil, lena n-áirítear normalú ``allowed_groups`` cosáin agus leithdháileadh per-tomhaltóir calafoirt SSO-proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce role naming conventions: folder names match the declared category prefix (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, …), and roles do not collide on canonical identifiers."
msgstr "Tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann i bhfeidhm coinbhinsiúin ról-ainmniú: ainmneacha fillteán mheaitseáil leis an réimír chatagóir dearbhaithe (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, ...), agus róil nach collide ar aitheantóirí Canonical."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce rules about roles which represent deployable applications: `web-app-*` roles MUST ship a `README.md` (required for the Web App Dashboard), every literal name compared against `group_names` in playbooks/roles MUST resolve to a real `application_id`, every `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference MUST name an existing application, and roles MUST NOT reach into `applications[...]` by subscript; they MUST use `lookup('applications', …)` or `utils.roles.applications.config.get` instead."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann rialacha i bhfeidhm maidir le róil a léiríonn iarratais in-imscartha: `web-app-*` róil MUST long a `README.md` (ag teastáil le haghaidh Dashboard App Gréasáin), gach ainm litriúil i gcomparáid i gcoinne `group_names` i leabhair súgartha / róil MUST réiteach fíor `application_id`, gach `applications['…']` / Baile `applications.get('…')` / Baile `applications.name` / Baile `get_domain('…')` MUST tagairt ainm iarratas atá ann cheana féin, agus róil NACH teacht isteach `applications[...]` ag subscript; MUST siad úsáid `lookup('applications', …)` nó `utils.roles.applications.config.get` ina ionad sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce safe handling of secrets across roles: env-file values MUST be quoted, shell tasks MUST quote password expansions, and password *definitions* MUST NOT apply the `quote` filter (which corrupts the stored value)."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a chur i bhfeidhm láimhseáil sábháilte rúin ar fud róil: luachanna env-comhad MUST a lua, tascanna bhlaosc MUST Sleachta faire leathnú, agus focal faire *sainmhínithe* NÍ MÓR iarratas an `quote` scagaire scagaire (a chuireann an luach stóráilte)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce structural invariants of every role under `roles/`: folder-name conventions and `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú invariants struchtúrtha de gach ról faoi `roles/`: coinbhinsiúin fillteán-ainm agus `include_tasks` / Baile `import_tasks` sprioc ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` and the roles that require a container network: subnets MUST be valid, unique, and non-overlapping, network names MUST map to an `application_id`, and every role that ships a `compose.yml.j2` with an `application_id` MUST have a network entry under `defaults_networks.local`."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann an conradh i bhfeidhm idir `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` agus na róil a éilíonn líonra coimeádán: subnets MUST bheith bailí, uathúil, agus neamh-overlapping, ainmneacha líonra léarscáil MUST chun `application_id`, agus gach ról a longa a `compose.yml.j2` le `application_id` MUST Tá iontráil líonra faoi `defaults_networks.local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's `services[*].backups.*` configuration and the backup infrastructure (enabled flag, `no_stop_required`, image consistency)."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann an conradh i bhfeidhm idir ról `services[*].backups.*` cumraíocht agus an bonneagar cúltaca (bratach cumasaithe, `no_stop_required`, comhsheasmhacht íomhá)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between a role's folder name, its `application_id` in `vars/main.yml`, and the invokability classification from `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháite a chuireann an conradh i bhfeidhm idir ainm fillteán ról, a `application_id` i `vars/main.yml`, agus an t-aicmiú invokability ó `plugins/filter/invokable_paths.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the dashboard-tile scope rule: only `web-app-*` roles may declare `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` truthy; non-`web-app-*` roles MUST drop the entry or ship a static `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú an riail raon feidhme Painéal na nIonstraimí-tíl: ach `web-app-*` Is féidir róil a dhearbhú `dashboard.{enabled,shared}` fírinne; neamh-`web-app-*` róil MUST titim ar an iontráil nó long statach `dashboard: { enabled: false, shared: false }`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the shape and uniqueness of `domains.{canonical,aliases}` across all roles and validate that `get_domain()` references point to real `application_id`s."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fhorfheidhmiú an cruth agus uathúlacht `domains.{canonical,aliases}` ar fud na róil agus a bhailíochtú go `get_domain()` pointe tagairtí do fíor `application_id`s."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that exercise custom Ansible action plugins end-to-end through real playbook runs (e.g. retry behavior of `uri` / `get_url` wrappers)."
msgstr "tástálacha comhtháthú a fheidhmiú plugins gníomh Ansible saincheaptha deireadh-le-deireadh trí Ritheann leabhar súgartha fíor (e.g. iompar retry `uri` / Baile `get_url` fillteáin)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that pin the `meta/services.yml` ↔ `templates/playwright.env.j2` ↔ `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parity contract: every enabled service surfaces as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=`, every env line is consumed by a gating helper in the spec, and `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` / `# nocheck: playwright-service-gate` are the only suppressions."
