# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Never start while a sweep, deploy, or gate is reading the working tree — a merge swaps files under it and has already destroyed a running roundtrip once. Stop the run first or wait for it. Untracked leftovers from an aborted merge block the next attempt: verify each against `git ls-tree -r --name-only FETCH_HEAD` before deleting, then delete them, and do not start a second in-sandbox attempt that recreates them."
msgstr "Ná tosú cé go bhfuil sweep, imscaradh, nó geata ag léamh an crann oibre - comhaid swaps chumasc faoi agus tá scriosta cheana féin roundtrip ag rith uair amháin. Stop an chéad reáchtáil nó fanacht chun é. leftovers Untracked ó bloc chumasc aborted an chéad iarracht eile: fhíorú gach ceann i gcoinne `git ls-tree -r --name-only FETCH_HEAD` roimh scriosadh, ansin iad a scriosadh, agus ná tús an dara in-sandbox iarracht a athchruthú iad."

