# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New *web-app-n8n* role: n8n workflow automation (Community Edition). SSO is wired through a trusted-header edge hook that is copied and mounted only when SSO is enabled (native SSO is enterprise-only in CE), LDAP sign-in is supported, and per-scenario Playwright coverage exercises the CE edge-SSO model. Ships at lifecycle *alpha*; subnet and port collisions with the new *web-app-semaphore* role were resolved on the way in. See the [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."
msgstr "Nuashonraithe go deireanach *web development8n* ról: n8n uathoibriú sreabhadh oibre (Clár na dToghthóirí). SSO sreangaithe trí Hook imeall iontaofa atá chóipeáil agus suite ach amháin nuair a SSO cumasaithe (Is SSO dúchais fiontar-amháin i CE), LDAP comhartha-i tacaíocht, agus per-scenario cleachtaí clúdach Playwright an tsamhail CE imeall-SSO. Longa ag saolré *alfa-uimhriúla*; folíon agus imbhualadh calafoirt leis an nua *web-app-semaphore* réitíodh ról ar an mbealach. Féach an [web development8Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."

