# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Ról nua Penpot (web-app-penpot, ceanglas 235) go longa an t-ardán dearadh Upstream Penpot chuimsíonn tosaigh, cúlú, onnmhaireoir agus Redis ag leagan íomhá 2.5.4, sreangaithe isteach sa Keycloak lárnach trí OIDC agus isteach sa OpenLDAP lárnach. Tá login áitiúil áitiúil-password Dúchasach ar fáil mar scoránaigh atá faoi mhíchumas go huathoibríoch faoi OIDC, leis an logála dúchais agus bratacha clárúcháin a dhíorthaítear ó bhratach SSO. A saincheaptha JVM truststore allmhairí an féin-sínithe Infinito CA mar sin OIDC thar TLS éiríonn, agus tá an ról a fheidhmiú deireadh-le-deireadh le Playwright clúdach logáil isteach OIDC, logáil amach agus a chruthú tionscadal. Aistríodh an folíon áitiúil go dtí 192.168.105.192/ Baile28 a sheachaint imbhualadh leis an raon ERPNext."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Ról nua Pi-poll (*web-app-pihole*) go longa an upstream Pi-poll DNS doirtealhole agus líonra-leathan ad blocker, lena comhéadan gréasáin admin gated taobh thiar de *riachtanais uisce: measartha2-proxy* agus Keycloak RBAC agus login féin-password (an *FTLCONF* web development API focal faire) ar fáil mar leagan fallback. Tá an réiteoir réamhtheachtach agus amchrios configurable, fanann an ról ar an gcríochphointe HTTP Pi-poll le linn imscaradh, agus feidhmítear é deireadh-le-deireadh le Playwright a chlúdaíonn an OAuth2, dúchais-login agus cásanna aoi-rochtain. Na longa ról ag beta saolré."

