msgid "New engine-agnostic object-store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, backed by either *SeaweedFS* or *MinIO*) that exposes a shared S3 endpoint, now consumed across 14 web-app roles for media and asset storage. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon and Matrix route their uploads to the central bucket, each exercised end-to-end with a SeaweedFS consumer check that requires a fresh object key per upload."
msgstr "Seirbhís nua inneall-agnostic réad-stór (*web-app-seaweedfs*, tacaíocht ag ceachtar *SeaweedFS* nó *MinIO*) a nochtann S roinnte3 endpoint, caite anois ar fud 14 róil gréasáin-iarratas le haghaidh stórála meán agus sócmhainní. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon agus Matrix bealach a n-uaslódáil chuig an buicéad lárnach, d'fheidhmigh gach ceann acu deireadh le deireadh SeaweedFS seiceáil tomhaltóirí a éilíonn eochair réad úr in aghaidh an uaslódáil."

