# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No provider or client `enabled` or `shared` expression may enumerate concrete peer role names. Provider enablement MUST be explicit operator/variant state or derived through a common direction-aware lookup. Every client MUST declare supported transports and authentication schemes. The discovery result MUST include selected entries and rejected entries with a stable rejection code such as `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing`, or `endpoint_unreachable`."
msgstr "Uimh soláthraí nó cliant `enabled` nó `shared` D'fhéadfadh go mbeadh ainmneacha ról piaraí nithiúla in áirithe. A chur ar chumas an tsoláthróra MUST a bheith oibreoir follasach / staid athraitheach nó a dhíorthaítear trí Lookup treo-aware coitianta. Gach MUST cliant dhearbhú iompair tacaíocht agus scéimeanna fíordheimhnithe. Áirítear ar an toradh fionnachtana MUST iontrálacha roghnaithe agus iontrálacha diúltaithe le cód diúltú cobhsaí, mar shampla `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing`, nó `endpoint_unreachable`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No role in this section has been proven to possess a safe native MCP server at its currently pinned version. Each is a candidate for an isolated adapter or a managed n8n workflow only after the exact pinned upstream API, authentication, pagination, and error semantics are inspected. The adapter MUST start with three to five named read tools, not a generated copy of the entire API."
msgstr "Níl aon ról san alt seo cruthaithe go bhfuil freastalaí MCP dúchais sábháilte ag a leagan pinned faoi láthair. Tá gach iarrthóir le haghaidh adapter iargúlta nó n a bhainistiú8n sreabhadh oibre ach amháin tar éis an API sruth pinned cruinn, fíordheimhniú, Tosú, agus shéimeantachtaí earráide a iniúchadh. An MUST adapter tús le trí go cúig ainmnithe uirlisí a léamh, ní cóip a ghintear den API ar fad."

