msgstr "WebUI Oscailte: `openwebui.com <https://openwebui.com>`__"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI’s ``ToolServerConnection`` accepts bearer, session, system_oauth and oauth_2.1. A server whose scheme it cannot present is skipped rather than registered with an unusable credential, so a basic-auth server such as Jenkins does not appear here."
msgstr "Oscail WebUI ar ``ToolServerConnection`` Glacann bearer, seisiún, system_oauth agus oauth_2.1. Tá freastalaí a bhfuil a scéim nach féidir é a chur i láthair skipped seachas cláraithe le dintiúir unusable, mar sin ní freastalaí bunúsach-auth ar nós Jenkins le feiceáil anseo."

