msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for ``.well-known`` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optamaithe le haghaidh timpeallachtaí Archlinux, soláthraíonn an ról seo réiteach lightweight, iontaofa le haghaidh freastal ar láithreáin ghréasáin statach. Cumhdaíonn sé go huathoibríoch NGINX chun freastal ar chomhaid ó eolaire réamhshainithe, leagann suas naisc HTTPS slán, agus folaíonn sé tacaíocht do ``.well-known`` cosáin a éilíonn dúshláin ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the ``certbot-NGINX`` package, configures a dedicated ``systemd`` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a ``sys-timer`` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
msgstr "Optamaithe do chórais Archlinux, cuireann an ról seo na ``certbot-NGINX`` pacáiste, cumraithe tiomanta ``systemd`` seirbhís le haghaidh athnuachan deimhnithe, agus comhtháthaíonn sé le ``sys-timer`` athnuachaintí tréimhsiúla a sceideal. Tar éis athnuachana, athlódáiltear NGINX chun na deimhnithe nuashonraithe a chur i bhfeidhm láithreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux systems, this role installs the `certbot-NGINX` package, configures a dedicated `systemd` service for certificate renewal, and integrates with a `sys-timer` to schedule periodic renewals. After a renewal, NGINX is reloaded to apply the updated certificates immediately."
