#, no-python-format
msgid "Package-changelog generator hardening: the Debian changelog and the Fedora spec *%changelog* are mirrored from CHANGELOG.md without tripping their native parsers — every change line is indented for Debian, every body line gains a dash continuation for RPM, and the archived-releases notice is folded into the oldest kept entry instead of trailing after the final entry. Previously the un-indented bodies made *dpkg-buildpackage* abort the Debian package build with an empty maintainer. The *Changelog* title is also preserved when the active window is trimmed. See [the release procedure](docs/contributing/actions/release.md)."
msgstr "Pacáiste-athrú gineadóir hardening: an Changelog Debian agus an spec Fedora *% a athrú* Tá scáthán ó CHANGELOG.md gan tripping a parsers dúchais - tá gach líne athraithe fleasctha do Debian, gnóthachain gach líne comhlacht leanúint Fleasc do RPM, agus tá an fógra scaoilte gcartlann fillte isteach an iontráil is sine a choimeád in ionad trailing tar éis an iontráil deiridh. Roimhe seo rinne na comhlachtaí neamhaitheanta *dpkg-tógáil pacáiste* abort an pacáiste Debian thógáil le cothabhálaí folamh. An bhfuil *Déan Teagmháil Linn* Tá teideal caomhnaithe freisin nuair a bhíonn an fhuinneog gníomhach bearrtha. Féach ar [an nós imeachta um scaoileadh](docs/contributing/actions/release.md)."

