# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s vhost name, username and password via ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent vhost, user and ``set_permissions`` grant scoped to that vhost. Existing vhosts and users are skipped, and the consumer password is realigned with the inventory on every deploy."
msgstr "Soláthar Per-tomhaltóir (``tasks/01_init.yml``) Ritheann le ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` agus ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; réitíonn sé ainm vhost an tomhaltóra, ainm úsáideora agus focal faire via ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` agus réitigh vhost idempotent, úsáideoir agus ``set_permissions`` deontas raon feidhme leis an vhost. vhosts atá ann cheana agus úsáideoirí a skipped, agus tá an focal faire tomhaltóirí réadaithe leis an bhfardal ar gach imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s username, password and key-prefix via ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` restricted to ``~{entity}:*``. The ACL users are recreated by the consumer’s ``01_init`` on every deploy, so a container restart that drops the in-memory ACL set is healed on the next run."
msgstr "Soláthar Per-tomhaltóir (``tasks/01_init.yml``) Ritheann le ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` agus ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; réitíonn sé ainm úsáideora an tomhaltóra, pasfhocal agus eochair-réamhshocrú trí ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` agus réitigh idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` srian le ``~{entity}:*``. Na húsáideoirí ACL a athchruthú ag an tomhaltóir ``01_init`` ar gach imscaradh, mar sin atosú coimeádán go titeann an in-memory ACL leagtha healed ar an chéad reáchtáil eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (`tasks/01_init.yml`) runs with `application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq` and `database_consumer_id=<consumer>`; it resolves the consumer's vhost name, username and password via `lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)` and reconciles an idempotent vhost, user and `set_permissions` grant scoped to that vhost. Existing vhosts and users are skipped, and the consumer password is realigned with the inventory on every deploy."
msgstr "Soláthar Per-tomhaltóir (`tasks/01_init.yml`) Ritheann le `application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq` agus `database_consumer_id=<consumer>`; réitíonn sé ainm vhost an tomhaltóra, ainm úsáideora agus focal faire via `lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)` agus réitigh vhost idempotent, úsáideoir agus `set_permissions` deontas raon feidhme leis an vhost. vhosts atá ann cheana agus úsáideoirí a skipped, agus tá an focal faire tomhaltóirí réadaithe leis an bhfardal ar gach imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (`tasks/01_init.yml`) runs with `application_id=svc-db-redis` and `database_consumer_id=<consumer>`; it resolves the consumer's username, password and key-prefix via `lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)` and reconciles an idempotent `ACL SETUSER` restricted to `~{entity}:*`. The ACL users are recreated by the consumer's `01_init` on every deploy, so a container restart that drops the in-memory ACL set is healed on the next run."
msgstr "Soláthar Per-tomhaltóir (`tasks/01_init.yml`) Ritheann le `application_id=svc-db-redis` agus `database_consumer_id=<consumer>`; réitíonn sé ainm úsáideora, pasfhocal agus eochair-réamhshocrú an tomhaltóra trí `lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)` agus réitigh idempotent `ACL SETUSER` srian le `~{entity}:*`. Athchruthaítear na húsáideoirí ACL ag an tomhaltóir `01_init` ar gach imscaradh, mar sin atosú coimeádán go titeann an in-memory ACL leagtha healed ar an chéad reáchtáil eile."

