# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning runs in ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: it copies the plugin into the code volume, runs ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, enables ``enablewebservices``, appends ``mcp`` to ``webserviceprotocols``, creates the ``infinito_mcp`` external service, attaches the read-only functions, mints the permanent token and stores it under ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."
msgstr "Ritheann a sholáthar i ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: cóipeanna sé an breiseán isteach an méid cód, Ritheann ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, Cumasaigh ``enablewebservices``, aguisíní ``mcp`` go dtí ``webserviceprotocols``, Cruthaíonn an ``infinito_mcp`` seirbhíse seachtrach, ag gabháil leis na feidhmeanna léamh-amháin, mints an dearbhán buan agus siopaí faoi ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."

