msgid "Raises when the subnet is missing or its prefix is not octet-aligned, so a topology this cannot express fails at render time instead of binding silently to the wrong network."
msgstr "Faigheann nuair a bhíonn an folíon ar iarraidh nó nach bhfuil a réimír octet-ailínithe, mar sin ní féidir le topology seo a chur in iúl theipeann ag an am a dhéanamh in ionad a ceangailteach go ciúin leis an líonra mícheart."

