msgstr "Rangú catagóir `relay`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Rate limiting is not among them. The proxy ships no `limit_req` or `limit_conn` anywhere, so a public MCP endpoint is only as protected as its own authentication and its declared `limits`. An operator exposing one to the open internet has to put a rate limiter in front of the vhost; the platform will not supply one."
msgstr "Níl teorainn Ráta eatarthu. Níl aon longa seachvótála `limit_req` nó `limit_conn` áit ar bith, mar sin tá críochphointe MCP poiblí ach amháin mar a chosaint mar fíordheimhnithe féin agus a dhearbhú `limits`. Tá oibreoir a nochtadh ceann ar an idirlíon oscailte a chur ar limiter ráta os comhair an vhost; ní bheidh an t-ardán a sholáthar ar cheann."

