msgstr "Léigh ar aghaidh Mód 🔒"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only project identity; no task start, playbook, Terraform, shell, repository, key, inventory, environment, or user mutation"
msgstr "Féiniúlacht tionscadail Read-amháin; aon tús tasc, leabhar súgartha, Terraform, bhlaosc, stór, eochair, fardal, timpeallacht, nó sócháin úsáideora"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only subcommands (`view`, `list`, `status`, `diff`, `checks`, `watch`, `download`, `clone`) do not match and remain auto-allowed via the sandbox, mirroring the GET-vs-mutation split used for `gh api`. The `deny` rules above take precedence for the highest-blast verbs (e.g. `gh repo delete`, `gh secret *`, `gh ssh-key *`)."
msgstr "Léigh ar aghaidh subcommands (`view`, `list`, `status`, `diff`, `checks`, `watch`, `download`, `clone`) nach mheaitseáil agus fanacht uathoibríoch-cheadaithe tríd an bosca gainimh, ag déanamh scáthán ar an scoilt GET-vs-athrú a úsáidtear le haghaidh `gh api`. An `deny` rialacha a ghlacadh thuas tosaíocht do na briathra is airde-sraon (e.g. `gh repo delete`, `gh secret *`, `gh ssh-key *`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only token with field restrictions; no checkout/checkin, asset, license, accessory, user, or settings mutation"
msgstr "Léigh-amháin le srianta allamuigh; aon Seiceáil / checkout, sócmhainní, ceadúnas, cúlpháirtí, úsáideoir, nó socruithe sócháin"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Read-only user restricted to named wikis/spaces; no page, attachment, script, rights, extension, or user mutation"
msgstr "Léigh-amháin úsáideora srianta wikis ainmnithe / spásanna; aon leathanach, ceangaltán, script, cearta, síneadh, nó sócháin úsáideora"

