# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads"
msgstr "Léigh níos mó"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads 'applications' and 'group_names' from Ansible variables and discovers service providers from the role-local services metadata."
msgstr "Léigh níos mó 'applications' agus 'group_names' ó athróg Ansible agus faigheann soláthraithe seirbhíse ó na meiteashonraí seirbhísí ról-áitiúla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads GitHub Actions runs via the ``gh`` CLI and maps the per-app compose (\"docker\") and swarm deploy jobs to pass/fail/abort states. A mode job that ran but did not finish successfully (cancelled, timed out, still running) counts as a failure; a mode the role has no job for is N/A and never fails the aggregated ``total`` column."
msgstr "Léigh GitHub Gníomhartha ritheann tríd an ``gh`` CLI agus léarscáileanna an chumadh per-app (\"docker\") agus swarm poist imscaradh chuig pass/fail/abort stáit. post modh a bhí ar siúl ach ní raibh a chríochnú go rathúil (cealaithe, timed amach, fós ag rith) comhaireamh mar teip; Is mód nach bhfuil aon phost don N / A agus ní theipeann ar an comhiomlánaithe ``total`` colún."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reads ``services.sso.{enabled,shared,flavor,oauth2.*}`` from the merged applications payload and derives the semantic predicates and flavor-specific sub-values that the SSO-proxy wiring, the redis-sidecar gating, and the consumer-side playwright env all need."
msgstr "Léigh níos mó ``services.sso.{enabled,shared,flavor,oauth2.*}`` ó na hiarratais chumasc payload agus díorthaíonn na preideacáidí shéimeantacha agus fo-luachanna blas-sonrach go bhfuil an sreangú SSO-proxy, an ath-thaobh gating, agus an tomhaltóra-taobh playwright env gach gá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads `default.env` plus the current runtime context (distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived sizes, sha256 secrets, ...) and writes the resulting `.env` at the repo root. Implementation lives in `utils.env`; this package is the CLI entry point."
msgstr "Léigh níos mó `default.env` móide an comhthéacs reatha runtime (distro, GHA / Gníomh bratacha, df / méideanna meminfo-derived, sha256 rúin,...) agus scríobhann an toradh `.env` ag an fhréamh repo. Saol an chur i bhfeidhm i `utils.env`; Is é an pacáiste seo an pointe iontrála CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads every ``*.xml`` under <reports-dir> (one per test target, written by scripts/tests/code/run.sh via ``--junitxml``). Per report: a headline with the pass/fail/skip counts and total time, failures rendered opened, and the full per-test table (name, status, duration) collapsed in a details block, slowest first."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads from `log_byte_offset` to end and asserts that every required role's body actually executed in that slice (i.e. at least one TASK block for the role ended with a non-skip status)."
msgstr "Léigh ó `log_byte_offset` chun deireadh a chur agus a dhearbhú go bhfuil gach ról ag teastáil comhlacht chun báis iarbhír sa slice (i.e. bloc TASK amháin ar a laghad don ról dar críoch le stádas neamh-skip)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads from the mirror first and falls back to the upstream registry only for images the mirror does not carry, so a full sweep does not spend the upstream's rate limit. Determinate answers are cached on disk."
msgstr "Reads as an scáthán ar dtús agus titim ar ais go dtí an clár suas le sruth ach amháin le haghaidh íomhánna nach bhfuil an scáthán a dhéanamh, mar sin ní sweep iomlán a chaitheamh ar an sruth ar teorainn ráta. freagraí determinate i dtaisce ar diosca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reads only ``roles/*/meta/{services,server}.yml`` files."
msgstr "Léigh ach amháin ``roles/*/meta/{services,server}.yml`` comhaid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads or mutates repository collaborator membership. Mutations escalate access; even GETs leak the contributor list. Access changes belong to a human reviewer."
msgstr "Léigh nó mutates ballraíocht comhoibritheach stór. I bhfad níos mó rochtain escalate; fiú GETs leak an liosta ranníocóir. Baineann athruithe rochtana le hathbhreithneoir daonna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads or mutates repository deploy keys. Deploy keys are full-power repo-auth credentials: adding one creates a persistent backdoor; removing one breaks deployments. Manage out-of-band only."
msgstr "Léigh nó mutates stór eochracha imscaradh. Tá eochracha Deploy lán-chumhacht dintiúir repo-auth: a chur ar cheann cruthaíonn backdoor leanúnach; deireadh a chur le imscaradh amháin sosanna. Bainistigh as-banna amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads route through :func:`utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml_any` (already memoised per-path). :func:`get_role_types` caches its return per role-directory string so repeated calls during a single test sweep stay free."
msgstr "Léigh bealach tríd :func:`utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml_any` (i gcuimhne cheana féin per-path). :func:`get_role_types` caches a fhilleadh in aghaidh an teaghrán ról-eolaire glaonna sin arís agus arís eile le linn tástála amháin fanacht saor in aisce."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads the ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` value from ``default.env`` so the envelope has a single source of truth instead of being duplicated as a hardcoded set at every consumer."
msgstr "Léigh na ``INFINITO_LIFECYCLES`` luach ó ``default.env`` mar sin tá foinse amháin fírinne ag an gclúdach in ionad é a dhúbailt mar shocrú cruachódaithe ag gach tomhaltóir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads the canonical dict-of-dicts shape from ``roles/<role>/meta/volumes.yml`` (YAML key = semantic short name; optional ``name:`` field = docker volume name). Entries with ``type: config`` / ``type: secret`` emit their respective top-level sections; everything else flows through the volumes section."
msgstr "Léigh an Canonical dict-de-dicts cruth ó ``roles/<role>/meta/volumes.yml`` (YAML eochair = ainm gearr shéimeantach; roghnach ``name:`` réimse = ainm toirt docker). Iontrálacha le ``type: config`` / Baile ``type: secret`` scaoileann siad a gcuid rannóga barrleibhéil faoi seach; sreabhadh gach rud eile tríd an rannóg toirteanna."

msgid "Reads the merged-config SPOT through lookup('config'); the flavor itself is declared in svc-storage-nfs-server/meta/services.yml."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads variables from env file (default: .env, generated from default.env)"
msgstr "Léigh athróg ó comhad env (réamhshocraithe: .env, a ghintear ó default.env)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real Nextcloud integration coupling: end-to-end tests now assert genuine two-way OAuth/API coupling for *gitlab*, *mattermost*, *openproject*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *discourse*, *github*, *google*, *jira*, *mastodon*, *matrix*, *moodle* and *suitecrm*, rather than the mere presence of a connect button. All integration OAuth credentials are stored Nextcloud-encrypted via ICrypto (sensitive app values), OpenProject and Zammad secrets survive a re-deploy, and OpenWebUI/Ollama is wired in as a real *integration_openai* chat backend. Bridges with no Nextcloud-33 plugin (Moodle, SuiteCRM) are disabled."
msgstr "Real Estate Nextcloud comhtháthú cúplála: tástálacha deireadh le deireadh a dhearbhú anois fíor dhá-bhealach OAuth /API Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí *tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil*, *ábhar beagnach*, *oscailte*, *taiseachas aeir: fliuch*, *duille dath: glas*, *Amharc ar gach eolas*, *tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil*, *Go raibh maith agat*, *taiseachas aeir: fliuch*, *minicíocht uisce: flúirseach*, *maitrís maitrís*, *cineál gas: in airde* agus *cineál gas: in airde*, seachas an láithreacht ach an cnaipe ceangal. Tá gach dintiúir comhtháthú OAuth stóráilte Nextcloud- Criptithe trí ICrypto (luachanna app íogair), OpenProject agus Zammad rúin maireachtáil ath-imlonnú, agus OpenWebUI /Ollama Tá sreangaithe i mar fíor *integration_openai* comhrá siar. Droichid gan aon Nextcloud- - - - -33 breiseán breiseán (Moodle, SuiteCRM) go bhfuil siad faoi mhíchumas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real scenario where the component is the surface, OR `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` with a pointer to the role-local test that covers it."
msgstr "Cás fíor i gcás ina bhfuil an chomhpháirt an dromchla, NÓ `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` le pointeoir leis an tástáil ról-áitiúil a chlúdaíonn é."

