# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reconciliation MUST use the ownership name `infinito:<provider-application-id>`. It MUST update or remove only entries carrying that marker and preserve all human-created client configuration. Zero matching entries creates one, one updates it, and more than one MUST fail without guessing which duplicate to keep."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as an ainm úinéireachta `infinito:<provider-application-id>`. MUST sé cothrom le dáta nó a bhaint ach iontrálacha iompar an marcóir agus a chaomhnú gach duine-cruthaithe cumraíocht cliant. Cruthaíonn iontrálacha Zero meaitseáil amháin, nuashonruithe amháin é, agus níos mó ná aon MUST theipeann gan guessing a dhúbailt a choinneáil."

