# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Recreate the inventory and deploy the selected applications after cycling the development stack and purging shared entities. Use this flow when stale container state or cross-application entities (for example shared analytics) need a clean slate before the deploy."
msgstr "Athchruthú an fardal agus na hiarratais roghnaithe a imscaradh tar éis rothaíocht an chairn forbartha agus íonú eintitis roinnte. Bain úsáid as an sreabhadh nuair stát coimeádán stale nó eintitis tras-iarratas (mar shampla Analytics roinnte) gá scláta glan roimh an imscaradh."

