# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Recursive credentials emission into a ruamel CommentedMap."
msgstr "Dintiúr Athchúrsach astaíochta isteach i ruamel CommentMap."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Recursive force-delete with no confirmation and no undo. Sandbox `allowWrite` does not protect here because `.` (the repo) is writable; `rm -rf .` would erase the working tree and `.git/`."
msgstr "Athchúrsach bhfeidhm-delete gan aon deimhniú agus gan aon gan amhras. taiseachas aeir: fliuch `allowWrite` Ní chosaint anseo mar gheall ar `.` (an repo) is inscríofa; `rm -rf .` scrios an crann oibre agus `.git/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Recursive tree listing under ``cli/<parts>/`` with Unicode tree connectors, per-entry emoji glyphs, and multi-line wrapped descriptions aligned to a single description column. ``max_depth`` is 1-based: ``None`` (default) walks the full tree, ``1`` shows only the immediate children."
msgstr "Liosta crann Athchúrsach faoi ``cli/<parts>/`` le chónaisc crann Unicode, Iomaji glyphs in aghaidh an-iontrála, agus tuairiscí fillte il-líne ailínithe le colún tuairisc amháin. ``max_depth`` Is maith liom 1-bhunaithe: ``None`` (cineál gas: in airde) siúlóidí an crann iomlán, ``1`` Léiríonn ach na páistí láithreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Recursive walker: every dict at any depth (top-level entity, sub-entity, plugin map, ...) that declares BOTH `repository:` and `ref:` is a candidate. Only semver-compatible refs are version-checkable; branches (`master`, `main`, `stable`) and commit SHAs are skipped."
msgstr "Siúlóidí Athchúrsach: gach deach ag aon doimhneacht (eintiteas barrleibhéil, fo-eintiteas, léarscáil breiseán,...) a dhearbhaíonn BOTH `repository:` agus `ref:` Is iarrthóir. Níl ach refs semver-comhoiriúnach leagan-seiceáil; brainsí (`master`, `main`, `stable`) agus tiomantas SHAs a skipped."

