# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replace `hosted_only` with `stdio_only`. The audit of `discourse/discourse-mcp` at `v0.3.1` closed the sidecar path: ownership, licence, pinning and the read-only default all pass, but the HTTP transport serves one session per process, which upstream asserts itself in `src/test/transport.test.ts` at that tag. A shared multi-consumer endpoint cannot be built on it, and the deploy-time contract probe alone would leave the process in its `503` restart-required state. Enable nothing until upstream supports concurrent sessions."
msgstr "Athsholáthar `hosted_only` le `stdio_only`. An iniúchóireacht `discourse/discourse-mcp` ag an `v0.3.1` dúnta an cosán sidecar: úinéireacht, ceadúnas, pinning agus an léamh-amháin réamhshocraithe gach pas, ach feidhmíonn an t-iompar HTTP seisiún amháin in aghaidh an phróisis, a dhearbhaíonn sruth féin i `src/test/transport.test.ts` ag an chlib sin. Ní féidir críochphointe il-tomhaltóra comhroinnte a thógáil air, agus d'fhágfadh an probe conartha imscartha ina n-aonar an próiseas ina `503` stát restart-riachtanach. Ní féidir aon rud a chumasú go dtí go dtacóidh sé le seisiúin chomhthráthacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replace `hosted_only` with `unreviewed_third_party`. The review ran and selected no module. Odoo SA publishes no server and the OCA organisation holds no MCP repository, so the field is third-party only. The leading candidate, `ivnvxd/mcp-server-odoo` at `v0.8.0`, fails on maintenance breadth (197 of 231 commits from one author), on access control that ships as a separate Odoo Apps store module outside any pinnable tag, and on a mutating default tool scope. Re-review if Odoo SA or the OCA publishes a server."
msgstr "Athsholáthar `hosted_only` le `unreviewed_third_party`. An t-athbhreithniú ar siúl agus roghnaigh aon mhodúl. Odoo SA Foilsíonn aon fhreastalaí agus tá an eagraíocht OCA aon stór MCP, mar sin tá an réimse tríú páirtí amháin. An t-iarrthóir is mó, `ivnvxd/mcp-server-odoo` ag an `v0.8.0`, theipeann ar an leithead cothabhála (197 de 231 tiomantas ó údar amháin), ar rialú rochtana go longa mar Odoo ar leith Apps siopa modúl lasmuigh aon chlib pinnable, agus ar raon feidhme uirlis mutating réamhshocraithe. Ath-athbhreithniú má Odoo SA nó OCA Foilsíonn freastalaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replace `hosted_only`. Pin the official WordPress MCP adapter, expose its HTTP endpoint, register only reviewed Abilities with permission callbacks, and authenticate as a real restricted user through Application Password or proven OAuth."
msgstr "Athsholáthar `hosted_only`. PIN an t-oifigeach WordPress MCP adapter, a nochtadh a endpoint HTTP, clárú ach slógtha athbhreithniú le callbacks cead, agus fhíordheimhniú mar úsáideoir fíor srianta trí Pasfhocal Iarratais nó OAuth cruthaithe."

