# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replacing beats adding. ``nft -f`` on an existing table merges, so a rule dropped from the declaration would stay in the kernel and the ruleset could only ever grow. Each fragment therefore creates, deletes and redeclares its table in one transaction, which is also why the table is never observed empty: unlike a flush followed by rules, there is no window in which the boundary is gone."
msgstr "Builleoga a chur leis. ``nft -f`` ar chumasc tábla atá ann cheana féin, mar sin thit riail as an dearbhú a bheadh fanacht sa eithne agus d'fhéadfadh na rialachaset fás riamh. Cruthaíonn gach ilroinnt dá bhrí sin, scriosann agus athléiríonn a tábla in idirbheart amháin, a bhfuil freisin cén fáth nach bhfuil an tábla breathnaithe folamh: murab ionann agus flush dhiaidh rialacha, níl aon fhuinneog ina bhfuil an teorainn imithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Replacing beats adding. `nft -f` on an existing table merges, so a rule dropped from the declaration would stay in the kernel and the ruleset could only ever grow. Each fragment therefore creates, deletes and redeclares its table in one transaction, which is also why the table is never observed empty: unlike a flush followed by rules, there is no window in which the boundary is gone."
msgstr "Builleoga a chur leis. `nft -f` ar chumasc tábla atá ann cheana féin, mar sin thit riail as an dearbhú a bheadh fanacht sa eithne agus d'fhéadfadh na rialachaset fás riamh. Cruthaíonn gach ilroinnt dá bhrí sin, scriosann agus athléiríonn a tábla in idirbheart amháin, a bhfuil freisin cén fáth nach bhfuil an tábla breathnaithe folamh: murab ionann agus flush dhiaidh rialacha, níl aon fhuinneog ina bhfuil an teorainn imithe."

