# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Restores the Debian dev-image build by introducing the INFINITO_VENV_DIR SPOT and calling infinito via its absolute venv path in scripts/docker/entry.sh, so the post-`make install` version check no longer trips on the PATH that bash -lc clobbers via /etc/profile; also scopes the auto-update PR dedup fingerprint to the files a run actually committed (instead of the whole commit tree) so unrelated drift on main no longer forces a fresh PR on every daily cron, nests web-app-bluesky's nocheck markers under the acl block they describe, and rolls up dependabot bumps (actions/cache 4→5, actions/setup-node 4→6) plus routine Docker image / git ref refreshes."
msgstr "Restores an Debian dev-íomhá thógáil trí thabhairt isteach ar an INFINITO_VENV_DIR SPOT agus ag glaoch infinito tríd a cosán venv iomlán i scripts/docker/entry.sh, mar sin an post-`make install` seiceáil leagan a thuilleadh turais ar an PATH a bash -lc clobbers via /etc / próifíl; freisin raon feidhme an uathoibríoch-suas dáta PR dedup méarloirg chuig na comhaid a reáchtáil iarbhír tiomanta (in ionad an crann tiomanta go léir) mar sin nach bhfuil baint acu le sruth ar phríomh a thuilleadh fórsaí PR úr ar gach cron laethúil, neadacha web-app-bluesky's marcóirí nocheck faoi an bloc acl cur síos orthu, agus rollann suas bumps dependabot (gníomhaíochtaí / cache 4→ →5, gníomhaíochtaí / setup-node 4→ →6) móide ghnáthamh íomhá Docker / git ref refreshes."

