# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Rith an script; Tosaíonn sé ar dtús an ról aonad cúltaca imscaradh (difreálach úr `backup-nfs-to-local` glúin de na honnmhairithe beo), ansin scátháin an pictiúr isteach sa sprioc (`rsync -a --delete`, leis an roinnte `<state>/backup` fréamh cosanta ó scriosadh agus ní chóipeáil i). `--no-safety-backup` skips an t-aonad a reáchtáil nuair a bhíonn an sprioc aon rud fiú a shábháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Rith an script; Tosaíonn sé ar dtús an ról aonad cúltaca imscaradh (glúin baudolo úr difreálach de gach toirt agus bunachar sonraí), réitíonn an toirt mountpoint agus scátháin an pictiúr isteach é (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips an t-aonad a reáchtáil nuair a bhíonn an sprioc aon rud fiú a shábháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Rith an script; Tosaíonn sé ar dtús an ról aonad cúltaca imscaradh (difreálach úr ``backup-nfs-to-local`` glúin de na honnmhairithe beo), ansin scátháin an pictiúr isteach sa sprioc (``rsync -a --delete``, leis an roinnte ``<state>/backup`` fréamh cosanta ó scriosadh agus ní chóipeáil i). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips an t-aonad a reáchtáil nuair a bhíonn an sprioc aon rud fiú a shábháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Rith an script; Tosaíonn sé ar dtús an ról aonad cúltaca imscaradh (glúin baudolo úr difreálach de gach toirt agus bunachar sonraí), réitíonn an toirt mountpoint agus scátháin an pictiúr isteach é (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips an t-aonad a reáchtáil nuair a bhíonn an sprioc aon rud fiú a shábháil."

