# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Security: resolved all 80 open CodeQL/code-scanning alerts and added recurrence guards. Broke an unsafe import cycle in *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; hardened *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie prototype-pollution guard, log sanitisation, HTML-escaped exceptions, ReDoS-bounded handle regex) and *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; required TLS ≥ 1.2 in network diagnose probes; validated *actionlint* tar members against path traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexes to avoid catastrophic backtracking; anchored six Playwright URL regexes and pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* to a SHA. Guards: an *import-linter* contract, a lint requiring justified bandit *noqa*, and ruff *BLE001* as a ratchet."
msgstr "Slándáil: réiteach go léir 80 oscailte CodeQL / bogearraí-scanning foláirimh agus gardaí atarlú breise. Broke timthriall allmhairiú neamhshábháilte i *cli/administration/deploy/development* trí duilleog *env.py*; cruaite *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (fianán fréamhshamhail-pollution garda, sanitisation logáil, HTML-escaped eisceachtaí, ReDoS-bounded láimhseáil regex) agus *web-app-baserow* SSO láimhseáil oscailte atreorú; ag teastáil TLS ≥ 1.2 i probes diagnose líonra; bailíochtaithe *actionlint* baill tarra i gcoinne traversal cosán; rewrote *taiseachas aeir: fliuch*/ Baile*apt-purge* regexes a sheachaint backtracking tubaisteach; ancaire sé URL Playwright regexes agus pinned *crs-k / brainse* go SHA. Gardaí: *allmhairiú-linter* conradh, lint a éilíonn bandit údar *riachtanais uisce: measartha*, agus ruff *BLIAIN001* mar ratchet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to `127.0.0.1` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites `X-Forwarded-*`. The `X-Auth-Request-*` / `Remote-User` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through `web-svc-logout` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks' own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr "Slándáil: na headers aitheantais iontaofa gan choinníoll, atá ach sábháilte toisc go bhfuil an calafort app faoi cheangal `127.0.0.1` agus gach iarratas a thrasnaíonn an oauth2-proxy a scríobhann `X-Forwarded-*`. An `X-Auth-Request-*` / Baile `Remote-User` Tá leaganacha neamhaird d'aon ghnó mar sin ní féidir le cliant authenticated cheana féin a instealladh aitheantas éagsúla. Ní mór Logout dul tríd `web-svc-logout` / an oauth2-proxy sign-out, ní Postmarks'nasc logála féin, toisc go n-athbhunaíonn an header seachvótálaí an seisiún ar an gcéad iarratas eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to ``127.0.0.1`` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites ``X-Forwarded-*``. The ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through ``web-svc-logout`` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks’ own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr "Slándáil: na headers aitheantais iontaofa gan choinníoll, atá ach sábháilte toisc go bhfuil an calafort app faoi cheangal ``127.0.0.1`` agus gach iarratas a thrasnaíonn an oauth2-proxy a scríobhann ``X-Forwarded-*``. An ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / Baile ``Remote-User`` Tá leaganacha neamhaird d'aon ghnó mar sin ní féidir le cliant authenticated cheana féin a instealladh aitheantas éagsúla. Ní mór Logout dul tríd ``web-svc-logout`` / an oauth2-proxy sign-out, ní Postmarks’ nasc logout féin, mar gheall ar an header seachfhreastalaí ath-bhunaíonn an seisiún ar an chéad iarratas eile."

