# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Self-built and stdlib-only: the served surface is three JSON-RPC methods, and a dependency-free image has no transitive supply chain to audit per release. The container runs as a non-root user with a read-only root filesystem and all Linux capabilities dropped."
msgstr "Féin-tógtha agus stdlib-amháin: Is é an dromchla a sheirbheáil trí modhanna JSON-RPC, agus tá íomhá saor ó spleáchas ar bith slabhra soláthair a sheoladh chuig iniúchadh in aghaidh an scaoilte. Ritheann an coimeádán mar úsáideoir neamh-fréamh le córas comhad fréimhe léamh-amháin agus gach cumas Linux thit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
