# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Self-hosted CI runners: new *svc-runner* role plus *cli/deploy/runner* command spin up N containerised GitHub Actions runners on any server, adding to the 20 GitHub-hosted ones. Each runner is isolated (own subnet, ports, inventory, Docker volume, DNS) and auto-re-registers. Runs on Debian, Ubuntu and Arch, supports Docker-in-Docker, and ships a full in-runner E2E deploy test. See the *svc-runner* README."
msgstr "Féin-óstáil dara háit CI: nua *svc-runner* ról móide *cli/deploy/runner* ordú casadh suas N coimeádánized GitHub Gníomhairí dara háit ar aon fhreastalaí, ag cur leis an 20 GitHub-óstach cinn. Tá gach dara háit scoite (féin subnet, calafoirt, fardal, toirt Docker, DNS) agus athchlárú uathoibríoch. Ritheann ar Debian, Ubuntu agus Arch, Tacaíonn Docker-i-Docker, agus longa go hiomlán i-runner E2E tástáil imscaradh. Féach an *svc-runner* README."

