# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single sign-on is wired in by default whenever the upstream software supports it: the role MUST configure OIDC against [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) when an OIDC client adapter exists upstream, and MUST configure LDAP against [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) when an LDAP adapter exists upstream. If a role offers both, it MUST default to OIDC and MAY expose LDAP behind a service flag. Roles whose upstream ships neither MUST document the exception in their `README.md`."
msgstr "Tá comhartha-ar Aonair sreangaithe de réir réamhshocraithe aon uair a thacaíonn na bogearraí upstream é: an ról MUST chumrú OIDC i gcoinne [web-app-keycloak](../../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/) nuair atá adapter cliant OIDC ann in aghaidh srutha, agus MUST chumrú LDAP in aghaidh [svc-db-openldap](../../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/) nuair a bhíonn adapter LDAP in aghaidh srutha. Má thairgeann ról an dá, MUST sé réamhshocraithe OIDC agus MAY nochtadh LDAP taobh thiar de bhratach seirbhíse. Róil nach bhfuil longa srutha doiciméadú MUST an eisceacht ina `README.md`."

