msgstr "Foinse amháin na fírinne do chéannacht oinniún an nód: ``ensure_node_onion`` mints/reuses na príomhchomhaid anseo agus na ``svc-net-tor`` ról cóipeanna iad isteach sa daemon ag rith. Lives lasmuigh rud ar bith regenerates an imscaradh agus tá sé suite isteach sa DiD ag ``{playbook_dir}/.onion-identity/hs``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for the per-addon enable flags consumed by the Playwright addon-gating helper (``tests/addon-gating.js`` -> ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Replaces the error-prone per-template Jinja loop: it resolves the materialised ``addons`` mapping for ``application_id`` and returns one ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` line per declared addon (sorted by env key, newline-joined), where the env-key derivation matches addon-gating.js exactly."
msgstr "Foinse amháin na fírinne le haghaidh an per-addon ar chumas bratacha arna gcaitheamh ag an cúntóir Playwright addon-gating (``tests/addon-gating.js`` - ú ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Replaces an earráid-prone per-template lúb Jinja: réitíonn sé an materialised ``addons`` mapáil do ``application_id`` agus tuairisceáin amháin ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` líne in aghaidh an addon dearbhaithe (curtha in eagar ag eochair env, líne- tadhlach), nuair a oireann an díorthú env-eochair addon-gating.js go díreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for: parsing raw service-config resource scalars, evaluating the enabled/shared/container predicates, walking a role's services (resolving template-gated shared services to the provider role's entity via the service registry, loading each service once unless ``dedup=False``), and aggregating the collected rows into a budget."
msgstr "Foinse amháin na fírinne le haghaidh: scalars acmhainn parsing amh seirbhíse-mhuinín, meastóireacht a dhéanamh ar an enabled/shared/container preideacáidí, ag siúl ról seirbhísí (seirbhísí comhroinnte teimpléid-gated a réiteach d'eintiteas ról an tsoláthraí tríd an gclárú seirbhíse, gach seirbhís a luchtú uair amháin mura rud é ``dedup=False``), agus na sraitheanna bailithe a chomhshuimiú isteach i mbuiséad."

