# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Cuirtear Snipe-IT isteach trí dhroichead iontaofa: an oauth2-proxy fíordheimhnithe i gcoinne Keycloak agus Snipe-IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints seisiún dúchais don meaitseáil `users.username` sraith (féach ar [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). Dearbhaíonn an geata aon `allowed_groups`, mar sin `biber` pasanna an seachvótálaí – ach na forálacha ról ach an cuntas riarthóir ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), mar sin déanann an header nach bhfuil ainm úsáideora Snipe-IT a fhios agus tagann an cuairteoir ar ais go dtí an fhoirm logála dúchais. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) dá bhrí sin, dearbhaíonn `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, cé go bhfuil an `administrator` Fanann persona beo (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) agus feidhmíonn sé deireadh leis an droichead iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Cuirtear Snipe-IT isteach trí dhroichead iontaofa: an oauth2-proxy fíordheimhnithe i gcoinne Keycloak agus Snipe-IT ar ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints seisiún dúchais don meaitseáil ``users.username`` sraith (féach ar ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) agus feidhmíonn sé deireadh leis an droichead iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "Is córas bainistíochta sócmhainní foinse oscailte é Snipe-IT atá deartha chun rianú crua-earraí agus fardal bogearraí a chuíchóiriú. Soláthraíonn an imscaradh réiteach uathoibrithe, coimeádán ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose, láraithe MariaDB comhtháthú bunachar sonraí, agus slán, suímh timpeallacht configurable, lena n-áirítear tacaíocht ríomhphoist láidir SMTP agus go dtí feabhsuithe fíordheimhnithe SAML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Mar sin, `meta/services.yml` MUST NACH bhfuil leibhéal barr `services:` eochair wrapping a ábhar. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NACH bhfuil leibhéal barr `volumes:` eochair, agus baineann an riail chéanna le `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, agus `meta/info.yml`. Socraíonn an ainm comhaid ina n-aonar an réimír cosán sa chrann iarratais ábhartha, a choimeádann cosáin tomhaltóirí gearr agus intuartha (gan a bheith iomarcach `compose.…` iontrálacha)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
