# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-test only (called by the swarm matrix after provision). In swarm an embedded per-app database (``shared: false``) resolves to a per-app mariadb whose volume is NFS-backed with no placement pin — InnoDB on NFS plus a free-floating task is unsupported (locking, split-brain). Embedded DBs are a compose-only pattern. Flipping every consumer's DB service to ``shared: true`` routes it to the central svc-db-* provider (as the baseline variant does), so no per-app DB is scheduled in swarm."
msgstr "Swarm-tástála amháin (ar a dtugtar an maitrís swarm tar éis soláthar). I swarm bunachar sonraí leabaithe in aghaidh an-app (``shared: false``) réitíonn sé le mariadb per-app a bhfuil a toirt NFS-tacaíocht gan aon bioráin socrúcháin - InnoDB ar NFS móide tasc saor in aisce-urghabháil (Glasáil, scoilt-inchinn). Tá DBanna Leabaithe patrún dhlúth-amháin. Seirbhís DB gach tomhaltóra a fheistiú ``shared: true`` bealaí sé go dtí an svc-db- lárnach* soláthróir (mar a dhéanann an leagan bonnlíne), mar sin níl aon DB per-app sceidealta i swarm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm: the device grant renders in compose mode only, matching the cadvisor precedent, because `docker stack deploy` drops `devices`. An embodied device is single-node by definition, so this is consistent rather than a gap, but the swarm path of the agent roles is never exercised with the robot role present."
msgstr "Swarm: déanann an deontas gléas modh a chumadh ach amháin, agus déanann sé freastal ar an bhfreastalaí, mar gheall ar `docker stack deploy` titeann `devices`. Tá gléas embodied aon-node de réir sainmhíniú, mar sin tá sé seo comhsheasmhach seachas bearna, ach tá an cosán swarm na róil gníomhaire a fheidhmiú riamh leis an ról robot i láthair."

