# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for Arch Linux, this role monitors containers for failure states and initiates a controlled restart of affected Compose configurations. If port conflicts prevent recovery, the role stops the affected stack, restarts Docker, and recreates the container environment."
msgstr "Tailored do Arch Linux, monatóireacht ar an ról seo coimeádáin do stáit teip agus tús a chur le atosú rialaithe de chumraíochtaí Múirín difear. Má coinbhleachtaí port cosc a ghnóthú, stopann an ról an chairn difear, atosú Docker, agus recreates an timpeallacht coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tailored for creative professionals and developers, this role streamlines the process of setting up a portfolio site. It automates tasks such as Docker container configuration, dynamic routing via NGINX, and repository integration, so you can concentrate on perfecting your content and design. Enjoy a responsive layout and easy-to-modify YAML files that let you rapidly update your online presence without deep technical intervention."
msgstr "Tailored do dhaoine gairmiúla cruthaitheacha agus forbróirí, sruthlíníonn an ról seo an próiseas a bhunú suíomh punainne. uathoibríonn sé tascanna ar nós chumraíocht coimeádán Docker, ródú dinimiciúil trí NGINX, agus comhtháthú stór, ionas gur féidir leat díriú ar perfecting do ábhar agus dearadh. Bain sult as leagan amach sofhreagrach agus éasca le-a mhodhnú comhaid YAML a lig tú cothrom le dáta go tapa do láithreacht ar líne gan idirghabháil theicniúil domhain."

