# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Target `<branch>` is the branch the operator names. If none is named, the agent MUST NOT silently assume the current branch. Instead, resolve the current branch via `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`, propose it to the operator, and wait for explicit confirmation before proceeding. Only after the operator confirms (or names a different branch) is the value frozen as `<branch>`. All subsequent steps operate on the same frozen `<branch>` regardless of what is checked out later. The operator MUST be free to switch branches and keep working while the agent runs."
msgstr "Sprioc na Sprioc `<branch>` Is é an brainse na hainmneacha oibreoir. Má tá aon cheann ainmnithe, an gníomhaire NACH MUST glacadh adh an brainse reatha. Ina áit sin, an brainse reatha a réiteach tríd `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`, é a mholadh don oibreoir, agus fanacht le daingniú sainráite roimh dul ar aghaidh. Ach amháin tar éis an t-oibreoir Deimhníonn (nó ainmneacha brainse éagsúil) Is é an luach reoite mar `<branch>`. Oibríonn gach beart ina dhiaidh sin ar an reoite céanna `<branch>` beag beann ar an méid a sheiceáil amach níos déanaí. MUST an t-oibreoir a bheith saor chun brainsí a athrú agus a choinneáil ag obair agus ritheann an gníomhaire."

