# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests MUST simulate real user behaviour by interacting with the rendered UI. Navigating directly to an action endpoint via `page.goto(<endpoint>)` is FORBIDDEN whenever a click target exists on the current surface. The most common offender is logout: a test MUST click a logout button or a logout link rendered by the role, never `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. The same rule applies to login, password change, account deletion, file upload, post submission, and every other user-initiated action."
msgstr "Tástáil MUST insamhail iompar úsáideora fíor ag idirghníomhú leis an Chomhéadain a rinneadh. Ag breathnú go díreach chuig pointe gníomhaíochta trí `page.goto(<endpoint>)` Is FORBIDDEN aon uair a bhfuil sprioc cliceáil ar an dromchla reatha. Is é an ciontóir is coitianta logout: MUST tástála cliceáil ar an cnaipe logout nó nasc logout a rinne an ról, riamh `page.goto(LOGOUT_URL)`. Baineann an riail chéanna le logáil isteach, athrú phasfhocal, scriosadh cuntas, comhad a uaslódáil, aighneacht phost, agus gach gníomh úsáideora-initithe eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST NOT cover unrelated OAuth2 or OIDC configuration. Generic OAuth2 / OIDC invariants belong one level up under `oauth2_oidc/`. Port and domain checks belong under `tests/integration/ports/` and `tests/integration/domains/`."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire NACH chlúdach OAuth nach mbaineann2 nó cumraíocht OIDC. cineál gas: in airde2 / OIDC ivariants mbaineann leibhéal amháin suas faoi `oauth2_oidc/`. Baineann seiceálacha calafoirt agus fearainn faoi `tests/integration/ports/` agus `tests/integration/domains/`."

