# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot, PR helpers). Tests for local `make` targets, role logic, or non-CI scripts MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach ach GitHub-taobh CI / déantúsáin CD (sreabhadh oibre, Spleáchas, cúntóirí PR). Tástáil do áitiúil `make` spriocanna, loighic ról, nó neamh-CI scripteanna MUST beo in áiteanna eile faoi `tests/integration/`."

