msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach amháin `meta/main.yml` láithreacht agus cruth réimse. Tástálacha faoi spleáchais ról a dhearbhaítear sa chomhad sin (`dependencies:`) MUST beo faoi [`dependencies/`](dependencies/); seiceálacha ceangailte `meta/services.yml` MUST beo faoi [`services/`](services/) (leis an ordú-amháin `galaxy_info.run_after` seiceálacha faoi [`services/run_after/`](services/run_after/)); seiceálacha i gcoinne `meta/variants.yml` MUST beo faoi [`variants/`](variants/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key. Checks tied specifically to `galaxy_info.run_after` (self-references, reference existence, run-after cycles) MUST live under [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Generic structural role checks (folder names, presence of `meta/main.yml`, include target existence) MUST live two levels up under `tests/integration/roles/`."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach amháin `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` eochair. Seiceálacha ceangailte go sonrach le `galaxy_info.run_after` (féin-tagairtí, ann tagartha, timthriallta reáchtáil-tar éis) MUST beo faoi [`../services/run_after/`](../services/run_after/). Seiceálacha ról struchtúrach cineálach (ainmneacha fillteán, láithreacht `meta/main.yml`, san áireamh ann sprioc) MUST beo dhá leibhéal suas faoi `tests/integration/roles/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover `meta/services.yml` shape and content. The ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in the [`run_after/`](run_after/) sub-cluster; coverage of `meta/variants.yml` lives one level up in [`../variants/`](../variants/); coverage of `meta/main.yml`'s `dependencies:` key lives in [`../dependencies/`](../dependencies/)."
