# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover prometheus-specific wiring and the prometheus service entry. Broader `meta/services.yml` shape rules MUST live one level up in [`services/`](../); the ordering-only `galaxy_info.run_after` cluster lives in [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach ach prometheus-sonrach sreangú agus an iontráil seirbhíse prometheus. Amharc ar gach eolas `meta/services.yml` rialacha cruth MUST beo leibhéal amháin suas i [`services/`](../); an t-ordú-amháin `galaxy_info.run_after` saol braisle i [`run_after/`](../run_after/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository settings files (Claude Code config, IDE rule files, agent permission catalogues). Code conventions MUST live elsewhere under `tests/lint/repository/`."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST amháin a chlúdach suímh stór comhaid (Claude Code config, IDE comhaid riail, catalóga cead gníomhaire). Coinbhinsiúin Cód MUST beo in áiteanna eile faoi `tests/lint/repository/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover repository/ref shape rules. Broader `meta/services.yml` invariants live one level up in [`services/`](../)."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach amháin stór / rialacha cruth machnamh. Amharc ar gach eolas `meta/services.yml` invariants beo leibhéal amháin suas i [`services/`](../)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-folder and role-name conventions. Per-role structural rules (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) MUST live under the sibling clusters [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), or [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach ach ról-fillteán agus ról-ainm coinbhinsiúin. Rialacha struchtúracha Per-ról (`meta/`, `tasks/`, `templates/`) MUST beo faoi na braislí deartháireacha [`meta/`](../meta/), [`when/`](../when/), nó [`run_once/`](../run_once/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-level structural rules (folder naming, role-name regex). `meta/main.yml` presence and field checks MUST live under [`meta/`](meta/). Dependency-graph checks (self-, circular, unnecessary dependencies, `run_after`) MUST live under [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (and the sibling [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Application-specific role rules (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage, `application_id` identity) MUST live under [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block-level `when:` hygiene (guard blocks, duplication, size) MUST live under [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target existence MUST live under [`includes/`](includes/). Compose- or handler-specific checks MUST live in their respective topical clusters."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST chlúdach ach ról-leibhéal rialacha struchtúrtha (fillteán ainmniú, ról-ainm regex). `meta/main.yml` láithreacht agus seiceálacha allamuigh MUST beo faoi [`meta/`](meta/). Seiceálacha ag brath ar mhír (féin-, ciorclach, spleáchais gan ghá, `run_after`) MUST beo faoi [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (agus an deartháireacha [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Rialacha maidir le ról sonrach an iarratais (web-app README, `applications[...]` / Baile `group_names` úsáid, `application_id` féiniúlacht) MUST beo faoi [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` seiceálacha saolré bratach MUST beo faoi [`run_once/`](run_once/). Bloc-leibhéal `when:` health insurance (bloic garda, dúbailt, méid) MUST beo faoi [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / Baile `import_tasks` / Baile `include_role` / Baile `import_role` sprioc ann MUST beo faoi [`includes/`](includes/). Comhdhéanta- nó láimhseálaí-sonrach seiceálacha MUST beo ina mbraislí i mbéal an phobail faoi seach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about block-level `when:` semantics and guard-block shape. `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); rules about `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence MUST live under [`../includes/`](../includes/)."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST ach rialacha a chlúdach faoi bloc-leibhéal `when:` shéimeálacha agus cruth garda-block. `run_once_<role>` seiceálacha saolré bratach MUST beo faoi [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); rialacha faoi `include_tasks` / Baile `import_tasks` sprioc ann MUST beo faoi [`../includes/`](../includes/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about how playbooks invoke role groups and how the invokable-paths filter maps to stages. Tests for role-internal `meta/main.yml` MUST live under [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); tests for include/import target existence MUST live under [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."
msgstr "Tástáil sa eolaire MUST ach rialacha a chlúdach faoi conas a imirt leabhair agairt grúpaí ról agus conas na léarscáileanna invokable-cosáin scagaire do chéimeanna. Tástáil do ról-internal `meta/main.yml` MUST beo faoi [`roles/meta/`](../../roles/meta/); tástálacha lena n-áirítear / a allmhairiú sprioc ann MUST beo faoi [`roles/includes/`](../../roles/includes/)."

