# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The 2.7.0 image ships 23 tool categories, which are application names (``calendar``, ``files``, ``mail``, ``talk``, …) rather than operations: each bundles its read and its write tools, and the hub offers no setting that removes only the mutating ones. Enabling the ExApp writes ``true`` for every category absent from ``tool_status``, so the hub itself serves all of them, write tools included."
msgstr "An bhfuil 2.7.0 long íomhá 23 catagóirí uirlis, a bhfuil ainmneacha iarratais (``calendar``, ``files``, ``mail``, ``talk``, ...) seachas oibríochtaí: gach bundles a léamh agus a uirlisí a scríobh, agus cuireann an mol aon suíomh a chuireann ach na cinn mutating. Enabling an ExApp scríobhann ``true`` i gcás gach catagóire as láthair ó ``tool_status``, mar sin feidhmíonn an mol féin gach ceann acu, uirlisí a scríobh san áireamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The 2.7.0 image ships 23 tool categories, which are application names (`calendar`, `files`, `mail`, `talk`, …) rather than operations: each bundles its read and its write tools, and the hub offers no setting that removes only the mutating ones. Enabling the ExApp writes `true` for every category absent from `tool_status`, so the hub itself serves all of them, write tools included."
msgstr "An bhfuil 2.7.0 long íomhá 23 catagóirí uirlis, a bhfuil ainmneacha iarratais (`calendar`, `files`, `mail`, `talk`, ...) seachas oibríochtaí: gach bundles a léamh agus a uirlisí a scríobh, agus cuireann an mol aon suíomh a chuireann ach na cinn mutating. Enabling an ExApp scríobhann `true` i gcás gach catagóire as láthair ó `tool_status`, mar sin feidhmíonn an mol féin gach ceann acu, uirlisí a scríobh san áireamh."

