# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The AUR PKGBUILDs this project consumes carry a checksum on a git source, which makepkg can only reject; integrity rests on the pinned upstream tag fetched over HTTPS."
msgstr "An PKGBUILDs AUR itheann an tionscadal seo a dhéanamh checkum ar fhoinse git, a dhéanamh is féidir a dhiúltú ach amháin; Tá sláine ar an chlib pinned upstream fetched thar HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The AUR is one origin host with no mirror pool behind it, so a flap there lasts minutes rather than the seconds a pool member needs to rotate out; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40s window has been observed losing to a single flap."
msgstr "Is é an AUR óstach tionscnaimh amháin gan aon chomhthiomsú scáthán taobh thiar de, mar sin maireann flap ann nóiméad seachas na soicind is gá comhalta linn snámha a rothlú amach; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40s fuinneog breathnaíodh a chailliúint le flap amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
