# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree behind these paths is materialised by a per-application group-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), anchored at `/<group_root>/<application_id>` with `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."
msgstr "An bhfuil Keycloak crann grúpa taobh thiar de na cosáin atá ábhartha ag grúpa-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), ancaire ag `/<group_root>/<application_id>` le `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree is built by **per-application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Each deployed application gets one mapper anchored at `/roles/<application_id>` whose LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` surfaces only that application's role groups. The mapper uses the LDAP `description` attribute as the visible Keycloak group name, so the resulting group paths carry no redundant prefix."
msgstr "An bhfuil Keycloak Tá crann grúpa tógtha ag **an t-iarratas** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Faigheann gach iarratas imscaradh mapper amháin ancaire ag `/roles/<application_id>` a bhfuil scagaire LDAP `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` dromchlaí ach go bhfuil rólghrúpaí an iarratais. Úsáideann an mapper an LDAP `description` tréith mar an le feiceáil Keycloak ainm an ghrúpa, mar sin ní dhéanann na bealaí grúpa mar thoradh ar aon réimír iomarcach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MCP surface ships disabled by default and is independent of the host role's `lifecycle`: a `beta` host role MUST NOT imply that its MCP surface is stable. An MCP surface is only considered validated once its acceptance criteria are met end to end."
msgstr "Na longa dromchla MCP faoi mhíchumas de réir réamhshocraithe agus tá sé neamhspleách ar an ról óstach `lifecycle`: a `beta` Ról óstach NACH MST le tuiscint go bhfuil a dromchla MCP cobhsaí. Ní mheastar go bhfuil dromchla MCP bailíochtaithe ach amháin nuair a chomhlíontar a chritéir ghlactha chun deiridh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The MDAD inventory is templated to enable a conservative-default bridge set plus Jitsi + Element Call. Bridge enablement is gated on `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 default-ON set (operator-confirmed): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Default-OFF (operator opts in): every bridge that needs a third-party API token the operator must obtain manually — `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, and the superseded `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."
msgstr "Tá an fardal MDAD teimpléad chun a chur ar chumas a shocrú droichead coimeádach-réamhshocrú móide Jitsi + Element Call. Tá cumas Droichead gated ar `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 riachtanais uisce: measartha (oibreoir-dhearbhú): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Réamhshocrú (roghnaíonn an t-oibreoir i): gach droichead a éilíonn tríú páirtí API ní mór don oibreoir a fháil de láimh — `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, agus an áit `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MariaDB image tag to pull (e.g. `10.6`, `10.11`, or `latest`)."
msgstr "An bhfuil MariaDB tag íomhá a tharraingt (e.g. `10.6`, `10.11`, nó `latest`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matomo API token is generated during the Matomo bootstrap and persisted to disk by `sys-token-store`. It is then resolved through `lookup('users')`, which hydrates tokens from the store at runtime."
msgstr "An bhfuil Matomo API chomhartha a ghintear le linn an Matomo buataisítrap agus fós le diosca ag `sys-token-store`. Tá sé réiteach ansin trí `lookup('users')`, a hidráitithe comharthaí ón siopa ag runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matrix role gains an ansible flavor (requirement 025) built on a unified compose template, with full Docker-in-Docker isolation, host-network mode cascaded to the addons and Jitsi, a central Postgres backend sharing the MATRIX_POSTGRES variables, and a central coturn aligned to the shared coturn variables for the MASH role. A dedicated MDAD runner image (python 3.13-slim with docker 28.0.4 CLI, migration validated against v2026.05.18.0) mounts the Infinito self-signed CA into both the runner and Synapse, and bootstrap now recovers cleanly from a stale marker."
msgstr "An bhfuil Matrix ról gnóthachain blas ansible (ceanglas 025) tógtha ar theimpléad chumadh aontaithe, le leithlisiú lán Docker-i-Docker, mód cogaíochta líonra cascaded leis na addons agus Jitsi, postend lárnach roinnt ar an MATRIX_POSTGRES athróg, agus coturn lárnach ailínithe leis na hathróga coturn roinnte don ról MASH. A íomhá tiomnaithe dara háit MDAD (bláthanna cumhra: cumhráin 3.13-Slim le docker 28.0.4 CLI, imirce bailíochtaithe i gcoinne v2026.05.18.0) mounts an féin-sínithe Infinito CA isteach sa dara háit agus Synapse araon, agus buataisítrap aisghabhann anois go glan ó marcóir stale."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Meta Infinite Graph is an essential tool for analyzing, auditing, and maintaining the modular structure of the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It provides a clear overview of all roles and how they are interconnected."
msgstr "Is é an Graph Infinite Meta uirlis riachtanach le haghaidh anailís, iniúchóireacht, agus a chothabháil ar an struchtúr modúlach an Infinito.Nexus éiceachóras. Soláthraíonn sé léargas soiléir ar gach ról agus ar an gcaoi a bhfuil siad idirnasctha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "An bhfuil NGINX Certbot Automation Cinntíonn ról go fanacht deimhnithe SSL / TLS Criptithe bailí gan idirghabháil láimhe. Cuireann sé slándáil agus iontaofacht na seirbhísí gréasáin trí uathoibriú bainistíochta saolré deimhniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let’s Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "An bhfuil NGINX Certbot Automation Cinntíonn ról go fanacht deimhnithe Criptithe SSL / TLS bailí gan idirghabháil láimhe. Cuireann sé slándáil agus iontaofacht na seirbhísí gréasáin trí uathoibriú bainistíochta saolré deimhniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, `.well-known` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let's Encrypt."
msgstr "An NGINX File Server Leagann ról suas freastalaí comhad simplí agus slán statach ag baint úsáide as [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). Soláthraíonn sé ar bhealach éasca chun freastal ar chomhaid thar HTTPS, lena n-áirítear liosta eolaire, `.well-known` tacaíocht, agus comhtháthú deimhnithe uathoibríoch SSL / TLS trí Criptiú A ligean ar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, ``.well-known`` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let’s Encrypt."
msgstr "An NGINX File Server Leagann ról suas freastalaí comhad simplí agus slán statach ag baint úsáide as `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. Soláthraíonn sé ar bhealach éasca chun freastal ar chomhaid thar HTTPS, lena n-áirítear liosta eolaire, ``.well-known`` tacaíocht, agus comhtháthú deimhnithe uathoibríoch SSL / TLS trí Criptiú A ligean ar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval role ensures that your NGINX-served domains have valid, automatically issued SSL/TLS certificates, improving web security without manual intervention."
msgstr "An bhfuil NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval cinntíonn ról go bhfuil do fearainn NGINX-chosanta bailí, d'eisigh go huathoibríoch deimhnithe SSL / TLS, feabhas a chur ar shlándáil gréasáin gan idirghabháil láimhe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Static HTML Server role provides a simple and efficient method to publish static websites with HTTPS, perfect for personal homepages, landing pages, or small projects."
msgstr "An NGINX Static HTML Server Soláthraíonn ról modh simplí agus éifeachtach a fhoilsiú láithreáin ghréasáin statach le HTTPS, foirfe do leathanaigh bhaile pearsanta, leathanaigh tuirlingthe, nó tionscadail bheaga."

