# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC client used by the application has the `groups` client scope attached as a **default** scope (not optional). The design note in [RBAC design](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) explains why."
msgstr "Tá an cliant OIDC a úsáideann an t-iarratas an `groups` raon feidhme cliant ceangailte mar **cineál gas: in airde** raon feidhme (ní roghnach). An nóta dearadh i [Dearadh RBAC](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) Míníonn cén fáth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC group path `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` already namespaces by application, so an `openbao-` prefix would be redundant, and the repo's other `meta/rbac.yml` files use bare role names."
msgstr "An cosán grúpa OIDC `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` ainmneacha spásanna cheana féin trí iarratas, mar sin `openbao-` bheadh réimír iomarcach, agus an repo eile `meta/rbac.yml` comhaid a úsáid ainmneacha ról lom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, the Discourse round-trip by ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."
msgstr "Tá na bealaí logála OIDC + RBAC clúdaithe ag ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / Baile ``test-rbac-roles.js``, an Discourse bhabhta-turas ag ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, the Discourse round-trip by `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."
msgstr "Tá na bealaí logála OIDC + RBAC clúdaithe ag `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / Baile `test-rbac-roles.js`, an Discourse bhabhta-turas ag `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) are mandatory because they gate SSO login: when one of them is the selected flavor and the system hides the native login form, an un-installed OIDC app leaves the instance with no usable login path. Failing at install time surfaces the version-pin mismatch immediately rather than as a downstream login timeout in the Playwright e2e suite."
msgstr "Na pointí iontrála logála OIDC (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) Tá siad éigeantach mar gheall ar gheata siad logáil SSO: nuair a bhíonn ceann acu an blas roghnaithe agus seithí an córas an fhoirm logála dúchais, fágann app OIDC neamhshuiteáilte mar shampla gan aon cosán logáil isteach inúsáidte. Failing ag a shuiteáil dromchlaí am an leagan-bioráin mismatch láithreach seachas mar logála downstream timeout sa Playwright e2e sraith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC role's `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer capable) names the claim holding the user's groups; those values resolve against identity groups of `type=external` via group aliases on the auth mount, which carry the policies."
msgstr "Ról an OIDC `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer in ann) ainmneacha an t-éileamh a bhfuil grúpaí an úsáideora; na luachanna réiteach i gcoinne grúpaí aitheantais `type=external` trí ailiasanna grúpa ar an mount auth, a dhéanann na beartais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC username claim is paired with the LDAP login attribute by design. See [ldap.md](ldap.md) for the LDAP-side rule."
msgstr "Tá an t-éileamh ainm úsáideora OIDC péireáilte leis an tréith logála LDAP trí dhearadh. Féach ar [ldap.md](ldap.md) don riail LDAP-taobh."

