# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `gitlab_repositories` volume is declared `nfs: false`, so in swarm mode it stays a plain node-local volume instead of being rewritten to the shared NFS backend. Gitaly is pinned to a single replica. When a swarm reschedule moves the gitaly task to another node, the repositories stay on the previous node's local volume; move the volume data manually before rescheduling gitaly."
msgstr "An bhfuil `gitlab_repositories` toirt dearbhaithe `nfs: false`, mar sin i mód swarm fhanann sé toirt plain nód-áit in ionad a bheith athscríofa leis an siar NFS roinnte. Tá Gitaly pinned le macasamhail amháin. Nuair a bogann reschedule swarm an tasc gitaly le nód eile, fanacht ar na stórtha ar an nód roimhe ar líon áitiúil; bogadh na sonraí toirt de láimh roimh rescheduling gitaly."

