msgid "The `guest` persona is always live (no auth chain assumption) and the canonical-landing baseline test runs unconditionally."
msgstr "An bhfuil `guest` Is persona gcónaí (aon toimhde slabhrauth) agus ritheann an tástáil bonnlíne Canonical-thírithe gan choinníoll."

