msgstr "An bhfuil `infinito_` réimír sa ainm comhaid MUST a bheith i láthair iff ndéanann an eochair úinéireacht an `INFINITO_` réim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `ldap` service block in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) is intentionally pinned to literal `false` (see [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): the `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. `discourse-ldap-auth` therefore resolves to disabled until that block is flipped back to the dynamic group-membership form."
msgstr "An bhfuil `ldap` bloc seirbhíse i [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Tá pinned d'aon ghnó go litriúil `false` (féach ar [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): an `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` sosanna breiseán Discourse buataisítrap ar leaganacha beaga anuas. `discourse-ldap-auth` dá bhrí sin, réitíonn sé do dhaoine faoi mhíchumas go dtí go bhfuil an bloc flipped ar ais go dtí an fhoirm ghrúpa-comhalta dinimiciúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `lint` job runs [call-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` fans every lint check out in parallel, plus a hadolint SARIF job. It MUST pass before the pipeline continues."
msgstr "An bhfuil `lint` Ritheann an post [glaoch-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` lucht leanúna gach lint seiceáil amach i comhthreomhar, móide post hadolint SARIF. MÓR é pas sula leanann an phíblíne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` on every container start, so the schema is seeded automatically on the first deploy."
msgstr "An bhfuil `listmonk` Ritheann ordú seirbhíse `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` ar gach tús coimeádán, mar sin tá an scéimre síol go huathoibríoch ar an chéad imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` on every container start, so schema migrations apply automatically when a new image is deployed."
msgstr "An bhfuil `listmonk` Ritheann ordú seirbhíse `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` ar gach tús coimeádán, mar sin feidhm imircí scéimre go huathoibríoch nuair a íomhá nua imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `lookup('database', ...)` API is the convenience accessor for database connection values; it resolves the active direct database service from the role-local keys above."
msgstr "An bhfuil `lookup('database', ...)` API Is é an rochtaineoir áise do luachanna nasc bunachar sonraí; réitíonn sé an tseirbhís bunachar sonraí díreach gníomhach ó na heochracha ról-áitiúil thuas."

