msgid "The `make runner-ci-deploy` target invokes `python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner`. You can also call it directly:"
msgstr "An bhfuil `make runner-ci-deploy` agairt sprioc `python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner`. Is féidir leat glaoch freisin go díreach:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `oidc` plugin (`pretix-oidc`, pinned to `2.3.1`) is pip-installed at image build time and delivers Keycloak/OIDC login. It auto-enables whenever the SSO partner role (`web-app-keycloak`) is co-deployed and stays off otherwise."
msgstr "An bhfuil `oidc` breiseán breiseán (`pretix-oidc`, pinned go `2.3.1`) Tá pip-suiteáilte ag am a thógáil íomhá agus seachadtaí Keycloak/ OIDC logáil isteach. Tá sé auto-chumasaigh aon uair an ról comhpháirtíochta SSO (`web-app-keycloak`) tá sé comh-imlonnaithe agus fanann sé ar shlí eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pre-commit` hooks are installed automatically by `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides go into the process environment before invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` honors caller-set values via setdefault semantics."
msgstr "An bhfuil `pre-commit` crúcaí suiteáilte go huathoibríoch ag `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides dul isteach sa timpeallacht phróiseas roimh invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` onóracha luachanna caller-leagtha trí shéimeantáin setdefault."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pull_request` orchestrator then waits for and consumes those images."
msgstr "An bhfuil `pull_request` Ansin fanann ceoltóir na híomhánna sin agus ídíonn sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `rbac_group_path` lookup plugin is the only sanctioned producer of OIDC group paths in this repository. Tests in this directory MUST cover invariants that protect that contract: callsite shape, role declaration consistency, and the ban on inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` constructions introduced by requirement 005."
msgstr "An bhfuil `rbac_group_path` Is breiseán Lookup an táirgeoir amháin ceadaithe de chonairí grúpa OIDC sa stór. Tástáil sa eolaire MUST clúdach invariants a chosnaíonn an conradh: cruth callite, comhsheasmhacht dearbhú ról, agus an toirmeasc ar inlíne `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` tógálacha a tugadh isteach de réir riachtanas 005."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `redirect_uris` lookup generates `https://<domain>/*` per SSO consumer, which covers the UI and API callbacks but not a localhost one. Machine access goes through AppRole (Decision #2) instead. Documented as a limitation in the README."
msgstr "An bhfuil `redirect_uris` Gineann Lookup `https://<domain>/*` in aghaidh an tomhaltóra SSO, a chlúdaíonn an Chomhéadain agus API callbacks ach ní ceann localhost. Téann rochtain meaisín trí AppRole (Cinneadh #2) ina ionad sin. Doiciméadaithe mar theorainn leis an LÉAS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` flag is retained as belt-and-suspenders. If `Bash(*)` were ever removed, the sandbox auto-allow would still cover the common shapes, but it is no longer the primary gate."
msgstr "An bhfuil `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` coimeádtar bratach mar crios-agus-suspenders. Más rud é `Bash(*)` Baineadh riamh, bheadh an auto-cheadú bosca gainimh a chlúdach fós na cruthanna coitianta, ach tá sé a thuilleadh ar an geata bunscoile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.network` block governs outbound and local connectivity from inside the sandbox."
msgstr "An bhfuil `sandbox.network` rialú bloc nascacht outbound agus áitiúil ó taobh istigh den bhosca gainimh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `scripts/` tree MUST contain executable shell entry points and shell helper files only."
msgstr "An bhfuil `scripts/` MUST crann go bhfuil pointí iontrála bhlaosc inrite agus comhaid bhlaosc cúntóir amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `security-codeql` job runs the CodeQL scan (catalogued in the `Security and linting` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). A failing scan MUST fail `code-quality-gate` and thereby block all downstream deploy, install, and environment tests."
msgstr "An bhfuil `security-codeql` Ritheann post an scanadh CodeQL (catalógaithe sa `Security and linting` tábla de [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). A teip scanadh MUST theipeann `code-quality-gate` agus dá bhrí sin bloc gach tástálacha downstream imscaradh, shuiteáil, agus timpeallacht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application's HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "An bhfuil `sys-front-inj-logout` Ról Ansible embeds huathoibríoch snippet lightweight JavaScript isteach do iarratais gréasáin ar freagraí HTML. Aithníonn an script naisc logála amach, cnaipí, foirmeacha, agus eilimintí eile, overrides a n-sprioc URLanna, agus cinntíonn úsáideoirí a atreorú chuig logout lárnach OIDC endpoint, ag soláthar taithí signout comhsheasmhach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail-smtp` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using [Postfix](https://www.postfix.org/), listening exclusively on `localhost`.   It is designed to be used as a fallback when no central Mailu instance is available, enabling applications and system services to send email via `localhost:25` without additional configuration."
msgstr "An bhfuil `sys-svc-mail-smtp` configures ról a **áitiúil SMTP Relay** ag baint úsáide as [Post a fhógairt](https://www.postfix.org/), éisteacht go heisiach ar `localhost`. Tá sé deartha le húsáid mar fallback nuair nach bhfuil aon lárnach Mailu mar shampla ar fáil, iarratais ar chumas agus seirbhísí córas ríomhphost a sheoladh tríd `localhost:25` gan chumraíocht bhreise."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack.   It wires together:"
msgstr "An bhfuil `sys-svc-mail` Ról gníomhartha mar **phost lárnach ciseal orchestration** sa Infinito.Nexus Stack. sreanga sé le chéile:"

