msgstr "An bhfuil `test-e2e-cli` an creat `files/test/test.sh` foinsiú athróga ó `templates/test.env.j2` tar éis gach timthriall imscaradh. Seiceáil an t-aschur imscaradh agus an t-aschur tástála CLI roimh dhearbhú a shocrú iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role MUST stage `files/playwright/` recursively (so `addons/` is included) and discover specs recursively."
msgstr "An bhfuil `test-e2e-playwright` ról céim MUST `files/playwright/` riachtanais uisce: measartha (amhlaidh `addons/` san áireamh) agus a fháil amach specs athchúrsach."

