msgid "The `test` job runs [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` fans the unit, integration, lint and external suites out in parallel on the runner host. It MUST pass `code-quality-gate`."
msgstr "An bhfuil `test` Ritheann an post [glaoch-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` lucht leanúna an t-aonad, comhtháthú, lint agus sraitheanna seachtracha amach go comhthreomhar ar an óstach dara háit. Tá sé MUST pas `code-quality-gate`."

