# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is built around one simple idea: keep the parts small, explicit, and reusable, then combine them into a full stack only when a bundle needs them."
msgstr "Tá an ailtireacht tógtha timpeall smaoineamh simplí amháin: a choinneáil ar na codanna beag, follasach, agus ath-inúsáidte, ansin iad a chur le chéile i Stack iomlán ach amháin nuair a riachtanais bundle iad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is replayed like the distro rather than left to the rotation: it is the machine the job ran on, not a preference the deploy may fall back from, so the title states what it actually was."
msgstr "Tá an ailtireacht replayed cosúil leis an distro seachas d'fhág go dtí an uainíocht: tá sé an meaisín an post ar siúl ar, ní rogha is féidir leis an imscaradh titim ar ais ó, mar sin deir an teideal cad a bhí sé i ndáiríre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is the one axis a deploy job cannot apply to itself: the distro is installed and the filesystem is built, but the CPU arrives with the runner. The matrix therefore carries the runner label with the row (`ubuntu-latest` for amd64, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` for arm64), `runs-on` reads it, and the job asserts `uname -m` against what it was assigned before deploying anything, so a label that stops resolving to arm64 hardware fails loudly instead of reporting an arm64 row green from an amd64 machine."
msgstr "Is é an ailtireacht an ais amháin nach féidir le post imscaradh iarratas a dhéanamh air féin: Tá an distro suiteáilte agus tá an córas comhaid tógtha, ach thagann an LAP leis an dara háit. Mar sin, déanann an maitrís an lipéad rádala leis an tsraith (`ubuntu-latest` am trátha64, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` le haghaidh lámh64), `runs-on` léann sé, agus na dearbhuithe poist `uname -m` i gcoinne an méid a sannadh é roimh aon rud a imscaradh, mar sin lipéad a stopann réiteach ar lámh64 crua-earraí theipeann os ard in ionad tuairisciú lámh64 as a chéile glas ó amd64 meaisín."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architectures one role's rows may draw from this run."
msgstr "Is féidir leis an ailtireacht ról amháin sraitheanna tharraingt as an rith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The archive CLI is byte-idempotent. Re-running it on an already-processed tree leaves every file unchanged: CHANGELOG.md is rewritten only when its target content differs from disk, the per-release archive files are never overwritten, and the package changelogs are only rewritten when the regenerated content differs from disk. This makes it safe to run from a pre-commit hook, a release script, or by hand without keeping track of state."
msgstr "Tá an chartlann CLI tréte-idempotent. Ath-reáchtáil sé ar crann cheana féin-próiseáilte duilleoga gach comhad gan athrú: CHANGELOG.md athscríofa ach amháin nuair a difríocht a ábhar sprioc ó dhiosca, na comhaid cartlanna per-scaoileadh riamh overwritten, agus tá na changelogs pacáiste athscríofa ach amháin nuair a bhíonn difríocht idir an t-ábhar athghiniúint ó diosca. Seo a dhéanann sé sábháilte a reáchtáil ó Hook réamh-iomaitheoir, script scaoilte, nó ar láimh gan rian stáit a choimeád."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The argv list, proxy-free."
msgstr "An liosta argv, saor in aisce seachfhreastalaí."

