# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The asset host for the current deployment: the internal CDN origin when web-svc-cdn is deployed with flavor internal, else jsdelivr."
msgstr "An ósta sócmhainní don imscaradh reatha: an tionscnamh CDN inmheánach nuair web-svc-cdn imscaradh le blas inmheánach, eile jsdelivr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit MUST classify these as `db-extension` (out of scope), so a later sweep does not mistake them for app addons. If a future role mixes app addons and DB extensions under one key, the migration MUST split them by destination."
msgstr "An MUST iniúchadh rangú iad seo mar `db-extension` (as raon feidhme), mar sin ní sweep níos déanaí dearmad iad le haghaidh addons app. Má meascann ról sa todhchaí addons app agus síntí DB faoi eochair amháin, an MUST imirce roinnte iad ag ceann scríbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit is the role tree itself: every fact about a role's MCP surface lives in its own `meta/services.yml`, so a separate artifact would be a copy that can go stale. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` enumerates the integrated roles."
msgstr "Is é an t-iniúchadh an crann ról féin: gach rud faoi ról ar shaolré MCP ina chuid féin `meta/services.yml`, mar sin bheadh artifact ar leith a bheith cóip gur féidir dul stale. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` enumerates na róil comhtháite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The automatic pin follows the effective deploy mode, and in swarm it must NOT be ``host-gateway``: that alias resolves per node, while openresty publishes :80 with ``mode: host`` under ``node.role == manager``, so every replica on a worker dialled its own gateway and the token exchange died with 'Connection refused' (7b1839681, measured on penpot in run 31340965955). Swarm therefore gets the stack host's routable address -- the destination svc-net-tor already sends all hidden-service traffic to. ``ansible_facts`` carries it because the compose file is rendered once with the manager as inventory host and swarm applies the same ``extra_hosts`` to every task."
msgstr "Leanann an bioráin uathoibríoch an modh imscaradh éifeachtach, agus i swarm ní mór é a NACH ``host-gateway``: go réitíonn ailias in aghaidh an nód, agus foilsíonn openresty:80 le ``mode: host`` faoi bhun ``node.role == manager``, mar sin gach macasamhail ar oibrí dialled a gheata féin agus an malartú chomhartha a fuair bás le 'Gníomh dhiúltaigh' (7b1839681, a thomhas ar penpot i rith 31340965955). Swarm dá bhrí sin faigheann an óstach Stack seoladh routable - an ceann scríbe svc-net-tor Cuireann cheana féin gach trácht i bhfolach-seirbhíse chuig. ``ansible_facts`` Déanann sé toisc go bhfuil an comhad a chumadh a rinneadh uair amháin leis an mbainisteoir mar óstach fardal agus swarm feidhm mar an gcéanna ``extra_hosts`` le gach tasc."

msgid "The axis is still pinned; the condition decides **which kind**. Pick the kind that satisfies both:"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The axis suffix a CI selection token may carry (``#0,2@swarm+tor``) is split off before the lookup and re-attached after it, so translating a list never drops what the operator pinned on it."
msgstr "Is féidir leis an iarmhír ais token rogha CI a iompar (``#0,2@swarm+tor``) Tá roinnt amach roimh an lookup agus ath-attached tar éis é, mar sin a aistriú liosta riamh titeann cad an t-oibreoir pinned ar sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The backup host is NOT appended to the cluster inventory: it lives in a sibling ``backup.yml`` next to ``INV_PATH`` (same host_vars dir), deployed as a second play after the cluster one. Without a svc-swarm-node group that play resolves DEPLOYMENT_MODE=compose and IS_STACK_HOST=true on the backup host, so the backup roles run without cluster-membership special cases."
msgstr "Is é an óstach cúltaca NACH i gceangal leis an fardal braisle: tá sé ina chónaí i deartháireacha ``backup.yml`` in aice leis ``INV_PATH`` (céanna host_vars taiseachas aeir: fliuch), imscaradh mar an dara súgradh tar éis an ceann braisle. Gan svc-swarm-node grúpa a réitíonn spraoi DEPLOYMENT_MODE= a chumadh agus IS_STACK_HOST=true ar an óstach cúltaca, mar sin ritheann na róil cúltaca gan cnuas-comhal cásanna speisialta."

msgid "The base URL to translate against."
