# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The compose step runs `compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<app> full_cycle=true variant=0`; the swarm step runs `swarm-zombie app=<app>`, pinned to `variant:0` so a multi-variant app validates one cluster (parity with the compose step, not the full per-variant CI matrix that runs one isolated runner per variant). The cluster is named `<app>-swarm-mgr-01` etc. via the mandatory `SWARM_NAME` (the app id is the default cluster id). Each validated swarm cluster is released afterwards unless you pass `keep=true`."
msgstr "Ritheann an chéim chumadh `compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<app> full_cycle=true variant=0`; Ritheann an chéim swarm `swarm-zombie app=<app>`, pinned go `variant:0` mar sin bailíonn app il-athrú braisle amháin (parity leis an chéim chumadh, ní an maitrís CI iomlán in aghaidh an-éagsúil a ritheann dara háit iargúlta amháin in aghaidh an athraithe). Tá an braisle ainmnithe `<app>-swarm-mgr-01` etc tríd an éigeantach `SWARM_NAME` (Is é an app id an braisle réamhshocraithe id). Tá gach braisle swarm bailíochtaithe scaoileadh ina dhiaidh sin mura pas tú `keep=true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The compound predicates are the documented call surface — call sites should prefer ``is_proxy_gated`` over manually combining ``enabled`` and ``flavor``. The ``oauth2_*`` fields are the documented way to read the gated upstream config; templates that previously spelled out ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` SHOULD use ``lookup('sso', app_id, 'oauth2_<sub>')`` instead so the Python-side helper and the Ansible-side lookup share one schema."
msgstr "Is iad na preideacáidí cumaisc an dromchla glao doiciméadaithe - ba chóir suímh glaonna fearr ``is_proxy_gated`` níos mó le chéile de láimh ``enabled`` agus ``flavor``. An ``oauth2_*`` Tá réimsí an mbealach doiciméadaithe a léamh ar an gated upstream config; teimpléid a litrithe roimhe seo amach ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` úsáid a bhaint as shampoo ``lookup('sso', app_id, 'oauth2_<sub>')`` ina ionad sin an cúntóir Python-taobh agus an Lookup Ansible-taobh roinnt scéimre amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The concurrency group stays the primary mechanism; it reaps within seconds of a run being created and needs no runner. `entry-cancel-superseded.yml` is the fallback for the case where it does not, and carries no group of its own, because the run holding a group cannot be the run that frees it."
msgstr "Fanann an grúpa concurrency an mheicníocht bunscoile; reaps sé laistigh de soicind de reáchtáil á chruthú agus ní gá aon dara háit. `entry-cancel-superseded.yml` Is é an fallback don chás nach ndéanann sé, agus nach ndéanann aon ghrúpa dá chuid féin, toisc nach féidir leis an reáchtáil grúpa a bheith ar an reáchtáil go FreeS sé."

