msgstr "An óstach sealaíochta cumraithe, an seoladh lúbadh, ailias an coimeádán le haghaidh a óstach, nó bainisteoir swarm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The constructor stage renders once through the [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) action and parks the result together with its cache key in the host fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (the action calls `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Every later worker inherits that fact at fork time; `get_merged_applications` serves it whenever the key still matches and renders only when it does not (a changed `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` or `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."
msgstr "Tugann an chéim tógálaí uair amháin tríd an [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) gníomh agus páirceanna an toradh mar aon lena eochair taisce sa bhfíric óstach `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (na glaonna gníomhaíochta `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Gach oibrí ina dhiaidh sin hoidhreacht go fíoras ag am forc; `get_merged_applications` feidhmíonn sé aon uair a oireann an eochair agus déanann ach amháin nuair nach bhfuil sé (a athrú `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` nó `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that `/metrics` is reachable at the documented path (where applicable). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer `up=1` verification live in `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only, parameterised over `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn ról an tomhaltóra ach amháin go `/metrics` is reachable ag an cosán doiciméadaithe (i gcás inarb infheidhme). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial, agus in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir `up=1` fíorú beo i `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` ach amháin, paraiméadaraithe thar `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that the matomo tracking snippet is in the HTML and that navigation generates the expected `/matomo.php` request (covered by `assertCspInjections` in the persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer tracker-site registration live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn ról an tomhaltóra ach go bhfuil an snippet rianú matomo sa HTML agus go ngineann nascleanúint na súil `/matomo.php` iarratas a dhéanamh (clúdaithe ag `assertCspInjections` i persona-helper). Matomo admin-rochtana, biber denial, agus in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir clárú rian-láithreán beo i `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` ach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role's spec does NOT exercise the dashboard tile. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile-reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and delegates the body to `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` from the sibling `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tile visibility, click → `#main iframe` embed, header \"Tab\" button → new browser tab). Consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any tile / iframe / tab assertions."
msgstr "Ní dhéanann an ról tomhaltóirí spec NACH a fheidhmiú ar an tíl Painéal na nIonstraimí. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` paraiméadar tástáil tíl-rochtana amháin in aghaidh an tomhaltóra thar `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` agus toscairí an comhlacht chun `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` ó na deartháireacha `dashboard-card-flow.js` Plandaí faoi dhíon (infheictheacht tíl, cliceáil → `#main iframe` leabú, header \"Tab\" cnaipe → cluaisín bhrabhsálaí nua). specs Tomhaltóirí NACH a shimpliú aon tíl / iframe / dearbhuithe cluaisín."

