# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The current `roles/web-app-matrix/` ships a self-contained compose stack with Synapse, Element, a handful of bridges and a ChatGPT bot. Adding a new bridge or service today means hand-rolling its compose service, env file, postgres seed, well-known entries and Playwright coverage inside this repo — the marginal cost per bridge is high, and the matrix-docker-ansible-deploy (MDAD) upstream community already maintains all of that under one umbrella role."
msgstr "An reatha `roles/web-app-matrix/` longa féin-atá chumadh Stack le Synapse, Element, dornán de droichid agus luibh ChatGPT. Ag cur droichead nó seirbhís nua ciallaíonn lá atá inniu ann lámh-rolladh a sheirbhís a chumadh, comhad env, síol postgres, iontrálacha maith ar a dtugtar agus clúdach Playwright taobh istigh den repo - tá an costas imeallach in aghaidh an droichid ard, agus an maitrís-déantóir-dífhostaithe-deploy (MDAD) Coinníonn pobal réamhtheachtach cheana féin go léir faoi scáthról amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The current statement that Flowise lacks an instance-level registry is incorrect for the pinned version and MUST be removed from requirement 025 and the role README. The deployment MUST use the authenticated `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` routes with a scoped API identity whose workspace permissions are limited to the required `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, and `tools:delete` operations."
msgstr "An ráiteas reatha go Flowise easpa clárlann leibhéal shampla mícheart don leagan pinned agus MUST a bhaint as riachtanas 025 agus an README ról. An MUST imscaradh a bhaint as an fíordheimhnithe `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` bealaí le raon feidhme API aitheantas a bhfuil ceadanna spáis oibre teoranta don riachtanas `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, agus `tools:delete` oibríochtaí."

