msgid "The effective budget for the actual workload is lower than the table suggests because the runner itself plus the nested `infinito` container (systemd, nested Docker, Ansible) reserve a non-trivial baseline. Plan for roughly **1–2 GB of overhead** before any role deploys a service."
msgstr "Tá an buiséad éifeachtach don ualach oibre iarbhír níos ísle ná mar a thugann an tábla le fios mar gheall ar an dara háit féin móide an neadaithe `infinito` coimeádán (córasach, neadaithe Docker, Ansible) cúlchiste bonnlíne neamh-trivial. Plean do garbh **1– – – –2 GB de lastuas** sula n-imíonn aon ról seirbhís."

