msgid "The entity-keyed purge primitive ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (driven by the app-keyed orchestrator ``apps.sh`` as a sibling of ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) invokes this module to remove the vhost files belonging to a given compose entity. The mapping entity -> apps -> domains is resolved via ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` plus ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` so the helper stays ansible-free and runnable inside the infinito container without a templar context."
msgstr "An t-eintiteas-eochairithe purge primitive ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (tiomáinte ag an orchestrator app-keyed ``apps.sh`` mar deartháireacha ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) agairt an modúl a bhaint as na comhaid vhost a bhaineann le heintiteas a chumadh ar leith. Tá an t-eintiteas mapála - lí apps - lí réimsí réitithe trí ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` móide móide ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / Baile ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` mar sin fanann an cúntóir saor in aisce agus runnable taobh istigh den choimeádán infinito gan comhthéacs templar."

