# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following roles have an upstream MCP path that this deployment cannot use. Each declares a `services.mcp` block carrying only `blocker`, `source_url` and `notes`, with `enabled` and `shared` false, so the role stays out of discovery while the audit still reports why it is not integrated:"
msgstr "Tá cosán MCP réamhtheachtach ag na róil seo a leanas nach féidir leis an imscaradh seo a úsáid. Gach Dearbhaíonn a `services.mcp` bloc iompar amháin `blocker`, `source_url` agus `notes`, le `enabled` agus `shared` bréagach, mar sin fanann an ról as fionnachtain agus tuairiscíonn an t-iniúchadh fós cén fáth nach bhfuil sé comhtháite:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The format is the docker-compose `.env`-subset: flat `KEY=value` lines, `#` for comments, optional surrounding double/single quotes for values that contain whitespace or special characters. Anything more exotic (nested mappings, multiline values, variable expansion) is rejected so drift between the file and its consumers stays loud."
msgstr "Is é an fhormáid an docker-chomhdhéanamh `.env`- subset: árasán `KEY=value` línte, `#` le haghaidh tuairimí, roghnach máguaird dúbailte / Sleachta aonair do luachanna go bhfuil spás bán nó carachtair speisialta. Rud ar bith níos coimhthíocha (mapaí neadaithe, luachanna illíne, leathnú athraitheach) diúltaíodh mar sin sruth idir an comhad agus a thomhaltóirí fanacht os ard."

