msgid "The generated `.env` is the single effective configuration source for all tooling. `make dotenv` composes it from `default.env`, the environment handlers, and finally your personal `custom.env`."
msgstr "An ghintear `.env` Is é an fhoinse chumraíocht éifeachtach amháin do gach tooling. `make dotenv` é a chumadh ó `default.env`, an láimhseálaithe comhshaoil, agus ar deireadh do phearsanta `custom.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generation layout belongs to baudolo, which writes it, so the file names and subdirectory below are read from the generation's own manifest rather than restated here. Restating them would let a rename on its side leave the globs matching nothing, which reads as \"this generation holds no databases\" rather than as a failure."
msgstr "Baineann an leagan amach glúin le baudolo, a scríobhann é, mar sin na hainmneacha comhaid agus subdirectory thíos a léamh ó léiriú an ghlúin féin seachas a bheith fágtha anseo. Bheadh restating iad a ligean athainmniú ar a taobh a fhágáil ar an globs meaitseáil rud ar bith, a léann mar \"Níl aon bhunachair shonraí ag an ghlúin seo\" seachas mar theip."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generator owns only the sections it can derive from metadata:"
msgstr "Is leis an gineadóir ach na hailt is féidir é a dhíorthú ó meiteashonraí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "An biber playwright cineálach agus riarthóir personas atá blocáilte via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` i `templates/playwright.env.j2` (riachtanais uisce: measartha 019 Riail na Rialacha 11 follasach rogha amach). Is Bluesky ar sóisialta-iarratas ar soghluaiste-aon SPA a suíonn a logout / rialú cuntas taobh thiar de roghchlár próifíl nach féidir leis an seiceáil auth-dromchla a bhaint amach. An bespoke \"OIDC: auth2-proxy + logáil isteach-bróicéir titim Bluesky seisiún isteach i bhfeidhm sóisialta Keycloak (leagan A+)\" tástáil agus a mhacasamhail LDAP-athrú i `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` a fhíorú cheana féin an dá personas fhíordheimhniú i gceart (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt i láthair tar éis an bróicéir handoff). Nuair a roghnóir cobhsaí don roghchlár próifíl sóisialta-iarratas tailte upstream, scaoil an rogha-outs agus lig an duine cúntóirí tiomáint an Painéal na nIonstraimí → app turas logout deireadh-le-deireadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this deployment is to provide a production-ready, scalable WordPress instance with multisite capabilities and enhanced performance. By automating the custom image build and configuration processes via Docker Compose and Ansible, it minimizes manual intervention, reduces errors, and allows you to concentrate on building great content."
msgstr "Is é an sprioc atá leis an imscaradh seo ná táirgeadh-réidh, inscálaithe a chur ar fáil WordPress mar shampla le cumais multisite agus feidhmíocht feabhsaithe. Trí uathoibriú an íomhá a thógáil agus próisis chumraíocht saincheaptha trí Docker Compose agus Ansible, laghdaíonn sé idirghabháil láimhe, laghdaíonn earráidí, agus is féidir leat díriú ar ábhar mór a thógáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to deliver a **hassle-free, production-ready reverse proxy** for self-hosted containers, suitable for homelabs and small-scale production workloads."
msgstr "Is é an sprioc an ról seo a sheachadadh **hassle-saor in aisce, táirgeadh-réidh seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais** do choimeádáin féin-óstáil, oiriúnach do saotharlanna baile agus ualaí oibre ar scála beag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure."
msgstr "Is é an sprioc an ról seo a chur ar fáil **foinse amháin na fírinne le haghaidh ainmniú** ar fud do bhonneagar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure.   It makes all applications feel like part of the same ecosystem, visually and functionally."
msgstr "Is é an sprioc an ról seo a chur ar fáil **foinse amháin na fírinne le haghaidh ainmniú** ar fud do bhonneagar. Déanann sé go mbraitheann gach iarratas mar chuid den éiceachóras céanna, amhairc agus feidhmiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The group stays primary. It reaps within seconds of a run being created and needs no runner, while the fallback first has to win a runner slot — from the very pool the superseded sweep is saturating, so it is slowest exactly when it is needed. Measured waits in this repository range from under a minute to about twenty. That is the cost of the fallback, and the reason it is a fallback rather than the mechanism."
msgstr "Fanann an grúpa bunscoile. Tá sé reaps laistigh de soicind de reáchtáil á chruthú agus ní gá aon dara háit, cé go bhfuil an t-aiseolas chéad a bhuachan sliotán rádala - as an linn snámha an-ionad Tá sweep sáithe, mar sin tá sé níos moille go díreach nuair a bhíonn sé ag teastáil. Waits Tomhas sa raon stór ó faoi nóiméad go dtí thart ar fiche. Is é sin costas an fallback, agus an chúis go bhfuil sé ina fallback seachas an mheicníocht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The hazard is ordering-dependent, not universal: it fires only when a consumer already holds an endpoint at the moment the provider first renders with the overlay. A provider that renders first migrates cleanly and never sees it, which is why some roles pass and others abort on the same change. Purging the provider's stack does not help, because the project label lives on the Docker network rather than in the compose directory. A fresh deployment is unaffected, so this never appears in CI."
msgstr "Tá an ghuaise ag ordú-spleách, ní uilíoch: tinte sé ach amháin nuair a bhíonn críochphointe ag tomhaltóir cheana féin i láthair na huaire déanann an soláthraí an forleagan ar dtús. Tá soláthraí a fhágann an chéad migrates cleanly agus ní fheiceann sé, agus sin an fáth pas roinnt róil agus daoine eile abort ar an athrú céanna. Ní Purging Stack an tsoláthraí cabhrú, toisc go bhfuil cónaí ar an lipéad tionscadail ar an líonra Docker seachas sa eolaire chumadh. Tá imscaradh úr unaffected, mar sin tá sé seo riamh le feiceáil i CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper hard-fails on unknown service names. Adding a new gate requires both the env-template flag and at least one `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')` call in the spec; the parity guards [test_env_services_match.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_env_services_match.py) and [test_spec_env_gates.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_spec_env_gates.py) enforce that contract."
msgstr "An cúntóir crua-fails ar ainmneacha seirbhíse anaithnid. Ag cur geata nua éilíonn an dá an bhratach env-template agus ar a laghad ceann `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')` glaoch ar an spec; na gardaí parity [test_env_services_match.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_env_services_match.py) agus [test_spec_env_gates.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_spec_env_gates.py) an conradh sin a fhorfheidhmiú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper may print:"
msgstr "Féadfaidh an cúntóir a phriontáil:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper module `utils/roles/meta_lookup.py` exposes `get_role_run_after(role) -> list[str]` and `get_role_lifecycle(role) -> str | None`. All consumers of these fields use the helper instead of hand-rolled derivations. The helper returns `[]` / `None` gracefully when `meta/services.yml` is absent or when the field is not set."
msgstr "An modúl cúntóir `utils/roles/meta_lookup.py` a nochtadh `get_role_run_after(role) -> list[str]` agus `get_role_lifecycle(role) -> str | None`. Úsáideann gach tomhaltóir de na réimsí seo an cúntóir in ionad díorthuithe láimhe. Tuairisceáin cúntóir `[]` / Baile `None` gracefully nuair `meta/services.yml` Tá sé as láthair nó nuair nach bhfuil an réimse leagtha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper script `BIN_RESOLVE_CONTAINER_ID` is deployed by sys-svc-compose during the constructor stage. It refuses to run on non-manager nodes (exit 64) and reports clear errors when the service has no running task (exit 65) or the task is not yet bound to a container (exit 66)."
msgstr "An script cúntóir `BIN_RESOLVE_CONTAINER_ID` a imscaradh sys-svc-compose le linn na céime tógálaí. Diúltaíonn sé a reáchtáil ar nóid neamh-bainisteoir (scoir scoir 64) agus tuarascálacha earráidí soiléire nuair nach bhfuil aon tasc ag rith na seirbhíse (scoir scoir 65) nó nach bhfuil an tasc faoi cheangal go fóill le coimeádán (scoir scoir 66)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The high-level structure:"
msgstr "An struchtúr ardleibhéil:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The history with SAMPLE appended, truncated to the newest WINDOW entries."
msgstr "An stair le SAMPLE ceangailte, teasctha leis na hiontrálacha WINDOW is nuaí."

