# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The idea is to fit into existing environments instead of replacing everything at once."
msgstr "Is é an smaoineamh a d'oirfeadh i dtimpeallachtaí atá ann cheana in ionad gach rud ag an am céanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ideal outcome is boring reliability: contributors should be able to trust that a test run says something meaningful about the system, not just about the machine that happened to execute it. ✅"
msgstr "Is é an toradh idéalach iontaofacht leadránach: Ba chóir go mbeadh rannchuiditheoirí in ann muinín a deir reáchtáil tástála rud éigin brí mar gheall ar an gcóras, ní hamháin mar gheall ar an meaisín a tharla a fhorghníomhú. ✅"

# translated-by: libretranslate
