# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The in-play loader (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) uses each role's variant-free base config (the assembled `meta/<topic>.yml` payload) as the default and lets the inventory's `applications.<app>` overrides win via deep merge: the inventory itself is the source of truth for what variant a round runs against. Variant 0 enumerates every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` with `enabled: true, shared: true` so the \"all flags on\" baseline is explicit and deep-merge with a non-baseline override yields the expected variant-N shape (see [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) for the file-format rule and [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) for the lint guard)."
msgstr "An luchtaire in-imirt (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) Úsáideann gach ról ar mhalairt-saor in aisce bonn config (an chéile `meta/<topic>.yml` payload) mar an réamhshocraithe agus ligeann an fardal ar `applications.<app>` overrides bua trí chumasc domhain: Is é an fardal féin an fhoinse na fírinne le haghaidh cén leagan ritheann bhabhta i gcoinne. Amharc ar gach eolas 0 enumerates gach seirbhís dinimiciúil-eochair ó `meta/services.yml` le `enabled: true, shared: true` mar sin an \"gach bratach ar\" Tá bonnlíne follasach agus domhain-cumasc le toradh override neamh-bunlíne an cruth athraitheach-N súil (féach ar [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) don riail comhad-format agus [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) don garda lint)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The include set passed to stage 2 is built per round by the matrix planner: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) and [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) call `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` in [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), which resolves each round's include via `_resolve_round_include` in [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) using the [CombinedResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) with `follow_run_after=False`. The swarm test path computes its include separately via [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), reading the active variant map from `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Both expand the selection along two transitive paths:"
msgstr "I measc na sraithe a rith go céim 2 tógtha in aghaidh an bhabhta ag an pleanálaí maitrís: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) agus [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) glaoch ar `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` i [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), a réitíonn gach babhta san áireamh trí `_resolve_round_include` i [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) ag baint úsáide as an [Comhcheangail Réiteach](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) le `follow_run_after=False`. Tiomsaíonn an cosán tástála Swarm a chur san áireamh ar leithligh via [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), léamh an léarscáil athraitheach gníomhach ó `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. An dá leathnú ar an roghnú ar feadh dhá bealaí a leanas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The index is rebuilt on every run so it cannot drift from what is on disk: a manually deleted index gets restored, and a stale link to a removed archive gets dropped. The function stays byte-idempotent: when the resulting content matches what is already on disk, the file is not rewritten."
msgstr "Is é an t-innéacs atógáil ar gach reáchtáil ionas nach féidir é a sruth ó cad atá ar an diosca: Faigheann innéacs a scriosadh de láimh ais, agus faigheann nasc stale chuig cartlann a bhaint thit. Fanann an fheidhm byte-idempotent: nuair a oireann an t-ábhar mar thoradh ar cad atá cheana féin ar diosca, nach bhfuil an comhad a athscríobh."

