msgid "The instructions test used to be a job of its own that picked one random role per run. Riding along on a deploy row instead costs no extra runner and covers every role the sweep touches. The row it rides on is the role's smallest variant -- the one enabling the fewest services -- because that is the shape the README's Production block describes: the bare role, with the optional providers switched off."
msgstr "An tástáil treoracha a úsáidtear chun bheith ina phost ar a chuid féin a roghnaíodh ról randamach amháin in aghaidh an rith. Marcaíocht chomh maith ar a chéile imscaradh costais ina ionad sin aon dara háit breise agus clúdaíonn gach ról na baint sweep. Is é an tsraith rides sé ar an ról ar leagan is lú - an ceann ar chumas na seirbhísí is lú -- toisc go bhfuil an cruth an bloc Táirgeadh README ar cur síos: an ról lom, leis na soláthraithe roghnacha aistrigh amach."

