#, python-brace-format
msgid "The override path is host-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. The inventory mirror step (see [mirror.md](mirror.md)) writes there automatically; manual overrides go to the same key."
msgstr "Is é an cosán override óstach-vars `applications.<role>.services.<service>.{image,version}`. An chéim scáthán fardal (féach ar [mirror.md](mirror.md)) scríobhann ann go huathoibríoch; overrides láimhe dul go dtí an eochair céanna."

