msgstr "Athraíonn an pacáiste an tiomanta [default.env](../../default.env) móide comhthéacs runtime beag isteach sa gitignored `.env` ag an fhréamh repo. Baineann gach modúl anseo le ceann de cheithre ról: parse, réiteach, orchestrate, scríobh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package installs the lint toolchain (actionlint, shfmt, ruff, ansible-lint, mbake, markdownlint-cli2, eslint, shellcheck, ansible-playbook, ansible-galaxy) using the right channel per tool (system package manager, pip, npm, or GitHub release). Modules at this level are channel-agnostic primitives; per-tool policy lives one level down in [lint/](lint/)."
msgstr "Cuireann an pacáiste an uirlis slabhra lint (actionlint, shfmt, ruff, ansible-lint, mbake, markdownlint-cli2, eslint, seileata, leabhar ansible-play, ansible-galaxy) ag baint úsáide as an cainéal ceart in aghaidh an uirlis (córas bainisteoir pacáiste, pip, npm, nó GitHub scaoileadh). Tá modúil ag an leibhéal seo primitives cainéal-agnostic; Tá beartas per-tool saol leibhéal amháin síos i [lint /](lint/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The package is split by concern: - ``vault``: vault block construction + detection - ``overrides``: ``--set`` parsing + per-key resolution - ``emit``: recursive credentials emission into ruamel CommentedMaps - ``prompts``: interactive operator prompts - ``__main__``: argparse + orchestration"
msgstr "Tá an pacáiste roinnte ag imní: - ``vault``: tógáil bloc boghadh + brath - ``overrides``: ``--set`` parsáil + réiteach in aghaidh an-eochair - ``emit``: dintiúir athchúrsach astaíochta i ruamel CommentMaps - ``prompts``: leideanna oibreoir idirghníomhach - ``__main__``: Argparse + orchestration"

# translated-by: libretranslate
