# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants: as described above, Postmarks' sole native credential is the single shared `ADMIN_KEY` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. `biber` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application's administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, so `biber` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Fógraítear na bratacha persona i [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` Tá bac ach amháin sa `sso: false` leaganacha: mar a thuairiscítear thuas, Postmarks'Is é an t-aon dintiúir dúchais amháin roinnte `ADMIN_KEY` foirm phasfhocal, nach bhfuil an Keycloak riarthóir rúnda na cineálacha persona, mar sin gan an muinín-ceann droichead níl aon logáil admin a thiomáint. `biber` blocáilte i ngach leagan - an oauth2-Ní cheadaítear ach grúpa RBAC riarthóir an iarratais agus athsheiceálacha an droichid `X-Forwarded-Groups`, mar sin `biber` Tá sé dhiúltú roimh Postmarks Tá sé bainte amach, agus le SSO as an t-aon credential chlé mbaineann le haon chuntas úsáideora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants: as described above, Postmarks’ sole native credential is the single shared ``ADMIN_KEY`` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. ``biber`` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application’s administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, so ``biber`` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Fógraítear na bratacha persona i `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` Tá bac ach amháin sa ``sso: false`` leaganacha: mar a thuairiscítear thuas, Postmarks'Is é an t-aon dintiúir dúchais an singil roinnte ``ADMIN_KEY`` foirm phasfhocal, nach bhfuil an Keycloak riarthóir rúnda na cineálacha persona, mar sin gan an muinín-ceann droichead níl aon logáil admin a thiomáint. ``biber`` blocáilte i ngach leagan - an oauth2-Ní cheadaítear ach grúpa RBAC riarthóir an iarratais agus athsheiceálacha an droichid ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, mar sin ``biber`` Tá sé dhiúltú roimh Postmarks Tá sé bainte amach, agus le SSO as an t-aon credential chlé mbaineann le haon chuntas úsáideora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The persona scenarios MUST drive the journey from [Three personas, fixed flow](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) end to end. Per-service contract tests MUST exercise the [per-service assertion catalogue](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) entry that matches their gated service. The [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint hard-fails the build when a stub is detected, so the rule is enforced automatically."
msgstr "Na cásanna persona MUST tiomáint an turas ó [Trí personas, sreabhadh seasta](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) deireadh a chur leis. tástálacha conartha Per-seirbhíse MUST a fheidhmiú [catalóg dearbhaithe in aghaidh na seirbhíse](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) iontráil a oireann a seirbhís gated. An bhfuil [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint crua-fails an tógáil nuair a bhíonn stub bhrath, mar sin tá an riail i bhfeidhm go huathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pin lives in ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (one SPOT, Dependabot keeps it current). Host venvs, the lint container and CI all read that same pin, so a rule that is preview-gated in one release and stable in the next (e.g. ISC004, or S310 firing on ``urllib.request.Request``) cannot disagree across environments."
msgstr "Tá cónaí ar an bioráin i ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (amháin, Coinníonn Spleáchas é faoi láthair). venvs óstáil, an coimeádán lint agus CI léamh go léir go bioráin céanna, mar sin riail go bhfuil réamhamharc-gated i scaoileadh amháin agus cobhsaí sa chéad cheann eile (e.g. ISC004, nó S310 lámhaigh ar ``urllib.request.Request``) Ní féidir easaontas thar timpeallachtaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The pinned 6.7.8.2 predates the experimental native `/api/_mcp` server."
msgstr "An pinned 6.7.8.2 predates an dúchais turgnamhach `/api/_mcp` freastalaí."

