msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role attaches to the shared overlay declared in ``meta/networks.yml`` so client containers can reach the endpoint container-to-container; the overlay alias resolves to workhorse."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról leis an ró-leagan roinnte a dhearbhaítear in ``meta/networks.yml`` mar sin is féidir le coimeádáin cliant teacht ar an gcoimeádán-go-tainer endpoint; réitíonn an forleagan ailias chun workhorse."

