# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot's containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) and is modeled on [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) and [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."
msgstr "Tugann an ról suas Penpot's cruach coimeádán taobh thiar den chaighdeán Infinito.Nexus seachfhreastalaí agus sreanga a athrú i féiniúlacht lárnach, cúltaca, agus bonneagar Painéal na nIonstraimí. Leanann sé an leagan amach meta per-role ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) agus tá sé múnlaithe ar [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) agus [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot’s containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) and is modeled on ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`__."
msgstr "Tugann an ról suas PenpotStack coimeádán taobh thiar den chaighdeán Infinito.Nexus seachfhreastalaí agus sreanga a athrú i féiniúlacht lárnach, cúltaca, agus bonneagar Painéal na nIonstraimí. Leanann sé an leagan amach meta per-role (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) agus tá sé múnlaithe ar ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Tógann an ról íomhá saincheaptha lean ar bharr an oifigigh Jira íomhá bogearraí, forálacha toirt leanúnach, agus nochtann an app taobh thiar do seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Rialú éagsúil image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. Tá JVM carn sizing uathoibríoch-díortha ó RAM óstach le caipíní sábháilte a chosc `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Tógann an ról íomhá saincheaptha lean ar bharr an oifigigh Jira íomhá bogearraí, forálacha toirt leanúnach, agus nochtann an app taobh thiar do seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Rialú éagsúil image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. Tá JVM carn sizing uathoibríoch-díortha ó RAM óstach le caipíní sábháilte a chosc ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Tógann an ról íomhá saincheaptha íosta ar bharr an oifigigh Confluence íomhá, ullmhaíonn toirt leanúnach, agus nochtann an app taobh thiar de do seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Tá Cumraíocht thiomáint ag athróg (íomhá, leagan, méideanna, fearainn, OIDC). Tá JVM carn sizing uathoibríoch-díorthaithe ó RAM óstach le caipíní sábháilte a sheachaint `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Tógann an ról íomhá saincheaptha íosta ar bharr an oifigigh Confluence íomhá, ullmhaíonn toirt leanúnach, agus nochtann an app taobh thiar de do seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Tá Cumraíocht thiomáint ag athróg (íomhá, leagan, méideanna, fearainn, OIDC). Tá JVM carn sizing uathoibríoch-díorthaithe ó RAM óstach le caipíní sábháilte a sheachaint ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether ``pip`` from ``ansible_python_interpreter`` supports ``--break-system-packages`` and only uses it (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older ``pip`` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Seiceálacha ról an bhfuil ``pip`` ó ``ansible_python_interpreter`` tacú le tacaíocht ``--break-system-packages`` agus é a úsáid ach amháin (móide móide ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) nuair atá siad ar fáil. Coinníonn sé seo an ról ag luí le níos sine ``pip`` leaganacha (e.g., roinnt córais CentOS / RHEL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether `pip` from `ansible_python_interpreter` supports `--break-system-packages` and only uses it (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older `pip` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Seiceálacha ról an bhfuil `pip` ó `ansible_python_interpreter` tacú le tacaíocht `--break-system-packages` agus é a úsáid ach amháin (móide móide `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) nuair atá siad ar fáil. Coinníonn sé seo an ról ag luí le níos sine `pip` leaganacha (e.g., roinnt córais CentOS / RHEL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures a systemd service and timer which executes the CSP crawler periodically against all NGINX domains."
msgstr "Cumhdaíonn an ról seirbhís córasach agus lasc ama a fhorghníomhú an crawler CSP go tréimhsiúil i gcoinne gach bhfearann NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Déanann an ról a chumrú agus a imscaradh coimeádán PhpMyAdmin shampla ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Comhtháthaíonn sé go roghnach le bunachar sonraí lárnach agus úsáideann athróga dochreidte dinimiciúil chun tacú le himscaradh solúbtha i dtimpeallachtaí táirgthe agus saotharlainne araon."

msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as ``http://jupyter:8888`` once it declares ``jupyter`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` with it."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as `http://jupyter:8888` once it declares `jupyter` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` with it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "An ról imscaradh amháin ``registry:2`` mar shampla i mód seachfhreastalaí tarraingt-trí ar óstach a ghrúpa fardal ar. Toisc go bhfuil an grúpa de ghnáth óstach amháin (an bainisteoir Swarm), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` réiteach ar ``compose`` don ról; il-óstach lucht leanúna-amach don taisce féin as raon feidhme le haghaidh v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "An ról imscaradh amháin `registry:2` mar shampla i mód seachfhreastalaí tarraingt-trí ar óstach a ghrúpa fardal ar. Toisc go bhfuil an grúpa de ghnáth óstach amháin (an bainisteoir Swarm), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` réiteach ar `compose` don ról; il-óstach lucht leanúna-amach don taisce féin as raon feidhme le haghaidh v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys end-to-end on the project's reference distribution and is covered by **at least** a smoke-level Playwright spec, but neither the deploy nor the spec depth is considered production-grade."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról deireadh le deireadh a chur le dáileadh tagartha an tionscadail agus tá sé clúdaithe ag **ar a laghad** spec Playwright leibhéal deataigh, ach nach bhfuil an imscaradh ná an doimhneacht spec a mheastar a tháirgeadh-grád."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via `SEMAPHORE_*` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak `administrator` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "An ról imscaradh an coimeádán Semaphore amháin (lena rádala tasc leabaithe) agus sreanga sé isteach san ardán trí `SEMAPHORE_*` athróg timpeallacht. Is é an draoi thus sheachbhóthar ag síolú an admin tosaigh ó rúin a rinneadh, mar sin tailte úr imscaradh go díreach ar an leathanach logála Semaphore. Nuair a bhíonn SSO ar chumas, an Keycloak `administrator` a cruthaíodh ag am imscaradh mar Semaphore seachtrach admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; an OIDC callback oireann sé trí ríomhphost agus síníonn an t-oibreoir i mar admin Semaphore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via ``SEMAPHORE_*`` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak ``administrator`` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "An ról imscaradh an coimeádán Semaphore amháin (lena rádala tasc leabaithe) agus sreanga sé isteach san ardán trí ``SEMAPHORE_*`` athróg timpeallacht. Is é an draoi thus sheachbhóthar ag síolú an admin tosaigh ó rúin a rinneadh, mar sin tailte úr imscaradh go díreach ar an leathanach logála Semaphore. Nuair a bhíonn SSO ar chumas, an Keycloak ``administrator`` a cruthaíodh ag am imscaradh mar Semaphore seachtrach admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; an OIDC callback oireann sé trí ríomhphost agus síníonn an t-oibreoir i mar admin Semaphore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Is é an ról eolaire ainm `application_id`. Mar shampla `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` Tá sé nochta mar `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` mar atá `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, agus mar sin de."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does NOT carry \"known broken\" warnings in its `README.md`."
msgstr "Níl an ról NACH iompar \"ar fáil\" rabhaidh ina `README.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does not exist on disk yet (or only as a placeholder `meta/services.yml`). It is listed in this state so that contributors can discover what the project intends to ship next."
msgstr "Níl an ról ann ar an diosca go fóill (nó mar shealbhóir áite amháin `meta/services.yml`). Tá sé liostaithe sa stát seo ionas gur féidir le rannchuiditheoirí a fháil amach cad atá beartaithe ag an tionscadal a long chugainn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role enables a ready-to-use Arduino development setup by installing necessary tools and configuring user permissions for serial access."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról ar chumas sraith forbartha réidh le húsáid Arduino trí uirlisí riachtanacha a shuiteáil agus ceadanna úsáideoirí a chumrú le haghaidh rochtain sraitheach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról go Docker agus Docker Compose i láthair, chomhtháthaíonn cúltaca riachtanach, deisiú, agus rólanna seiceáil sláinte, agus tacaíonn sé le modhanna glantacháin nó athshocrú iomlán do thimpeallacht úr Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment.   When enabled via `MODE_CLEANUP` or `MODE_RESET`, it will automatically prune unused Docker resources.   `MODE_RESET` additionally restarts the Docker service after cleanup."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról go Docker agus Docker Compose i láthair, chomhtháthaíonn cúltaca riachtanach, deisiú, agus rólanna seiceáil sláinte, agus tacaíonn sé le modhanna glantacháin nó athshocrú iomlán do thimpeallacht úr Docker. Nuair a chumasú trí `MODE_CLEANUP` nó `MODE_RESET`, beidh sé prune go huathoibríoch acmhainní Docker neamhúsáidte. `MODE_RESET` atosú chomh maith leis an tseirbhís Docker tar éis cleanup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the [MCP Server plugin](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), baked into the image alongside the other plugins in `files/plugins.txt`. The surface is declared as the `mcp` service in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "An ról a nochtadh Jenkins mar fhreastalaí MCP tríd an [MLA freastalaí breiseán](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), bácáilte isteach san íomhá taobh leis na plugins eile i `files/plugins.txt`. Fógraítear an dromchla mar `mcp` service india `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, baked into the image alongside the other plugins in ``files/plugins.txt``. The surface is declared as the ``mcp`` service in ``meta/services.yml``."
msgstr "An ról a nochtadh Jenkins mar fhreastalaí MCP tríd an `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, bácáilte isteach san íomhá taobh leis na plugins eile i ``files/plugins.txt``. Fógraítear an dromchla mar ``mcp`` service india ``meta/services.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the ``webservice_mcp`` protocol plugin, baked into the image at ``webservice/mcp`` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
msgstr "Léiríonn an ról dromchla Prótacal Múnla comhthéacs tríd an ``webservice_mcp`` breiseán prótacal, bácáilte isteach san íomhá ag ``webservice/mcp`` agus a sheirbheáil ag an sidecar NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the `webservice_mcp` protocol plugin, baked into the image at `webservice/mcp` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
msgstr "Léiríonn an ról dromchla Prótacal Múnla comhthéacs tríd an `webservice_mcp` breiseán prótacal, bácáilte isteach san íomhá ag `webservice/mcp` agus a sheirbheáil ag an sidecar NGINX."

