# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom ``auth_oauth_https`` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard ``auth_oauth`` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the ``web.base.url`` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Áirítear leis an ról saincheaptha ``auth_oauth_https`` addon a shocraíonn OAuth atreorú URIs nuair a reáchtáil taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais le foirceannadh TLS. An caighdeán ``auth_oauth`` D'fhéadfadh modúl a ghiniúint go mícheart URIs atreorú HTTP. Maireann an addon an t-iompar a úsáid ``web.base.url`` paraiméadar córais, ag cinntiú go n-úsáidtear HTTPS i gcónaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom `auth_oauth_https` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard `auth_oauth` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the `web.base.url` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Áirítear leis an ról saincheaptha `auth_oauth_https` addon a shocraíonn OAuth atreorú URIs nuair a reáchtáil taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais le foirceannadh TLS. An caighdeán `auth_oauth` D'fhéadfadh modúl a ghiniúint go mícheart URIs atreorú HTTP. Maireann an addon an t-iompar a úsáid `web.base.url` paraiméadar córais, ag cinntiú go n-úsáidtear HTTPS i gcónaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
