# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **Nix** using either the native package manager (where supported and reliable) or the **official installer** with **SHA256 verification**."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil **riachtanais uisce: measartha** ag baint úsáide as ceachtar an bainisteoir pacáiste dúchais (áit tacaíocht agus iontaofa) nó an **tráthchuid oifigiúil** le **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí256 fíorú**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured ``msmtprc`` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated ``msmtp-mta`` package, it configures a direct ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` compatibility symlink to ``msmtp``."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí**, Láimhseálann difríochtaí pacáiste distro-shonrach (lena n-áirítear EPEL buataisítrap ar hóstach teaghlaigh EL- nuair is gá), agus imscaradh réamh-chumraithe ``msmtprc`` comhad via Jinja2. Do distros gan tiomanta ``msmtp-mta`` pacáiste, cumraíonn sé díreach ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` comhoiriúnacht symlink le ``msmtp``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured `msmtprc` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated `msmtp-mta` package, it configures a direct `/usr/bin/sendmail` compatibility symlink to `msmtp`."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí**, Láimhseálann difríochtaí pacáiste distro-shonrach (lena n-áirítear EPEL buataisítrap ar hóstach teaghlaigh EL- nuair is gá), agus imscaradh réamh-chumraithe `msmtprc` comhad via Jinja2. Do distros gan tiomanta `msmtp-mta` pacáiste, cumraíonn sé díreach `/usr/bin/sendmail` comhoiriúnacht symlink le `msmtp`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs ``dockreap`` using Python tooling and runs it with the ``--no-confirmation`` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil ``dockreap`` ag baint úsáide as uirlis Python agus ritheann sé leis an ``--no-confirmation`` bratach chun glanadh uathoibríoch, neamh-idirghníomhach a chinntiú."

