# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a ``systemd`` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil ar script agus a ``systemd`` seirbhís le lasc ama a scanadh go tréimhsiúil le haghaidh méideanna gan ainm leftover."

