msgid "The role installs a script and a `systemd` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes.   This helps prevent wasted disk space and leftover resources from old deployments."
msgstr "An ról a shuiteáil ar script agus a `systemd` seirbhís le lasc ama a scanadh go tréimhsiúil le haghaidh méideanna gan ainm leftover. Cuidíonn sé seo le spás diosca dramhaíola agus acmhainní leftover ó imscaradh d'aois a chosc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "An ról installs aonad córasach a snapshots gach eolaire foinse cumraithe isteach `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, crua-nasctha i gcoinne an ghlúin roimhe sin. Foinsí Roghnaithe a skipped nuair as láthair (an CA i modh Criptithe Lig, ACME / certbot i mód féin-sínithe). Glacann an ghlúin an crann cúltaca céanna na róil tarraingthe agus gléas a ithe, mar sin sreabhann sé chuig an óstach cúltaca agus an gléas criptithe go huathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let’s Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
