# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
