# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The safety of this design comes entirely from **confinement of the device**, not from confinement of the agent: the machine is dedicated to Hermes, single-tenant, network-segmented, and physically separate from shared infrastructure. `svc-ai-robot` is the role that provisions that device and deploys Hermes on it in privileged mode. It builds on the [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) role rather than reimplementing the agent."
msgstr "Tagann sábháilteacht an dearadh seo go hiomlán ó **gaibhniú na feiste**, ní ó ghaibhniú an ghníomhaire: tá an meaisín tiomanta do Hermes, aon-tionónta, líonra-segmented, agus go fisiciúil ar leithligh ó bhonneagar roinnte. `svc-ai-robot` Is é an ról go forálacha a gléas agus imscaradh Hermes ar sé i mód phribhléid. Tógann sé ar an [`web-app-hermes`](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) ról seachas an gníomhaire a chur chun feidhme."

