msgstr "An mapáil chéanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same reachability problem exists without Tor wherever the host resolves through a listener of its own on loopback, which is how the simulated cluster nodes are wired. Handing containers the declared clearnet address there was what a literal bridge address in the inventory used to paper over, and that literal went stale the moment the daemon's address pool moved the bridge off Docker's default."
msgstr "Tá an fhadhb sroichte céanna gan Tor cibé áit réitíonn an óstach trí éisteoir a chuid féin ar ais lúb, a bhfuil conas a bhfuil na nóid braisle insamhailte sreang. Coimeádáin a láimhseáil an seoladh soiléir dearbhaithe go raibh cad a seoladh droichead litriúil san fhardal a úsáidtear chun páipéar os a chionn, agus chuaigh litriúil stale an nóiméad ar athraíodh a ionad an linn seoladh daemon ar an droichead amach réamhshocraithe Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same selections with every axis dropped, one entry per role."
msgstr "Na roghanna céanna le gach ais thit, iontráil amháin in aghaidh an ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The same shape serves the repository-root file, which holds the shared collection any role and any inventory bundle may install from, and a role's own file, which holds what only that role installs."
msgstr "Feidhmíonn an cruth céanna an comhad stór-fréamh, a bhfuil an bailiúchán roinnte aon ról agus d'fhéadfadh aon bundle fardal a shuiteáil ó, agus ról comhad féin, a bhfuil an méid amháin go installs ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`, see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) bounds every write, every read, and every outbound connection. `deny` rules block destructive patterns unconditionally; `ask` rules force operator review on every mutating `gh`/`docker`/`git commit`/`Skill(update-config*)` invocation. The wildcard does **not** loosen any existing guardrail; it only drops the per-shape workarounds."
msgstr "An bosca gainimh (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`, féach [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) bounds gach scríobh, gach léamh, agus gach nasc outbound. `deny` rialacha bloc patrúin millteach gan choinníoll; `ask` rialacha athbhreithniú oibreoir fórsa ar gach mutating `gh`/ Baile`docker`/ Baile`git commit`/ Baile`Skill(update-config*)` sonrascadh. Déanann an cárta fiáin **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** scaoileadh aon iarnród garda atá ann cheana féin; titeann sé ach na babhtaí oibre in aghaidh an-cruth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` rule blocks GPG access by design; agent commands must never touch private key material. This env override removes the resulting signing failure without weakening the credential-path protection. Agent-authored commits land unsigned; the `Co-Authored-By` trailer documents authorship."
msgstr "An bosca gainimh `denyRead: ~/.gnupg` bloic riail rochtain GPG de réir dearadh; Ní mór orduithe gníomhaire dteagmháil ábhar eochair príobháideach. Cuireann an override env seo an teip sínithe mar thoradh air gan lagú ar an gcosaint chos dintiúir. Gníomhaire-údar tiomantas talamh gan síniú; an `Co-Authored-By` doiciméid leantóra authorship."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox can connect to any Unix-domain socket on the host. Required so commands like `docker`, `systemctl`, and language servers continue to work; these all communicate over Unix sockets (e.g. `/var/run/docker.sock`)."
msgstr "Is féidir leis an bosca gainimh ceangal le haon soicéad Unix-domain ar an óstach. Riachtanach orduithe mar sin cosúil `docker`, `systemctl`, agus freastalaithe teanga ar aghaidh ag obair; na cumarsáid ar fad thar soicéid Unix (e.g. `/var/run/docker.sock`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox cannot be escaped through the host daemon"
msgstr "Ní féidir an bosca gainimh a éalú tríd an daemon óstach"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox has `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` so that normal workflow tools (`docker`, `systemctl`, language servers) continue to work. Any command that reaches `/var/run/docker.sock` can request a container with `-v /:/host --privileged`, which the Docker daemon executes as root and mounts the host filesystem. The sandbox's `allowWrite` does NOT protect against this path because Docker is a trusted service on the other end of the socket."
msgstr "Tá bosca gainimh `sandbox.network.allowAllUnixSockets: true` ionas go mbeidh uirlisí sreabhadh oibre gnáth (`docker`, `systemctl`, freastalaithe teanga) leanúint ar aghaidh ag obair. Aon ordú a shroicheann `/var/run/docker.sock` is féidir a iarraidh coimeádán le `-v /:/host --privileged`, a fhorghníomhú an daemon Docker mar fhréamh agus mounts an córas comhad óstach. An bosca gainimh ar `allowWrite` NACH chosaint i gcoinne an cosán toisc go bhfuil Docker seirbhís iontaofa ar an taobh eile den soicéad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The sandbox is activated unconditionally via `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. This means filesystem and network restrictions below are enforced **at every session**, not only when the operator manually switches into sandbox permission mode. The OS-level sandbox is the source of truth for what commands may read, write, and reach over the network; the `allow`/`ask`/`deny` permission lists remain in force as a second line of defence for policy concerns the OS cannot express (e.g. requiring confirmation before publishing a commit)."
msgstr "Tá an bosca gainimh i ngníomh gan choinníoll trí `\"sandbox\": { \"enabled\": true }`. Ciallaíonn sé seo córas comhaid agus srianta líonra thíos i bhfeidhm **ag gach seisiún**, ní hamháin nuair a athraíonn an t-oibreoir de láimh i mód cead bosca gainimh. Is é an bosca gainimh OS-leibhéal foinse na fírinne do cad is féidir orduithe a léamh, scríobh, agus a bhaint amach thar an líonra; an `allow`/ Baile`ask`/ Baile`deny` fanfaidh liostaí ceada i bhfeidhm mar an dara líne cosanta i gcás ábhar imní beartais, ní féidir leis an OS a chur in iúl (e.g. deimhniú a éileamh sula bhfoilsítear gealltanas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The sandbox's `denyRead` list (`~/.gnupg`, `~/.kube`, `~/.aws`, `~/.config/gcloud`) is the primary mechanism that prevents the agent from reading host credentials. Every credential store an operator uses on the host is assumed to be covered, **with the documented exception of `~/.ssh`** (see Assumption 10)."
msgstr "An bosca gainimh ar `denyRead` liosta de na liosta (`~/.gnupg`, `~/.kube`, `~/.aws`, `~/.config/gcloud`) Is é an mheicníocht phríomha a chuireann cosc ar an ngníomhaire ó dintiúirí óstacha a léamh. Glactar le gach siopa dintiúir a úsáideann oibreoir ar an óstach a bheith clúdaithe, **leis an eisceacht doiciméadaithe `~/.ssh`** (féach Tomhaltas 10)."

msgid "The scan is cached behind a fresh list, because one source message is scanned once per target language and callers may sort or trim the result."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scheduled `🔄 Update versions` pipeline (version bumps and PR open/refresh)."
msgstr "An sceidealta `🔄 Update versions` píblíne píblíne (leagan bumps agus PR oscailte / refresh)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scheduled update workflow MUST be able to reuse the same discovery logic in update mode. Version bumps MAY update `version`; new addon entries MAY be added with `enabled: false`, `required: false`, and complete `update` metadata."
msgstr "MUST an sreabhadh oibre nuashonraithe sceidealta in ann an loighic fionnachtana céanna a athúsáid i mód nuashonraithe. Leagan bumps MAY cothrom le dáta `version`; iontrálacha nua addon MAY a chur leis le `enabled: false`, `required: false`, agus iomlán `update` meiteashonraí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The schema MUST reject a generic URL, runtime OpenAPI document, free-form GraphQL query, raw SQL tool, unrestricted bucket, arbitrary filesystem root, shell command, Docker socket, or implicit exposure of every operation added by an upstream upgrade."
msgstr "Diúltóidh an MUST scéimre URL cineálach, doiciméad OpenAPI runtime, ceist GraphQL saor in aisce, uirlis SQL amh, buicéad neamhshrianta, fréamh córas comhaid treallach, ordú bhlaosc, soicéad Docker, nó nochtadh intuigthe de gach oibríocht a chuirtear le uasghrádú sruth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The schema lives at ``meta/networks.yml.overlay`` per provider role, discovered into the service_registry by ``discover_role_services``. Keys:"
msgstr "Tá cónaí ar an scéimre ag ``meta/networks.yml.overlay`` in aghaidh an ról soláthraí, fuair sé amach isteach sa service_registry ag an ``discover_role_services``. Eochracha:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope MUST be a **default** client scope on every OIDC client that needs group-based RBAC. Making it optional reintroduces a userinfo regression: when optional with `include.in.token.scope=false`, Keycloak drops the group-membership mapper from userinfo even when the scope is explicitly requested, so consumers receive no groups and fall back to `subscriber`."
msgstr "An MUST raon feidhme a bheith ina **cineál gas: in airde** raon feidhme cliaint ar gach cliant OIDC a riachtanais RBAC bunaithe ar ghrúpa. Déanann sé athbhunaíonn roghnach athchéimniú úsáideora: nuair atá sé roghnach le `include.in.token.scope=false`, Keycloak titeann an léarscáileoir grúpa ó userinfo fiú nuair a iarrtar an raon feidhme go sainráite, mar sin ní fhaigheann tomhaltóirí aon ghrúpaí agus titim ar ais go dtí `subscriber`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is image handling. Workflow orchestration, metadata resolution, and generic waiting logic should live in other script directories."
msgstr "Is é an raon feidhme an fillteán láimhseáil íomhá. Ba chóir go mbeadh ceolfhoireann sreabhadh oibre, réiteach meiteashonraí, agus loighic feithimh cineálach i eolairí scripte eile."

