msgid "Then trigger:"
msgstr "Ansin truicir:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "There are known security concerns with Fetchmail as stated in the [German Wikipedia](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fetchmail). If you require Fetchmail functions in the future, consider creating a Docker container for [Getmail](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Getmail) as it is considered more secure."
msgstr "Tá imní slándála ar eolas le Fetchmail mar atá luaite sa [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fetchmail). Má éilíonn tú feidhmeanna Fetchmail sa todhchaí, mheas a chruthú coimeádán Docker do [Faigh amach níos mó](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Getmail) mar a mheastar é a bheith níos sábháilte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "There is consequently no auth chain for the persona helpers to drive and no admin surface to assert against. The opt-out is permanent, not a rollout gap."
msgstr "Tá dá bhrí sin aon slabhra auth do na Cúntóirí persona a thiomáint agus aon dromchla admin a dhearbhú i gcoinne. Is é an rogha buan, ní bearna rolladh amach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "There is no standalone `make` target for Playwright. Tests run as part of local deploy flows (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec-only iteration after the first successful deploy, see [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Níl aon standalone `make` sprioc do Playwright. Tástálacha reáchtáil mar chuid de shreabhadh imscaradh áitiúil (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). Le haghaidh atriall spec-amháin tar éis an chéad imscaradh rathúil, féach [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are NOT valid exceptions and MUST NOT be invoked:"
msgstr "Tá na NACH eisceachtaí bailí agus NACH MÓR agairt:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are deployment-orchestration failures, not playwright-parity failures, and were therefore deferred per the autonomy escape clause (archived req 019)."
msgstr "Tá siad seo teipeanna imscaradh-orchestration, ní teipeanna playwright-parity, agus dá bhrí sin, cuireadh siar in aghaidh an clásal éalú neamhspleáchas (req cartlainne 019)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are desktop GNOME Shell extensions with no in-app web surface to drive, so they are exempt from the Playwright requirement (requirement 026, Decision 11)."
msgstr "Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil Shell síntí gan aon dromchla gréasáin in-app a thiomáint, mar sin tá siad díolmhaithe ón gceanglas Playwright (ceanglas 026, Cinneadh 11)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are optional and fail soft: unset means the provider's route is never published, and the deployment falls back to whatever local backend the round deploys. The workflow reads each as `${{ secrets.X || vars.X }}`, so the same name works as a repository variable; see [configuration.md](configuration.md#provider-keys-variable-or-secret-) for why the secret is the better half of that pair."
msgstr "Tá siad seo roghnach agus theip bog: ciallaíonn unset nach bhfuil an bealach an tsoláthraí foilsithe riamh, agus an t-imscaradh ar ais go dtí cibé áit áitiúil siar na imscaradh bhabhta. Léann an sreabhadh oibre gach ceann mar `${{ secrets.X || vars.X }}`, mar sin oibríonn an t-ainm céanna mar athróg stór; féach [configuration.md](configuration.md#provider-keys-variable-or-secret-) cén fáth go bhfuil an rún an leath níos fearr den péire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These are used only for pulling source images from Docker Hub and are not required for GHCR authentication."
msgstr "Tá siad seo a úsáidtear ach amháin le haghaidh tarraingt íomhánna foinse ó Docker Hub agus nach bhfuil ag teastáil le haghaidh fíordheimhnithe GHCR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These assets are meant to support confidence, not ceremony. They help the project validate real-world behavior across local development, CI environments, and deployment-oriented smoke tests. The emphasis is on practical feedback: when something breaks, the surrounding test tooling should make the failure easier to understand, easier to reproduce, and easier to clean up. 🚀"
msgstr "Tá na sócmhainní i gceist chun tacú le muinín, ní searmanas. Cuidíonn siad leis an tionscadal a bhailíochtú iompar fíor-domhan ar fud fhorbairt áitiúil, timpeallachtaí CI, agus tástálacha deataigh imscaradh-dhírithe. Tá an bhéim ar aiseolas praiticiúil: nuair a bhriseann rud éigin, ba chóir go mbeadh an uirlis tástála máguaird a dhéanamh níos éasca a thuiscint, níos éasca a atáirgeadh, agus níos éasca a ghlanadh suas. 🚀"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These build on the working onion node and are implemented after the web core is verified."
msgstr "Tá siad seo a thógáil ar an nód oinniún oibre agus a chur i bhfeidhm tar éis an croí gréasáin a fhíorú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These choices are settled at requirement creation time and bound the implementation. Re-opening any of them MUST be recorded in the implementing PR."
msgstr "Socraítear na roghanna seo ag am cruthaithe riachtanas agus tá siad faoi cheangal an cur chun feidhme. Athoscailt aon cheann acu MUST a thaifeadadh sa PR cur chun feidhme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These decisions were confirmed by the operator before implementation starts and are NOT subject to re-litigation during implementation."
msgstr "Dhearbhaigh an t-oibreoir na cinntí sin sula dtosófar ar an gcur chun feidhme agus NACH bhfuil siad faoi réir athlitriú le linn an chur chun feidhme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These have genuine forks and MUST be resolved with the operator before or during implementation. Do not silently pick one and bury it."
msgstr "Tá forcanna fíor agus MUST a réiteach leis an oibreoir roimh nó le linn chur i bhfeidhm. Ná roghnaigh go ciúin amháin agus é a adhlacadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These operations are unconditionally blocked, regardless of any `allow` entry or sandbox state. They cover destructive patterns whose blast radius is unacceptable even inside the sandbox (`.` is `allowWrite`, so `rm -rf .` would still erase the working tree and `.git/`)."
msgstr "Tá na hoibríochtaí bac gan choinníoll, beag beann ar aon `allow` staid iontrála nó bosca gainimh. Clúdaíonn siad patrúin millteach a bhfuil ga soinneáin do-ghlactha fiú taobh istigh den bosca gainimh (`.` Is maith liom `allowWrite`, mar sin `rm -rf .` bheadh fós scrios an crann oibre agus `.git/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These operations pause and require explicit operator approval before executing, even when sandboxed."
msgstr "Tá na hoibríochtaí sos agus a cheangal ar fhormheas oibreoir sainráite roimh fhorghníomhú, fiú nuair a sandboxed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These package definitions are required to bootstrap and run the local development/test environment reliably. 🚀"
msgstr "Tá na sainmhínithe pacáiste ag teastáil chun buataisítrap agus a reáchtáil an fhorbairt áitiúil / timpeallacht tástála iontaofa. 🚀"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These pages drill into a single workflow rather than enumerate every target. `make help` is the authoritative list of available targets:"
msgstr "Druileáil na leathanaigh seo i sreabhadh oibre amháin seachas gach sprioc a ríomh. `make help` liosta údarásach na spriocanna atá ar fáil:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These permissions are required for DNS record management, CAA/SPF/DKIM handling, cache purging, and certificate provisioning."
msgstr "Tá na ceadanna ag teastáil le haghaidh bainistíochta taifead DNS, CAA/SPF/DKIM láimhseáil, purging taisce, agus soláthar deimhniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These primitives are entity-keyed. The app-keyed orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) maps app ids to entities and drives them in sequence alongside the token-store wipe in [tokens.py](../../../../utils/cleanup/tokens.py)."
msgstr "Tá na primitives aonán-eochair. An t-app-keyed orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) léarscáileanna leideanna app d'eintitis agus thiomáineann iad in ord in éineacht leis an wipe chomhartha-stór i [tokens.py](../../../../utils/cleanup/tokens.py)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These principles govern how teams collaborate, plan, and deliver work. For code design principles, see [principles.md](../design/principles.md)."
msgstr "Rialaíonn na prionsabail seo an chaoi a gcomhoibríonn foirne, an plean, agus an obair a sheachadadh. Le haghaidh prionsabail dearadh cód, féach [principles.md](../design/principles.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These roles remain out of shared MCP discovery. A future exception requires a new requirement with a fixed operation list, dedicated identity, isolation boundary, human approval for mutations, and audit trail."
msgstr "Tá na róil fós as fionnachtain MCP roinnte. Éilíonn eisceacht sa todhchaí ceanglas nua le liosta oibríochta seasta, aitheantas tiomnaithe, teorainn leithlis, ceadú an duine le haghaidh sócháin, agus rian iniúchóireachta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These rules are enforced via branch protection. See [branch.md](artefact/git/branch.md) for the full policy."
msgstr "Déantar na rialacha sin a fhorfheidhmiú trí chosaint brainse. Féach ar [branch.md](artefact/git/branch.md) don pholasaí iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These rules keep shared role values explicit, reusable, and easy to read."
msgstr "Coinníonn na rialacha seo rólluachanna comhroinnte follasach, in-athúsáidte, agus éasca le léamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These scripts are the SPOT for repository identity resolution."
msgstr "Is iad na scripteanna seo an t-uaslagóir le haghaidh réiteach céannachta stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These scripts keep PR scope detection, branch-prefix validation, and fork merge-ref resolution together in one place. The `🧩 Subset` label's PR-body parser lives in the `cli.meta.ci.subset_roles` module; the dispatcher [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh) selects between it and the diff resolver. See the \"Subset label\" section in [pipeline.md](../../../../docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Coinníonn na scripteanna a bhrath raon feidhme PR, bailíochtú brainse-réamhshocrú, agus réiteach merge-s forc le chéile in aon áit amháin. An bhfuil `🧩 Subset` lipéad PR-comhlacht parser ina chónaí sa `cli.meta.ci.subset_roles` modúl; an dispatcher [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh) roghnaíonn sé agus an réiteoir diff. Féach an \"lipéad subset\" alt i [pipeline.md](../../../../docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These scripts run **on the deployed host**, not on the controller. `test-e2e-cli` renders `templates/test.env.j2` into the environment and calls `test.sh`, which orchestrates the rest. They use `systemctl`, the `container` wrapper and `/etc/machine-id`, so they only make sense where the role actually deployed."
msgstr "Na scripteanna reáchtáil **ar an óstach imscaradh**, ní ar an rialtóir. `test-e2e-cli` custom `templates/test.env.j2` isteach sa timpeallacht agus glaonna `test.sh`, a orchestrates an chuid eile. Úsáid siad `systemctl`, an `container` fillteán agus `/etc/machine-id`, mar sin a dhéanann siad ach ciall i gcás an ról a imscaradh iarbhír."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These scripts run inside the local infinito container and remove container-local state only. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Na scripteanna reáchtáil taobh istigh an coimeádán infinito áitiúil agus a bhaint coimeádán-áit stát amháin. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These steps are the shared repository workflow and apply regardless of whether you work on Linux, macOS, or Windows with WSL2."
msgstr "Is iad na céimeanna seo an sreabhadh oibre stór comhroinnte agus iarratas a dhéanamh is cuma an bhfuil tú ag obair ar Linux, macOS, nó Windows le WSL2."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These templates are intended for inclusion in larger NGINX configuration files via Jinja2.   They modularize your configuration by separating HTML, WebSocket, and media proxying, allowing for clear, reusable, and maintainable reverse proxy logic."
msgstr "Tá na teimpléid atá beartaithe lena gcur san áireamh i gcomhaid chumraíochta NGINX níos mó trí Jinja2. modularize siad do chumraíocht ag scaradh HTML, WebSocket, agus seachfhreastalaí meáin, ag ligean do soiléir, in-athúsáidte, agus loighic seachfhreastalaí in-aisiompaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "These variables cap the `infinito` container so local runs can reproduce GitHub-hosted runner pressure. Each default is `0`, which Docker interprets as \"unlimited\" and is identical to omitting the key. See [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md) for runner specs and reproduction profiles."
msgstr "Na athróg caipín an `infinito` coimeádán is féidir Ritheann áitiúla a atáirgeadh GitHub-óstach brú rádala. Gach réamhshocraithe `0`, a léiríonn Docker mar \"unlimited\" agus tá sé comhionann a fhágáil ar lár an eochair. Féach ar [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md) do specs rádala agus próifílí atáirgeadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They are also the rows a run must not sample. A priority row is deployed in **every combination it can take** — each variant, in each mode its role offers, and on the modes that carry the onion axis once behind Tor and once on clearnet — all within the same sweep. A 3-variant role offering compose and swarm therefore becomes 3 × 2 × 2 = **12 jobs**, not 3. That is the point of naming a role in `priority`: it is proven everywhere at once instead of over four sweeps."
msgstr "Tá siad freisin nach mór na sraitheanna a reáchtáil sampla. Tá sraith tosaíochta imscaradh i **gach meascán is féidir é a ghlacadh** — gach malairt, i ngach modh a thairgeann a ról, agus ar na modhanna a dhéanann an ais oinniún uair amháin taobh thiar de Tor agus uair amháin ar clearnet - go léir laistigh den scuab céanna. Amharc ar gach eolas 3- Ról athraitheach a thairiscint chumadh agus swarm dá bhrí sin, 3 × 2 × 2 = = = **12 Post a fhógairt**Níl, 3. Is é sin an pointe a ainmniú ról i `priority`: tá sé cruthaithe i ngach áit ag an am céanna in ionad níos mó ná ceithre scuab."

msgid "They live apart from the client itself because the generator runs on the bare bootstrap interpreter: importing the client would pull in the language table and with it a YAML parser the generator is not allowed to need."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "They live at ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.{run_after,lifecycle}`` where ``<primary_entity>`` is the value returned by :func:`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` for the role's directory name."
msgstr "Tá cónaí orthu ag ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.{run_after,lifecycle}`` i gcás ``<primary_entity>`` gurb é an luach a d'fhill sé :func:`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` don ról ainm eolaire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They live at ``secrets.credentials``, which is where the roles' own vars and every other consumer address them. Reading the top-level ``credentials`` instead returns nothing for every provider whose ``credential.source`` is ``credentials``, and the deploy then aborts on a secret that was provisioned all along."
msgstr "Tá cónaí orthu ag ``secrets.credentials``, a bhfuil i gcás ina vars na róil féin agus gach tomhaltóir eile aghaidh a thabhairt orthu. Léitheoireacht an leibhéal barr ``credentials`` ina ionad sin tuairisceáin rud ar bith do gach soláthraí a bhfuil ``credential.source`` Is maith liom ``credentials``, agus an imscaradh ansin aborts ar rún a bhí ar fáil go léir chomh maith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They must not contain application-specific configuration values."
msgstr "Ní mór dóibh go bhfuil luachanna chumraíocht bhfeidhm-sonrach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They should be listed as Idle in ``github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners``."
msgstr "Ba chóir iad a liostú mar Idle i ``github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They should be listed as Idle in `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."
msgstr "Ba chóir iad a liostú mar Idle i `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "They travel as `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` and `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` through the workflow `env:` block, the passthrough allowlist in [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), the `infinito` service environment in [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), and land in `API.<provider>.api_key` in the development inventory, whose path is the SPOT behind `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Skipping the compose forwarding makes them resolve to empty inside the container without any error."
msgstr "Taisteal siad mar `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` agus `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` tríd an sreabhadh oibre `env:` bloc, an givelist passthrough i [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), an `infinito` timpeallacht seirbhíse i [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), agus talamh i `API.<provider>.api_key` san fhardal forbartha, a bhfuil a cosán an gar do `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Déanann Skipping an casta ar aghaidh iad a réiteach a fholmhú taobh istigh den choimeádán gan aon earráid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator that defines `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, and `build_env()`. Walks the handler registry."
msgstr "Thin orchestrator a shainmhíníonn `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, agus `build_env()`. Siúl an clár láimhseálaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator: each variable's mapping/computation lives in its own module under :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` walks the ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` registry, letting each handler read/write through an :class:`EnvBuilder`."
msgstr "Ceolfhoireann Thin: gach athróg ar mapáil / ríomh saol ina modúl féin faoi :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` siúlóidí na ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` clárú, ligean gach láimhseálaí léamh / scríobh trí :class:`EnvBuilder`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Thin wrapper around the `image` lookup (the SPOT for resolving the ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` reference). ``container_image`` only adds the ``image: \"...\"`` compose-line wrapping so templates can drop it in as a standalone statement:"
msgstr "Thin fillteán ar fud an `image` taiseachas aeir: fliuch (an nóta le haghaidh réiteach ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` tagairt do). ``container_image`` ach cuireann an ``image: \"...\"`` timfhilleadh a chumadh-líne ionas gur féidir le teimpléid titim isteach mar ráiteas standalone:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Third render backend (additive)"
msgstr "Tríú thabhairt ar ais (breiseán breiseán)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** is a tool designed for showcasing the Infinito.Nexus platform to various audiences, including **Administrators**, **Developers**, **End-Users**, **Businesses**, and **Investors**. The presentation leverages **Reveal.js** to create an interactive, engaging, and fully containerized experience that can be easily deployed with Docker."
msgstr "Seo é **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** uirlis atá deartha chun an Infinito.Nexus ardán do lucht féachana éagsúla, lena n-áirítear **Riarthóirí**, **Forbairtí**, **Deireadh an chomhrá**, **Gnóchain**, agus **Infheisteoirí**. Giarálacha an cur i láthair **Reveal.js** a chruthú taithí idirghníomhach, tarraingteach, agus go hiomlán coimeádán is féidir a imscaradh go héasca le Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This 3-node topology (1 manager + 2 workers) is also the minimum exercised by the CI pilot workflow — see [CI: pilot validation workflow](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Any host in `svc-swarm-manager` MUST also be in `svc-swarm-node`. A deploy with a host in `svc-swarm-manager` but missing from `svc-swarm-node` MUST fail at inventory-validation time."
msgstr "Seo é 3topology -node (1 bainisteoir + 2 oibrithe) gurb é an t-íosmhéid a fheidhmíonn sreabhadh oibre píolótach CI freisin — féach [CI: sreabhadh oibre bailíochtaithe píolóta](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Aon óstach i `svc-swarm-manager` MUST freisin i `svc-swarm-node`. A imscaradh le óstach i `svc-swarm-manager` ach ar iarraidh ó `svc-swarm-node` MUST theipeann ar am fardal-luacháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról Ansible a shuiteáil agus cumraíocht [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), uirlis foinse saor in aisce agus oscailte chun imscaradh a uathoibriú [A ligean ar Criptiú](https://letsencrypt.org/) deimhnithe. Láimhseálann sé freisin ar an thus na plugins DNS do dhúshláin ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról Ansible a shuiteáil agus cumraíocht `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, uirlis foinse saor in aisce agus oscailte chun imscaradh a uathoibriú `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ deimhnithe. Láimhseálann sé freisin ar an thus na plugins DNS do dhúshláin ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the integration of Matomo tracking code into NGINX-served websites. It simplifies the process of adding the Matomo analytics tracking script and image tracker to all your web pages served through NGINX."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról Ansible comhtháthú Matomo cód rianú isteach láithreáin ghréasáin NGINX tuillte. Simplíonn sé an próiseas a chur leis an Matomo rianú anailísíochta script agus rianaitheoir íomhá do gach leathanach gréasáin sheirbheáil trí NGINX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the validation of [Content Security Policy (CSP)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP) enforcement for all configured domains by crawling them using a [CSP Checker](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker)."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról Ansible bailíochtú [Beartas slándála (CSP)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP) forfheidhmiú do gach réimsí cumraithe trí crawling iad ag baint úsáide as [CSP Checker](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the validation of `Content Security Policy (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP>`__ enforcement for all configured domains by crawling them using a `CSP Checker <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker>`__."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról Ansible bailíochtú `Content Security Policy (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP>`__ forfheidhmiú do gach réimsí cumraithe trí crawling iad ag baint úsáide as `CSP Checker <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/csp-checker>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automatically restarts Docker Compose configurations with exited or unhealthy containers on Arch Linux systems. It ensures the stability of containerized workloads by recovering from common error conditions like port binding issues."
msgstr "Tá an ról uafásach atosú go huathoibríoch Docker Compose cumraíochtaí le coimeádáin amach nó neamhshláintiúla ar chórais Arch Linux. Cinntíonn sé cobhsaíocht na n-ualach oibre coimeádán trí ghnóthú ó choinníollacha earráide coitianta cosúil le saincheisteanna ceangailteacha calafoirt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures NGINX to perform 301 redirects from one domain to another. It handles SSL certificate retrieval for the source domains and sets up the NGINX configuration to redirect to the specified target domains."
msgstr "Cumhdaíonn an ról Ansible NGINX a dhéanamh 301 atreorú ó réimse amháin go ceann eile. Láimhseálann sé aisghabháil deimhniú SSL do na fearainn foinse agus leagann sé suas an chumraíocht NGINX a atreorú chuig na réimsí sprioc sonraithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (``sshd``) by deploying a templated ``sshd_config`` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Cumhdaíonn an ról Ansible an daemon OpenSSH (``sshd``) trí úsáid a bhaint as teimpléad ``sshd_config`` comhad. Cuireann sé socruithe slána, is fearr-chleachtais chun rochtain iargúlta a dhaingniú agus an baol a bhaineann le míchumrú nó glasáil a laghdú. I measc na Socruithe díchumasú logáil isteach fréimhe, forfheidhmiú poiblí-eochair fíordheimhnithe, agus a leagan síos leibhéil logála cuí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role configures the OpenSSH daemon (`sshd`) by deploying a templated `sshd_config` file. It applies secure, best-practice settings to harden remote access and reduce the risk of misconfiguration or lockout. Settings include disabling root login, enforcing public-key authentication, and setting appropriate logging levels."
msgstr "Cumhdaíonn an ról Ansible an daemon OpenSSH (`sshd`) trí úsáid a bhaint as teimpléad `sshd_config` comhad. Cuireann sé socruithe slána, is fearr-chleachtais chun rochtain iargúlta a dhaingniú agus an baol a bhaineann le míchumrú nó glasáil a laghdú. I measc na Socruithe díchumasú logáil isteach fréimhe, forfheidhmiú poiblí-eochair fíordheimhnithe, agus a leagan síos leibhéil logála cuí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys **NGINX** as a high-performance [reverse proxy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy) in front of Docker-hosted services.   It provides automatic TLS integration, WebSocket support, and a flexible templating system for per-application configuration."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible **NGINX** mar ardfheidhmíocht [auto extended warranty](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy) os comhair Docker-óstach seirbhísí. Soláthraíonn sé comhtháthú TLS uathoibríoch, tacaíocht WebSocket, agus córas teocht solúbtha do chumraíocht in aghaidh an iarratais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys **NGINX** as a high-performance `reverse proxy <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy>`__ in front of Docker-hosted services."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible **NGINX** mar ardfheidhmíocht `reverse proxy <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_proxy>`__ os comhair Docker-óstach seirbhísí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Collabora Online (CODE) in Docker to enable real-time, in-browser document editing for Nextcloud. It automates the setup of the Collabora CODE container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible Collabora Ar Líne (CODE) i Docker a chumasú fíor-ama, in-bhrabhsálaí doiciméad eagarthóireacht do Nextcloud. uathoibríonn sé an thus an Collabora CODE coimeádán, NGINX cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, aonrú líonra trí líonraí Docker, agus bainistíocht athróg timpeallacht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys EspoCRM using Docker. It handles:"
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible EspoCRM ag baint úsáide as Docker. Láimhseálann sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys SuiteCRM using Docker and the Infinito.Nexus shared stack. It handles:"
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible SuiteCRM ag baint úsáide as Docker agus an Infinito.Nexus Stack roinnte. Láimhseálann sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Taiga in a Docker-based environment, allowing fast, reproducible, and secure installations. Authentication defaults to Taiga's own OpenID Connect integration against Keycloak, which federates users from OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible Taiga i dtimpeallacht Docker-bhunaithe, ag ligean go tapa, atáirgthe, agus suiteálacha slán. mainneachtainí fíordheimhnithe a Taiga's féin OpenID Nasc comhtháthú i gcoinne Keycloak, a chothaíonn úsáideoirí ó OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Taiga in a Docker-based environment, allowing fast, reproducible, and secure installations. Authentication defaults to Taiga’s own OpenID Connect integration against Keycloak, which federates users from OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible Taiga i dtimpeallacht Docker-bhunaithe, ag ligean go tapa, atáirgthe, agus suiteálacha slán. mainneachtainí fíordheimhnithe a Taiga’s OpenID féin Nasc comhtháthú i gcoinne Keycloak, a chothaíonn úsáideoirí ó OpenLDAP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular `.env` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Áirítear leis tacaíocht do Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN / STUN, seiceálacha sláinte, agus modúlach `.env` thus. Tá an ról seo oiriúnach d'institiúidí oideachais agus d'fhoirne a dteastaíonn réiteach comhroinnte físeán féin-óstáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible [PhpMyAdmin](https://www.phpmyadmin.net/) i dtimpeallacht Docker slán, iomlán le OAuth roghnach2 tacaíocht seachfhreastalaí. Cuireann sé ar chumas bainistíochta gan uaim MariaDB/ MySQL bunachair sonraí trí comhéadan gréasáin-app-bhunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose. It includes support for Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN/STUN, health checks, and a modular ``.env`` setup. This role is ideal for educational institutions and teams requiring a self-hosted video conferencing solution. > 🔧 **Note**: The database layer should be decoupled in a future release to improve modularity and integration. >"
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Áirítear leis tacaíocht do Greenlight, OIDC, LDAP, TURN / STUN, seiceálacha sláinte, agus modúlach ``.env`` thus. Tá an ról seo oiriúnach d'institiúidí oideachais agus d'fhoirne a éilíonn réiteach comhroinnte físeán féin-óstáil. 🔧 **Tabhair faoi deara**: Ba chóir an ciseal bunachar sonraí a dhíchúpláil i scaoileadh amach anseo chun feabhas a chur ar modularity agus comhtháthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ in a secure Docker environment, complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support. It enables seamless management of MariaDB/MySQL databases via a web-app-based interface."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible `PhpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net/>`__ i dtimpeallacht Docker slán, iomlán le OAuth roghnach2 tacaíocht seachfhreastalaí. Cuireann sé ar chumas bainistíochta gan uaim MariaDB/ MySQL bunachair sonraí trí comhéadan gréasáin-app-bhunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their ``dns:`` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradh recourse lárnach / forwarding réiteoir DNSSEC (Unbound) i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Ritheann sé mar chairn aon-seirbhíse fánach le IP statach ar a líonra féin, ionas gur féidir le stacks tomhaltóirí pointe a n- ``dns:`` ag sé in ionad embedding a réiteach féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their `dns:` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradh recourse lárnach / forwarding réiteoir DNSSEC (Unbound) i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Ritheann sé mar chairn aon-seirbhíse fánach le IP statach ar a líonra féin, ionas gur féidir le stacks tomhaltóirí pointe a n- `dns:` ag sé in ionad embedding a réiteach féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a PostgreSQL database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify database administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and essential database tasks (such as database and user creation) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradhs agus cumrú a PostgreSQL bunachar sonraí i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Tá sé deartha a shimpliú riarachán bunachar trí uathoibriú a chruthú líonraí, coimeádáin, agus tascanna bunachar sonraí riachtanach (mar bhunachar sonraí agus a chruthú úsáideora) do thimpeallacht slán agus ardfheidhmíochta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a Qdrant vector database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs Qdrant as a central, pinned engine that many application roles share over the cross-stack network, keeping the consumer roles stateless and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradhs agus cumrú a Qdrant bunachar sonraí veicteoir i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Ritheann sé Qdrant mar lárnach, inneall pinned a roinnt róil iarratais thar an líonra tras-stack, a choinneáil ar na róil tomhaltóra stateless agus NFS-roinnte i swarm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to `<entity>-*` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradh agus cumrú lárnach Elasticsearch inneall cuardaigh i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Tá sé deartha chun riarachán cuardaigh a shimpliú trí uathoibriú a chruthú líonraí, coimeádáin, agus in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir innéacs namespaces (ról agus úsáideoir raon feidhme `<entity>-*` innéacsanna) do thimpeallacht slán agus ardfheidhmíochta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Elasticsearch search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify search administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and per-consumer index namespaces (a role and user scoped to ``<entity>-*`` indices) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradh agus cumrú lárnach Elasticsearch inneall cuardaigh i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Tá sé deartha chun riarachán cuardaigh a shimpliú trí uathoibriú a chruthú líonraí, coimeádáin, agus in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir innéacs namespaces (ról agus úsáideoir raon feidhme ``<entity>-*`` innéacsanna) do thimpeallacht slán agus ardfheidhmíochta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Typesense search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed as a central engine: many application roles share one pinned Typesense stack instead of each embedding its own sidecar, keeping the application roles stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible imscaradh agus cumrú lárnach Typesense inneall cuardaigh i coimeádán Docker ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Tá sé deartha mar inneall lárnach: roinnt róil iarratais go leor pinned amháin Typesense Stack in ionad gach embedding a sidecar féin, a choinneáil ar na róil iarratais stateless, gan íoc agus NFS-roinnte i swarm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról Ansible seo agus bainistíonn sé coimeádán [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) freastalaí, ag soláthar rochtain éasca le níos mó 2,000 SVG agus deilbhíní PNG le húsáid i dtionscadail gréasáin, doiciméadú, agus brandáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról Ansible seo agus bainistíonn sé coimeádán `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ freastalaí, ag soláthar rochtain éasca le níos mó 2,000 SVG agus deilbhíní PNG le húsáid i dtionscadail gréasáin, doiciméadú, agus brandáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys the ONLYOFFICE Document Server in Docker to provide real-time, in-browser editing for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations. It automates the setup of the Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management for secure integration with Nextcloud or other WOPI-compatible platforms."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról Ansible an Freastalaí Doiciméad ONLYOFFICE i Docker a chur ar fáil fíor-ama, in-bhrabhsálaí eagarthóireacht do dhoiciméid, scarbhileoga, agus cur i láthair. uathoibríonn sé an thus an coimeádán Freastalaí Doiciméad, NGINX cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, aonrú líonra trí líonraí Docker, agus bainistíocht athróg timpeallacht do chomhtháthú slán le Nextcloud nó ardáin eile WOPI-comhoiriúnach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról uafásach seo **theming domhanda comhsheasmhach** ar fud gach iarratas NGINX-choimeád ag instealladh comhaid CSS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files.   The role leverages [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) to generate a dynamic, customizable color palette for light and dark mode, compatible with popular web tools like **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, and many more."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról uafásach seo **theming domhanda comhsheasmhach** ar fud gach iarratas NGINX-choimeád ag instealladh comhaid CSS. An ról giarála [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) a ghiniúint pailéad dath dinimiciúil, customizable le haghaidh modh éadrom agus dorcha, ag luí le huirlisí gréasáin tóir ar nós **strap leathair**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, agus go leor eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) is sourced in both [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) and [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) to a centralized `.profile`."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról seo inghlactha go [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) Tá a fháil sa dá [Uisce agus Séarachas](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) agus [An tSeachtain](https://www.zsh.org/) timpeallachtaí. Cuireann sé ar chumas luchtú athraitheach timpeallacht comhsheasmhach ar fud sliogáin logála éagsúla trí nascadh comhaid phróifíl bhlaosc-shonrach (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) go láraithe `.profile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ is sourced in both `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ and `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) to a centralized ``.profile``."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról seo inghlactha go `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ Tá a fháil sa dá `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ agus `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ timpeallachtaí. Cuireann sé ar chumas luchtú athraitheach timpeallacht comhsheasmhach ar fud sliogáin logála éagsúla trí nascadh comhaid phróifíl bhlaosc-shonrach (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) go láraithe ``.profile``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that the target host’s system hostname is set to the inventory hostname."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an ról Ansible go bhfuil an óstach córas sprioc ar hostname leagtha chuig an hostname fardal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures the ``doli`` (dotlinker) CLI is installed (via ``pkgmgr``) and applies dotlinker mappings provided by the calling role."
msgstr ""

