# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "An ról Ansible sleachta an leagan tionscadail ón áitiúil ``pyproject.toml`` (ag baint úsáide as ``playbook_dir``) agus scríobhann sé mar athróg timpeallacht ar fud an chórais isteach ``/etc/environment`` ar an óstach a bhainistiú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local `pyproject.toml` (using `playbook_dir`) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into `/etc/environment` on the managed host."
msgstr "An ról Ansible sleachta an leagan tionscadail ón áitiúil `pyproject.toml` (ag baint úsáide as `playbook_dir`) agus scríobhann sé mar athróg timpeallacht ar fud an chórais isteach `/etc/environment` ar an óstach a bhainistiú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role facilitates the deployment of a MariaDB server using Docker. It is designed to ensure ease of installation and configuration, with the flexibility to adapt to different environments."
msgstr "Éascaíonn an ról seo inghlactha imscaradh MariaDB freastalaí ag baint úsáide as Docker. Tá sé deartha chun éascaíocht a dhéanamh ar shuiteáil agus ar chumraíocht, leis an tsolúbthacht a chur in oiriúint do thimpeallachtaí éagsúla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the `*.localhost` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Ráthaíonn an ról uafásach go réitíonn sprioc na `*.localhost` ainmneacha feidhmíonn sé, gan dul trí DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role guarantees that a target resolves the ``*.localhost`` names it serves, without going through DNS."
msgstr "Ráthaíonn an ról uafásach go réitíonn sprioc na ``*.localhost`` ainmneacha feidhmíonn sé, gan dul trí DNS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s ``sub_filter`` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing ``</head>`` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Instealladh an ról Ansible snippet saincheaptha JavaScript i ngach freagraí HTML sheirbheáil ag NGINX. Giaráil sé NGINX ar ``sub_filter`` a chur isteach gan uaim do script iarratas-sonrach díreach roimh an dúnadh ``</head>`` tag, ag cinntiú go ritheann do chód ar gach ualach leathanach, atá úsáideach do bratacha gné domhanda, Analytics, nó feabhsuithe Chomhéadain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into all HTML responses served by NGINX. It leverages NGINX’s `sub_filter` to seamlessly insert your application-specific script just before the closing `</head>` tag, ensuring that your code runs on every page load, which is useful for global feature flags, analytics, or UI enhancements."
msgstr "Instealladh an ról Ansible snippet saincheaptha JavaScript i ngach freagraí HTML sheirbheáil ag NGINX. Giaráil sé NGINX ar `sub_filter` a chur isteach gan uaim do script iarratas-sonrach díreach roimh an dúnadh `</head>` tag, ag cinntiú go ritheann do chód ar gach ualach leathanach, atá úsáideach do bratacha gné domhanda, Analytics, nó feabhsuithe Chomhéadain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role injects a small JavaScript snippet into your HTML responses that enables parent pages to get notified whenever the iframe’s location changes and forces external links to open in a new tab."
msgstr "Instealladh an ról Ansible snippet beag JavaScript isteach i do freagraí HTML a chuireann ar chumas leathanaigh tuismitheoir a fháil ar an eolas aon uair an iframe ar athruithe suíomh agus fórsaí naisc seachtracha a oscailt i táb nua."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs **fakeroot** for the current Linux distribution. Fakeroot enables non-privileged users to simulate root-level file manipulations, making it ideal for building packages or performing file operations that normally require root permissions."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible **cineál gas: in airde** don dáileadh Linux reatha. Cuireann Fakeroot ar chumas úsáideoirí neamh-privileged a insamhail cúblálacha comhad leibhéal fréimhe, rud a chiallaíonn sé oiriúnach do phacáistí tógála nó oibríochtaí comhaid a éilíonn de ghnáth ceadanna fréamhacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs GNU Make on Arch Linux systems using the Pacman package manager. GNU Make is a build automation tool that automatically builds executable programs and libraries from source code by reading files called Makefiles."
msgstr "An ról Ansible installs GNU Déan ar Arch Linux córais ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman. GRÚPA Déan Is uirlis uathoibriú a thógáil a thógann go huathoibríoch cláir inrite agus leabharlanna ó cód foinse ag comhaid léamh ar a dtugtar Makefiles."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager. It ensures that Git is installed only once, even when the role is applied to multiple hosts or executed in a multi-task scenario."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible Git ar an gcóras sprioc ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman. Cinntíonn sé go Git suiteáilte ach uair amháin, fiú nuair a chuirtear an ról i bhfeidhm ar hóstach iolrach nó a fhorghníomhú i gcás il-tasc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs Node.js on the target system using the native package manager."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible Node.js ar an spriocchóras ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste dúchais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) and updates packages using `pkgmgr` on Arch Linux systems. It provides a unified interface for package installation and update management, ensuring consistent deployment across environments."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible [Bainisteoir Pacáiste Kevin](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) agus pacáistí nuashonruithe ag baint úsáide as `pkgmgr` ar chórais Arch Linux. Soláthraíonn sé comhéadan aontaithe le haghaidh suiteáil pacáiste agus bainistíocht cothrom le dáta, ag cinntiú imscaradh comhsheasmhach ar fud na timpeallachtaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ and updates packages using ``pkgmgr`` on Arch Linux systems. It provides a unified interface for package installation and update management, ensuring consistent deployment across environments."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ agus pacáistí nuashonruithe ag baint úsáide as ``pkgmgr`` ar chórais Arch Linux. Soláthraíonn sé comhéadan aontaithe le haghaidh suiteáil pacáiste agus bainistíocht cothrom le dáta, ag cinntiú imscaradh comhsheasmhach ar fud na timpeallachtaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **NGINX** as a core HTTP/stream server on Arch Linux systems. It provides:"
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe **NGINX** mar fhreastalaí croí HTTP / sruth ar chórais Arch Linux. Soláthraíonn sé:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see [SMTP on Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** (móide comhoiriúnacht seoltaí roghnach) ar fud an réamhshocraithe Infinito distro leagtha: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora agus CentOS. Soláthraíonn sé cliant SMTP lightweight a fheidhmíonn mar athsholáthair titim isteach le haghaidh sreabhadh oibre seoltaí traidisiúnta, ar chumas seachadadh ríomhphoist iontaofa trí fhreastalaí SMTP seachtrach. Le haghaidh tuilleadh cúlra ar SMTP, féach [SMTP ar Vicipéid](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures **msmtp** (plus optional sendmail compatibility) across the default Infinito distro set: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora and CentOS. It provides a lightweight SMTP client that serves as a drop-in replacement for traditional sendmail workflows, enabling reliable email delivery via an external SMTP server. For more background on SMTP, see `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** (móide comhoiriúnacht seoltaí roghnach) ar fud an réamhshocraithe Infinito distro leagtha: Arch Linux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora agus CentOS. Soláthraíonn sé cliant SMTP lightweight a fheidhmíonn mar athsholáthair titim isteach le haghaidh sreabhadh oibre seoltaí traidisiúnta, ar chumas seachadadh ríomhphoist iontaofa trí fhreastalaí SMTP seachtrach. Le haghaidh tuilleadh cúlra ar SMTP, féach `SMTP on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMTP>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures Firefox on Arch Linux systems, enforcing Enterprise Policies to automatically install key browser extensions. It ensures that Firefox is installed and set up with policies that force-install uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC Browser extension, delivering a secure and consistent browsing experience."
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe Firefox maidir le córais Arch Linux, Beartais Fiontraíochta a fhorfheidhmiú chun síntí bhrabhsálaí eochair a shuiteáil go huathoibríoch. Cinntíonn sé go Firefox suiteáilte agus a chur ar bun le beartais a bhfeidhm-shuiteáil uBlock Origin agus an KeePassXC Síneadh bhrabhsálaí, ag seachadadh taithí brabhsála slán agus comhsheasmhach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures [Kevin's Package Manager](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe [Bainisteoir Pacáiste Kevin](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager) - uirlis Python configurable atá deartha chun repositories il agus uathoibriú coitianta a bhainistiú Git oibríochtaí. An clones ról an stór ó GitHub, Leagann na ceadanna inrite don script is mó, agus ritheann an t-ordú a shuiteáil a chur ar bun ailiasanna ordú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - a configurable Python tool designed to manage multiple repositories and automate common Git operations. The role clones the repository from GitHub, sets the executable permissions for the main script, and runs the installation command to set up command aliases."
msgstr "Shuiteálacha ról Ansible agus cumraithe `Kevin’s Package Manager <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/package-manager>`__ - uirlis Python configurable atá deartha chun repositories il agus uathoibriú coitianta a bhainistiú Git oibríochtaí. An clones ról an stór ó GitHub, Leagann na ceadanna inrite don script is mó, agus ritheann an t-ordú a shuiteáil a chur ar bun ailiasanna ordú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról Ansible seo na bogearraí go léir a theastaíonn le haghaidh athsheinm Blu-ray ar chórais Arch Linux-bhunaithe. Cinntíonn sé go VLC agus na leabharlanna is gá le haghaidh díchriptiú diosca Blu-ray agus athsheinm (``libaacs``, ``libbluray``) i láthair, agus cuireann crúcaí do phacáistí AUR roghnach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures all the software required for Blu-ray playback on Arch Linux–based systems. It ensures that VLC and the necessary libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback (`libaacs`, `libbluray`) are present, and provides hooks for optional AUR packages."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról Ansible seo na bogearraí go léir a theastaíonn le haghaidh athsheinm Blu-ray ar chórais Arch Linux-bhunaithe. Cinntíonn sé go VLC agus na leabharlanna is gá le haghaidh díchriptiú diosca Blu-ray agus athsheinm (`libaacs`, `libbluray`) i láthair, agus cuireann crúcaí do phacáistí AUR roghnach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Chromium browser along with essential security and productivity extensions. It ensures that Chromium is installed and properly set up with forced installation of uBlock Origin and the KeePassXC browser extension via Enterprise Policies, providing a secure and streamlined browsing experience."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus cumrú na Chromium bhrabhsálaí chomh maith le síneadh slándála agus táirgiúlachta riachtanach. Cinntíonn sé go Chromium Tá sé suiteáilte agus a chur ar bun i gceart le suiteáil éigean de uBlock Origin agus an KeePassXC síneadh bhrabhsálaí trí Bheartais Fiontraíochta, ag soláthar taithí brabhsála slán agus sruthlínithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Nextcloud desktop client on Arch Linux systems. It also manages symbolic links from commonly used user directories (like `Documents`, `Pictures`, etc.) to the respective folders inside a cloud-synced Nextcloud directory. This ensures user data is seamlessly integrated into the synchronized cloud folder."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus cumrú na Nextcloud cliant deisce ar chórais Arch Linux. Bainistíonn sé freisin naisc siombalach ó eolairí úsáideora a úsáidtear go coitianta (maith liom `Documents`, `Pictures`, etc.) leis na fillteáin faoi seach taobh istigh de scamall-synced Nextcloud eolaire. Cinntíonn sé seo go bhfuil sonraí úsáideora comhtháite seamlessly isteach an fillteán scamall synchronized."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Nextcloud desktop client on Arch Linux systems. It also manages symbolic links from commonly used user directories (like ``Documents``, ``Pictures``, etc.) to the respective folders inside a cloud-synced Nextcloud directory. This ensures user data is seamlessly integrated into the synchronized cloud folder."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus cumrú na Nextcloud cliant deisce ar chórais Arch Linux. Bainistíonn sé freisin naisc siombalach ó eolairí úsáideora a úsáidtear go coitianta (maith liom ``Documents``, ``Pictures``, etc.) leis na fillteáin faoi seach taobh istigh de scamall-synced Nextcloud eolaire. Cinntíonn sé seo go bhfuil sonraí úsáideora comhtháite seamlessly isteach an fillteán scamall synchronized."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and configures the Tor service and the Tor Browser Launcher, providing a privacy-focused web browsing environment on Pacman-based Linux distributions."
msgstr "Déanann an ról Ansible seo an tseirbhís Tor agus an Tor Brabhsálaí Tor a shuiteáil agus a chumrú, ag soláthar timpeallacht brabhsála gréasáin atá dírithe ar phríobháideacht ar dáiltí Linux Pacman-bhunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and executes [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), a tool designed to clean up unused anonymous Docker volumes (including symlinks and their targets) to maintain a tidy Docker environment."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus forghníomhaíonn [`dockreap`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner), uirlis atá deartha chun líon Docker gan ainm a ghlanadh (lena n-áirítear symlinks agus a spriocanna) timpeallacht Docker slachtmhar a choinneáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and executes ```dockreap`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner>`__, a tool designed to clean up unused anonymous Docker volumes (including symlinks and their targets) to maintain a tidy Docker environment."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus forghníomhaíonn ```dockreap`` <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/docker-volume-cleaner>` , uirlis atá deartha chun líon Docker gan ainm a ghlanadh (lena n-áirítear symlinks agus a spriocanna) timpeallacht Docker slachtmhar a choinneáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs and makes the Infinito.Nexus CLI available on your system."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról Ansible agus a dhéanann an Infinito.Nexus CLI ar fáil ar do chóras."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs everything needed for Arduino development on Arch Linux. It includes the official Arduino IDE, documentation, and user group configurations to enable serial port access for uploading code to boards."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról Ansible seo gach rud is gá le haghaidh forbairt Arduino ar Arch Linux. Cuimsíonn sé an Arduino oifigiúil IDE, doiciméadú, agus cumraíochtaí grúpa úsáideora chun rochtain port sraitheach do chód a uaslódáil chuig boird."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs non-free GPU drivers on Arch Linux systems by invoking the ``mhwd`` utility. It ensures that the appropriate proprietary drivers for your PCI graphics hardware are installed and ready for use."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo inchreidte tiománaithe GPU neamh-saor in aisce ar chórais Arch Linux trí na ``mhwd`` fóntais. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil na tiománaithe dílseánaigh cuí do do crua-earraí grafaicí PCI suiteáilte agus réidh le húsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs non-free GPU drivers on Arch Linux systems by invoking the `mhwd` utility. It ensures that the appropriate proprietary drivers for your PCI graphics hardware are installed and ready for use."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo inchreidte tiománaithe GPU neamh-saor in aisce ar chórais Arch Linux trí na `mhwd` fóntais. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil na tiománaithe dílseánaigh cuí do do crua-earraí grafaicí PCI suiteáilte agus réidh le húsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs npm and optionally runs ``npm ci`` within a given project directory. It is intended to streamline dependency installation for Node.js applications."
msgstr "Tá an ról Ansible installs npm agus go roghnach ritheann ``npm ci`` laistigh de eolaire tionscadail ar leith. Tá sé beartaithe suiteáil spleáchas a chuíchóiriú le haghaidh Node.js iarratais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
