# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) on Arch Linux systems. GCC is a standard compiler suite supporting C, C++, and other programming languages. It is a core component for compiling and building software from source."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo an Bailiúchán Compiler GNU isteach (GCC) ar chórais Arch Linux. Is GCC sraith compiler caighdeánach tacaíocht C, C+, agus teangacha cláir eile. Tá sé ina chomhpháirt lárnach do thiomsú agus bogearraí a thógáil ó fhoinse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the Intel VA-API media driver for the current Linux distribution."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról uafásach seo an Intel VA-API tiománaí meáin don dáileadh Linux reatha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "An ról Ansible installs an [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) cliant deisce ar chórais Arch Linux ag baint úsáide as an [AUR (riachtanais uisce: measartha User Stórála Stórála)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."
msgstr "An ról Ansible installs an `Spotify <https://www.spotify.com/>`__ cliant deisce ar chórais Arch Linux ag baint úsáide as an `AUR (Arch User Repository) <https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It's particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Tá an ról Ansible freagrach as a shuiteáil GnuCash, bogearraí bainistíochta airgeadais saor in aisce agus foinse oscailte, ar chórais ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman. Tá sé úsáideach go háirithe do bhunú GnuCash i dtimpeallacht Linux le hidirghabháil láimhe íosta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role is responsible for installing GnuCash, a free and open-source financial management software, on systems utilizing the Pacman package manager. It’s particularly useful for setting up GnuCash in a Linux environment with minimal manual intervention."
msgstr "Tá an ról Ansible freagrach as a shuiteáil GnuCash, bogearraí bainistíochta airgeadais saor in aisce agus foinse oscailte, ar chórais ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman. Tá sé úsáideach go háirithe do bhunú GnuCash i dtimpeallacht Linux le hidirghabháil láimhe íosta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages Docker Compose project structures and workflows for applications on Arch Linux. It creates dedicated instance directories, manages `.env` and `compose.yml` files, and provides automation logic for project reset, rebuild, and startup sequences."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról uafásach seo Docker Compose struchtúir tionscadail agus sreabhadh oibre le haghaidh iarratas ar Arch Linux. Cruthaíonn sé eolairí mar shampla tiomnaithe, Bainistíonn `.env` agus `compose.yml` comhaid, agus soláthraíonn loighic uathoibriú do athshocrú tionscadail, atógáil, agus ord tosaithe."

