msgid "This Ansible role provides Redis in two interchangeable shapes, selected per consumer with the ``shared`` flag (mirroring ``svc-db-postgres``):"
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo ar fáil Redis in dhá cruthanna idirmhalartaithe, roghnaithe in aghaidh an tomhaltóra leis an ``shared`` bratach bratach (scáthán ``svc-db-postgres``):"

