# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. `stable`) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo ar fáil **láidir, ath-inúsáidte Git fóntais tarraingt** le haghaidh uathoibriú córas. Feidhmíonn sé clones éadomhain nó nuashonruithe Git stórtha agus roghnach **bioráin an crann ag obair le tag ar leith** (e.g. `stable`) i stát HEAD scoite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. ``stable``) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo ar fáil **láidir, ath-inúsáidte Git fóntais tarraingt** le haghaidh uathoibriú córas. Feidhmíonn sé clones éadomhain nó nuashonruithe Git stórtha agus roghnach **bioráin an crann ag obair le tag ar leith** (e.g.``stable``) i stát HEAD scoite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a central RabbitMQ message broker that many roles share. It runs the broker inside a Docker container and isolates each consumer with its own virtual host and user, making it suitable for production or local development."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo lárnach ar fáil RabbitMQ bróicéir teachtaireacht a roinnt róil go leor. Ritheann sé an bróicéir taobh istigh de coimeádán Docker agus isolates gach tomhaltóir lena óstach fíorúil féin agus úsáideoir, rud a chiallaíonn sé oiriúnach le haghaidh táirgeadh nó forbairt áitiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a generic, reusable Playwright end-to-end (E2E) test runner for the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról Ansible cineálach, reusable Playwright deireadh-le-deireadh (E2E) rádala tástála don Infinito.Nexus éiceachóras."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you're consolidating your application's data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról Ansible córas bunachar sonraí láraithe i do Docker Compose timpeallacht. Tacaíonn sé an dá MariaDB agus PostgreSQL, ag soláthar réiteach láidir, inscálaithe, agus íseal-chothabháil bunachar sonraí. Cibé an bhfuil tú ag comhdhlúthú sonraí d'iarratas nó a chruthú stóráil lárnach tiomnaithe, an ról seo shimpliú thus agus comhtháthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you’re consolidating your application’s data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról Ansible córas bunachar sonraí láraithe i do Docker Compose timpeallacht. Tacaíonn sé an dá MariaDB agus PostgreSQL, ag soláthar réiteach láidir, inscálaithe, agus íseal-chothabháil bunachar sonraí. Cibé an bhfuil tú ag chomhdhlúthú sonraí d'iarratas nó a chruthú stóráil lárnach tiomnaithe, an ról seo shimpliú thus agus comhtháthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role removes NGINX configuration files and revokes and deletes Certbot certificates for domains marked as deprecated."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról Ansible comhaid chumraíocht NGINX agus a chúlghairm agus a scriosadh Certbot deimhnithe do fearainn marcáilte mar a dímheasadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (``svc-db-postgres``). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, ``shared: false``) or from this central pinned stack (``shared: true``)."
msgstr "Ritheann an ról uafásach Memcached mar spleáchas inneall lárnach, ag léiriú an phatrún lár-sonraí Bunachar (``svc-db-postgres``). Sroicheann tomhaltóir é ceachtar leabaithe (a sidecar taobh istigh a chairn féin, ``shared: false``) nó ón Stack pinned lárnach (``shared: true``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role runs Memcached as a central engine dependency, mirroring the central-database pattern (`svc-db-postgres`). A consumer reaches it either embedded (a sidecar inside its own stack, `shared: false`) or from this central pinned stack (`shared: true`)."
msgstr "Ritheann an ról uafásach Memcached mar spleáchas inneall lárnach, ag léiriú an phatrún lár-sonraí Bunachar (`svc-db-postgres`). Sroicheann tomhaltóir é ceachtar leabaithe (a sidecar taobh istigh a chairn féin, `shared: false`) nó ón Stack pinned lárnach (`shared: true`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sends periodic health check emails using **msmtp** to verify that your mail transport agent is operational. It deploys a simple script and hooks it into a systemd service and timer, with failure notifications sent via Telegram."
msgstr "Seo ról Ansible cuireann r-phoist seiceáil sláinte tréimhsiúla ag baint úsáide as **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** a fhíorú go bhfuil do ghníomhaire iompair poist ag feidhmiú. imscaradh sé script simplí agus crúcaí sé isteach i seirbhís córasach agus lasc ama, le fógraí teip a sheoladh trí Telegram."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the ``pip`` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Leagann an ról Ansible suas timpeallacht forbartha Python ar Arch Linux. Áirítear leis Python féin, an ``pip`` bainisteoir pacáiste, agus cuireann sé ar an bhforbróir ginearálta persona chun tacú le scriptiú, forbairt i bhfeidhm, eolaíocht sonraí, agus níos mó."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up a Python development environment on Arch Linux. It includes Python itself, the `pip` package manager, and builds on the general developer persona to support scripting, application development, data science, and more."
msgstr "Leagann an ról Ansible suas timpeallacht forbartha Python ar Arch Linux. Áirítear leis Python féin, an `pip` bainisteoir pacáiste, agus cuireann sé ar an bhforbróir ginearálta persona chun tacú le scriptiú, forbairt i bhfeidhm, eolaíocht sonraí, agus níos mó."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role sets up and manages Akaunting, an innovative online accounting software, using Docker and Docker Compose. Empower your financial management with Akaunting, a dynamic and feature-rich accounting platform designed to simplify your bookkeeping and boost your business growth. Enjoy intuitive tools, real-time insights, and an energetic approach to your finances."
msgstr "Leagann an ról Ansible suas agus bainistíonn Akaunting, bogearraí cuntasaíochta ar líne nuálach, ag baint úsáide as Docker agus Docker Compose. Cumhachtú do bhainistiú airgeadais le Akaunting, ardán cuntasaíochta dinimiciúil agus gné-saibhir atá deartha chun do leabharchoimeád a shimpliú agus do fhás gnó a threisiú. Bain sult as uirlisí iomasach, léargas fíor-ama, agus cur chuige fuinniúil ar do airgeadais."

