msgstr "Seo é Docker Compose uathoibríonn imscaradh a shuiteáil agus a oibriú Pixelfed mar shampla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment sets up PeerTube with integrated support for essential services such as a PostgreSQL database, Redis cache, and an NGINX reverse proxy for secure HTTPS termination and domain routing. The configuration supports advanced security settings, modular service scaling, and automated environment injection."
msgstr "Seo é Docker Compose cur i bhfeidhm PeerTube le tacaíocht chomhtháite do sheirbhísí riachtanacha amhail PostgreSQL bunachar sonraí, Redis taisce, agus seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais le haghaidh foirceannadh HTTPS slán agus ródú fearainn. Tacaíonn an chumraíocht suímh slándála chun cinn, scálú seirbhíse modúlach, agus instealladh timpeallacht uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker Compose deployment uses Ansible automation to launch pgAdmin together with necessary network and volume configurations. It enables you to centrally manage your PostgreSQL databases with the following core software features:"
msgstr "Seo é Docker Compose Úsáideann imscaradh uathoibriú Ansible a sheoladh pgAdmin mar aon le cumraíochtaí líonra agus toirt is gá. Cuireann sé ar chumas tú a bhainistiú go lárnach do PostgreSQL bunachair sonraí leis na gnéithe bogearraí croí seo a leanas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Docker deployment uses Ansible automation to set up Snipe‑IT along with necessary services such as a MariaDB database, an optional OAuth2 proxy for additional security, and a reverse proxy configuration. The system is built for reliable asset management in various environments."
msgstr "Úsáideann an imscaradh Docker uathoibriú Ansible a chur ar bun Snipe‑IT chomh maith le seirbhísí riachtanacha ar nós MariaDB bunachar sonraí, OAuth roghnach2 seachfhreastalaí le haghaidh slándála breise, agus cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Tá an córas tógtha le haghaidh bainistíochta sócmhainní iontaofa i dtimpeallachtaí éagsúla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This README accompanies the Hunspell Playbook, located within the ``infinito`` repository. The playbook is focused on installing Hunspell, a widely-used spell checker, along with various language packages to enhance its functionality."
msgstr "Seo README tionlacan na Hunspell Playbook, atá suite laistigh den ``infinito`` stór. Tá an leabhar súgartha dírithe ar shuiteáil Hunspell, seiceálaí litrithe a úsáidtear go forleathan, chomh maith le pacáistí teanga éagsúla chun feabhas a chur ar a fheidhmiúlacht."

