# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the new setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "Seo restarts freisin `docker.service` agus ansin glaonna `make network-refresh`, mar sin tá an Stack fhorbairt Infinito reáchtáil recreated nuair a bhíonn ceann gníomhach agus sroicheann an suíomh nua spásanna líonra coimeádán úr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This automated Docker Compose deployment streamlines the process by building a custom WordPress image (which includes tools like msmtp for email delivery) and configuring the necessary PHP settings, ensuring that your WordPress site is secure, scalable, and always up to date."
msgstr "Seo uathoibrithe Docker Compose an próiseas a shruthlíniú trí saincheaptha a thógáil WordPress íomhá íomhá (lena n-áirítear uirlisí cosúil le msmtp do sheachadadh ríomhphoist) agus a chumrú na socruithe PHP is gá, ag cinntiú go bhfuil do WordPress Tá an suíomh slán, inscálaithe, agus i gcónaí suas go dtí seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids ABI and SONAME mismatches on rolling or less frequently rebuilt distributions."
msgstr "Seachnaíonn sé seo mismatches ABI agus SONAME ar dáiltí rollta nó níos lú atógáil go minic."

