# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you're looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Seo coimeádán YOURLS Tá réiteach tógtha ar láidir Docker Compose agus uathoibriú Ansible. Simplíonn sé an próiseas imscaradh trí chomhtháthú le láraithe MariaDB bainistiú agus soláthar réamh-chumraithe seiceálacha sláinte agus suímh chomhshaoil. Cibé an bhfuil tú ag iarraidh a ghiniúint go tapa naisc i gcuimhne nó gá Analytics mionsonraithe, Tacaíonn an imscaradh do straitéis digiteach seamlessly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you’re looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Seo coimeádán YOURLS Tá réiteach tógtha ar láidir Docker Compose agus uathoibriú Ansible. Simplíonn sé an próiseas imscaradh trí chomhtháthú le láraithe MariaDB bainistiú agus soláthar réamh-chumraithe seiceálacha sláinte agus suímh chomhshaoil. Cibé an bhfuil tú ag iarraidh a ghiniúint go tapa naisc i gcuimhne nó gá Analytics mionsonraithe, Tacaíonn an imscaradh do straitéis digiteach seamlessly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This decision is **load-bearing**: openresty owns the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection). Migrating to Traefik in v1 would silently drop that pipeline — it has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial Yaegi-plugin port. Traefik migration is tracked as a Future Extension once edge-HA becomes worth the porting effort."
msgstr "Is é an cinneadh seo **ualach-tionchar**: openresty úinéireacht na `sys-front-inj-*` Lua comhlacht athscríobh píblíne (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logáil isteach instealladh snippet). Migrating go Traefik i v1 bheadh titim go ciúin go píblíne - níl aon choibhéis aige i Traefik gan calafort Yaegi-plugin neamh-trivial. Traefik imirce rianú mar Síneadh Todhchaí uair amháin imeall-HA thiocfaidh chun bheith fiú an iarracht porting."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This declares two variants. Variant 0 pins every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` to `enabled: true, shared: true` so the maximum-footprint baseline is explicit. Variant 1 keeps the same dynamic flags on and additionally flips Multisite on against three canonical domains."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn sé seo dhá leagan. Amharc ar gach eolas 0 bioráin gach seirbhís-eochair dinimiciúil ó `meta/services.yml` go dtí `enabled: true, shared: true` mar sin tá an íoslíne uas-chosc follasach. Amharc ar gach eolas 1 Coinníonn na bratacha dinimiciúil céanna ar agus freisin flips Multisite ar aghaidh trí fearainn Canonical."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This deployment simplifies LDAP management by presenting a modern web interface that lets you search, modify, and manage directory entries easily. It supports integration with external LDAP servers and works seamlessly behind a reverse proxy, allowing administrators to focus on core directory tasks rather than deployment intricacies."
msgstr "Simplíonn an imscaradh bainistíochta LDAP trí comhéadan gréasáin nua-aimseartha a ligeann duit cuardach a dhéanamh, a mhodhnú, agus iontrálacha eolaire a bhainistiú go héasca. Tacaíonn sé le comhtháthú le freastalaithe LDAP seachtrach agus oibríonn seamlessly taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, ag ligean do riarthóirí díriú ar thascanna eolaire lárnach seachas intricacies imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host application logic that belongs to an Ansible role."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR an eolaire seo loighic iarratais óstach a bhaineann le ról Ansible."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST NOT host host-side tooling. Scripts that run on the developer or CI host belong under their workflow-specific path (for example `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."
msgstr "Seo eolaire MUST NACH óstáil ósta-taobh tooling. Baineann scripteanna a reáchtáiltear ar an bhforbróir nó ar óstach CI faoina gcosán sreafa-shonrach oibre (mar shampla `scripts/tests/`, `scripts/image/`, `scripts/meta/`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only files consumed by the `coredns` compose service."
msgstr "An MUST eolaire bhfuil ach comhaid a chaitear ag an `coredns` seirbhís a chumadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory MUST contain only scripts that execute inside the `infinito` container, either as the container entrypoint, as a Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, or as a `systemd` unit hook."
msgstr "Tá an MUST eolaire ach scripteanna a fhorghníomhú taobh istigh den `infinito` coimeádán, mar an iontráil coimeádán, mar Docker `HEALTHCHECK`, nó mar `systemd` Hook aonad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Ansible collection requirement files used by the installation logic."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire comhaid riachtanas bailiúchán Ansible a úsáideann an loighic a shuiteáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Jinja2 templates for different NGINX `location` blocks, each designed to proxy and optimize different types of web traffic. These templates are used by the `sys-svc-proxy` role to modularize and standardize reverse proxy configuration across a wide variety of applications."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Jinja2 teimpléid do NGINX éagsúla `location` bloic, gach deartha chun seachfhreastalaí agus cineálacha éagsúla tráchta gréasáin a bharrfheabhsú. Tá na teimpléid a úsáideann an `sys-svc-proxy` ról a mhodhnú agus a chaighdeánú cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí ais ar fud réimse leathan na n-iarratas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains Pull Request-specific resolver scripts used by the PR workflow."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Poll Iarratas-sonrach scripteanna réiteora a úsáideann an sreabhadh oibre PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains action-oriented runbooks for agent work. Its scope is how agents should develop, debug, test, refactor, commit, and handle pull requests while staying aligned with repository policy."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire runbooks gníomh-dhírithe le haghaidh oibre gníomhaire. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas ba cheart do ghníomhairí iarrataí tarraingthe a fhorbairt, a dhífhabhtú, a thástáil, a fhrachtóir, a dhéanamh, agus a láimhseáil agus iad ag fanacht ailínithe leis an mbeartas stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing configuration references for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is the global and per-application settings operators adjust through inventory, group vars, and application overrides."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire riarthóir-facing tagairtí chumraíocht Infinito.Nexus. Is é a raon feidhme na hoibreoirí suímh domhanda agus in aghaidh an iarratais a choigeartú trí fhardal, vars grúpa, agus overrides i bhfeidhm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains administrator-facing operational guides for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is CLI installation, inventory creation, and deploy and redeploy flows for running environments."
msgstr "Tá treoracha oibriúcháin riarthacha ag an eolaire seo le haghaidh Infinito.Nexus. Is é a raon feidhme suiteáil CLI, cruthú fardal, agus sreabhadh imscaradh agus ath-imlonnú do thimpeallachtaí ag rith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for `group_vars` files. Its scope is how automated changes should handle shared application inventory data, lookup overrides, and related variable definitions."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir gníomhaire do `group_vars` comhaid. Is é a raon feidhme conas ba cheart athruithe uathoibrithe a láimhseáil sonraí fardail iarratais roinnte, overrides Lookup, agus sainmhínithe athraitheacha gaolmhara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains agent guidance for role-local implementation files. Its scope is CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, and other role-specific files that require consistent behavior during automated edits."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir gníomhaire do ról-áitiúil comhaid a chur i bhfeidhm. Is é a raon feidhme CSS, JavaScript, Playwright, agus comhaid ró-sonrach eile a éilíonn iompar comhsheasmhach le linn eagarthóireachta uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains all deployable bundles for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire gach bundles in-imlonnaithe do Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains automation scripts used across the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna uathoibrithe a úsáidtear ar fud an tionscadail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub Container Registry usage. Its scope is authentication, cleanup, and other GHCR-specific operational concerns in the repository."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora le haghaidh GitHub Clárlann úsáid. Tá a raon feidhme fíordheimhnithe, cleanup, agus imní oibriúcháin GHCR-sonrach eile sa stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for GitHub governance and repository controls. Its scope is branch protection, repository settings, GitHub Actions workflows and variables, and other platform rules that affect contributions."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora do GitHub rialachas agus rialuithe stór. Is é a raon feidhme cosaint brainse, suímh stór, GitHub Gníomhartha sreabhadh oibre agus athróg, agus rialacha ardán eile a théann i bhfeidhm ar ranníocaíochtaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for Infinito.Nexus shared services. Its scope is the model that defines how shared services are declared, discovered, loaded, injected, and consumed, plus the per-service contracts that role authors and consumers MUST follow."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora Infinito.Nexus seirbhísí comhroinnte. Is é a raon feidhme an tsamhail a shainmhíníonn conas a seirbhísí roinnte a dhearbhú, fuair sé amach, luchtaithe, instealladh, agus a chaitear, chomh maith leis na conarthaí in aghaidh na seirbhíse a ró-údair agus tomhaltóirí MUST leanúint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for automated tests. Its scope is how lint, unit, integration, regression, and Playwright coverage should be structured, selected, and validated."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora le haghaidh tástálacha uathoibrithe. Is é a raon feidhme conas ba chóir lint, aonad, comhtháthú, aischéimniú, agus clúdach Playwright a struchtúrú, a roghnú, agus a bhailíochtú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for code design and implementation. Its scope is architecture, service wiring, coding principles, exceptions, and the boundaries that shape maintainable changes."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora do dhearadh cód agus a chur i bhfeidhm. Is é a raon feidhme ailtireacht, sreangú seirbhíse, prionsabail códaithe, eisceachtaí, agus na teorainneacha a chruth athruithe inchothabhála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for container image artefacts. Its scope is how images are declared, discovered, mirrored, and maintained across the repository and CI flow."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora do artefacts íomhá coimeádán. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas a dhearbhaítear, a aimsítear, a léirítear, agus a choinnítear ar fud an stór agus sreabhadh CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for local environments. Its scope is setup, supported operating systems, variables, and resource constraints for running the project safely on a workstation."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora do thimpeallachtaí áitiúla. Tá a raon feidhme thus, tacaíocht córais oibriúcháin, athróg, agus srianta acmhainní do reáchtáil an tionscadail go sábháilte ar stáisiún oibre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for project tools. Its scope is how repository-standard tools should be used, when they apply, and where they fit into the wider workflow."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora le haghaidh uirlisí tionscadail. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas ba cheart uirlisí caighdeánacha a úsáid, nuair a bhíonn feidhm acu, agus nuair is cuí leo sa sreabhadh oibre níos leithne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor guidance for team collaboration, communication, and organisational processes. Its scope is how contributors communicate, document their work, and apply agile principles across the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora do chomhoibriú foirne, cumarsáid, agus próisis eagrúcháin. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas a dhéanann rannchuiditheoirí cumarsáid, a gcuid oibre a dhoiciméadú, agus prionsabail aoise a chur i bhfeidhm ar fud shaolré an tionscadail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Ansible lookup plugins under [plugins/lookup/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Its scope is how the project exposes merged configuration data to runtime consumers without materializing repository-wide facts."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora le haghaidh plugins Lookup Ansible faoi [Breiseáin/cookup/](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/). Is é a raon feidhme conas a nochtann an tionscadal sonraí cumraíochta chumasc do thomhaltóirí runtime gan fíricí ar fud an stór materializing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for Git-managed artefacts and CI/CD pipeline conventions. Its scope is how branches, commits, pull requests, the CI/CD pipeline, and the maintainer's fork-based remote layout MUST be structured and used in this repository."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora Git- déantúsáin agus coinbhinsiúin píblíne CI/CD a bhainistiú. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas a dhéanann brainsí, cimithe, iarrataí tarraingthe, an píblíne CI / CD, agus MUST leagan amach iargúlta forc-bhunaithe an choimeádaí a struchtúrú agus a úsáid sa stór seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for `README.md` files stored inside documentation directories. Its scope is purpose, scope, and navigation behavior for docs-scoped READMEs."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora `README.md` comhaid a stóráil stiúrthóireachtaí doiciméid taobh istigh. Is é a raon feidhme cuspóir, raon feidhme, agus iompar loingseoireachta doics-cóip READMEs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for files under [plugins/](../../../../../plugins/). Its scope is how Ansible plugin sources MUST be structured so that runtime consumers, tests, and documentation stay aligned."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora comhaid faoi [plugins/](../../../../../plugins/). Is é a raon feidhme conas foinsí breiseán Ansible MUST a struchtúrú ionas go mbeidh tomhaltóirí runtime, tástálacha, agus doiciméid fanacht ailínithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for project artefacts. Its scope is how repository-managed files and generated delivery artefacts should be documented, structured, and maintained."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora le haghaidh déantúsóirí tionscadail. Is é a raon feidhme an chaoi ar cheart comhaid stór-bhainistithe agus déantáin seachadta ginte a dhoiciméadú, struchtúrtha, agus a chothabháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for role-local files. Its scope is how key artefacts inside roles should be written so generated behavior, documentation, and frontend overrides stay consistent."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora do chomhaid ról-áitiúil. Is é a raon feidhme conas ba chóir monaí eochair taobh istigh róil a scríobh iompar, doiciméadú, agus overrides tosaigh fanacht comhsheasmhach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor rules for specific repository file types. Its scope is authoring expectations for human-facing files whose structure and meaning must stay consistent across the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha rannchuiditheora le haghaidh cineálacha comhaid stór ar leith. Is é a raon feidhme ionchais údar do chomhaid daonna-facing nach mór a struchtúr agus a bhrí fanacht comhsheasmhach ar fud an tionscadail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor workflow guidance. Its scope is branch strategy, commits, testing, local deploys, CI, review, pull requests, releases, and the end-to-end path from local change to merged contribution."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir sreabhadh oibre rannchuiditheora. Is é an raon feidhme straitéis brainse, tiomantas, tástáil, imscaradh áitiúil, CI, athbhreithniú, iarrataí a tharraingt, scaoileadh, agus an cosán deireadh-le-deireadh ó athrú áitiúil chun ranníocaíocht a chumasc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains contributor-facing repository rules and workflows. Its scope is how humans and agents set up the environment, write documentation, communicate, define requirements, and contribute safely through the project lifecycle."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire rialacha stór ranníocóir-facing agus sreabhadh oibre. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná conas a bhunaigh daoine agus gníomhairí an timpeallacht, doiciméid a scríobh, ceanglais a chur in iúl, a shainiú, agus cur go sábháilte tríd an saolré tionscadail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible filter plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire saincheaptha **Breiseáin scagaire Ansible** a úsáidtear laistigh den Infinito.Nexus tionscadal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains custom **Ansible lookup plugins** used within the Infinito.Nexus project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire saincheaptha **Breiseáin Lookup Ansible** a úsáidtear laistigh den Infinito.Nexus tionscadal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains debugging guidance for contributor workflows. Its scope is how to investigate failures in CI, networking, and related development loops."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir debugging do shreabhadh oibre rannchuiditheora. Is é a raon feidhme conas a imscrúdú teipeanna i CI, líonrú, agus lúbanna forbartha gaolmhara."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains default variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire comhaid sainmhíniú athróg réamhshocraithe le haghaidh `svc-db-mariadb` Ról inghlactha. Déanann sé gach luachanna configurable a bhaineann le MariaDB imscaradh agus is féidir iad a choigeartú gan loighic tasc a mhodhnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains documentation for contributors working alongside AI coding agents in this project. It covers shared agent guidelines that apply regardless of the AI tool used, as well as tool-specific permission references and security rationale for each supported agent."
msgstr "Tá doiciméadú do rannchuiditheoirí ag obair in éineacht le gníomhairí códaithe AI sa tionscadal seo. Clúdaíonn sé treoirlínte gníomhaire roinnte a bhfuil feidhm acu beag beann ar an uirlis AI a úsáidtear, chomh maith le tagairtí cead-shonrach uirlis agus réasúnaíocht slándála do gach gníomhaire tacaíocht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains file-scoped guidance for automated edits. Its scope is machine-readable rules that apply when an agent modifies specific repository file types or configuration areas."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir comhad-cóip le haghaidh eagarthóireachta uathoibrithe. Is é a raon feidhme rialacha atá inléite ag meaisín a bhfuil feidhm acu nuair a athraíonn gníomhaire cineálacha sonracha comhaid stór nó réimsí cumraíochta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains gating helpers that decide whether a tagged commit is eligible for release. The current gate enforces that the version-tag commit is contained in `origin/main`, so version tags pushed from feature branches cannot trigger a release. Helpers MUST be invoked from release-related workflows only and MUST NOT be treated as a substitute for branch protection; the gate is an additional check on top of, not a replacement for, the repository's branch-protection rules."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí gating a chinneadh cibé an bhfuil tiomantas clib incháilithe le haghaidh scaoileadh. Forfheidhmíonn an geata reatha go bhfuil an leagan-tag tiomantas atá i `origin/main`, mar sin ní féidir le clibeanna leagan bhrú ó bhrainsí gné spreagadh scaoileadh. Cabhracha MUST a agairt ó shreabhadh oibre a bhaineann le scaoileadh amháin agus NACH MUST a chóireáil mar ionad cosanta brainse; Is é an geata seiceáil bhreise ar bharr, ní athsholáthair le haghaidh, rialacha cosanta brainse an stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains generic wait and polling scripts used by workflow automation."
msgstr "Tá fanacht cineálach agus scripteanna vótála a úsáidtear ag uathoibriú sreabhadh oibre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helper scripts and binaries that are installed on the host to provide **container-related runtime functionality** for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna cúntóir agus binaries atá suiteáilte ar an óstach a chur ar fáil **feidhmiúlacht runtime coimeádán a bhaineann** le haghaidh Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers invoked from workflows that listen on `pull_request_target`, `push`, and `delete`. The helpers call the GitHub Actions API to cancel runs made obsolete by a closed PR, a deleted branch, or a newer commit on the same PR or branch. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows that have not received one of those events, because cancelling unrelated runs would mask real failures and waste accumulated work."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí agairt ó shreabhadh oibre a éisteacht ar `pull_request_target`, `push`, agus `delete`. Iarrann na cúntóirí na GitHub Actions API a chur ar ceal Ritheann déanta as feidhm ag PR dúnta, brainse a scriosadh, nó níos nuaí tiomantas ar an PR céanna nó brainse. Helpers MUST NACH a dtugtar ó shreabhadh oibre nach bhfuair ceann de na himeachtaí, toisc go mbeadh ar ceal Ritheann neamhghaolmhara masc teipeanna fíor agus obair carntha dramhaíola."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains helpers that mutate persistent on-host state during purge flows."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí a mutate staid leanúnach ar-óstach le linn sreabhadh purge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains host-level helpers: disk-space reclamation and reporting, swap-file enlargement, Docker-daemon cleanup, and post-failure diagnostic dumps. Helpers MUST be invoked from workflow `run:` blocks under [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) and MUST NOT be called from application code, Ansible roles, or any runtime path outside CI. They assume a GitHub-hosted Ubuntu runner and modify host-kernel state (mount points, swap, Docker storage) that does not exist inside the `infinito` container."
msgstr "Tá an t-eolaire Cúntóirí leibhéal óstach: athshlánú diosca-spás agus tuairisciú, méadú swap-comhaid, Docker-daemon cleanup, agus dumpaí diagnóiseacha iar-failure. Cabhraíonn MUST agairt ó shreabhadh oibre `run:` bloic faoi [`.github/workflows/`](../../../.github/workflows/) agus NÍ MÓR a dtugtar ó cód iarratais, róil Ansible, nó aon cosán runtime lasmuigh CI. Glacann siad dara háit Ubuntu GitHub-óstach agus modhnaíonn siad stát óstach-ceireal (pointí mount, swap, stóráil Docker) nach bhfuil ann taobh istigh de `infinito` coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains language-specific coding guidance. Its scope is conventions that only apply to particular implementation languages when the general code rules need narrower detail."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir códaithe teanga-sonrach. Is é a raon feidhme coinbhinsiúin nach mbaineann ach le teangacha cur chun feidhme áirithe nuair is gá na rialacha cód ginearálta sonraí níos cúinge."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains machine-readable guidance for AI agents working in this repository. Its scope is agent behavior, required workflows, and specialized instruction files that extend [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for automated execution."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir meaisín- inléite do ghníomhairí AI ag obair sa stór. Is é a raon feidhme iompar gníomhaire, sreafaí oibre ag teastáil, agus comhaid teagaisc speisialaithe a leathnú [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) le haghaidh forghníomhú uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains meta-level guidance for agent behavior. Its scope is purpose, ethics, help paths, communication style, and other repository-wide framing for automated contributors."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir meta-leibhéal d'iompar gníomhaire. Is é a raon feidhme cuspóir, eitic, cosáin cabhrú, stíl cumarsáide, agus eile stór-chomhtháthú ar fud do rannchuiditheoirí uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains operational documentation for the Nextcloud role in Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Tá doiciméadú oibríochtúil san eolaire seo don Nextcloud ról i Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific environment setup guidance. Its scope is operating-system differences that affect local development and execution."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir thus timpeallacht ardán-shonrach. Is é a raon feidhme difríochtaí córas oibriúcháin a théann i bhfeidhm ar fhorbairt agus fhorghníomhú áitiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for enabling systemd in environments where it is not active by default. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna ardán-sonrach do chumasú córasaithe i dtimpeallachtaí áit nach bhfuil sé gníomhach de réir réamhshocraithe. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for setting up local DNS resolution for the `infinito.test` domain (and subdomains) on the development machine."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna ardán-sonrach do bhunú réiteach DNS áitiúil don `infinito.test` fearann (agus subdomains) ar an meaisín forbartha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains platform-specific scripts for trusting the Infinito Root CA certificate on the developer's machine. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna ardán-shonrach chun muinín an deimhniú Infinito Root CA ar an bhforbróir meaisín. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project requirements documents. Its scope is user stories and acceptance criteria that define what the project must do and that guide agent-assisted implementation."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire doiciméid riachtanais tionscadail. Is é an raon feidhme atá aige ná scéalta úsáideoirí agus critéir ghlactha a shainíonn cad is gá don tionscadal a dhéanamh agus an treoir sin a chur i bhfeidhm gníomhaire-cúnamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project-specific Ansible modules used by Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire modúil Ansible tionscadal-sonrach a úsáideann Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire réiteoirí íon a léamh stát stór (stair git, meiteashonraí ról, clibeanna leagan, athróg timpeallacht ionchur) agus astaíonn luachanna a réiteach trí `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` nó stdout. MUST a bheith idempotent agus MUST NACH stór mutate nó stát cláraithe thar scríobh chuig `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. Is iad na hábhair imní faoi chumhdach réiteach whitelist app diff-driven, an `🧩 Subset` logo dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, a picks idir an fo-thacar PR-comhlacht agus an réiteoir diff), scaoileadh-tag bhrath, fionnachtain app don maitrís imscaradh, agus a bhrath athrú go geataí an phíblíne cothrom le dáta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire réiteoirí stór-shonrach a úsáidtear ar fud sreabhadh oibre agus Cúntóirí sliogáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna réiteora do bhrath artifacts díorthaithe ar iarraidh agus meiteashonraí a scaoileadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing TLS/PKI concerns in the Infinito Nexus development environment. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna do bhainistiú TLS / imní PKI i dtimpeallacht forbartha Infinito Nexus. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing systemd across different platforms and environments used in Infinito Nexus development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna do bhainistiú córasach ar fud ardáin éagsúla agus timpeallachtaí a úsáidtear i bhforbairt Infinito Nexus. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts related to the image lifecycle used by the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna a bhaineann leis an saolré íomhá a úsáideann an tionscadal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that install and bootstrap host-side tooling used by the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna a shuiteáil agus buataisítrap ósta-taobh tooling a úsáideann an tionscadal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that resolve metadata and derived values used by the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna a réiteach meiteashonraí agus luachanna díorthaithe a úsáideann an tionscadal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts that run repository lint checks."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire scripteanna a reáchtáil seiceálacha lint stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains security guidance for Infinito.Nexus users and administrators. Its scope is operational security expectations, reporting paths, and role-specific hardening advice."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir slándála Infinito.Nexus úsáideoirí agus riarthóirí. Tá a raon feidhme ionchais slándála oibriúcháin, cosáin tuairiscithe, agus comhairle cruaite ról-sonrach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shared Python helpers used by custom modules and plugins."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí Python roinnte in úsáid ag modúil saincheaptha agus plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains shell helpers that synchronize repository refs before later workflow jobs derive CI scope from git history."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí sliogáin a shioncrónú refs stór roimh post sreabhadh oibre níos déanaí a dhíorthaíonn raon feidhme CI ó stair git."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the AppArmor-facing maintenance layer for the local and CI development experience."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire an ciseal cothabhála AppArmor-facing don taithí forbartha áitiúil agus CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` applied to every host in the inventory. It holds the shared baseline that every role and every host-specific var can build on top of."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire [An bhfuil tú](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_variables.html) `group_vars` i bhfeidhm ar gach óstach san fhardal. Tá sé an bonnlíne roinnte gur féidir le gach ról agus gach var óstach-sonrach a thógáil ar bharr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the helpers invoked by [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) to bump pinned upstream versions and open a pull request once per day. The helpers are thin wrappers: the image-version and repository-ref bumpers delegate to Python CLIs under [cli/contributing/](../../../cli/contributing/) that scan `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and rewrite version pins in place; the PR-open helper commits, force-pushes the update branch, and creates or refreshes the PR via `gh`. Helpers MUST NOT be called from workflows other than `🔄 Update versions`; the `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` gate is enforced once, at the workflow's job level, and bypassing it from another caller would create PRs even when auto-updates are intentionally disabled."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na Cúntóirí agairt ag [cron-update.yml](../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) a bump pinned leaganacha srutha agus a oscailt iarratas tarraingt uair amháin in aghaidh an lae. Is iad na cúntóirí fillteáin tanaí: an íomhá-leagan agus tuairteoirí stór-frith a tharmligean chuig Python CLIs faoi [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](../../../cli/contributing/) go scanadh `roles/*/meta/services.yml` agus bioráin leagan athscríobh i bhfeidhm; an cúntóir PR-oscailte tiomantas, force-pushes an brainse cothrom le dáta, agus cruthaíonn nó athnuachan an PR trí `gh`. Ní thugtar cabhair ó shreabhadh oibre seachas `🔄 Update versions`; an `CI_ENABLE_AUTO_UPDATES` Tá geata i bhfeidhm uair amháin, ag leibhéal poist an tsreabhadh oibre, agus go mbeadh seachbhóthar sé ó glaoiteoir eile a chruthú PR fiú nuair a bhíonn auto-updates faoi mhíchumas d'aon ghnó."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the iteration loops agents follow while driving a role end to end: the [Compose Loop](compose.md), the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), the [Playwright Spec Loop](playwright.md), the [Workflow Loop](workflow.md), and the cross-mode [Roundtrip Loop](roundtrip.md) gate that runs compose then swarm. Its scope is the mechanics of those loops."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na gníomhairí lúb atriall leanúint agus ag tiomáint deireadh ról: an [Naisc ábhartha eile](compose.md), an [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](swarm.md), an [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](playwright.md), an [Sreabhadh Oibre](workflow.md), agus an tras-mode [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](roundtrip.md) geata a ritheann chumadh ansin swarm. Is é a raon feidhme an Meicnic na lúb."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the modular workspace test suite for Infinito.Nexus. It validates the full local development flow from a clean state."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire seo an seomra tástála spás oibre modúlach do Infinito.Nexus. Bailíonn sé an sreabhadh forbartha áitiúil iomlán ó stát glan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the repository documentation published for Infinito.Nexus. Its scope is contributor guidance, agent instructions, operational guides, requirements, and security guidance across the project."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire doiciméadú stór foilsithe le haghaidh Infinito.Nexus. Is é a raon feidhme treoir rannchuiditheora, treoracha gníomhaire, treoracha oibriúcháin, ceanglais, agus treoir slándála ar fud an tionscadail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shared environment bootstrap layer for Infinito.Nexus scripts. ✨"
msgstr "Tá an eolaire ar an timpeallacht roinnte buataisí ciseal do Infinito.Nexus scripteanna. ✨"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains the shell helpers that [entry-pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) calls: resolving the languages LibreTranslate supports into the job matrix, merging the source strings of the `core` and `docs` domains into `locale/`, and machine-translating one language per runner."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na cúntóirí bhlaosc go [iontráil pr-translate.yml](../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-translate.yml) glaonna: na teangacha a réiteach LibreTranslate tacaíochtaí isteach sa maitrís post, chumasc na teaghráin foinse an `core` agus `docs` fearainn isteach `locale/`, agus meaisín-aistriú teanga amháin in aghaidh an dara háit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains variable definition files for the `svc-db-mariadb` Ansible role. It centralizes all configurable values related to MariaDB deployment and can be adjusted without modifying task logic."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire comhaid sainmhíniú athraitheach do `svc-db-mariadb` Ról inghlactha. Déanann sé gach luachanna configurable a bhaineann le MariaDB imscaradh agus is féidir iad a choigeartú gan loighic tasc a mhodhnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains workstation bundle skeletons."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire creatlach beart stáisiún oibre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents GitHub Actions in this repository."
msgstr "GitHub Gníomhartha sa stór seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory documents how agents MUST debug failures during agent work. Its scope covers three independent workflows: local deploys (debugged from live local output and local logs), GitHub Actions / CI run failures (fully automated triage that fetches logs and artefacts itself via `gh`), and ad-hoc inspection of log files manually placed in the repository workdir by the operator."
msgstr "Doiciméid eolaire conas gníomhairí MUST teipeanna debug le linn obair gníomhaire. Clúdaíonn a raon feidhme trí shreabhadh oibre neamhspleácha: imscaradh áitiúil (debugged ó aschur áitiúil beo agus logs áitiúla), GitHub Gníomhartha / CI teipeanna reáchtáil (triage go hiomlán uathoibrithe a fetches logs agus déantáin féin trí `gh`), agus ad-hoc iniúchadh comhaid logáil isteach curtha de láimh sa stór workdir ag an oibreoir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory follows the same high-level structure as `package-manager`:"
msgstr "Seo a leanas an t-eolaire an struchtúr céanna ardleibhéil mar `package-manager`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds DNS helpers used during development and environment preparation. The folder contains the local name-resolution setup and teardown logic used during development and environment preparation. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí DNS a úsáidtear le linn forbartha agus ullmhúchán comhshaoil. Tá an fillteán an t-ainm-réiteach áitiúil thus agus loighic teardown a úsáidtear le linn forbartha agus ullmhúchán comhshaoil. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds Docker-related network helpers. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí líonra Docker-a bhaineann leo. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds IPv6 enable and restore helpers for local development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). For the generic stack refresh helper used by `make network-refresh`, see [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire IPv6 ar chumas agus ar ais Cúntóirí d'fhorbairt áitiúil. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md). Maidir leis an cúntóir spólach cruach cineálach a úsáideann `make network-refresh`, féach [../docker/README.md](../docker/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds PHP files that the [web-app-wordpress](../../) role copies into the running container at `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire comhaid PHP go bhfuil an [web-app-wordpress](../../) cóipeanna ról isteach sa choimeádán ag rith ag `/var/www/html/wp-content/mu-plugins/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds container-side helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire cúntóirí coimeádán-taobh grú de réir ceantair. Bain úsáid as an README i ngach eolaire leanaí mar an pointe iontrála Canonical don réimse sin. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds host and system cleanup helpers. For container-local cleanup helpers, see [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire cabhracha óstach agus córas glanadh. Le haghaidh cúntóirí glanta coimeádán-áitiúil, féach [../../container/purge/README.md](../../container/purge/README.md). Maidir leis an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds network helpers grouped by area. Use the child README files for the DNS, Docker, and IPv6 details. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Cúntóirí líonra grúpáilte de réir ceantair. Bain úsáid as na comhaid README leanbh don DNS, Docker, agus IPv6 sonraí. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds system-facing helpers grouped by area. Use the README in each child directory as the canonical entry point for that area. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire cúntóirí córas-facing grúpáilte de réir ceantair. Bain úsáid as an README i ngach eolaire leanaí mar an pointe iontrála Canonical don réimse sin. Chun an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the Git workflow helper scripts. These helpers own the Git operations that the Claude sandbox denies, so they run under the operator's control with access to `~/.gnupg` and interactive `pinentry`. For the canonical command index, see [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire Git scripteanna cúntóir sreabhadh oibre. Na Cúntóirí féin ar an Git oibríochtaí a dhiúltaíonn an bosca gainimh Claude, mar sin ritheann siad faoi rialú an oibreora le rochtain ar `~/.gnupg` agus idirghníomhach `pinentry`. Maidir leis an innéacs ordú Canonical, féach [make.md](../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the architecture decision records of Infinito.Nexus. A record states one decision that shapes the system, the forces that constrain it, and what living with it costs."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire taifid cinneadh ailtireachta Infinito.Nexus. Deir taifead cinneadh amháin go cruthanna an córas, na fórsaí a srian é, agus cad ina gcónaí leis na costais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the cleanup helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na Cúntóirí cleanup faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/`. Do Cúntóirí áitiúla eile, úsáid [../README.md](../README.md). Maidir leis an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the container execution helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na cúntóirí fhorghníomhú coimeádán faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/`. Do Cúntóirí áitiúla eile, úsáid [../README.md](../README.md). Maidir leis an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the contributor guidance for how Infinito.Nexus integrates applications with the shared identity providers, Keycloak (OIDC) and OpenLDAP. Read the pages here before adding or changing any login, user-provisioning, or role-mapping code in a role."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire treoir rannchuiditheora maidir le conas Infinito.Nexus iarratais a chomhtháthú leis na soláthraithe comhaitheantais, Keycloak (OIDC) agus OpenLDAP. Léigh na leathanaigh anseo roimh aon logáil isteach, úsáideoir-provisioning, nó ról-mapping cód i ról a chur leis nó a athrú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable CI deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na sreabha executable CI imscaradh faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/ci/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable act deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire seo an gníomh inrite sreabhadh imscaradh faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/act/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the executable local deploy flows under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na sreabha imscaradh áitiúil inrite faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`."

