#, python-brace-format
msgid "This directory holds the in-container halves of the local deploy flows. Each script runs inside the development compose container (the repo is bind-mounted at `${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}`) and is invoked by a matching host wrapper under [apps/](../apps/README.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na halves in-atá an sreabhadh imscaradh áitiúil. Ritheann gach script taobh istigh den fhorbairt chum coimeádán (tá an repo ceangailte-mounted ag `${INFINITO_SRC_DIR}`) agus agairt ag fillteán óstach meaitseáil faoi [apps/](../apps/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the inventory refresh helpers under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/`. For other local helpers, use [../README.md](../README.md). For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Tá an t-eolaire seo na cúntóirí athnuachana fardal faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/local/reset/`. Do Cúntóirí áitiúla eile, úsáid [../README.md](../README.md). Maidir leis an Canonical Déan innéacs sprioc agairt na Cúntóirí, féach [make.md](../../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory holds the local deploy flows for one or more applications. For the higher-level overview, prerequisites, and naming rationale, see [README.md](../README.md)."
msgstr "Tá an eolaire na sreabha imscaradh áitiúil le haghaidh iarratas amháin nó níos mó. Maidir leis an forbhreathnú ardleibhéil, réamhriachtanais, agus réasúnaíocht ainmniú, féach [README.md](../README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
