# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory hosts the Python implementation behind `make dotenv`. For the general rules that govern READMEs in code directories see [documentation.md](../../docs/contributing/documentation.md). For the per-variable defaults that this code consumes see [default.env](../../default.env)."
msgstr "Seo eolaire hóstach ar an chur i bhfeidhm Python taobh thiar de `make dotenv`. Maidir leis na rialacha ginearálta a rialaíonn READMEanna i eolairí cóid féach [documentation.md](../../docs/contributing/documentation.md). Maidir leis na mainneachtainí in aghaidh an-éagsúil a itheann an cód a fheiceáil [default.env](../../default.env)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
