# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This is the mechanism that lets variants control whether a shared service is pulled in: a variant override pins `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` to a literal boolean; the round's include resolution reads the variant-merged services map; the provider role's group materialises in (or drops out of) the inventory accordingly."
msgstr "Is é seo an mheicníocht a ligeann malairtí rialú cibé an bhfuil seirbhís roinnte ceirteacha tarraingthe i: bioráin override malairt `services.<service>.{enabled,shared}` le boolean litriúil; I measc an bhabhta ar réiteach léann an léarscáil seirbhísí athraitheach chumasc; an ról an tsoláthraí ábhar grúpa i (nó titeann amach as) an fardal dá réir sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is the one clause that carries a hard guarantee, so it is enforced rather than asserted. In compose the agent role reads the runtime the container actually received and refuses the deploy when it is `runc`. In swarm the node reads its own default runtime and refuses the sandbox label while that is still `runc`, because the label is what routes sandboxed services to it. A lint additionally refuses a privileged container, a host network, pid, ipc or user namespace, and a host docker socket in any role that declares the sandbox, since any one of those hands the workload back to the host and cancels the runtime."
msgstr "Is é seo an clásal amháin a iompraíonn ráthaíocht chrua, mar sin tá sé i bhfeidhm seachas a dhearbhú. I chumadh an ról gníomhaire léann an runtime an coimeádán a fuarthas iarbhír agus diúltaíonn an imscaradh nuair a bhíonn sé `runc`. I swarm léann an nód a runtime réamhshocraithe féin agus diúltaíonn an lipéad bosca gainimh agus go bhfuil fós `runc`, toisc go bhfuil an lipéad cad bealaí seirbhísí sandboxed dó. Diúltaíonn lint coimeádán phribhléid, líonra óstach, pid, ipc nó ainmspás úsáideora, agus soicéad docker óstach in aon ról a dhearbhaíonn an bosca gainimh, ós rud é aon cheann de na lámha an t-ualach oibre ar ais go dtí an ósta agus cuireann sé ar ceal an runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is the pipeline the deploy jobs discover through, and the single place the run's shape is decided:"
msgstr "Is é seo an píblíne na poist imscaradh amach trí, agus tá an áit amháin ar an cruth a reáchtáil ar chinneadh:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This keeps the main timeline readable as a high-level overview and prevents important messages from being buried in back-and-forth discussion."
msgstr "Coinníonn sé seo an príomh-amlíne inléite mar forbhreathnú ardleibhéil agus cuireann sé cosc ar theachtaireachtaí tábhachtacha ó bheith curtha i ndíospóireacht chúl-agus-forth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This lookup is the single sanctioned way to derive the Keycloak group path that an application role maps to. It replaces the scattered `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` idiom so the per-application OU hierarchy has one authoritative producer."
msgstr "Is é seo an Lookup an bealach amháin a cheadaítear a dhíorthaíonn an Keycloak cosán grúpa go bhfuil rólchláir léarscáileanna chun. Tagann sé in ionad an scaipthe `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` idiom mar sin tá an ordlathas OU per-iarratas táirgeoir údarásach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This major release migrates every role to the new meta/ layout with explicit per-role networks, ports, run_after, and info.yml metadata, introduces a variant-aware matrix-deploy planner, ships a process-wide YAML / file / registry caching stack, promotes 13+ apps from alpha to beta, and adds a lint corpus that pins the new conventions in CI."
msgstr "Migrates an scaoileadh mór gach ról leis an meta nua / leagan amach le líonraí follasach per-ról, calafoirt, run_after, agus info.yml meiteashonraí, tugann sé pleanóir maitrís-fiosrúcháin athraitheach isteach, longa YAML / comhad / clárlann caching Stack, cuireann sé chun cinn 13+ apps ó alfa go béite, agus cuireann corpus lint go bioráin na coinbhinsiúin nua i CI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This makes Home Assistant a natural [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP server role** and the concrete backend for the isolated-home-assistant scenario in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): the agent stays kernel-isolated and reaches the home only through this MCP surface, never through host access. Home Assistant runs natively on `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, so it co-locates with the Pi agent story."
msgstr "Déanann sé seo Home Assistant nádúrtha [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **Ról freastalaí MCP** agus an cúlú coincréite don chás scoite-bhaile-cúnamhach i [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): fanann an gníomhaire eithne-olated agus sroicheann an baile ach amháin tríd an dromchla MCP, riamh trí rochtain óstach. Baile Cúntóir ar siúl ó dhúchas ar `arm64`/ Raspberry Pi, mar sin comh-locates sé leis an scéal gníomhaire Pi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This makes ``sys-svc-mail`` the canonical entrypoint for “mail capabilities” on a node, abstracting away whether the actual delivery happens via Mailu or a local relay."
msgstr "Déanann sé seo ``sys-svc-mail`` an iontráil Canonical le haghaidh “inniúlachtaí ríomhphoist” ar nód, a bhaint amach cibé an dtarlaíonn an seachadadh iarbhír trí Mailu nó Relay áitiúil."

