# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page describes the design of the Infinito.Nexus RBAC layer that provisions LDAP groups, synchronises them to Keycloak, and emits them as the OIDC `groups` claim. For IAM fundamentals that span both providers, see [common.md](common.md). For the LDAP server layer, see [ldap.md](ldap.md). For the OIDC client layer, see [oidc.md](oidc.md). Operator-facing steps live in [Administration RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."
msgstr "An leathanach seo cur síos ar an dearadh ar an Infinito.Nexus RBAC ciseal go forálacha grúpaí LDAP, synchronises iad a Keycloak, agus astaíonn iad mar an OIDC `groups` éileamh. Do bunúsacha IAM a théann trasna an dá soláthraithe, féach [common.md](common.md). Maidir leis an tsraith freastalaí LDAP, féach [ldap.md](ldap.md). Maidir leis an gciseal cliant OIDC, féach [oidc.md](oidc.md). céimeanna oibreora-facing beo i [Riarachán RBAC](../../../administration/configuration/rbac.md)."

