# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the OS-level sandbox configuration for Claude Code. The relevant keys live under `sandbox` in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). The sandbox is the **primary** containment layer in this project: because the allowlist uses the wildcard `Bash(*)` (with `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` as defence-in-depth), sandbox confinement, not the per-command allowlist, is what bounds the blast radius of Bash. The `allow`/`ask`/`deny` lists described in [settings.md](settings.md) remain in force on top of it as the policy gate."
msgstr "Doiciméid an leathanach seo an chumraíocht bosca gainimh OS-leibhéal do Claude Code. Na heochracha ábhartha beo faoi `sandbox` i [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json). Is é an bosca gainimh an **bunscoileanna bunscoile** ciseal srianadh sa tionscadal seo: toisc go n-úsáideann an liosta an cárta fiáin `Bash(*)` (le `autoAllowBashIfSandboxed` mar chosaint i doimhneacht), gaibhniú bosca gainimh, nach bhfuil an in aghaidh an-command allowlist, cad bounds an ga soinneáin de Bash. An bhfuil `allow`/ Baile`ask`/ Baile`deny` liostaí cur síos ar [settings.md](settings.md) fanacht i bhfeidhm ar a bharr mar an geata beartais."

