# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This process provides a streamlined way to manage Pixelfed users directly from the CLI in a Dockerized environment, ensuring that you can efficiently administer your Pixelfed instance without needing to access the Pixelfed web interface."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an próiseas ar bhealach sruthlínithe a bhainistiú Pixelfed úsáideoirí go díreach ón CLI i dtimpeallacht Dockerized, ag cinntiú gur féidir leat a riaradh go héifeachtach do Pixelfed mar shampla gan gá chun rochtain a fháil ar an Pixelfed comhéadan gréasáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This pulls in [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools) through the project's `dev` extras and puts `git-setup-remotes` and `git-sign-push` on `$PATH`."
msgstr "Tarraingíonn sé seo i [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools) tríd an tionscadal `dev` extras agus cuireann `git-setup-remotes` agus `git-sign-push` ar aghaidh `$PATH`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This purges the app's containers + volumes + Ansible-managed state on the host, then re-deploys. Use it once, then return to `mode=update` without `purge=true`. Do NOT loop with `purge=true`; if the failure survives a single purge it is not a state issue."
msgstr "Laghdaíonn sé seo coimeádáin an app + toirteanna + stát inláimhsithe ar an óstach, ansin ath-imlonnú. Úsáid sé uair amháin, ansin ar ais chuig `mode=update` gan `purge=true`. An bhfuil lúb NACH le `purge=true`; má mhaireann an teip purge amháin nach saincheist stáit é."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release delivers a major stability and reliability upgrade across the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It focuses on **deterministic deployments**, **robust TLS/CA handling**, **mirror-aware inventories**, and **CI/CD resilience**, while standardizing Docker service configuration across roles."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an scaoileadh seo cobhsaíocht mhór agus uasghrádú iontaofacht ar fud an Infinito.Nexus éiceachóras. Díríonn sé ar **imlonnú cinntitheach**, **Láimhseáil láidir TLS /CA**, **aireagóirí scáthán-aware**, agus **CI/CD athléimneacht**, agus a chaighdeánú chumraíocht seirbhíse Docker ar fud róil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release ensures that commits carrying a version tag trigger the full distro test matrix by detecting tags pointing at the current commit, while regular commits continue to run on a single random distro."
msgstr "Cinntíonn an scaoileadh go tiomantas a iompar tag leagan truicir an maitrís tástála distro iomlán trí bhrath clibeanna dírithe ar an tiomantas atá ann faoi láthair, cé go tiomantas rialta ar aghaidh a reáchtáil ar distro randamach amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release expands the application portfolio with new civic, ERP, feedback, and observability roles, replaces legacy generated runtime data with lookup-driven configuration and service loading, broadens Playwright end-to-end coverage across the stack, and hardens CI, local development, and deployment reliability."
msgstr "Leathnaíonn an scaoileadh seo an phunann iarratais le róil nua cathartha, ERP, aiseolas, agus inbhraiteacht, in ionad sonraí runtime oidhreacht ghintear le chumraíocht Lookup-tiomáinte agus luchtú seirbhíse, leathnaíonn Playwright clúdach deireadh-le-deireadh ar fud an chairn, agus hardens CI, forbairt áitiúil, agus iontaofacht imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release focuses on improving Matomo installation stability, aligning base images, and introducing automated CI image cleanup. **Improvements**"
msgstr "Díríonn an scaoileadh seo ar fheabhsú Matomo cobhsaíocht a shuiteáil, íomhánna bonn a ailíniú, agus glanadh íomhá CI uathoibrithe a thabhairt isteach. **Amharc ar gach eolas**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release improves CI and developer tooling robustness by fixing hardlink-related errors, stabilizing workflow triggers, resolving type-checking import cycles, and hardening cleanup and teardown logic across the CLI and templating utilities."
msgstr "Feabhsaíonn an scaoileadh seo láidreacht uirlisí CI agus forbróir trí earráidí a bhaineann le nasc crua a shocrú, truicir sreabhadh oibre a chobhsú, timthriallta iompórtála iompórtála a réiteach, agus loighic glanta agus teardown a mhúscailt ar fud an CLI agus fóntais templating."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This release lands the matrix-deploy hardening pass, an interactive console for the CLI, the bundles workflow, a per-consumer Postgres builder, a shared Playwright persona library across every web role, a SPOT env pipeline under the `INFINITO_` namespace, and a new education-suite bundle (openwebui + mailu) alongside the KIX Service Management role."
msgstr "Tailte an scaoileadh seo an pas cruaite maitrís, consól idirghníomhach don CLI, sreabhadh oibre na bundles, tógálaí per-tomhaltóir Postgres, leabharlann persona Playwright roinnte ar fud gach ról gréasáin, píblíne env faoin `INFINITO_` ainmspás, agus nua oideachais-oiriúnach bundle (Déan teagmháil anois) taobh leis an KIX Ról Bainistíochta na Seirbhíse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses a fork-based workflow. Contributors MUST NOT configure the remote layout by hand. Remote setup and signed pushes are handled by [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), declared as a dev dependency in [pyproject.toml](../../../../pyproject.toml)."
msgstr "Úsáideann an stór seo sreabhadh oibre forc-bhunaithe. Contributors NACH chumrú an leagan amach iargúlta de láimh. Tá thus cianda agus pushes sínithe láimhseáil ag [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), dearbhaithe mar spleáchas dev i [pyproject.toml](../../../../pyproject.toml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses a strict fork-first workflow. You MUST NOT commit directly to `main`. You MUST do all work in your own fork and MUST open Pull Requests from your fork back to the main repository."
msgstr "Úsáideann an stór seo sreabhadh oibre dian forc-chéad. NÍ MÓR duit tiomantas go díreach chuig `main`. MÓR duit gach obair a dhéanamh i do forc féin agus MUST Iarratais Pull oscailte ó do forc ar ais go dtí an príomh-stóras."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This repository uses several test and validation types:"
msgstr "Úsáideann an stór seo roinnt cineálacha tástála agus bailíochtaithe:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement closes that gap consistently across the role tree rather than role by role."
msgstr "Dúnann an ceanglas seo an bhearna sin go comhsheasmhach ar fud an chrainn ról seachas ról de réir ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers requirement and design work only. It does not authorize enabling a new MCP endpoint, upgrading an application, installing an upstream plugin, or widening a credential in the same change that introduces this document."
msgstr "Clúdaíonn an ceanglas seo riachtanas agus obair deartha amháin. Ní chuireann sé údar ar chumas endpoint MCP nua, uasghrádú iarratas, shuiteáil breiseán réamhtheachtach, nó leathnú dintiúir san athrú céanna a thugann isteach an doiciméad seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers the catalogs, their extraction, their machine translation and their validation. Serving the catalogs is [038 - web-svc-api](README.md#archive); consuming them inside core roles is [039 - Core i18n Consumers](039-core-i18n-consumers.md). The consumer repositories (infinito-nexus-gui, meta-infinite-graph, portfolio) keep their own interface strings in their own gettext catalogs and switch only after 037 to 039 are green."
msgstr "Clúdaíonn an ceanglas seo na catalóga, a n-eastóscadh, a n-aistriúchán meaisín agus a bhailíochtú. Ag freastal ar na catalóga [038 - - - - - web-svc-api](README.md#archive); Tógann iad taobh istigh róil croí [039 - Croí i18n Tomhaltóirí](039-core-i18n-consumers.md). Repositories an tomhaltóra (infinito-nexus-gui, meitea-finite-graph, punainne) a choinneáil ar a gcuid teaghráin comhéadan féin ina gcatalóga gettext féin agus athrú ach amháin tar éis 037 go dtí 039 tá siad glas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement covers two related but separable deliverables:"
msgstr "Clúdaíonn an ceanglas seo dhá insoláthartha gaolmhara ach inscartha:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement extends [025 - MCP Role Integration](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Requirement 025 defines the initial MCP metadata and the first Open WebUI integration; this requirement defines the exhaustive role audit, proxy and workflow-adapter contract, client reconciliation, and the conditions under which the remaining roles may be integrated."
msgstr "Síneann an ceanglas seo [025 - Comhtháthú Ról MCP](025-mcp-role-integration.md). Riachtanas 025 Sainmhíníonn na meiteashonraí MCP tosaigh agus an chéad Open WebUI comhtháthú; Sainmhíníonn an ceanglas seo an t-iniúchadh ról uileghabhálach, an seachvótálaí agus an conradh sreabhadh oibre, an t-athmhuintearas cliaint, agus na coinníollacha faoina bhféadfar na róil atá fágtha a chomhtháthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This requirement moves the core roles that render translated text onto the catalogs of [037 - Gettext Catalogs with LibreTranslate Autotranslation](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) and opens the API of [038 - web-svc-api](README.md#archive) to browser consumers. The consumer repositories change afterwards and are not part of this requirement."
msgstr "Gluaiseann an ceanglas seo na róil lárnacha a fhágann téacs aistrithe isteach ar na catalóga de [037 - Catalóga Gettext le LibreTranslate Autotranslation](037-gettext-catalogs-libretranslate.md) agus osclaíonn an API de [038 - - - - - web-svc-api](README.md#archive) do thomhaltóirí bhrabhsálaí. Athraíonn stórtha an tomhaltóra ina dhiaidh sin agus níl siad mar chuid den riachtanas seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This restore path also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the restored setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "An cosán ar ais atosú freisin `docker.service` agus ansin glaonna `make network-refresh`, mar sin tá an Stack fhorbairt Infinito ag rith recreated nuair a bhíonn ceann gníomhach agus sroicheann an suíomh ar ais spásanna líonra coimeádán úr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role **does not ship the installer script** and therefore requires network access during installation."
msgstr "An ról seo **nach long an script suiteálaí** agus dá bhrí sin éilíonn rochtain líonra le linn a shuiteáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role adapts iptables rules to enable proper connectivity for a WireGuard client running behind a NAT or firewall. It ensures that traffic is forwarded correctly by applying necessary masquerading rules."
msgstr "Déanann an ról seo rialacha iptables a chur ar chumas nascacht chuí do chliant WireGuard ag rith taobh thiar de NAT nó balla dóiteáin. Cinntíonn sé go gcuirtear an trácht ar aghaidh i gceart trí rialacha riachtanacha a chur i bhfeidhm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` to:"
msgstr "Tugann an ról seo aghaidh ar shaincheist choiteann ar ríomhairí glúine Linux: an clúdach a dhúnadh agus mar thoradh ar codlata nó hibernation gan choinne. Cuireann sé na huirlisí hibernation is gá agus nuashonruithe `/etc/systemd/logind.conf` go:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role addresses a common issue on Linux laptops: closing the lid while docked or plugged in leads to unintended sleep or hibernation. It installs the necessary hibernation tools and updates ``/etc/systemd/logind.conf`` to:"
