# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates essential GNOME desktop roles (including caffeine, extensions, and terminal) for a complete GNOME environment on Linux."
msgstr "Comhiomláin an ról seo róil deisce GNOME riachtanach (lena n-áirítear caiféin, síntí, agus críochfort) do thimpeallacht GNOME iomlán ar Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role aggregates various GNOME desktop components to ensure a cohesive and fully functional GNOME environment on Arch Linux. It includes the installation and configuration of several sub-roles:"
msgstr "Comhiomláin an ról seo comhpháirteanna deisce GNOME éagsúla chun timpeallacht GNOME comhtháite agus feidhmiúil go hiomlán a chinntiú ar Arch Linux. Cuimsíonn sé suiteáil agus cumraíocht roinnt fo-ráillí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role asserts that the mount, source, and target configuration values are present, deploys the rsync-driver script, and installs a systemd mount unit plus a oneshot service. The oneshot service is triggered automatically when the configured mount path appears, so the only operator action is to physically plug the device in."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn an ról seo go bhfuil na luachanna mount, foinse, agus cumraíochta sprioc i láthair, imscaradh an script rsync-driver, agus installs aonad mount córasach móide seirbhís oneshot. Tá an tseirbhís oneshot spreagtha go huathoibríoch nuair is cosúil an cosán cumadh mount, mar sin tá an gníomh oibreoir amháin a plug fisiciúil an gléas i."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the cleanup of old backups by executing a Python script that deletes outdated backup versions based on disk usage thresholds. It ensures that backup storage does not exceed a defined usage percentage."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról an cleanup na cúltacaí d'aois trí fhorghníomhú script Python a scriosadh leaganacha cúltaca as dáta bunaithe ar thairseacha úsáid diosca. Cinntíonn sé nach stóráil cúltaca níos mó ná céatadán úsáide sainithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the creation of a swapfile on the target system by cloning a swapfile creation script from a Git repository and executing it with the specified swapfile size."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo a chruthú swapfile ar an gcóras sprioc ag chlónáil script a chruthú swapfile ó Git stór agus é a fhorghníomhú leis an méid swapfile sonraithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment and configuration of a complete, production-ready Taiga stack using Docker Compose. It ensures integration with common infrastructure tools such as NGINX, PostgreSQL, and RabbitMQ, while optionally enabling OpenID Connect authentication for enterprise-grade SSO."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról an imscaradh agus cumraíocht iomlán, táirgeadh-réidh Taiga Stack ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Cinntíonn sé comhtháthú le huirlisí bonneagair coitianta ar nós NGINX, PostgreSQL, agus RabbitMQ, agus go roghnach chumasú OpenID Nasc fíordheimhnithe le haghaidh SSO fiontraíochta-grád."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin's Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo imscaradh Bainisteoir Pacáiste Kevin trí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Kevin’s Package Manager by:"
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo imscaradh Bhainisteoir Pacáiste Kevin trí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Odoo in a containerized Docker environment with PostgreSQL database integration, OIDC/LDAP authentication support, and full Infinito.Nexus stack integration including reverse proxy, CSP configuration, and centralized identity management."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról an imscaradh Odoo i dtimpeallacht Docker coimeádán le PostgreSQL comhtháthú bunachar sonraí, tacaíocht fíordheimhnithe OIDC/LDAP, agus lán Infinito.Nexus comhtháthú cruach lena n-áirítear seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, CSP chumraíocht, agus bainistíocht aitheantais láraithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the ``community.general.pacman`` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról a shuiteáil Jrnl ag baint úsáide as an ``community.general.pacman`` modúl do chórais a thacaíonn leis an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman, ag cinntiú go Jrnl suiteáilte agus suas go dtí seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the `community.general.pacman` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról a shuiteáil Jrnl ag baint úsáide as an `community.general.pacman` modúl do chórais a thacaíonn leis an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman, ag cinntiú go Jrnl suiteáilte agus suas go dtí seo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of fakeroot via the OS package manager, ensuring that users can simulate superuser operations without requiring elevated privileges."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról a shuiteáil fakeroot tríd an bainisteoir pacáiste OS, ag cinntiú gur féidir le húsáideoirí insamhail oibríochtaí superuser gan gá pribhléidí ardaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo suiteáil micrea, eagarthóir téacs CLI, ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe. Úsáideann sé an ``community.general.pacman`` modúl chun a chinntiú go bhfuil an eagarthóir suiteáilte agus suas chun dáta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the `community.general.pacman` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo suiteáil micrea, eagarthóir téacs CLI, ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe. Úsáideann sé an `community.general.pacman` modúl chun a chinntiú go bhfuil an eagarthóir suiteáilte agus suas chun dáta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of neovim, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo suiteáil neovim, eagarthóir téacs CLI, ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe. Úsáideann sé an ``community.general.pacman`` modúl chun a chinntiú go bhfuil an eagarthóir suiteáilte agus suas chun dáta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of neovim, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the `community.general.pacman` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo suiteáil neovim, eagarthóir téacs CLI, ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe. Úsáideann sé an `community.general.pacman` modúl chun a chinntiú go bhfuil an eagarthóir suiteáilte agus suas chun dáta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the [auto-btrfs-balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo bainistiú agus cothromú na gcóras comhaid Btrfs. Clones sé an leagan is déanaí de na [auto-btrfs-iarmhéid](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) stór agus cumrú seirbhís córasach agus lasc ama a reáchtáil an script cothromú go huathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo bainistiú agus cothromú na gcóras comhaid Btrfs. Clones sé an leagan is déanaí de na `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ stór agus cumrú seirbhís córasach agus lasc ama a reáchtáil an script cothromú go huathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the process of setting up and running the Infinito.Nexus presentation in a Docker container, ensuring a reproducible and isolated environment for displaying the content."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo an próiseas a bhunú agus a reáchtáil ar an Infinito.Nexus cur i láthair i gcoimeádán Docker, ag cinntiú timpeallacht atáirgthe agus scoite chun an t-ábhar a thaispeáint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the removal of orphaned Docker volumes that consume unnecessary disk space. It is especially useful in backup, CI/CD, or maintenance routines."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról a bhaint toirt Docker dílleachtaithe a ithe spás diosca gan ghá. Tá sé úsáideach go háirithe i cúltaca, CI / CD, nó gnáthaimh chothabhála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the restart process for Docker Compose instances within a specified directory. It deploys a Python script that checks for the presence of compose.yml files and restarts the associated services. A hard restart is applied for certain directories if needed."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo an próiseas atosú do Docker Compose cásanna laistigh de eolaire sonraithe. Imscaradh sé script Python go seiceálacha ar an láthair compose.yml comhaid agus atosú na seirbhísí gaolmhara. Tá atosú crua i bhfeidhm do eolairí áirithe más gá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS certificates using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo aisghabháil [A ligean ar Criptiú](https://letsencrypt.org/) Deimhnithe SSL / TLS ag baint úsáide as [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) le haghaidh fearainn a sheirbheáil trí NGINX. Tacaíonn sé le deimhnithe aonair-domain agus cárta fiáin araon, agus is féidir é a úsáid an DNS nó gréasáin modhanna dúshlán ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS certificates using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo aisghabháil `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ Deimhnithe SSL / TLS ag baint úsáide as `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ le haghaidh fearainn a sheirbheáil trí NGINX. Tacaíonn sé le deimhnithe aonair-domain agus cárta fiáin araon, agus is féidir é a úsáid an DNS nó gréasáin modhanna dúshlán ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificate renewal system for NGINX using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo an thus uathoibríoch [A ligean ar Criptiú](https://letsencrypt.org/) córas athnuachana deimhnithe le haghaidh NGINX ag baint úsáide as [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). Cinntíonn sé go ndéantar deimhnithe SSL / TLS a athnuachan gan uaim sa chúlra agus go n-athluchtaíonn NGINX go huathoibríoch tar éis athnuachan rathúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificate renewal system for NGINX using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Uathoibríonn an ról seo an thus uathoibríoch `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ córas athnuachana deimhnithe le haghaidh NGINX ag baint úsáide as `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. Cinntíonn sé go ndéantar deimhnithe SSL / TLS a athnuachan gan uaim sa chúlra agus go n-athluchtaíonn NGINX go huathoibríoch tar éis athnuachan rathúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo ag bácálann an déantúsán scaoilte réamhtheachtach isteach i beag ``nginx:alpine`` íomhá agus tacaíochtaí **ballaí il in aghaidh an imscaradh**: gach iontráil faoi ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` Léiríonn liosta nasc de na ballaí cumraithe go léir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small `nginx:alpine` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes as its own path under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` with its own baked-in `wall-config.json`. The root `/` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo ag bácálann an déantúsán scaoilte réamhtheachtach isteach i beag `nginx:alpine` íomhá agus tacaíochtaí **ballaí il in aghaidh an imscaradh**: gach iontráil faoi [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes mar a cosán féin faoi `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` lena chuid féin bácáilte-i `wall-config.json`. An fhréamh `/` Léiríonn liosta nasc de na ballaí cumraithe go léir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps **per-domain NGINX configuration**: it requests TLS certificates, applies global modifiers, deploys a ready-made vHost file, and can optionally lock down access via OAuth2."
msgstr "Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil **in aghaidh na cruinne chumraíocht NGINX**: iarratais sé teastais TLS, iarratas modifiers domhanda, imscaradh réamhdhéanta vHost comhad, agus is féidir go roghnach glas síos rochtain via OAuth2."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node``. The manager is the single host in ``svc-swarm-manager``; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in ``group_vars``. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "An ról seo buataisítraps agus bainistíonn sé Docker Swarm braisle ar fud na hóstach sa ghrúpa Ansible ``svc-swarm-node``. Is é an bainisteoir an t-óstach amháin i ``svc-swarm-manager``; téann gach comhalta grúpa eile isteach mar oibrí. Tá Ballraíocht in iúl trí bhallraíocht grúpa amháin, riamh trí liostaí dhúbailte i ``group_vars``. lipéid nód Fardal a bhrú chuig an braisle tar éis an chéim a bheith páirteach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node`. The manager is the single host in `svc-swarm-manager`; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in `group_vars`. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "An ról seo buataisítraps agus bainistíonn sé Docker Swarm braisle ar fud na hóstach sa ghrúpa Ansible `svc-swarm-node`. Is é an bainisteoir an t-óstach amháin i `svc-swarm-manager`; téann gach comhalta grúpa eile isteach mar oibrí. Tá Ballraíocht in iúl trí bhallraíocht grúpa amháin, riamh trí liostaí dhúbailte i `group_vars`. lipéid nód Fardal a bhrú chuig an braisle tar éis an chéim a bheith páirteach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only \"the owner\". The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (`req.session.loggedIn`)."
msgstr "Tógann an ról seo Postmarks ó fhoinse isteach i íomhá saincheaptha, sreanga sé go dtí an seachfhreastalaí caighdeánach droim ar ais, agus leanann a chuid sonraí SQLite. Is Postmarks aon-úsáideoir: níl aon chuntais, ach amháin \"an t-úinéir\". Is é an login upstream foirm focal faire comhroinnte amháin go smeach amháin seisiún boolean (`req.session.loggedIn`)."

msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only “the owner”. The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (``req.session.loggedIn``)."
msgstr ""

