# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn an ról seo aon bhreiseáin (sé longa aon ``meta/addons/`` web development). **Sraith an Domhain** bainistíocht breiseán shuiteáil agus ar chumas ag runtime; níl aon declarative in aghaidh an-plugin shuiteáil cosán sa ról seo. Tá Breiseáin oibritheoirí. Na méideanna ainmnithe ``plugins`` agus ``client-plugins`` a dhearbhú in ``meta/volumes.yml`` Is cóipeanna dí-áitiúil díorthaithe go bhfuil gach sleachta macasamhail as féin ó na íomhá ar bundles prepackaged; fós bundle uaslódáil sa siopa comhad, ní iontu. Uimh droichid addon aon seirbhís in-repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no `meta/addons/` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes `plugins` and `client-plugins` declared in `meta/volumes.yml` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image's prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Dearbhaíonn an ról seo aon bhreiseáin (sé longa aon `meta/addons/` web development). **Sraith an Domhain** bainistíocht breiseán shuiteáil agus ar chumas ag runtime; níl aon declarative in aghaidh an-plugin shuiteáil cosán sa ról seo. Tá Breiseáin oibritheoirí. Na méideanna ainmnithe `plugins` agus `client-plugins` a dhearbhú in `meta/volumes.yml` Tá cóipeanna díorthaithe áitiúla go bhfuil gach sleachta macasamhail dó féin ó bundles réamhphacáistithe an íomhá; fós bundle uaslódáil sa siopa comhad, ní iontu. Uimh droichid addon aon seirbhís in-repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role depends on ``sys-pip``, which ensures that ``pip`` is installed on the target system."
msgstr "Braitheann an ról seo ar ``sys-pip``, a chinntíonn go ``pip`` suiteáilte ar an gcóras sprioc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role depends on `sys-pip`, which ensures that `pip` is installed on the target system."
