# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploy Decidim, an open-source participatory democracy platform for public consultations, civic processes, community voting, and collaborative policy creation."
msgstr "An ról seo a imscaradh Decidim, ardán daonlathas rannpháirteach foinse oscailte do chomhairliúcháin phoiblí, próisis shibhialta, vótáil pobail, agus cruthú beartais chomhoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a containerized web service using Docker Compose. It is designed to integrate seamlessly into the Infinito.Nexus stack, including optional Redis and database backends, CSP handling, and analytics integration."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid **LibreTranslate** mar sheirbhís gréasáin coimeádán ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Tá sé deartha a chomhtháthú seamlessly isteach sa Infinito.Nexus Stack, lena n-áirítear roghnach Redis agus cúltacaí bunachar sonraí, láimhseáil CSP, agus comhtháthú Analytics."

