# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Baserow using Docker Compose, integrating key components such as PostgreSQL for the database, Redis for caching, and NGINX for secure domain management and certificate handling. It is designed to offer a robust, scalable solution for running your own Baserow instance in a containerized environment."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Baserow ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose, comhpháirteanna eochair a chomhtháthú, mar shampla PostgreSQL don bhunachar sonraí, Redis le haghaidh caching, agus NGINX le haghaidh bainistíochta fearainn slán agus láimhseáil deimhniú. Tá sé deartha chun réiteach láidir, inscálaithe a thairiscint chun do chuid féin a reáchtáil Baserow mar shampla i dtimpeallacht coimeádán."

