# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Discourse using Docker, automating tasks such as container orchestration, service configuration, and routine administrative operations. It integrates key components like Redis and PostgreSQL, sets up domain routing with NGINX, and ensures streamlined updates for a reliable forum experience."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Discourse ag baint úsáide as Docker, tascanna uathoibrithe ar nós ceolfhoirne coimeádán, chumraíocht seirbhíse, agus oibríochtaí riaracháin ghnáthamh. Comhtháthaíonn sé comhpháirteanna eochair mhaith Redis agus PostgreSQL, Leagann suas ródú fearainn le NGINX, agus cinntíonn sé nuashonruithe sruthlínithe le haghaidh taithí fóram iontaofa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``frappe/erpnext`` single-image multi-role pattern from `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central ``svc-db-mariadb`` and ``svc-db-redis`` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe’s built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid ERPNext mar a Infinito.Nexus app gréasáin ag baint úsáide as an sruth ``frappe/erpnext`` aonair-íomhá il-ról patrún ó `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: íomhá Docker amháin, orduithe éagsúla in aghaidh an choimeádáin (backend gunicorn, nginx tosaigh, websocket fixio, sceidealóir, dhá oibrithe scuaine, móide configurator aon-lámh). MariaDB agus Redis teacht as an lárnach ``svc-db-mariadb`` agus ``svc-db-redis`` soláthraithe — na trí Frappe Redis róil loighciúil (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) scair lárnach amháin Redis mar shampla trí scoilt DB-uimhir (0 / Baile 1 / Baile 2). Úsáideann Fíordheimhniú Frappe's tógtha i Eochair Logáil Sóisialta i gcoinne an roinnte Keycloak OIDC cliant gan auth2-proxy sidecar; chónaidhm LDAP agus SMTP outbound trí Mailu sreangaithe nuair a bhíonn a soláthraithe i láthair."

