# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Fider mar chuid den Infinito.Nexus Stack ag baint úsáide as amháin Docker Compose coimeádán tacaíocht ag PostgreSQL. Cruthaíonn sé SSO trí Keycloak go huathoibríoch ar an gcéad imscaradh, fógraí ríomhphoist roghnach trí Mailu, agus HTTPS trí seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Friendica using Docker, managing the Friendica application container alongside a central MariaDB instance. It provides tools for full resets, manual and automatic database reinitialization, email and general configuration debugging, and autoinstall processes, all to ensure your Friendica installation remains reliable and easy to maintain."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Friendica ag baint úsáide as Docker, bhainistiú an Friendica coimeádán iarratas taobh lárnach MariaDB mar shampla. Soláthraíonn sé uirlisí le haghaidh athshocrú iomlán, athshuíomh bunachar sonraí láimhe agus uathoibríoch, r-phost agus debugging cumraíocht ginearálta, agus próisis autoinstall, go léir a chinntiú do Friendica Tá suiteáil iontaofa agus éasca le cothabháil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Funkwhale using Docker. It orchestrates multiple services (including the API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, and Typesense) integrating with centralized PostgreSQL and Redis services for a fully containerized music sharing experience."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Funkwhale ag baint úsáide as Docker. Sé orchestrates seirbhísí il (lena n-áirítear an API, Tosaigh, Oibrí Celery, Beat Celery, agus Typesense) comhtháthú le láraithe PostgreSQL agus Redis seirbhísí le haghaidh taithí a roinnt ceol go hiomlán coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project's central `svc-db-openldap` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to `svc-db-openldap` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid FusionDirectory ar aghaidh Docker Compose i gcoinne lár an tionscadail `svc-db-openldap` freastalaí. geataí an leagan OIDC FusionDirectory Chomhéadain gréasáin trí `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar do SSO; Tá an leagan LDAP ag brath ar an gcéanna FusionDirectory ceangailteach `svc-db-openldap` mar a cosán auth bunscoile. RBAC leanas an tsamhail ghrúpa LDAP go FusionDirectory Tuigeann cheana féin ó dhúchas, mar sin níl aon chiseal gliú ag teastáil le haghaidh mapála údaraithe."

