# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid GitLab ón Cloud oifigiúil Dúchasach GitLab (CNG) íomhánna CE ag ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` mar sheirbhísí ar leith: ``webservice`` (cineál gas: in airde), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (pointe iontrála HTTP amháin), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil) agus aon-shot ``migrations`` post. Gach íomhánna roinnt bioráin leagan amháin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis agus S3-compatible stóráil réad atá sreangaithe tríd an lookups ardán (lár nó sidecar), OIDC agus SMTP tríd an ardán SSO agus seirbhísí ríomhphoist. Críochnaíonn an seachfhreastalaí tosaigh TLS agus cuireann sé HTTP ar aghaidh chuig an gceall oibre."

