msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Jenkins ar aghaidh Docker Compose. Tógann sé saincheaptha Jenkins íomhá a réamh-shuiteáil na `oic-auth`, `ldap`, `role-strategy`, agus `configuration-as-code` plugins, ansin mounts comhad JCasC YAML go sreanga an réimse slándála i gcoinne Keycloak (malairt leagan 0, OIDC) nó `svc-db-openldap` (malairt leagan 1, LDAP). Tá an draoi thus skipped via `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` mar sin glacann an JCasC config thar ó chéad tosaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Joomla ar aghaidh Docker Compose. Tógann sé saincheaptha Joomla íomhá a bhácáil i Composer le haghaidh tógálaí síneadh runtime, ritheann an Joomla CLI suiteálaí le bunachar sonraí an róil, agus cuireann sé an in-role `plg_system_keycloak` breiseán mar sin labhraíonn an suíomh OIDC i gcoinne Keycloak le mapáil ghrúpa RBAC. Reáchtáil maitrís-imlonnú an ról a LDAP trí Joomla's eochair breiseán fíordheimhnithe LDAP ionad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Joomla ar aghaidh Docker Compose. Tógann sé saincheaptha Joomla íomhá a bhácáil i Composer le haghaidh tógálaí síneadh runtime, ritheann an Joomla CLI suiteálaí leis an ról ar bhunachar sonraí, agus a shuiteáil ar an in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` breiseán mar sin labhraíonn an suíomh OIDC i gcoinne Keycloak le mapáil ghrúpa RBAC. Reáchtáil maitrís-imlonnú an ról a LDAP trí Joomla’s core LDAP plugin fíordheimhnithe ionad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project's standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` and `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. The backend initialises its schema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) against the central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with `pg_trgm` pre-activated via `services.postgres.extensions`; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Initial admin credentials are seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` on first start (see `meta/secrets.yml`)."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid KIX mar a Infinito.Nexus app gréasáin taobh thiar de chaighdeán an tionscadail `sys-stk-front-proxy` agus `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy slabhra sidecar. An sruth `kix-on-premise` seachvótálaí, cúltaca, agus long coimeádáin tosaigh ó `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. Déanann an cúlú tús a scéimre (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) i gcoinne an lárnach `svc-db-postgres` braisle, nó i gcoinne an taobhcharr post leabaithe nuair nach bhfuil aon soláthraí lárnach san fhardal, le `pg_trgm` réamhghníomhachtú trí `services.postgres.extensions`; Is é an taisce an ró-áit áitiúil redis sidecar focal faire (neamhaird ar an tosaigh `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). dintiúir admin Tosaigh a shíolú trí `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` ar dtús tús (féach ar `meta/secrets.yml`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project’s standard ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` and ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream ``kix-on-premise`` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. The backend initialises its schema (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) against the central ``svc-db-postgres`` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with ``pg_trgm`` pre-activated via ``services.postgres.extensions``; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). Initial admin credentials are seeded via ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` on first start (see ``meta/secrets.yml``)."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid KIX mar a Infinito.Nexus app gréasáin taobh thiar de chaighdeán an tionscadail ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` agus ``web-app-keycloak``\\ slabhra SSO-proxy sidecar. An sruth ``kix-on-premise`` seachvótálaí, cúltaca, agus long coimeádáin tosaigh ó ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. Déanann an cúlú tús a scéimre (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) i gcoinne an lárnach ``svc-db-postgres`` braisle, nó i gcoinne an taobhcharr post leabaithe nuair nach bhfuil aon soláthraí lárnach san fhardal, le ``pg_trgm`` réamhghníomhachtú trí ``services.postgres.extensions``; Is é an taisce an ró-áit áitiúil redis sidecar focal faire (neamhaird ar an tosaigh ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). dintiúir admin Tosaigh a shíolú trí ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` ar dtús tús (féach ar ``meta/secrets.yml``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Keycloak in a Docker environment, integrating it with a PostgreSQL database and enabling operation behind a reverse proxy such as NGINX. It manages container orchestration and configuration via Docker Compose and environment variable templates, ensuring a secure and scalable identity management solution."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Keycloak i dtimpeallacht Docker, a chomhtháthú le PostgreSQL bunachar sonraí agus oibriú ar chumas taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí droim ar nós NGINX. Bainistíonn sé orchestration coimeádán agus cumraíocht trí Docker Compose agus teimpléid athraitheacha timpeallachta, ag cinntiú réiteach bainistíochta aitheantais slán agus inscálaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LAM in a Docker environment and integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It leverages environment variable templates to configure LDAP connection settings and administrative credentials, ensuring a smooth and customizable installation of LDAP Account Manager."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid LAM i dtimpeallacht Docker agus chomhtháthaíonn sé le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais a chur ar fáil rochtain slán. Giaráil sé teimpléid athraitheacha timpeallacht a chumrú suímh nasc LDAP agus dintiúir riaracháin, ag cinntiú suiteáil réidh agus customizable de LDAP Cuntas Bainisteoir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LM Studio as a headless model server in a single container, in both Docker Compose and Docker Swarm deployments. The server listens on port 1234 on the internal container network and is not published through the reverse proxy, while downloaded models and server settings persist in a dedicated volume. The role downloads its declared models at deploy time and the LiteLLM Gateway publishes them under the same aliases Ollama uses, so a consumer asks for one model name and reaches whichever backend the deployment provides."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid LM Studio mar fhreastalaí múnla headless i gcoimeádán amháin, sa dá Docker Compose agus Docker Swarm imscaradh. Éisteann an freastalaí ar port 1234 ar an líonra coimeádán inmheánach agus nach bhfuil foilsithe tríd an seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, agus fós samhlacha íoslódáil agus suímh freastalaí i méid tiomnaithe. Íoslódáil an ról a samhlacha dearbhaithe ag am imscaradh agus an LiteLLM Gateway iad a fhoilsiú faoi na nithe céanna Ollama úsáidí, mar sin iarrann tomhaltóir ar ainm samhail amháin agus sroicheann cibé acu siar a sholáthraíonn an t-imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Listmonk using Docker, ensuring a robust and scalable setup for your newsletter management needs. Listmonk’s architecture supports a dedicated PostgreSQL database and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure access. To configure and manage your instance, use the provided configuration files:"
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Listmonk ag baint úsáide as Docker, a chinntiú thus láidir agus inscálaithe do do riachtanais bainistíochta nuachtlitir. Tacaíonn ailtireacht Listmonk ar tiomanta PostgreSQL bunachar sonraí agus comhtháthú le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais le haghaidh rochtain slán. A chumrú agus a bhainistiú do shampla, úsáid a bhaint as na comhaid chumraíocht ar fáil:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LiteLLM as a shared gateway container in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL service. The gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims no domain of its own, and the browser-facing surface is published separately by the LiteLLM Admin UI. It renders the model list from the interchangeable local backends available on the host, Ollama and LM Studio, and adds the OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter entries whose API key is configured. Once the gateway is up, it provisions one virtual key per consuming application through the gateway admin API."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról seo LiteLLM mar choimeádán geata comhroinnte in imscaradh Compose agus Swarm, arna thacú ag an lár PostgreSQL seirbhís. Tá an geata headless: cuireann sé ceangal ar a calafort HTTP ar an óstach coimeádán agus éilíonn sé aon fhearann dá chuid féin, agus foilsíonn an dromchla brabhsálaí ar leithligh an dromchla LiteLLM Admin UI. Déanann sé an liosta múnla ó na backends áitiúla idirmhalartaithe ar fáil ar an óstach, Ollama agus LM Studio, agus cuireann an OpenAI, iontrálacha antraipteach agus OpenRouter a bhfuil API Tá eochair cumraithe. Nuair a bheidh an geata suas, forálacha sé eochair fíorúil amháin in aghaidh an t-iarratas Tógann tríd an admin geata API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mastodon using Docker, streamlining the installation and configuration of a full-featured social networking platform. Mastodon is built to support federation across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, real-time updates, and flexible API integrations. Its advanced architecture includes separate services for the web frontend, streaming API, and background job processing, ensuring high performance and scalability for large communities."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Mastodon ag baint úsáide as Docker, sruthlíniú a shuiteáil agus cumraíocht ardán líonraithe sóisialta lán-feiceáil. Tá Mastodon tógtha chun tacú le chónaidhm ar fud cásanna éagsúla, ag tairiscint moderation ábhar láidir, nuashonruithe fíor-ama, agus solúbtha API comhtháthú. Áirítear ar a ailtireacht chun cinn seirbhísí ar leith don tosaigh gréasáin, sruthú API, agus próiseáil poist cúlra, ag cinntiú ardfheidhmíochta agus inscálaitheacht do phobail mhóra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Matomo using Docker, automating the setup of your analytics platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for configuration and data, and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Matomo is configured to provide reliable and scalable analytics for your digital presence."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Matomo ag baint úsáide as Docker, uathoibriú an thus do ardán Analytics chomh maith lena mbunachar sonraí. Le tacaíocht do sheiceálacha sláinte, stóráil leanúnach le haghaidh cumraíochta agus sonraí, agus comhtháthú le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais, Matomo atá cumraithe a chur ar fáil anailísíocht iontaofa agus inscálaithe do do láithreacht dhigiteach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys MediaWiki using Docker, automating the setup of your wiki instance along with its underlying MariaDB database. It handles generating the essential configuration file (LocalSettings.php) from a seeded template and integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure, efficient web access."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid MediaWiki ag baint úsáide as Docker, uathoibriú an thus de do shampla wiki chomh maith lena bunúsacha MariaDB bunachar sonraí. Láimhseálann sé a ghiniúint an comhad chumraíocht riachtanach (LocalSettings.php) ó teimpléad síolaithe agus comhtháthaíonn sé le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais le haghaidh rochtain slán, éifeachtach gréasáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mobilizon using Docker, automating the setup of your event management platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for uploads and configuration, and seamless integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon is configured to provide reliable and scalable event hosting for your community."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Mobilizon ag baint úsáide as Docker, uathoibriú an thus do ardán bainistíochta ócáid chomh maith lena mbunachar sonraí. Le tacaíocht do sheiceálacha sláinte, stóráil leanúnach do uaslódáil agus chumraíocht, agus comhtháthú gan uaim le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais, Mobilizon Tá cumraithe imeacht iontaofa agus inscálaithe óstáil do do phobal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Moodle using Docker, automating the setup of both the Moodle application and its underlying MariaDB database. It integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent storage to safeguard your data and configuration."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Moodle ag baint úsáide as Docker, uathoibriú an thus an dá Moodle iarratas agus a fholuiteach MariaDB bunachar sonraí. Comhtháthaíonn sé le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais chun rochtain gréasáin slán agus éifeachtach a chinntiú agus úsáideann stóráil leanúnach chun do shonraí agus do chumraíocht a chosaint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Ollama as a local model server using Docker Compose. It integrates with Open WebUI for chat and Flowise for AI workflow automation, and configures local model caching so models can be reused across sessions or run fully offline."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Ollama mar fhreastalaí samhail áitiúil ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Comhtháthaíonn sé le Open WebUI le haghaidh comhrá agus Flowise do uathoibriú AI sreabhadh oibre, agus cumhrán samhail áitiúil caching ionas gur féidir samhlacha a athúsáid thar seisiúin nó a reáchtáil go hiomlán as líne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at ``openbao.<domain>``, behind the platform’s HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao’s own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid OpenBao mar a Infinito.Nexus iarratas ag ``openbao.<domain>``, taobh thiar den ardán HTTPS seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Daoine a shíniú i trí Keycloak le OIDC agus a fháil go díreach na pribhléidí a gcuid deontais ghrúpa RBAC; meaisíní fhíordheimhniú ar leithligh trí AppRole. Saol an Stáit i OpenBaosiopa rafta féin ar toirt leanúnach, agus séala statach auto-unseals an nód ar gach restart mar sin ní mór aon oibreoir idirghabháil a dhéanamh tar éis ath-imlonnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at `openbao.<domain>`, behind the platform's HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao's own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid OpenBao mar a Infinito.Nexus iarratas ag `openbao.<domain>`, taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí HTTPS an ardáin. Daoine a shíniú i trí Keycloak le OIDC agus a fháil go díreach na pribhléidí a gcuid deontais ghrúpa RBAC; meaisíní fhíordheimhniú ar leithligh trí AppRole. Saol an Stáit i OpenBao's siopa rafta féin ar toirt leanúnach, agus séala statach uathoibríoch-unseals an nód ar gach restart mar sin ní mór aon oibreoir idirghabháil a dhéanamh tar éis ath-imlonnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenClaw as a gateway container behind the reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Its compose service is pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host, its gateway configuration file is rendered from the role, and its state directory is kept in a persistent volume. Access is fronted by an OAuth2 proxy with Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid OpenClaw mar coimeádán geata taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí droim ar a bhfearann Canonical féin. Tá a sheirbhís a chumadh pinned leis an runtime isolating go bhfuil an Kata & gVisor Roghnaíonn ról don óstach, déantar a chomhad cumraíochta geata ón ról, agus coimeádtar a eolaire stáit i méid leanúnach. Tá rochtain os comhair OAuth2 seachfhreastalaí le Keycloak síniú isteach nuair Keycloak cuid den imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central ``svc-db-openldap`` directory, and runs side by side with ``web-app-nextcloud`` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid OpenCloud ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose i mód aon-bhruthach agus nochtann sé faoi ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` tríd an seachfhreastalaí lárnach droim ar ais. sreanga sé an imscaradh chuig an roinnte Keycloak realm via OIDC, úsáideoirí foinsí agus grúpaí ó na lárnach ``svc-db-openldap`` eolaire, agus ritheann taobh le taobh le ``web-app-nextcloud`` mar sin is féidir an dá ardáin comhad a chomhéist ar an óstach céanna. Le haghaidh sonraí sreangú féin féach `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ agus `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central `svc-db-openldap` directory, and runs side by side with `web-app-nextcloud` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid OpenCloud ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose i mód aon-bhruthach agus nochtann sé faoi `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` tríd an seachfhreastalaí lárnach droim ar ais. sreanga sé an imscaradh chuig an roinnte Keycloak realm via OIDC, úsáideoirí foinsí agus grúpaí ó na lárnach `svc-db-openldap` eolaire, agus ritheann taobh le taobh le `web-app-nextcloud` mar sin is féidir an dá ardáin comhad a chomhéist ar an óstach céanna. Le haghaidh sonraí sreangú féin féach [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) agus [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pi-hole as a containerized service within the Infinito.Nexus platform. Access is protected by OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, with RBAC enforced via OpenLDAP group membership."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról seo Pi-poll mar sheirbhís coimeádán laistigh den Infinito.Nexus ardán. Tá rochtain cosanta ag OAuth2/ BaileKeycloak SSO, le RBAC i bhfeidhm trí OpenLDAP comhaltas grúpa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pretix using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your Pretix server. It integrates with an external PostgreSQL database, Redis for caching and sessions, and an NGINX reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Pretix ag baint úsáide as Docker, uathoibriú a shuiteáil, chumraíocht, agus bainistíocht do Pretix freastalaí. Comhtháthaíonn sé le seachtrach PostgreSQL bunachar sonraí, Redis do caching agus seisiúin, agus seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais. Tacaíonn an ról le gnéithe chun cinn ar nós instealladh CSS domhanda, Matomo Analytics, OIDC fíordheimhnithe, agus logout láraithe, rud a chiallaíonn sé ar réiteach cumhachtach agus customizable laistigh den Infinito.Nexus éiceachóras."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at ``prometheus.<domain>`` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Prometheus mar chuid den Infinito.Nexus Stack ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Taispeánann sé na Prometheus Chomhéadain gréasáin ag ``prometheus.<domain>`` agus a chosnaíonn sé le SSO via Keycloak úsáid a bhaint as outh2-proxy. Tá logout uilíoch comhtháite le haghaidh foirceannadh seisiún."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at `prometheus.<domain>` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Prometheus mar chuid den Infinito.Nexus Stack ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose. Taispeánann sé na Prometheus Chomhéadain gréasáin ag `prometheus.<domain>` agus a chosnaíonn sé le SSO via Keycloak úsáid a bhaint as outh2-proxy. Tá logout uilíoch comhtháite le haghaidh foirceannadh seisiún."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys SeaweedFS as the central provider of the project-wide object-store service (engine ``seaweedfs``). Web-app roles consume it like a database: they enable a ``seaweedfs`` service in their ``meta/services.yml`` and resolve host, port, bucket, and credentials through the ``objstore`` lookup. A single server container runs master, volume, filer, and the S3 gateway in one process, accompanied by an nginx sidecar that routes the admin UIs. The role serves three canonical domains:"
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid SeaweedFS mar sholáthraí lárnach na seirbhíse ar fud an tionscadail (cineál gas: in airde ``seaweedfs``). Róil Web-app ithe sé cosúil le bunachar sonraí: chumas siad a ``seaweedfs`` seirbhís ina n- ``meta/services.yml`` agus óstach, port, buicéad, agus dintiúir a réiteach tríd an ``objstore`` cuma. Ritheann coimeádán freastalaí amháin máistir, toirt, filer, agus an S3 geata i bpróiseas amháin, in éineacht le sidecar nginx go bealaí an UIs admin. Feidhmíonn an ról trí fearainn Canonical:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys SeaweedFS as the central provider of the project-wide object-store service (engine `seaweedfs`). Web-app roles consume it like a database: they enable a `seaweedfs` service in their `meta/services.yml` and resolve host, port, bucket, and credentials through the `objstore` lookup. A single server container runs master, volume, filer, and the S3 gateway in one process, accompanied by an nginx sidecar that routes the admin UIs. The role serves three canonical domains:"
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid SeaweedFS mar sholáthraí lárnach na seirbhíse ar fud an tionscadail (cineál gas: in airde `seaweedfs`). Róil Web-app ithe sé cosúil le bunachar sonraí: chumas siad a `seaweedfs` seirbhís ina n- `meta/services.yml` agus óstach, port, buicéad, agus dintiúir a réiteach tríd an `objstore` cuma. Ritheann coimeádán freastalaí amháin máistir, toirt, filer, agus an S3 geata i bpróiseas amháin, in éineacht le sidecar nginx go bealaí an UIs admin. Feidhmíonn an ról trí fearainn Canonical:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Svc Engine."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Svc Engine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Svc Objstore."
msgstr "An ról seo in úsáid Svc Objstore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Test E2E Cli."
