# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a centralized global stylesheet that overrides the default theming of web applications served via NGINX. It's optimized to run only once per deployment and generates a **cache-busting version number** based on file modification timestamps.   It includes support for **dark mode**, **custom fonts**, and **extensive Bootstrap and UI component overrides**."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról seo bileog stíl dhomhanda láraithe a sháraíonn an t-iarratas gréasáin a sheirbheáil trí NGINX. Tá sé Optamaithe a reáchtáil ach uair amháin in aghaidh an imscaradh agus gineann a **uimhir leagan taisce-busting** bunaithe ar amstamps mhodhnú comhad. Cuimsíonn sé tacaíocht do **modh dorcha**, **clónna saincheaptha**, agus **Buataisítrap fairsing agus UI chomhpháirt overrides**."

