# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys an Nginx-based CDN container behind the project's standard reverse proxy and exposes the canonical `cdn` service so that other roles can consume it through `services.cdn`. It also publishes the `css` and `javascript` aliases as canonical references back to `cdn` so dependent applications can opt into either alias without duplicating configuration."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról seo coimeádán CDN Nginx-bhunaithe taobh thiar de sheachvótálaí droim ar ais caighdeánach an tionscadail agus nochtann sé an Canonical `cdn` seirbhís ionas gur féidir le róil eile é a ithe trí `services.cdn`. Foilsíonn sé freisin an `css` agus `javascript` ailiases mar thagairtí Canonical ar ais `cdn` mar sin is féidir le hiarratais ag brath a roghnú i ceachtar ailias gan chumraíocht dhúbailte."

