# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Imscaradh an ról seo na OpenTalk Stack ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose agus nochtann an tosaigh gréasáin ag ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` tríd an seachfhreastalaí lárnach droim ar ais. Ritheann sé an rialtóir Rust, an freastalaí meáin LiveKit WebRTC, an tosaigh gréasáin React, tiomanta Redis, tiomanta MinIO buicéad do shócmhainní rialtóir, RabbitMQ bróicéir, agus an OpenTalk taifeadta chun cruinniú MP4 cartlanna. Comhtháthaíonn an t-imscaradh leis an gcomhroinnt Keycloak realm via OIDC agus athbhusanna ``svc-db-postgres`` agus ``web-svc-coturn`` maidir le sonraí agus STUN/TURN. Le haghaidh sonraí sreangú féin féach `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ agus `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

