# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the ``nftables.service`` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Tugann an ról seo gach ról eile áit amháin chun rialacha scagaire paicéad a chur. Ról a theastaíonn uathu scríobhann ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` a dhearbhú a tábla nftables féin agus folaíonn sé an ról seo; Tá an ilroinnt a rinneadh ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, seiceáil, luchtú, agus a léamh ar ais, mar sin theipeann ar imscaradh seachas go ciúin ag fágáil bearna. Deployed ar a chuid féin, an ról a shuiteáil nftables, na rialacha a ualaí gach il, agus an ``nftables.service`` go replays iad ag tosaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes `templates/nftables.conf.j2` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the `nftables.service` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Tugann an ról seo gach ról eile áit amháin chun rialacha scagaire paicéad a chur. Ról a theastaíonn uathu scríobhann `templates/nftables.conf.j2` a dhearbhú a tábla nftables féin agus folaíonn sé an ról seo; Tá an ilroinnt a rinneadh `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, seiceáil, luchtú, agus a léamh ar ais, mar sin theipeann ar imscaradh seachas go ciúin ag fágáil bearna. Deployed ar a chuid féin, an ról a shuiteáil nftables, na rialacha a ualaí gach il, agus an `nftables.service` go replays iad ag tosaithe."

