# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) when any service fails."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo seirbhís córasach a chuireann fógraí tríd an dá [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) agus [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) nuair a theipeann ar aon tseirbhís."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ when any service fails."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo seirbhís córasach a chuireann fógraí tríd an dá `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ agus `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ nuair a theipeann ar aon tseirbhís."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the ``svc-swarm-node`` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from ``vars/main.yml`` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo freastalaí NFS i gceann de dhá bhlaist, an freastalaí eithne distro nó nfs-ganesha, a roghnaíodh in aghaidh an imscaradh. An dá onnmhairiú an cosán stát Swarm chun na seoltaí réiteach ar an ``svc-swarm-node`` grúpa agus le CIDR breise a cheadú-liosta; onnmhairíonn ganesha freisin an bonn onnmhairithe agus squashes root ann. Roghanna Onnmhairithe teacht ó ``vars/main.yml`` le haghaidh an blas eithne agus as an teimpléad cumraíocht ganesha do ganesha. NFS freastalaí HA, Kerberos comhtháthú, agus cliant-taobh gléasta atá as raon feidhme; mounts cliant láimhseáil ag ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the `svc-swarm-node` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from `vars/main.yml` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by `svc-storage-nfs-client`."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo freastalaí NFS i gceann de dhá bhlaist, an freastalaí eithne distro nó nfs-ganesha, a roghnaíodh in aghaidh an imscaradh. An dá onnmhairiú an cosán stát Swarm chun na seoltaí réiteach ar an `svc-swarm-node` grúpa agus le CIDR breise a cheadú-liosta; onnmhairíonn ganesha freisin an bonn onnmhairithe agus squashes root ann. Roghanna Onnmhairithe teacht ó `vars/main.yml` le haghaidh an blas eithne agus as an teimpléad cumraíocht ganesha do ganesha. NFS freastalaí HA, Kerberos comhtháthú, agus cliant-taobh gléasta atá as raon feidhme; mounts cliant láimhseáil ag `svc-storage-nfs-client`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and applies dotlinker (doli) mappings (generic role)."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil agus dotlinker i bhfeidhm (taiseachas aeir: fliuch) Léarscáileanna (cineál gas: in airde)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the [git-configurator](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról agus cumraithe Git ar an gcóras sprioc ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman (tríd an community.general.pacman modúlach). Ina theannta sin, cumraíonn sé Git don úsáideoir trí chumraíocht git saincheaptha a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as an [crios fuar: aon sonraí](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) uirlis. Cinntíonn an ról go Git suiteáilte agus go bhfuil na tascanna chumraíocht reáchtáil ach uair amháin in aghaidh an óstach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról agus cumraithe Git ar an gcóras sprioc ag baint úsáide as an bainisteoir pacáiste Pacman (tríd an community.general.pacman modúlach). Ina theannta sin, cumraíonn sé Git don úsáideoir trí chumraíocht git saincheaptha a shuiteáil ag baint úsáide as an `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ uirlis. Cinntíonn an ról go Git suiteáilte agus go bhfuil na tascanna chumraíocht reáchtáil ach uair amháin in aghaidh an óstach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Nginx HTTP and stream modules with performance-tuned defaults."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo modúil Nginx HTTP agus sruthanna le mainneachtainí feidhmíochta-túnaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures VirtualBox and its kernel modules on Pacman-based systems, including extension packs and user group setup."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil agus a chumrú VirtualBox agus a mhodúil eithne ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe, lena n-áirítear pacáistí síneadh agus thus grúpa úsáideoirí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``{{ system_service_id }}`` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo na comhpháirteanna is gá chun fógraí ríomhphoist a sheoladh trí chóras nuair a theipeann ar sheirbhís. Leagann sé suas an ``{{ system_service_id }}`` seirbhís agus cumrú paraiméadair ríomhphoist agus teimpléid ag baint úsáide as msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `{{ system_service_id }}` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo na comhpháirteanna is gá chun fógraí ríomhphoist a sheoladh trí chóras nuair a theipeann ar sheirbhís. Leagann sé suas an `{{ system_service_id }}` seirbhís agus cumrú paraiméadair ríomhphoist agus teimpléid ag baint úsáide as msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo na comhpháirteanna is gá chun fógraí a sheoladh trí chóras nuair a theipeann ar sheirbhís. Leagann sé suas an ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` seirbhís agus cumrú paraiméadair agus teimpléid customizable le haghaidh teachtaireachtaí a sheoladh trí `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through [Telegram](https://telegram.org). <!-- nocheck: url telegram.org answers 404 on the bare root -->"
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo na comhpháirteanna is gá chun fógraí a sheoladh trí chóras nuair a theipeann ar sheirbhís. Leagann sé suas an `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` seirbhís agus cumrú paraiméadair agus teimpléid customizable le haghaidh teachtaireachtaí a sheoladh trí [Teileagram](https://telegram.org). r- nocheck: url telegram.org Freagraí scríofa 404 ar an fhréamh lom - ^"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil agus a choimeádann an tseirbhís Docker, lena n-áirítear Docker Compose, ar chórais Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems.   It is part of the [Infinito.Nexus Project](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), maintained and developed by [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil agus a choimeádann an tseirbhís Docker, lena n-áirítear Docker Compose, ar chórais Linux. Tá sé mar chuid den [Infinito.Nexus Tionscadal Tionscadail](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), a chothabháil agus a fhorbairt ag [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](https://www.veen.world/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and runs the **cleanback** tool to automatically detect and remove **failed Docker backups**."
msgstr "Seo a shuiteáil ról agus ritheann an **taiseachas aeir: fliuch** uirlis a bhrath go huathoibríoch agus a bhaint **theip cúltacaí Docker**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs caffeine-ng and configures it to autostart for preventing screen sleep on GNOME."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo Caiféin-ng agus cabhraíonn sé le codladh scáileáin a chosc ar GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs distro-specific equivalents of core build tooling so systems are ready for compiling software from source. After deploying this role, all common build dependencies are available on the system."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo coibhéisí dí-shonrach de uirlis tógála croí mar sin tá córais réidh le bogearraí a thiomsú ó fhoinse. Tar éis an ról seo a imscaradh, tá gach spleáchas tógála coitianta ar fáil ar an gcóras."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil nó uasghrádú pacáiste Python **córas ar fud** ag baint úsáide as an gcóras ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). Tá sé i gceist le haghaidh uirlisí CLI ar chóir a bheith ar fáil ar fud an domhain (e.g., fóntais chothabhála)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "An ról seo a shuiteáil nó uasghrádú pacáiste Python **córas ar fud** ag baint úsáide as an gcóras `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). Tá sé i gceist le haghaidh uirlisí CLI ar chóir a bheith ar fáil ar fud an domhain (e.g., fóntais chothabhála)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na CopyQ bainisteoir clipboard ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe (e.g. Arch Linux) agus cinntíonn sé go gcuirtear tús leis go huathoibríoch don úsáideoir reatha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na CopyQ bainisteoir clipboard ar chórais Pacman-bhunaithe (e.g. Arch Linux) agus cinntíonn sé go gcuirtear tús leis go huathoibríoch don úsáideoir reatha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na KeePassXC iarratas deisce ar stáisiúin oibre Pacman-bhunaithe tríd an mbainisteoir pacáiste córas. Tá sé i gceist le haghaidh rólanna oibre pearsanta sa tsraith deisce agus ní dhéanann bunachair shonraí a chumrú, comhtháthú bhrabhsálaí, nó cúntóirí uathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo an bainisteoir pacáiste Nix i **slán, atáirgthe, agus idempotent** bhealach ar fud dáiltí Linux il."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo an bainisteoir pacáiste Nix trí pacman ar Arch x86_64 nó tríd an suiteálaí oifigiúil le SHA256 fíorú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na OBS Studio iarratas deisce ar stáisiúin oibre Pacman-bhunaithe tríd an mbainisteoir pacáiste córas. Díríonn sé ar an tsraith deisce agus ní dhéanann radhairc chumrú, feistí ghabháil, nó próifílí sruthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo na pacáistí cliant SSH a theastaíonn chun rochtain iargúlta slán agus fíordheimhniú eochairbhunaithe a chumasú ar chórais Linux. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil an cliant SSH cuí suiteáilte ag brath ar an dáileadh sprioc agus go bhfuil an tsuiteáil fhorghníomhú ach uair amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) pacáiste ar an spriocchóras. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil an bainisteoir pacáiste pip ar fáil le haghaidh a shuiteáil pacáistí Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na [taiseachas aeir: fliuch](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) pacáiste agus imscaradh comhad sudoers réamhshocraithe a chinntiú escalation phribhléid slán agus comhsheasmhach ar an spriocchóras. Úsáideann sé réamhchumraithe sudoers comhad a leanas cleachtais is fearr agus áirítear treoracha a léamh comhaid titim isteach ó `/etc/sudoers.d`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na ``baudolo`` CLI, leagann amach an crann cúltaca ar-óstach, imscaradh an tseirbhís córasach a thiomáineann an rith tréimhsiúil, agus sreanga an cleanup-de-failed-backups spleáchas mar sin nach bhfuil snapshots páirteach a choinneáil. Tá síolú Bunachar le haghaidh apps aonair a chuireann na róil tomhaltóra trí ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, a bhfuil siad san áireamh go coinníollach uair amháin ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` Tá sé i ``group_names``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na `baudolo` CLI, leagann amach an crann cúltaca ar-óstach, imscaradh an tseirbhís córasach a thiomáineann an rith tréimhsiúil, agus sreanga an cleanup-de-failed-backups spleáchas mar sin nach bhfuil snapshots páirteach a choinneáil. Tá síolú Bunachar le haghaidh apps aonair a chuireann na róil tomhaltóra trí `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, a bhfuil siad san áireamh go coinníollach uair amháin `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` Tá sé i `group_names`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ pacáiste ar an spriocchóras. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil an bainisteoir pacáiste pip ar fáil le haghaidh a shuiteáil pacáistí Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ pacáiste agus imscaradh comhad sudoers réamhshocraithe a chinntiú escalation phribhléid slán agus comhsheasmhach ar an spriocchóras. Úsáideann sé réamhchumraithe sudoers comhad a leanas cleachtais is fearr agus áirítear treoracha a léamh comhaid titim isteach ó ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo an script cúltaca agus an tseirbhís córasach a thiomáineann sé ar an sceideal cumraithe (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), agus serialises an reáchtáil i gcoinne an chuid eile den ghrúpa ionramháil trí [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). Is é an cosán foinse an bonn a onnmhairiú NFS réiteach ó [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) seirbhísí a phacáil; imscaradh an ról ar an óstach a fhreastalaíonn ar an onnmhairiú. Inis dúinn, le do thoil... [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) a choinneáil ar an crann Léim faoi cheangal agus [user-backup](../user-backup/) ionas gur féidir le hóstach downstream tarraingt an crann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Cuireann an ról seo an script cúltaca agus an tseirbhís córasach a thiomáineann sé ar an sceideal cumraithe (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), agus serialises an reáchtáil i gcoinne an chuid eile den ghrúpa ionramháil trí `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. Is é an cosán foinse an bonn a onnmhairiú NFS réiteach ó `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ seirbhísí a phacáil; imscaradh an ról ar an óstach a fhreastalaíonn ar an onnmhairiú. Inis dúinn, le do thoil... `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ a choinneáil ar an crann Léim faoi cheangal agus `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ ionas gur féidir le hóstach downstream tarraingt an crann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na pacáistí cliant NFS neamh-oiriúnach ar gach óstach sa ghrúpa Ansible ``svc-swarm-node`` agus probe-mounts an cumraithe ``storage.nfs.server`` agus an bonn a onnmhairiú ón svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml an t-am a d'fhéadfadh teacht agus ritability a dheimhniú. Tarlaíonn na méideanna toirt docker iarbhír níos déanaí, tiomáinte ag an inneall Docker ag tús coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Leagann an ról seo na pacáistí cliant NFS neamh-oiriúnach ar gach óstach sa ghrúpa Ansible `svc-swarm-node` agus probe-mounts an cumraithe `storage.nfs.server` agus an bonn a onnmhairiú ón svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml an t-am a d'fhéadfadh teacht agus ritability a dheimhniú. Tarlaíonn na méideanna toirt docker iarbhír níos déanaí, tiomáinte ag an inneall Docker ag tús coimeádán."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-tuple list (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) consumed by `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no `meta/addons/` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), declare them through the unified addon contract under `meta/addons/` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is a group-name tag. It exists so the project's inventory validator accepts `svc-swarm-manager` as a legitimate application_id. The actual swarm-init logic lives in `svc-swarm-node` and dispatches on `'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names`."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo tag ainm grúpa. Tá sé mar sin ghlacann bailíochtóir fardal an tionscadail `svc-swarm-manager` mar dlisteanach application_id. An iarbhír swarm-init loighic ina chónaí i `svc-swarm-node` agus seolta ar `'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is a group-name tag. It exists so the project’s inventory validator accepts ``svc-swarm-manager`` as a legitimate application_id. The actual swarm-init logic lives in ``svc-swarm-node`` and dispatches on ``'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names``."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo tag ainm grúpa. Tá sé mar sin Glacann bailíochtóir fardal an tionscadail ``svc-swarm-manager`` mar dlisteanach application_id. An iarbhír swarm-init loighic ina chónaí i ``svc-swarm-node`` agus seolta ar ``'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is built on top of your existing ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` role, and it automates the end-to-end process of turning HTTP sites into secure HTTPS sites."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo tógtha ar bharr do atá ann cheana féin ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` ról, agus uathoibríonn sé an próiseas deireadh-le-deireadh de casadh láithreáin HTTP isteach suímh slán HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is built on top of your existing `sys-svc-webserver-core` role, and it automates the end-to-end process of turning HTTP sites into secure HTTPS sites."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo tógtha ar bharr do atá ann cheana féin `sys-svc-webserver-core` ról, agus uathoibríonn sé an próiseas deireadh-le-deireadh de casadh láithreáin HTTP isteach suímh slán HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is focused on installing JDK 11, but it can be easily modified to install different versions of the JDK or additional Java-related tools as per your requirements."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo dírithe ar JDK a shuiteáil 11, ach is féidir é a mhodhnú go héasca a shuiteáil leaganacha éagsúla den JDK nó breise Javauirlisí a bhaineann le de réir do chuid riachtanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is intended as a shared dependency for other roles that execute OpenSSL commands on the host system."
msgstr "Tá an ról seo beartaithe mar spleáchas comhroinnte do róil eile a fhorghníomhú orduithe OpenSSL ar an gcóras óstach."

