# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages GNOME Shell extensions by ensuring user extensions are enabled and by installing the CLI GNOME Extension Manager. The CLI tool facilitates the configuration and control of GNOME extensions via the command line."
msgstr "Seo ról Bainistíonn GNOME Shell síntí ag a chinntiú go síntí úsáideora ar chumas agus trí shuiteáil an Bainisteoir Síneadh GNOME CLI. Éascaíonn an uirlis CLI chumraíocht agus rialú síntí GNOME tríd an líne ordú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages WireGuard on a client system. It sets up essential services and scripts to configure and optimize WireGuard connectivity."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról seo WireGuard ar chóras cliant. Leagann sé suas seirbhísí agus scripteanna riachtanacha a chumrú agus a uasmhéadú WireGuard nascacht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages [Wireguard](https://www.wireguard.com/) on the host. It installs the necessary Wireguard packages, configures sysctl settings for IPv4/IPv6 forwarding, and deploys the Wireguard configuration file to enable the VPN service using [wg-quick](https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/)."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról seo [Wireguard](https://www.wireguard.com/) ar an óstach. Shuiteálann sé an gá Wireguard pacáistí, cumraithe suímh steall do IPv4/ IPv6 ar aghaidh, agus imscaradh na Wireguard comhad cumraíochta chun an tseirbhís VPN a chumasú ag baint úsáide as [taiseachas aeir: fliuch](https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages `Wireguard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ on the host. It installs the necessary Wireguard packages, configures sysctl settings for IPv4/IPv6 forwarding, and deploys the Wireguard configuration file to enable the VPN service using `wg-quick <https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/>`__."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról seo `Wireguard <https://www.wireguard.com/>`__ ar an óstach. Shuiteálann sé an gá Wireguard pacáistí, cumraithe suímh steall do IPv4/ IPv6 ar aghaidh, agus imscaradh na Wireguard comhad cumraíochta chun an tseirbhís VPN a chumasú ag baint úsáide as `wg-quick <https://www.wireguard.com/quickstart/>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról seo glúin agus láimhseáil eochair SSH don [duille dath glas](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) ar spriocchóras. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil eochair SSH a ghintear mura bhfuil ceann ann cheana féin agus aschur an eochair phoiblí, ar chumas rochtain SSH slán don úsáideoir fhréamh i dtimpeallachtaí uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Bainistíonn an ról seo glúin agus láimhseáil eochair SSH don `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ ar spriocchóras. Cinntíonn sé go bhfuil eochair SSH a ghintear mura bhfuil ceann ann cheana féin agus aschur an eochair phoiblí, ar chumas rochtain SSH slán don úsáideoir fhréamh i dtimpeallachtaí uathoibrithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role monitors the health status of Docker containers on the system. It detects containers that are either **unhealthy** or have **exited with a non-zero code**, and triggers alerts if issues are found."
msgstr "Déanann an ról seo monatóireacht ar stádas sláinte choimeádáin Docker ar an gcóras. Braitheann sé coimeádáin atá ceachtar **taiseachas aeir: fliuch** nó a bheith **amach le cód neamh-zero**, agus triggers foláirimh má saincheisteanna le fáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role no longer ships its own local recording wrapper."
msgstr "Ní longann an ról seo a fillteán taifeadta áitiúil féin a thuilleadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role now supports OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentication with [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"
msgstr "Tacaíonn an ról seo anois le OpenID Connect (OIDC) fíordheimhnithe le [MailuAn tSeirbhís Garda Tarrthála](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role optimizes storage allocation for Docker volumes by migrating volumes between SSD (rapid storage) and HDD (mass storage) based on container image types. It creates symbolic links to maintain consistent storage paths after migration."
msgstr "Úsáideann an ról seo leithdháileadh stórála do thoirteanna Docker trí mhéideanna a aistriú idir SSD (stóráil go tapa) agus HDD (stóráil mais) bunaithe ar chineálacha íomhá coimeádán. Cruthaíonn sé naisc siombalach a choimeád ar bun cosáin stórála comhsheasmhach tar éis imirce."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the ``css`` service flag and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Is leis an ról seo na ``css`` bratach seirbhíse agus dearbhaíonn ``web-svc-cdn`` mar an sruthú a fhreastalaíonn ar na bytes CSS iarbhír. Róil Tomhaltóirí geata CSS-spleách dromchlaí ar ``'web-svc-css' in group_names`` trína gcuid féin ``meta/services.yml``. An ról fearainn Canonical 301-Atreorú chuig an bhfearann Canonical CDN mar sin probes sláinte i gcoinne an hostname CSS ar ais freagra bailí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role owns the `css` service flag and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate CSS-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-css' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the CSS hostname return a valid response."
msgstr "Is leis an ról seo na `css` bratach seirbhíse agus dearbhaíonn `web-svc-cdn` mar an sruthú a fhreastalaíonn ar na bytes CSS iarbhír. Róil Tomhaltóirí geata CSS-spleách dromchlaí ar `'web-svc-css' in group_names` trína gcuid féin `meta/services.yml`. An ról fearainn Canonical 301-Atreorú chuig an bhfearann Canonical CDN mar sin probes sláinte i gcoinne an hostname CSS ar ais freagra bailí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role performs a complete cleanup of Docker resources by invoking a systemd-managed script. It removes unused Docker images, stopped containers, networks, build cache, and anonymous volumes. The cleanup is fully automated and can run on a schedule or be triggered manually."
msgstr "Feidhmíonn an ról seo glanadh iomlán na n-acmhainní Docker trí script córasach a spreagadh. Cuireann sé íomhánna Docker nár úsáideadh, coimeádáin stop, líonraí, taisce a thógáil, agus méideanna gan ainm. Tá an glanadh uathoibrithe go hiomlán agus is féidir é a reáchtáil ar sceideal nó a spreagadh de láimh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a **unified mail setup** for your hosts:"
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról seo **thus phost aontaithe** do do hóstach:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a comprehensive Dockerized environment for running Akaunting. It deploys the Akaunting application alongside a MariaDB database, configures environment variables, and integrates with NGINX as a reverse proxy. This setup is ideal for both production and development environments."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról timpeallacht Dockerized cuimsitheach do reáchtáil Akaunting. imscaradh sé na Akaunting iarratas taobh le MariaDB bunachar sonraí, cumrú athróg timpeallacht, agus comhtháthaíonn le NGINX mar seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Tá an thus seo oiriúnach do thimpeallachtaí táirgthe agus forbartha araon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the `.env` configuration to customizing `compose.yml` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional LDAP/OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról seo imscaradh go hiomlán uathoibrithe [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose ar Arch Linux. Bainistíonn sé an saolré ar fad an imscaradh, ó chlónáil an stór Docker sruth agus a ghiniúint an `.env` chumraíocht a shaincheapadh `compose.yml` le haghaidh úsáide toirt, WebSocket seachfhreastalaí, agus roghnach LDAP / OIDC comhtháthú. Áirítear leis an thus gníomhachtaithe Greenlight coinníollach, tacaíocht WebRTC trí TURN / STUN, agus socrúcháin éagsúla le haghaidh saincheisteanna ceolfhoirne coimeádán aitheanta. Tá an ról modúlach agus comhtháthaíonn seamlessly leis an Infinito.Nexus bonneagar, lena n-áirítear cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, bainistíocht fearainn, agus rúin templating. De réir réamhshocraithe, BigBlueButton imscaradh le hardening is fearr-chleachtais, rúin modúlach, agus tacaíocht do mhodhanna fíordheimhnithe il agus backends stórála inscálaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the ``.env`` configuration to customizing ``compose.yml`` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional LDAP/OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról seo imscaradh go hiomlán uathoibrithe `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ ag baint úsáide as Docker Compose ar Arch Linux. Bainistíonn sé an saolré ar fad an imscaradh, ó chlónáil an stór Docker sruth agus a ghiniúint an ``.env`` chumraíocht a shaincheapadh ``compose.yml`` le haghaidh úsáide toirt, WebSocket seachfhreastalaí, agus roghnach LDAP / OIDC comhtháthú. Áirítear leis an thus gníomhachtaithe Greenlight coinníollach, tacaíocht WebRTC trí TURN / STUN, agus socrúcháin éagsúla le haghaidh saincheisteanna ceolfhoirne coimeádán aitheanta. Tá an ról modúlach agus comhtháthaíonn seamlessly leis an Infinito.Nexus bonneagar, lena n-áirítear cumraíocht seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais, bainistíocht fearainn, agus rúin templating. De réir réamhshocraithe, BigBlueButton imscaradh le hardening is fearr-chleachtais, rúin modúlach, agus tacaíocht do mhodhanna fíordheimhnithe il agus backends stórála inscálaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a locking mechanism to ensure that critical services are not interrupted during maintenance activities such as updates, backups, or patch applications. It waits for specified services to stop and prevents conflicting operations."
msgstr "Soláthraíonn an ról seo meicníocht glasála chun a chinntiú nach gcuirtear isteach ar sheirbhísí criticiúla le linn gníomhaíochtaí cothabhála ar nós nuashonruithe, cúltacaí, nó iarratais paiste. Fanann sé le haghaidh seirbhísí sonraithe chun oibríochtaí coinbhleachta a stopadh agus a chosc."

