# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról seo iomlán Nextcloud úsáid a bhaint as Docker Compose. uathoibríonn sé an thus an Nextcloud iarratas chomh maith lena fholuiteach MariaDB bunachar sonraí agus cumrú an córas le haghaidh rochtain phoiblí slán trí seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais. Áirítear leis an imscaradh chumraíocht uathoibrithe chumasc isteach ``config.php``, gnáthaimh seiceáil sláinte, agus tacaíocht comhtháite le haghaidh oibríochtaí cúltaca agus a ghnóthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into `config.php`, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról seo iomlán Nextcloud úsáid a bhaint as Docker Compose. uathoibríonn sé an thus an Nextcloud iarratas chomh maith lena fholuiteach MariaDB bunachar sonraí agus cumrú an córas le haghaidh rochtain phoiblí slán trí seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais. Áirítear leis an imscaradh chumraíocht uathoibrithe chumasc isteach `config.php`, gnáthaimh seiceáil sláinte, agus tacaíocht comhtháite le haghaidh oibríochtaí cúltaca agus a ghnóthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host's `/var/run/docker.sock` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról seo meaisín tiomnaithe mar cheann amháin nó níos mó GitHub Gníomhartha féin-óstáil dara háit CI do Infinito.Nexus. Ritheann gach cás rádala mar coimeádán Docker ephemeral (DooD - Docker as Docker): an coimeádán mounts an óstach `/var/run/docker.sock` agus úsáideann sé chun tús a chur le coimeádán Infinito DinD úr do gach post CI, ansin deora sé síos nuair a chríochnaíonn an post."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host’s ``/var/run/docker.sock`` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr "Forálacha an ról seo meaisín tiomnaithe mar cheann amháin nó níos mó GitHub Gníomhartha féin-óstáil dara háit CI do Infinito.Nexus. Ritheann gach cás rádala mar coimeádán Docker ephemeral (DooD - Docker as Docker): an coimeádán mounts an óstach ar ``/var/run/docker.sock`` agus úsáideann sé chun tús a chur le coimeádán Infinito DinD úr do gach post CI, ansin deora sé síos nuair a chríochnaíonn an post."

