msgid "This role provisions:"
msgstr "Forálacha an róil seo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role publishes the Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and for every release tag. It builds the repository's Markdown, reStructuredText and role READMEs into an HTML site with [Sphinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) and the [Awesome Sphinx Theme](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/). There is no database."
msgstr "Foilsíonn an ról seo Infinito.Nexus doiciméadú don tiomantas is déanaí agus do gach clib scaoilte. Tógann sé an stór Markdown, reStructuredText agus READMEs ról isteach i suíomh HTML le [Sphinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) agus an [Awesome Sphinx Téama](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/). Níl aon bhunachar sonraí."

