# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Trí eochracha suímh i `vars/main.yml` Tá adh aon-Gann ar v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` agus `security.captcha_secret`. An beo `settings` Déanann tábla amháin `security.captcha` rud éigin (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), mar sin go léir trí `UPDATE`s mheaitseáil sraitheanna náid agus ní `ON_ERROR_STOP` ná na fógraí athfhriotail. Tá hCaptcha dá bhrí sin riamh a bhí gníomhach, a dhéanann freisin ar an `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` réasúnaíocht i `templates/playwright.env.j2` cur síos ar chosaint nach bhfuil ann. Athscríobh na trí eochracha mar réad amháin, ansin cinneadh an bhfuil captcha ar an bhfoirm síntiús poiblí ag iarraidh ar chor ar bith."

