# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two controls stack. The actuating tools are named in `tools.mutating`, and `mutating_tools_enabled: false` withholds them from every client's include list, so an agent is offered `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` and `todo_get_items` only. Entity exposure bounds those: only entities exposed to Assist are reachable, and the role exposes none. Setting `mutating_tools_enabled: true` offers the actuating tools as well; entity exposure then decides what they can reach."
msgstr "Dhá chairn rialuithe. Na huirlisí actuating ainmnithe i `tools.mutating`, agus `mutating_tools_enabled: false` choimeád siar iad ó gach cliant ar áireamh liosta, mar sin tá gníomhaire ar fáil `GetDateTime`, `GetLiveContext` agus `todo_get_items` ach amháin. Teorainn le nochtadh na n-eintiteas: ach eintitis a nochtar chun cúnamh a bhaint amach, agus nochtann an ról aon cheann. Amharc ar gach eolas `mutating_tools_enabled: true` Cuireann na huirlisí actuating chomh maith; Cinneann nochtadh eintitis ansin cad is féidir leo a bhaint amach."

