msgstr "Dhá dintiúir, i dhá threo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two decisions are worth naming. The rate is `concurrent_requests` requests per second with an equal burst and `nodelay`, rather than an eighth declared limit: a client allowed N calls in flight, each bounded by `timeout_seconds`, cannot sustain more than N/s unless every call returns instantly, so the rate is derived from the contract instead of being a number invented per role and drifting from it. And a refusal answers `429` rather than nginx's default `503`, because a client that should back off must not read the refusal as an outage. The location strips a trailing slash from the declared path so a request to the path without it cannot walk past the limits."
msgstr "Is fiú dhá chinneadh a ainmniú. Is é an ráta `concurrent_requests` iarrataí in aghaidh an dara le pléasctha comhionann agus `nodelay`, seachas ochtú teorainn dhearbhaithe: cliant ceadaithe glaonna N ar eitilt, gach faoi cheangal ag `timeout_seconds`, Ní féidir a choinneáil níos mó ná N / s mura rud é gach tuairisceáin glao láithreach, mar sin tá an ráta a dhíorthaítear ón gconradh in ionad a bheith ar roinnt invented in aghaidh an ról agus drifting uaidh. Agus freagraí diúltaithe `429` seachas réamhshocraithe nginx `503`, toisc nach mór do chliant ba chóir ar ais as an diúltú a léamh mar outage. Stiallann an suíomh a slashing as an cosán dearbhaithe mar sin iarratas ar an cosán gan ní féidir é a siúl anuas na teorainneacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Two discovery queries, keeping today's filter semantics: the priority line is queried on its own whitelist so priority roles run even when the diff-derived whitelist would not have selected them, and the regular line is queried on the effective whitelist with the priority rows withdrawn. Concatenated, they are the sweep's ordered candidate list. Both lists are selection tokens (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): what a token pins narrows the row, what it leaves open the line decides as it always did."
msgstr "Dhá cheist fionnachtana, a choinneáil sa lá atá inniu shéimeantaigh scagaire: Tá an líne tosaíochta queried ar a whitelist féin mar sin rólanna tosaíochta a reáchtáil fiú nuair nach mbeadh an diff-derived whitelist roghnaigh iad, agus tá an líne rialta queried ar an whitelist éifeachtach leis na sraitheanna tosaíochta a tharraingt siar. Cumaraithe, tá siad an sweep ar liosta iarrthóirí ordaithe. Tá an dá liosta tokens roghnú (:mod:`utils.github.variant.selection`): cad a chuireann bioráin chomhartha ar an tsraith, cad a fhágann sé an líne a oscailt chinneann mar a rinne sé i gcónaí."

