# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upgrade candidates MUST share the same depth (1 to 5 components) AND the same flavor as the current tag, so that ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` never silently bumps to ``5.4.6-php8.4-apache`` (different runtime) or to ``5.4.6`` (different depth). Everything that is not the number folds into the flavor: the leading channel, the trailing suffix and the patch letter. That is what keeps ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` away from ``main-v1.77.7-nightly``, ``stable-9646`` away from a bare ``9646``, and ``2.4.0p32`` ordering against ``2.4.0p33`` rather than against the four-component ``2.4.0.32``. Only the patch number joins the ordering key, so ``p9`` sorts below ``p10``."
msgstr "MUST iarrthóirí Uasghrádú roinnt ar an doimhneacht chéanna (1 go dtí 5 comhpháirteanna) AGUS an blas céanna leis an chlib reatha, ionas go mbeidh ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` riamh bumps adhly a ``5.4.6-php8.4-apache`` (runtime éagsúla) nó chuig ``5.4.6`` (doimhneacht éagsúla). Gach rud nach bhfuil an uimhir folds isteach sa blas: an cainéal tosaigh, an iarmhír trailing agus an litir paiste. Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` ar shiúl ó ``main-v1.77.7-nightly``, ``stable-9646`` ar shiúl ó lom ``9646``, agus ``2.4.0p32`` ordú i gcoinne ``2.4.0p33`` seachas i gcoinne an ceithre-chomhpháirt ``2.4.0.32``. Glacann ach an uimhir paiste an eochair ordú, mar sin ``p9`` cineál thíos ``p10``."

