# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Uisce agus Séarachas ``host:port``: chumadh ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (ailias comhroinnte) don tosaigh app, nó ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` do sidecars ainmnithe (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` Ritheann app node-áitiúil faoi swarm agus foilsíonn a port áitiúil chuig an óstach, mar sin sroicheann an seachfhreastalaí overlay-attached sé ag ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` tríd an geata óstach (Leagann an glaoiteoir seo as an fíor DEPLOYMENT_MODE, ós rud é go bhfeidhm apps den sórt sin a chumadh-stíl a dhéanamh). Missing swarm port inmheánach crua-fails."

