# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Verify in a swarm cluster that the `force_bridge` upstream actually reaches the gateway: openresty resolves `host.docker.internal` to the host gateway, while `svc-ai-litellm` publishes `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. On a real host `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` is `127.0.0.1`, and the assumption is that `docker stack deploy` drops the bind IP from the short port syntax and publishes on all interfaces via the routing mesh. If that assumption fails, publish the gateway port in host mode (long syntax) or give openresty a `litellm` consumer flag instead."
msgstr "Fíoraigh i braisle swarm go bhfuil an `force_bridge` Sroicheann sruth an geata i ndáiríre: réitíonn oscailte `host.docker.internal` go dtí an geata óstach, agus `svc-ai-litellm` a fhoilsiú `{{ DOCKER_BIND_HOST }}:8081:4000`. Ar óstach fíor `DOCKER_BIND_HOST` Is maith liom `127.0.0.1`, agus is é an toimhde go `docker stack deploy` titeann an IP ceangal ó na syntax port gearr agus foilsíonn sé ar gach comhéadan tríd an mogalra routing. Má theipeann ar an toimhde, a fhoilsiú ar an gcalafort geata i mód óstach (syntax fada) nó oscailt a thabhairt `litellm` bratach tomhaltóirí ina ionad sin."

