#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Siúlóid (b'fhéidir neadaithe) dintiúr scéimre agus astaíonn bloc cruinneachán amháin in aghaidh an duille scalar isteach ``dest_node``. Díotálacha ionghabháil (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse isteach neadaithe CommentMaps mar sin bíonn gach duille a iontráil féin cruinneachán- Criptithe in ionad a bheith titim trí ``str(dict)`` i Python-repr blob (an aischéimniú a bhris reáchtáil 26428080957 Post a fhógairt 77797371397 agus 77797371442 le haghaidh web-app-espocrm agus web-app-listmonk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
