msgid "Walks the given directory, parses every ``playwright-junit.xml`` it finds, and prints a markdown table with one row per test case (app, test title, status, message) to stdout. The output is designed to be appended to ``$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY``."
msgstr "Siúlóidí an eolaire ar leith, parses gach ``playwright-junit.xml`` fhaigheann sé, agus priontaí tábla marcála le sraith amháin in aghaidh an cháis tástála (app, teideal tástála, stádas, teachtaireacht) a stdout. Tá an t-aschur deartha a chur i gceangal leis ``$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks the same edges the constructor's role set is built from, so a whitelist-scoped deploy and the full-inventory deploy agree on what a role depends on. The traversal itself lives in ``utils/roles/applications/in_group_deps``; this only exposes it to Ansible."
msgstr "Siúlóidí na h-imill chéanna tá ról an tógálaí leagtha tógtha ó, mar sin a imscaradh whitelist-scóip agus an lán-fardail imscaradh aontú ar an méid a bhfuil ról ag brath ar. An traversal féin ina chónaí i ``utils/roles/applications/in_group_deps``; seo ach nochtann sé go Ansible."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Walks up from ``start`` (default: current working directory) until a ``.env`` is found; returns ``None`` if none exists in any parent."
msgstr "Siúl suas ó ``start`` (réamhshocraithe: eolaire oibre reatha) go dtí go ``.env`` le fáil; tuairisceáin ``None`` má tá aon cheann in aon tuismitheoir."

