# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "What a token leaves open belongs to the line it stands in: `priority` covers every remaining combination in one sweep, `whitelist` keeps the rotation and the row's position in the matrix. A pin the row cannot take aborts the matrix rather than dropping the row, because a dropped row would report a green run for a combination that never ran. Such a pin is `@swarm` on a role without its own stack, `+tor` on a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` false, or any axis that fights the run's own `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` or `architectures` input, or `:arm64` on a role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `architectures: [amd64]`."
msgstr "Cad iad na duilleoga chomhartha oscailte a bhaineann leis an líne a sheasann sé i: `priority` Clúdaíonn gach meascán eile i scuab amháin, `whitelist` Coinníonn an uainíocht agus seasamh an tsraith sa maitrís. Ní féidir le bioráin an tsraith a ghlacadh aborts an maitrís seachas dropping an tsraith, toisc go mbeadh as a chéile thit tuarascáil a reáchtáil glas do mheascán riamh ar siúl. Tá a leithéid de bioráin `@swarm` ar ról gan a chairn féin, `+tor` ar malairt go bioráin `services.tor.enabled` bréagach, nó aon ais a troideanna an reáchtáil féin `mode`, `tor`, `distros`, `filesystem` nó `architectures` ionchur, nó `:arm64` ar ról a bhfuil `meta/services.yml` a dhearbhú `architectures: [amd64]`."

