# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is deployed, the node’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` is the minted ``.onion`` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) are routed by the ``Host`` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` because ``.onion`` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh ``svc-net-tor`` Tá imscaradh, an nód’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` Is é an minted ``.onion`` seoladh, mar sin an Stack ar fad (vhosts gréasáin, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) Réitíonn réimsí oinniún go comhsheasmhach. Ritheann an Daemon Tor mar óstach-líonra chumadh sidecar agus léarscáileanna seirbhís i bhfolach amháin chuig an óstach OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) go bhfuil ród ag an ``Host`` header. Tá TLS amach ar an taobh oinniún (onion v3 Soláthraíonn cheana féin criptithe iompair + fíordheimhnithe freastalaí); apps fós a fháil ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` mar gheall ar ``.onion`` Is brabhsálaí Secure Context."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is in the deploy, mint (or reuse) the node onion and set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` in the host_vars."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh ``svc-net-tor`` tá sé san imscaradh, mint (nó athúsáid) an nód oinniún agus a leagtar ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` sa host_vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh ``tor_node`` Tá sé leagtha (svc-net-tor a imscaradh) agus is é an URL óstach an ``primary_domain`` nó subdomain de, babhtáil an iarmhír sin le haghaidh ``tor_node`` agus an fórsa ``http`` scéim na scéime (Tá seirbhísí oinniún plaintext-only). Rud ar bith eile — ionchuir folamh, óstach nach bhfuil faoi ``primary_domain``, luach unparseable - ar ais gan athrú, mar sin tá an scagaire sábháilte aon-op ar clearnet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh ``version`` Is unset (aon luach seirbhísí, gan ró-bhród), tuairisceáin an Lookup an lom ``<image>`` (riachtanais uisce: measartha) agus astaíonn ``display.warning`` mar sin fógraí an t-oibreoir an tagairt gan staonadh gan aborting an spraoi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for `--clients N` and calls `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` to fill in `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automatically. The contributor MAY override the suggestion interactively. See [port.md](port.md) for the matching ports flow."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh `cli create role` scafalls ról nua, leideanna sé do `--clients N` agus glaonna `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` a líonadh isteach `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` go huathoibríoch. An ranníocóir MAY override an moladh idirghníomhú. Féach ar [port.md](port.md) do na calafoirt meaitseáil sreabhadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for required port categories per service entity and calls `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` per slot to fill in the entity's `ports` map. The contributor MAY override either suggestion interactively. See [address.md](address.md) for the matching subnet flow."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh `cli create role` scafalls ról nua, leideanna sé do chatagóirí port ag teastáil in aghaidh an eintitis seirbhíse agus glaonna `cli contributing network ports suggest --scope <…> --category <…> --count 1` in aghaidh an sliotán a líonadh isteach an t-eintiteas `ports` léarscáil. An ranníocóir MAY override ceachtar moladh idirghníomhú. Féach ar [address.md](address.md) don sreabhadh subnet meaitseáil."

