# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When any injector service (`asset`, `cdn`, `css`, `javascript`, `simpleicons`, `matomo`) is enabled, the role's `Content-Security-Policy` header MUST list the injector's host. The shared module `personas/utils/csp.js` exposes the full CSP test surface: `assertCspInjections` for the per-injector parity check, `assertCspResponseHeader` and `assertCspMetaParity` for header / meta validation, plus `installCspViolationObserver` / `readCspViolations` / `expectNoCspViolations` for the runtime `securitypolicyviolation` stream. Specs require these helpers from `./personas`."
msgstr "Nuair aon seirbhís instealladh (`asset`, `cdn`, `css`, `javascript`, `simpleicons`, `matomo`) ar chumas, an ról ar `Content-Security-Policy` header MUST liosta óstach an insteallta. An modúl roinnte `personas/utils/csp.js` nochtann sé an dromchla tástála iomlán CSP: `assertCspInjections` don seiceáil parity per-instealladh, `assertCspResponseHeader` agus `assertCspMetaParity` do cheanntásc / bailíochtú meta, móide `installCspViolationObserver` / Baile `readCspViolations` / Baile `expectNoCspViolations` don runtime `securitypolicyviolation` sruth. A cheangal ar Specs na Cúntóirí ó `./personas`."

