# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Whenever the agent runs `git commit` (the pre-commit hook executes `make test`, which takes several minutes), the agent MUST trigger context compaction in parallel so the wait time is spent productively. Preferred flow: launch the commit as a background task, then immediately invoke `/compact` (or equivalent context-compaction mechanism) while the hook runs. The agent MUST NOT idle-wait for `make test` to finish before compacting."
msgstr "Aon uair a ritheann an gníomhaire `git commit` (an Hook réamh-iomaitheoir fhorghníomhú `make test`, a thógann roinnt nóiméad), an gníomhaire MUST tús compaction comhthéacs comhthreomhar mar sin tá an t-am fanacht caite go productively. Sreabhadh Rogha: seoladh an tiomantas mar tasc cúlra, ansin agairt láithreach `/compact` (nó meicníocht chomhionann um chomhoibriú comhthéacs) cé go ritheann an Hook. NÍ MÓR an gníomhaire díomhaoin-ag fanacht le haghaidh `make test` a chríochnú roimh dhlúthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
