# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Whether a resolver answers on the bridge is not something the host's own ``resolv.conf`` can say - a systemd-resolved stub and a node dnsmasq both read as loopback-only, and only the second one also binds the bridge. Until that is declared rather than inferred, the bridge may be an address nothing serves, so it never goes out alone: a list that would carry it by itself gets the project's public resolver behind it. Without that the daemon has a single dead nameserver and every container and image build loses DNS."
msgstr "Cibé an bhfuil freagraí réiteora ar an droichead rud éigin an óstach féin ``resolv.conf`` Is féidir a rá - stub córasach-réitithe agus dnsmasq nód araon a léamh mar lúb ais-amháin, agus ach an dara ceann ceangal freisin ar an droichead. Go dtí go bhfuil dearbhaithe seachas inferred, d'fhéadfadh an droichead a bheith ina seoladh aon rud feidhmíonn, mar sin ní théann sé amach ina n-aonar: liosta a bheadh a dhéanamh leis féin faigheann réiteoir poiblí an tionscadail taobh thiar de. Gan go bhfuil an daemon a nameserver marbh amháin agus gach coimeádán agus íomhá a thógáil cailleann DNS."

