# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "TÚLRAÍ (Do URL Féin Shortener) Is open-source URL ghiorrú réiteach a chuireann ar chumas tú a chruthú, rianú, agus naisc gearr a bhainistiú gan stró. Giaráil an imscaradh Docker a chur ar fáil timpeallacht slán agus go héasca inscálaithe, ag cinntiú go bhfuil do YOURLS mar shampla cumraithe le haghaidh feidhmíocht agus iontaofacht is fearr is féidir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "Níl aon SSO dúchais ag DO RLS; déantar an seisiún admin a íoslaghdú ón oauth2-proxy header aitheantais ag ``shunt_is_valid_user`` titim isteach i ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` Fanann persona beo agus feidhmíonn sé deireadh leis an droichead."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "Níl aon SSO dúchais ag DO RLS; déantar an seisiún admin a íoslaghdú ón oauth2-proxy header aitheantais ag `shunt_is_valid_user` titim isteach i [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), a onóracha an header ach amháin ar an cosán admin gated agus amháin do bhaill an YOURLS grúpa riarthóir. An geata féin admhaíonn ach amháin go grúpa RBAC céanna ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), mar sin `biber` a diúltaíodh roimh YOURLS rud ar bith: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) a dhearbhú `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, agus tá an séanadh dhearbhú go sainráite ag `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. An `administrator` Fanann persona beo agus feidhmíonn sé deireadh leis an droichead."

