msgid "You MAY pass `disable=<csv>` to `make compose-deploy` to disable services automatically across all applications without editing any file:"
msgstr "Tá tú pas ÍMAT `disable=<csv>` go dtí `make compose-deploy` seirbhísí a dhíchumasú go huathoibríoch ar fud gach iarratas gan eagarthóireacht ar aon chomhad:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MAY see branching history"
msgstr "Tá tú MAY fheiceáil stair brainseach"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MAY use `unittest.mock` to isolate the unit under test from Ansible internals or external state."
msgstr "Úsáid ÍMAT `unittest.mock` a leithlisiú an t-aonad faoi thástáil ó inmheánach Ansible nó stát seachtrach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MAY use `unittest.mock` to stub out external services or filesystem state that is genuinely outside the integration scope."
msgstr "Úsáid ÍMAT `unittest.mock` a stub amach seirbhísí seachtracha nó stát córas comhaid atá fíor lasmuigh den raon feidhme comhtháthú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MAY:"
msgstr "Tá tú MAY:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NEVER expose secrets in prompts, code, screenshots, or logs."
msgstr "MUST tú NEVER nochtadh rúin i leideanna, cód, screenshots, nó logs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add a make target, script, or role task whose purpose is to generate, render, merge, or rewrite such a file."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a chur sprioc a dhéanamh, script, nó ról tasc a bhfuil a chuspóir a ghiniúint, a dhéanamh, chumasadh, nó a athscríobh comhad den sórt sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add a target unless a human operator or CI should run it directly."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit sprioc a chur mura rud é gur chóir d'oibreoir daonna nó CI é a reáchtáil go díreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add emojis to `docs/agents/` files, but workflow `name:` fields are not agent files and MUST use emojis."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit emojis a chur leis `docs/agents/` comhaid, ach sreabhadh oibre `name:` Nach bhfuil réimsí comhaid gníomhaire agus MUST úsáid emojis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add emojis to headlines in `docs/agents/` files, as these are machine-readable instruction files where emojis interfere with parsing."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit emojis a chur le ceannlínte i `docs/agents/` comhaid, mar go bhfuil na comhaid teagaisc meaisín- inléite i gcás ina cur isteach Iomajis ar parsing."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add new `set_fact` variables that shadow or wrap existing `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_*` variables."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a chur nua `set_fact` athróg go scáth nó wrap atá ann cheana `TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_*` athróg."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT add regression tests that only verify that code, YAML, Jinja, or other source text is still present."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tástálacha aischéimnithí a chur ach a fhíorú go bhfuil cód, YAML, Jinja, nó téacs foinse eile i láthair fós."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT assume that Act should be used automatically for workflow work. If the user agrees with the proposal, you SHOULD use `make act-workflow` for the iteration loop."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit glacadh leis gur chóir an tAcht a úsáid go huathoibríoch le haghaidh obair sreabhadh oibre. Má aontaíonn an t-úsáideoir leis an togra, úsáideann tú SHOULD `make act-workflow` don lúb iteration."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT break a single sentence across multiple lines in `.md` files. Each sentence MUST stay on one logical line so readers see the full statement at once and reflowable Markdown viewers do not introduce stray line breaks. A new line in the source MUST mean a new sentence, a new paragraph, or a structural element (heading, list item, table row, fenced block); never a soft wrap inside one sentence."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit briseadh pianbhreith amháin ar fud línte il i `.md` comhaid. Gach pianbhreith MUST fanacht ar líne loighciúil amháin mar sin feiceann léitheoirí an ráiteas iomlán ag an am céanna agus nach bhfuil lucht féachana Markdown reflowable isteach sosanna líne fáin. Ciallaíonn líne nua sa MUST foinse pianbhreith nua, mír nua, nó eilimint struchtúrach (ceannteideal, mír liosta, sraith tábla, bloc fál); riamh wrap bog taobh istigh de phianbhreith amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT close or skip a criterion that has not been explicitly verified, even if the implementation looks complete."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a dhúnadh nó a skip critéar nach bhfuil fíoraithe go sainráite, fiú má tá an cur i bhfeidhm iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit automatically without explicit confirmation from the user. You MUST ask before committing."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tiomantas go huathoibríoch gan deimhniú sainráite ón úsáideoir. MUST tú a iarraidh roimh cion."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit during an active iteration, because a live deploy makes the pre-commit hook stash the files it reads. If a commit is unavoidable, you MUST pass `--no-verify`."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tiomantas le linn atriall gníomhach, mar gheall ar a dhéanann imscaradh beo an Hook réamh-immit stash na comhaid léann sé. Má tá gealltanas dosheachanta, MUST tú pas `--no-verify`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT commit log files to the repository."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit comhaid logála tiomanta don stór."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` or any similar generated users dictionary."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a chruthú `group_vars/all/04_users.yml` nó aon fhoclóir úsáideoirí den chineál céanna a ghintear."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT create `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` or any similar generated applications dictionary."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a chruthú `group_vars/all/05_applications.yml` nó aon fhoclóir iarratais ginte den chineál céanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT debug from screenshots alone. Use raw logs."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit debug ó screenshots ina n-aonar. Úsáid logaí amh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT delete the main branch"
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit an brainse is mó a scriosadh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT enter the inner loop unless all of the following hold:"
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit dul isteach ar an lúb istigh mura bhfuil gach ceann de na shealbhú seo a leanas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT explicitly declare a documentation page as \"the SPOT\", \"Single Point of Truth\", or any equivalent self-label. SPOT status is conferred by readers cross-linking to the page from elsewhere, not by the page asserting it about itself. Describe the subject directly instead."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a dhearbhú go sainráite leathanach doiciméadú mar \"an nóta\", \"Pointe Aonair na Fírinne\", nó aon féin-lipéad coibhéiseach. Tugann léitheoirí tras-nasc chuig an leathanach ó áiteanna eile, ní ag an leathanach a dhearbhaíonn é féin. Déan cur síos ar an ábhar go díreach ina ionad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT fall back to `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` unless the reuse path has concrete evidence of a broken inventory or host stack, per [Compose Loop](compose.md)."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit titim ar ais go dtí `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` mura bhfuil fianaise nithiúil ag an gcosán athúsáide ar fhardal briste nó ar Stack óstach, in aghaidh [Naisc ábhartha eile](compose.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT filter applications inside the lookup. The lookup returns the full set; filtering by enabled or allowed apps stays a caller concern (for example [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit iarratais scagaire taobh istigh den Lookup. Filleann an Lookup an tacar iomlán; scagadh trí apps cumasaithe nó a cheadaítear fhanann imní glaoiteoir (mar shampla [applications_current_play.py](../../../../../../plugins/lookup/applications_current_play.py))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT hard-code values that come from `meta/services.yml` or `vars/main.yml` directly in `files/Dockerfile`."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit luachanna crua-cód a thagann ó `meta/services.yml` nó `vars/main.yml` go díreach i `files/Dockerfile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT hardcode values that differ between operators (paths, image tags, CPU or memory caps)."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit luachanna cruad NACH bhfuil difriúil idir oibreoirí (cosáin, clibeanna íomhá, caipíní LAP nó cuimhne)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a new keying scheme."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit scéim eochairithe nua a thabhairt isteach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a parallel cache. The variants are cached per `roles_dir` inside `utils/cache/applications.py` and returned as deep copies; mutating the result MUST NOT corrupt subsequent lookups."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a thabhairt isteach taisce comhthreomhar. Na leaganacha atá i dtaisce in aghaidh an `roles_dir` taobh istigh `utils/cache/applications.py` agus ar ais mar chóipeanna domhain; mutating an toradh NACH lookups truaillithe ina dhiaidh sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a runtime variant-selector extra-var. Variant data lives in the inventory after init; the deploy stage reads it as plain `applications.<app>` overrides."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a thabhairt isteach ar leagan runtime-roghnaí seach-var. Tá cónaí ar shonraí cartlainne san fhardal tar éis init; léann an chéim imscaradh é mar plain `applications.<app>` róródaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce a third parallel cache for the same concern. If you need to cache a derived shape, add a getter to the appropriate domain module (`applications`, `users`, or `domains`) that builds on the existing primitives."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a thabhairt isteach taisce tríú comhthreomhar don imní céanna. Más gá duit a chur i dtaisce cruth díorthaithe, cuir getter leis an modúl fearainn cuí (`applications`, `users`, nó `domains`) a thógann ar na primitives atá ann cheana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce an alternative key source. The `application_id` is always the role directory name."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit foinse eochair eile a thabhairt isteach. An bhfuil `application_id` Is é i gcónaí an t-ainm eolaire ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce conditionals or templating tricks at the variant-list level. The deep-merge is straight YAML; complex shape decisions belong inside the role itself."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit coinníollachtaí nó cleasanna templating a thabhairt isteach ag an leibhéal liosta athraitheach. Is é an domhain-cumasc díreach YAML; cinntí cruth casta bhaineann taobh istigh den ról féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce duplicate, conflicting, or purely cosmetic churn unless formatting cleanup is part of the task."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit dúblach, coimhlint, nó curn amháin cosmaideacha a thabhairt isteach mura bhfuil an glanadh formáidithe mar chuid den tasc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT introduce new override mechanisms (e.g. per-role variable mappings) that bypass the existing environment-variable interface."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit meicníochtaí nua sáraithe a thabhairt isteach (e.g. mapaí athróg per-role) a sheachbhóthar an comhéadan atá ann cheana comhshaoil- athraitheach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT invent commands, workflows, or files that do not exist."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit orduithe chumadh, sreabhadh oibre, nó comhaid nach bhfuil ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT key user overrides by `username`; use the canonical key."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit overrides úsáideoir eochair ag `username`; bain úsáid as an eochair Canonical."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mark a criterion as done (`- [x]`) until its behavior is verified end to end."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a mharcáil critéar mar a rinneadh (`- [x]`) go dtí go bhfuil a iompar a fhíorú deireadh a chur leis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mock collaborators that are part of the integration boundary being tested. The point is to verify real interaction."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit comhoibrithe bréige atá mar chuid den teorainn comhtháthú á thástáil. Is é an pointe a fhíorú idirghníomhaíocht fíor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT move an external test into `tests/lint/`, `tests/unit/`, or `tests/integration/` just for convenience when it still depends on live third-party state."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tástáil sheachtrach a bhogadh isteach `tests/lint/`, `tests/unit/`, nó `tests/integration/` ach le haghaidh áise nuair a bhraitheann sé fós ar stát tríú páirtí beo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT mutate values returned by `utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml`. The same dict instance is returned to every caller; callers that need to mutate MUST `copy.deepcopy()` the result first. Each domain getter documents whether it returns a fresh deep copy or the cached instance; respect that contract."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit luachanna mutate ar ais ag `utils.cache.yaml.load_yaml`. Tá an cás céanna deachúil ar ais chuig gach glaoiteoir; callairí gur gá a mutate MUST `copy.deepcopy()` an toradh ar dtús. Gach doiciméid getter fearainn cibé an bhfilleann sé cóip domhain úr nó an cás taisce; meas an conradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT name the file `meta/inventory.yml` for any reason. See the placement rule."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit ainm an comhad `meta/inventory.yml` ar chúis ar bith. Féach an riail socrúcháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT pass more than 7 roles to a single `apps=...` invocation, regardless of how many roles share the same root cause. If more than 7 roles share a root cause, you MUST split them into batches of at most 7. Within each batch, list roles in ascending alphabetical order. Process batches in ascending alphabetical order of their first role, sequentially. Once the shared root cause is verified fixed in one batch, you MUST skip all remaining batches that share that same root cause."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit pas a fháil níos mó ná 7 róil chuig ceann amháin `apps=...` invocation, is cuma cé mhéad ról a roinnt ar an chúis fhréamh céanna. Más mó ná 7 róil a roinnt ar chúis fhréamh, MUST tú iad a roinnt i mbaisceanna de ag an chuid is mó 7. Laistigh de gach baisc, rólanna liosta in ord aibítre ardaitheach. Baisceanna Próiseas in ord aibítre ardaitheach a gcéad ról, go seicheamhach. Nuair a bheidh an chúis fhréamh roinnte a fhíorú socraithe i bhaisc amháin, MUST tú skip gach baisc atá fágtha a roinnt go bhfuil an chúis fhréamh céanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT place emojis before the headline text, as this interferes with heading hierarchy rendering in some tools."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit emojis áit roimh an téacs ceannlíne, mar cuireann sé seo le rindreáil ordlathas ceannteideal i roinnt uirlisí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT post follow-up messages to the main timeline if they belong to an ongoing thread."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit teachtaireachtaí a leanúint suas go dtí an príomh-amlíne má bhaineann siad le snáithe leanúnach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT push directly to `main`"
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a bhrú go díreach chuig `main`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT push, directly or through wrappers that push implicitly."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a bhrú, go díreach nó trí fillteáin a bhrú intuigthe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT put per-environment overrides into `inventories/<env>/default.yml` for cases that belong to a single role; use this file instead. The environment inventory keeps only cross-cutting environment knobs."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit overrides in aghaidh an-comhshaoil isteach `inventories/<env>/default.yml` do chásanna a bhaineann le ról amháin; úsáid an comhad seo ina ionad. Coinníonn an fardal comhshaoil ach knobs timpeallacht trasghearrtha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT read from role `vars/main.yml` mappings of consuming roles (e.g. `test_e2e_playwright.*`) to override runner behaviour."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit léamh ó ról `vars/main.yml` mapaí de róil Tógann (e.g. `test_e2e_playwright.*`) iompar rádala a shárú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT reference requirement files from code (comments, docstrings, error / log messages, prose inside templates). Tokens such as `req 019`, `req 019 Rule 3`, `requirement-005`, or path references like `docs/requirements/019-...md` MUST NOT appear in `.js`, `.py`, `.yml`, `.j2`, `.sh`, or any other non-Markdown source file. Requirements are an authoring contract enforced by lint and integration tests; comments anchored to requirement numbers rot when requirements are renumbered, restructured, or rewritten, and they conflate the *what is true now* (which the comment should describe) with the *audit trail of how we got here* (which belongs in commit messages, pull request descriptions, and the requirement file itself). Describe the *why* of the code in present-state language; the contract enforcement lives in tests, not folklore."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit comhaid riachtanas tagartha ó cód (tuairimí, docstrings, earráid / teachtaireachtaí logáil, próise taobh istigh teimpléid). Tokens nós `req 019`, `req 019 Rule 3`, `requirement-005`, nó tagairtí cosán cosúil `docs/requirements/019-...md` NÍ MÓR le feiceáil i `.js`, `.py`, `.yml`, `.j2`, `.sh`, nó aon chomhad foinse neamh-Markdown eile. Is éard atá i gceist le ceanglais ná conradh údarach a chuirtear i bhfeidhm le tástálacha lint agus lánpháirtíochta; tuairimí a chuirtear ar ancaire le huimhreacha riachtanais lobhadh nuair a dhéantar na ceanglais a athuimhriú, a athstruchtúrú, nó a athscríobh, agus déanann siad na ceanglais a chumadh *cad é fíor anois* (a ba chóir an trácht cur síos) leis an *rian iniúchta ar conas a fuair muid anseo* (a bhaineann i teachtaireachtaí tiomanta, tarraingt cur síos ar iarraidh, agus an comhad ceanglas féin). Déan cur síos ar an *cén fáth* den chód i dteanga reatha stáit; tá an forfheidhmiú conartha ina chónaí i dtástálacha, gan bhéaloideas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT register runners against `infinito-nexus/core` from fork CI — the `GITHUB_TOKEN` there lacks organisation-level `administration` scope. The env-var override in `vars/main.yml` handles this automatically."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit dara háit a chlárú i gcoinne `infinito-nexus/core` ó forc CI — `GITHUB_TOKEN` easpa leibhéal eagraíochta `administration` raon feidhme. An override env-var i `vars/main.yml` Láimhseálann sé seo go huathoibríoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT reintroduce `default_users` or `defaults_users` references; they do not exist anymore."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a thabhairt isteach `default_users` nó `defaults_users` tagairtí; nach bhfuil siad ann níos mó."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT replace layout, spacing, sizing, positioning, z-index, overflow, animation timing, or component structure."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit ionad leagan amach, spásáil, sizing, suíomh, z-innéacs, thar maoil, uainiú beochan, nó struchtúr a chomhdhéanann í."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT replace semantic behavior, JavaScript hooks, or framework-specific class wiring."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit ionad iompar shéimeantach, crúcaí JavaScript, nó creat-sonrach sreangú rang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT report the task complete until all of the following hold:"
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tuairisc a thabhairt ar an tasc iomlán go dtí gach ceann de na shealbhú seo a leanas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT rewrite history on protected branches"
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit stair athscríobh ar bhrainsí cosanta"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT rewrite large upstream style blocks when a focused override or token remapping is enough."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit athscríobh bloic stíl sruth mór nuair a override dírithe nó remapping chomhartha go leor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT run more than one deploy command at the same time. Deployments MUST be executed serially, never in parallel."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a reáchtáil níos mó ná ceann a imscaradh ordú ag an am céanna. Imscaradh MUST a fhorghníomhú go sraitheach, riamh i comhthreomhar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT run more than one unit test command at the same time. Unit tests MUST be executed serially, never in parallel."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a reáchtáil níos mó ná ceann amháin ordú tástála aonad ag an am céanna. tástálacha aonad MUST a fhorghníomhú go sraitheach, riamh i comhthreomhar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT skip the inter-round purge."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit skip an purge idir babhta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use `--no-verify` unless the user gives a direct, unambiguous instruction to bypass the hook (e.g. \"skip the hook\", \"bypass pre-commit\")."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a úsáid `--no-verify` mura dtugann an t-úsáideoir teagasc díreach, gan athbhrí chun an Hook a sheachaint (e.g. \"skip an Hook\", \"seachbhóthar réamhchoimisiún\")."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use `.md` files to describe implementation logic that is already visible in the code."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a úsáid `.md` comhaid chun cur síos a dhéanamh ar loighic atá le feiceáil cheana féin sa chód."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "You MUST NOT use `templates/Dockerfile.j2` unless the Dockerfile requires Jinja2 control-flow logic (e.g. `{% if %}`, `{% for %}`)."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a úsáid `templates/Dockerfile.j2` mura n-éilíonn an Dockerfile Jinja2 loighic rialaithe-sreabhadh (e.g. `{% if %}`, `{% for %}`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use em dashes (—) as thought breaks or clause separators. You SHOULD prefer complete sentences. Hyphens (-) MAY be used for compound words and list items."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a úsáid em Fleascí (— — — —) mar bhriseanna smaoinimh nó deighilteoirí clásal. Is fearr leat SHOULD abairtí iomlán. Téipíní (- - - - -) MAY a úsáid le haghaidh focail cumaisc agus míreanna liosta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT use the full URL as link text. Use the domain name, `here`, or the filename instead. Never use the full path."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit a bhaint as an URL iomlán mar téacs nasc. Bain úsáid as an ainm fearainn, `here`, nó an ainm comhaid ina ionad. Ná bain úsáid as an cosán iomlán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write tests for non-executable files such as `.yml` or `.j2`. Test the code that consumes them instead."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tástálacha a scríobh le haghaidh comhaid neamh-infheidhmithe ar nós `.yml` nó `.j2`. Tástáil an cód a itheann iad ina ionad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST NOT write tests only for non-executable files such as `.yml` or `.j2`. Test the behavior that consumes them."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit tástálacha a scríobh ach amháin le haghaidh comhaid neamh-infheidhmithe ar nós `.yml` nó `.j2`. Tástáil an t-iompar a itheann iad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
