# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep dependencies inside this package minimal. Cache primitives MUST remain importable from filter plugins, lookup plugins, and CLI tools without dragging in heavy dependencies. **Specifically: `applications.py` MUST stay ansible-free at import time.** See CI runs 24934007615 / 24935979190 for the regression that motivated the split. Tests in `tests/unit/python/utils/cache/test_data.py::TestImportableWithoutAnsible` pin both the import-time and call-time invariants."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil spleáchais taobh istigh den phacáiste íosta. Cache primitives MUST fós iniompórtáilte ó plugins scagaire, plugins Lookup, agus uirlisí CLI gan dragging i spleáchas trom. **Go sonrach: `applications.py` MUST fanacht saor in aisce ag am a allmhairiú.** Féach Ritheann CI 24934007615 / Baile 24935979190 don aischéimniú a spreag an scoilt. Tástáil i `tests/unit/python/utils/cache/test_data.py::TestImportableWithoutAnsible` bioráin an invariants allmhairiú-am agus glaoch-am araon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep diffs focused, readable, and easy to review."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil diffs dírithe, inléite, agus éasca le hathbhreithniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep event handlers, observers, and DOM mutations idempotent because injected scripts may run on dynamic pages or be triggered repeatedly."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil láimhseálaithe ócáid, breathnóirí, agus sócháin DOM idempotent mar is féidir scripteanna instealladh reáchtáil ar leathanaigh dinimiciúil nó a spreagadh arís agus arís eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep explanations simple and explicit."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil mínithe simplí agus follasach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep external tests outside the default `make test` flow so normal validation stays reproducible without third-party network access."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil tástálacha seachtracha lasmuigh den réamhshocraithe `make test` sreabhadh mar sin tréimhsí bailíochtaithe gnáth inspreagtha gan rochtain líonra tríú páirtí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep helper-only logic, plumbing, and intermediate steps in `scripts/` or other implementation files."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil cúntóir-amháin loighic, pluiméireachta, agus céimeanna idirmheánacha i `scripts/` nó comhaid cur chun feidhme eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep public targets stable, named clearly, and documented."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil spriocanna poiblí cobhsaí, ainmnithe go soiléir, agus doiciméadaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep refactoring changes small enough to review and validate."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil athruithe refactoring beag go leor chun athbhreithniú agus a bhailíochtú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep role-local or component-specific shell helpers in their owning area, such as `roles/.../files/`, when they belong to a single role."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil ról-áitiúil nó chomhpháirt-sonrach Cúntóirí sliogáin ina gceantar féin, mar shampla `roles/.../files/`, nuair a bhaineann siad le ról amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep semver-like image versions current when the upstream image publishes matching newer tags."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil semver-mhaith leaganacha íomhá atá ann faoi láthair nuair a fhoilsíonn an íomhá upstream meaitseáil clibeanna níos nuaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep shell entrypoints in `scripts/` so they stay easy to discover and reuse."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil ar iontráil bhlaosc i `scripts/` mar sin fanacht siad éasca a fháil amach agus a athúsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST keep the command surface small enough that contributors can discover the obvious path quickly."
msgstr "MUST tú a choinneáil ar an dromchla ordú beag go leor gur féidir le rannchuiditheoirí a fháil amach an cosán soiléir go tapa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST load the following pages before editing any file, in this order:"
msgstr "MUST tú luchtú na leathanaigh seo a leanas roimh eagarthóireacht ar aon chomhad, san ord seo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST map `--color-01-*` and `--color-rgb-01-*` onto existing framework or app variables first. Add selector-level overrides only when variable mapping is insufficient."
msgstr "Léarscáil MUST tú `--color-01-*` agus `--color-rgb-01-*` ar chreat nó athróg app atá ann cheana féin ar dtús. Cuir overrides leibhéal roghnóir ach amháin nuair nach bhfuil mapáil athraitheach leordhóthanach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST mark the PR **ready for review** before requesting a review. CI starts automatically at that point."
msgstr "MUST tú marc an PR **réidh le hathbhreithniú** sula n-iarrfar athbhreithniú. Tosaíonn CI go huathoibríoch ag an bpointe sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open a PR to merge into `main`"
msgstr "MUST tú a oscailt PR a chumasc isteach `main`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open a Pull Request only when it is ready for real review."
msgstr "MUST tú a oscailt Iarratas Tarraingthe amháin nuair a bhíonn sé réidh le haghaidh athbhreithniú fíor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST open the browser console during runs that depend on injected JavaScript and confirm it is free of unhandled errors before reporting success."
msgstr "MUST tú a oscailt an consól bhrabhsálaí le linn ritheann go bhfuil ag brath ar instealladh JavaScript agus a dheimhniú go bhfuil sé saor in aisce earráidí gan láimhseáil roimh rath a thuairisciú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST output the storage path of the Playwright assets for the affected `<child-run-id>`."
msgstr "MUST tú aschur an cosán stórála na sócmhainní Playwright don tionchar `<child-run-id>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST override application values through the normal Ansible variable `applications`:"
msgstr "MUST luachanna iarratais override tríd an athróg Ansible gnáth `applications`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST override user values through the normal Ansible variable `users`:"
msgstr "MUST tú luachanna úsáideora override tríd an athróg Ansible gnáth `users`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pass every `ARG` via the `args:` block in `templates/compose.yml.j2`, directly after the `{{ lookup('template', 'roles/sys-svc-container/templates/build.yml.j2') }}` call."
msgstr "MUST tú pas gach `ARG` tríd an `args:` bloc i `templates/compose.yml.j2`, go díreach tar éis an `{{ lookup('template', 'roles/sys-svc-container/templates/build.yml.j2') }}` glaoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pass only the runtime values that the browser logic actually needs. Keep the rendered template surface small and explicit."
msgstr "MUST tú pas a fháil ach na luachanna runtime go bhfuil an loighic bhrabhsálaí riachtanais iarbhír. Coinnigh an dromchla teimpléad a rinneadh beag agus follasach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST pick the template that matches your change. The table below links the actual templates."
msgstr "MUST tú roghnaigh an teimpléad a oireann do athrú. Nascann an tábla thíos na teimpléid iarbhír."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST place role-local Dockerfiles at `files/Dockerfile`."
msgstr "MUST áit ról-áit Dockerfiles ag `files/Dockerfile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST place the emoji before the category, never after."
msgstr "MUST tú áit an Iomaji roimh an gcatagóir, riamh tar éis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer `make` targets over raw `docker`/`docker compose`/`ansible-playbook`/`python`/shell invocations whenever an equivalent target exists in the [`Makefile`](Makefile). Inspect the `Makefile` first; fall back to the raw command only when no target covers the operation. The reason is operational consistency, not permissioning. Raw commands also auto-allow under the sandbox."
msgstr "Is fearr leat MUST `make` spriocanna thar amh `docker`/ Baile`docker compose`/ Baile`ansible-playbook`/ Baile`python`/ sonraisc bhlaosc aon uair a bhfuil sprioc coibhéiseach sa [`Makefile`](Makefile). Iniúchadh an `Makefile` ar dtús; titim ar ais go dtí an t-ordú amh ach amháin nuair a chlúdaíonn aon sprioc an oibríocht. Is é an chúis comhsheasmhacht oibriúcháin, gan cead. orduithe amh freisin auto-cheadú faoin mbosca gainimh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer commands permitted in [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) over commands that require interactive approval when an equivalent exists."
msgstr "Is fearr leat MUST orduithe ceadaithe i [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) os cionn orduithe a dteastaíonn formheas idirghníomhach uathu nuair atá coibhéis ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer defining shared fixed role variables once in `vars/main.yml` as the single source of truth instead of recomputing them with `lookup()` or dotted variable composition in `*.j2` or `*.yml`."
msgstr "Is fearr leat MUST sainmhíniú athróg ról seasta roinnte uair amháin i `vars/main.yml` mar an fhoinse amháin na fírinne in ionad recomputing iad le `lookup()` nó comhdhéanamh athróg dotted i `*.j2` nó `*.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer stable selectors and narrow hooks over text matching or timing-based hacks."
msgstr "Is fearr leat MUST roghnóirí cobhsaí agus crúcaí caol thar téacs meaitseáil nó am-bhunaithe hacks."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prefer token mapping over selector rewrites so the role keeps its native structure."
msgstr "Is fearr leat MUST mapáil chomhartha thar rewrites roghnóir mar sin coimeádann an ról a struchtúr dúchais."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST prepend `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true` to every `make compose-deploy` command in the iteration (any mode), so trace, screenshot, and video of passing Playwright tests stay inspectable. Omit only when the user has explicitly opted out of per-test artefacts. For the full propagation chain see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."
msgstr "Tá tú MUST prepend `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true` le gach `make compose-deploy` ordú sa iteration (aon mhodh), mar sin rian, screenshot, agus físeán a rith tástálacha Playwright fanacht ininiúchta. Omit ach amháin nuair a roghnaigh an t-úsáideoir go sainráite as déantáin tástála. Chun an slabhra iomadú iomlán a fheiceáil [Tástáil Playwright](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST process the buckets in order: first complete the initial-pass actions under [External Failures](#external-failures) for every failure classified as external, then iterate over [Branch-Caused Failures](#branch-caused-failures). Issues filed afterwards for unresolvable branch-caused failures (per the last bullet of [Branch-Caused Failures](#branch-caused-failures)) reuse the External Failures procedure but are NOT part of this initial pass."
msgstr "MUST tú a phróiseáil na buicéid in ord: an chéad iomlán na gníomhartha tosaigh-pas faoi [Teipeanna Seachtracha](#external-failures) i gcás gach teipe rangaithe mar ráta seachtrach, ansin os a chionn [Teipeanna Brainse-Caused](#branch-caused-failures). Saincheisteanna a comhdaíodh ina dhiaidh sin le haghaidh teipeanna neamh-inréitithe (in aghaidh an piléar deireanach de [Teipeanna Brainse-Caused](#branch-caused-failures)) athúsáid an nós imeachta Teipeanna Seachtracha ach NACH cuid den phas tosaigh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST provide Playwright tests for every `web-*` role."
msgstr "MUST tú a chur ar fáil tástálacha Playwright do gach `web-*` ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST provide only the environment values that the role-local Playwright suite actually needs."
msgstr "MUST tú a chur ar fáil ach na luachanna comhshaoil go bhfuil an ról-áitiúil Playwright sraith riachtanais iarbhír."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST quote the `name:` value in double quotes because the colon (`:`) in the name is a reserved YAML character."
msgstr "MUST tú ceanglófar an `name:` luach i Sleachta dúbailte mar gheall ar an colon (`:`) Is é an t-ainm carachtar YAML forchoimeádta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST re-read `AGENTS.md` and follow all instructions in it before proceeding."
msgstr "MUST tú ath-léamh `AGENTS.md` agus lean na treoracha go léir ann sula dtéann siad ar aghaidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST re-run the full no-`apps=` sweep only as the final end-to-end parity confirmation, after the tail has gone green."
msgstr "MUST tú ath-reáchtáil an iomlán aon-`apps=` sweep ach amháin mar an dearbhú deiridh deireadh-le-deireadh parity, tar éis an eireaball imithe glas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `javascript.js`](../files/role/javascript.js.md) BEFORE you implement role-local JavaScript so you can see how browser-side behavior should be implemented before you add or rewrite injected scripts."
msgstr "Léigh tú MUST [Ról na Gaeilge `javascript.js`](../files/role/javascript.js.md) BEFORE tú a chur i bhfeidhm ról-áitiúil JavaScript ionas gur féidir leat a fheiceáil conas ba chóir a iompar bhrabhsálaí-taobh a chur i bhfeidhm sula gcuireann tú nó athscríobh scripteanna instealladh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `playwright.env.j2`](../files/role/playwright.env.j2.md) BEFORE you implement role-local Playwright environment templates so the rendered test inputs match the supported user journey."
msgstr "Léigh tú MUST [Ról na Gaeilge `playwright.env.j2`](../files/role/playwright.env.j2.md) BEFORE tú a chur i bhfeidhm ról-áitiúil teimpléid timpeallacht Playwright mar sin an ionchur tástála a rinneadh mheaitseáil leis an turas úsáideora tacaíocht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `playwright.spec.js`](../files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) BEFORE you implement or refactor role-local Playwright specs so end-to-end coverage stays aligned with the role behavior."
msgstr "Léigh tú MUST [Ról na Gaeilge `playwright.spec.js`](../files/role/playwright.spec.js.md) BEFORE tú a chur i bhfeidhm nó refactor ról-áitiúil specs Playwright sin tréimhsí clúdach deireadh-le-deireadh ailínithe leis an iompar ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read [Role `style.css`](../files/role/style.css.md) BEFORE you implement role-local CSS so you can see how CSS should be implemented before you add or rewrite overrides."
msgstr "Léigh tú MUST [Ról na Gaeilge `style.css`](../files/role/style.css.md) BEFORE tú a chur i bhfeidhm ról-áitiúil CSS ionas gur féidir leat a fheiceáil conas ba chóir CSS a chur i bhfeidhm sula gcuireann tú nó overrides athscríobh."

msgid "You MUST read every file under [`docs/agents/`](docs/agents/) (full directory walk, including subdirectories) for the agent execution flow, EXCEPT [`docs/agents/action/`](docs/agents/action/)."
msgstr ""

msgid "You MUST read every file under [`docs/contributing/`](docs/contributing/) (full directory walk, including subdirectories) for the full contributor guidance."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read the full requirement file before writing any code or plan."
msgstr "MUST tú a léamh an comhad ceanglas iomlán roimh scríobh aon cód nó plean."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST read the per-test logs for every run: the `list` reporter output, `playwright-report/index.html`, and `test-results/<test>/error-context.md` for any failed test."
msgstr "MUST tú léamh na logs in aghaidh an-tástála do gach reáchtáil: an `list` aschur tuairisceoir, `playwright-report/index.html`, agus `test-results/<test>/error-context.md` le haghaidh aon tástála theip."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST render the real entry point, URLs, feature flags, and credentials that the deployed role exposes."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit an pointe iontrála fíor, URLanna, bratacha gné, agus dintiúir go nochtann an ról a imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST replace hard-coded theme values: colors, RGB channels, gradients, borders, shadows, overlays, placeholder and focus colors."
msgstr "MUST tú in ionad crua-códaithe luachanna téama: dathanna, cainéil RGB, grádáin, teorainneacha, scáthanna, overlays, sealbhóirí áite agus dathanna fócas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST replace related values together: surface color, text color, border, hover, active, disabled, and alpha variants."
msgstr "MUST tú in ionad luachanna gaolmhara le chéile: dath dromchla, dath téacs, teorainn, hover, gníomhach, faoi mhíchumas, agus leaganacha alfa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST reply in a thread when responding to a specific message or topic."
msgstr "MUST tú freagra i snáithe agus tú ag freagairt do theachtaireacht nó do thopaic ar leith."

