msgstr "Tá tú MUST reáchtáil `make autoformat` roimh gach gealltanas. Más rud é `make autoformat` modifies aon chomhaid a bhí céim cheana féin, MUST tú ath-stage na comhaid roimh rith an tiomantas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST run `make test` before every deploy. Only proceed with the deploy if all tests pass."
msgstr "Tá tú MUST reáchtáil `make test` roimh gach imscaradh. Ach dul ar aghaidh leis an imscaradh má pas gach tástálacha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST set `design.css.colors.base` in the inventory as the single base color."
msgstr "Tá tú MUST leagtha `design.css.colors.base` san fhardal mar an dath bonn amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST set the executable bit on shell scripts that are meant to run directly."
msgstr "MUST tú a leagtar ar an giotán inrite ar scripteanna bhlaosc atá i gceist a reáchtáil go díreach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST state assumptions clearly."
msgstr "Tá tú boinn tuisceana stáit MUST go soiléir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST stop the inner loop. Inner-loop runs do NOT pick up role changes."
msgstr "MUST tú stop a chur leis an lúb istigh. Ritheann Inner-loop NACH piocadh suas athruithe ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST store general `.sh` scripts for infinito.nexus administration under `scripts/`."
msgstr "MUST tú a stóráil ginearálta `.sh` scripteanna do infinito.nexus riarachán faoi `scripts/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat AI output as a draft that must be reviewed for wrong assumptions, duplicate logic, and security mistakes."
msgstr "MUST tú a chóireáil aschur AI mar dréacht nach mór a athbhreithniú do thoimhdí mícheart, loighic dhúbailte, agus botúin slándála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat [AGENTS.md](../../../../AGENTS.md) as the single, runtime-agnostic source of agent-specific execution instructions. There are no tool-specific extension files."
msgstr "MUST tú a chóireáil [AGENTS.md](../../../../AGENTS.md) mar an fhoinse amháin, runtime-agnostic na treoracha a fhorghníomhú gníomhaire-sonrach. Níl aon uirlis-sonrach comhaid síneadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md) as the entry point for all agent-specific execution instructions."
msgstr "MUST tú a chóireáil [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md) mar an pointe iontrála do na treoracha a fhorghníomhú go sonrach gníomhaire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat each unchecked criterion (`- [ ]`) as a discrete unit of work."
msgstr "MUST tú a chóireáil gach critéar unchecked (`- [ ]`) mar aonad scoite oibre."

msgid "You MUST treat the matching Pull Request template described in [Pull Request Templates](../../contributing/artefact/git/pull-request.md) and stored in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE` as the SPOT for requirements, file checks, validation expectations, and the Definition of Done."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat the provided log files as the source of truth for the failure they describe."
msgstr "MUST tú a chóireáil na comhaid logáil ar fáil mar an fhoinse na fírinne le haghaidh an teip cur síos orthu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat the selected template as the SPOT for PR structure, author input, and review context."
msgstr "MUST tú cóir leighis a chur ar an teimpléad roghnaithe mar an SPOT do struchtúr PR, ionchur údar, agus athbhreithniú comhthéacs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST treat warnings about the concrete implementation, wiring, or runtime behavior as bugs that should be fixed."
msgstr "MUST tú rabhadh a chóireáil faoi chur i bhfeidhm coincréite, sreangú, nó iompar runtime mar bugs ba chóir a shocrú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST update your branch before merging"
msgstr "MUST tú suas chun dáta do bhrainse roimh chumasc"

