msgid "You MUST use Python `unittest` as the test framework."
msgstr "Bain úsáid as Python `unittest` mar an creat tástála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) as the SPOT for the general development workflow, testing, review, and the code and development guides."
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) mar an t-íospóid don sreabhadh oibre ginearálta forbartha, tástáil, athbhreithniú, agus an cód agus na treoracha forbartha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) for local development setup, contribution workflow, testing, and review."
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../../CONTRIBUTING.md) do thus forbartha áitiúla, sreabhadh oibre ranníocaíochta, tástáil, agus athbhreithniú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) keywords in all documentation to express requirement levels unambiguously:"
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) eochairfhocail i ngach doiciméadú a chur in iúl leibhéil riachtanas gan athbhrí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [SECURITY.md](../../../SECURITY.md) for vulnerability reporting."
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [SECURITY.md](../../../SECURITY.md) le haghaidh tuairisciú leochaileachta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [SUPPORT.md](../../../SUPPORT.md) for project help and participation."
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [SUPPORT.md](../../../SUPPORT.md) do chabhair tionscadail agus rannpháirtíocht."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use [agents.md](https://agents.md/) as the external meta reference for AGENTS files."
msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú [agents.md](https://agents.md/) mar an tagairt meta seachtrach do chomhaid AGENTS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
