msgstr "Úsáid MUST tú `javascript.js.j2` nuair a bhraitheann an script ar athróga ról nó luachanna fardal, agus úsáid `files/javascript/javascript.js` nuair a bhíonn an script statach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST use `templates/javascript.js.j2` when runtime values from the inventory or role variables must be rendered into the browser code."
