# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify schema conformance per [Contributing `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): persona names match `<persona>: <flow>`, every skip routes through `PERSONA_<X>_BLOCKED=true` or `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` (never runtime detection), and every persona reaches an authenticated surface and drives a role-specific interaction."
msgstr "MUST tú a fhíorú comhlíonta scéimre in aghaidh an [Ag cur `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): meaitseáil ainmneacha persona `<persona>: <flow>`, gach bealaí skip trí `PERSONA_<X>_BLOCKED=true` nó `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` (riamh bhrath runtime), agus sroicheann gach persona dromchla fíordheimhnithe agus thiomáineann idirghníomhaíocht ról-shonrach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify that primary actions, links, forms, cards, dialogs, navigation, and overlays still belong to the same visual system."
msgstr "MÓR duit a fhíorú go mbaineann gníomhaíochtaí príomhúla, naisc, foirmeacha, cártaí, dialóga, nascleanúint, agus overlays fós leis an gcóras amhairc céanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST verify that the new app behaves correctly end to end, not just whether it compiles or deploys."
msgstr "MUST tú a fhíorú go n-iompraíonn an app nua deireadh i gceart chun deiridh, ní hamháin cibé an bhfuil sé compiles nó imscaradh."

