msgid "You MUST wait for the DOM before touching elements, and guard missing elements so unrelated pages do not break."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR duit fanacht ar an DOM roimh eilimintí touching, agus garda eilimintí ar iarraidh mar sin nach bhfuil leathanaigh nach bhfuil a bhriseadh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST write in English in all public channels and threads."
msgstr "MÓR duit scríobh i mBéarla i ngach cainéal poiblí agus snáitheanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD add `design.font.import_url` when typography and colors should be controlled together."
msgstr "Tú SHOULD cuir `design.font.import_url` nuair ba chóir clóscríobh agus dathanna a rialú le chéile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD annotate non-obvious keys with a short inline comment that explains why they exist, not what they do."
msgstr "SHOULD tú eochracha neamh-obvious le trácht inlíne gearr a mhíníonn cén fáth a bhfuil siad ann, ní cad a dhéanann siad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD attach screenshots, traces, logs, and migration notes when they materially help validate the change."
msgstr "SHOULD tú ag gabháil screenshots, rianta, logs, agus nótaí imirce nuair a chabhróidh siad go hábhartha a bhailíochtú an t-athrú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD avoid creating or maintaining manual per-directory indexes when automatic indexing already covers the same pages. An additional `index.rst` inside a `docs/` subdirectory is NOT RECOMMENDED because the root index already covers those pages automatically, but it MAY be added when a focused local entry point materially improves navigation. If such a local `index.rst` is added, it SHOULD stay minimal and MUST NOT duplicate a manually curated page inventory that the automatic index already provides."
msgstr "SHOULD tú a sheachaint a chruthú nó a chothabháil innéacsanna láimhe in aghaidh-eolaire nuair a chlúdaíonn innéacsú uathoibríoch cheana féin ar na leathanaigh chéanna. An bhreis `index.rst` taobh istigh de `docs/` Tá subdirectory NACH MOLADH toisc go gclúdaíonn an t-innéacs fréimhe cheana féin na leathanaigh sin go huathoibríoch, ach MAY a chur leis nuair a pointe iontrála áitiúil dírithe feabhas ábhartha nascleanúint. Má tá a leithéid de áitiúil `index.rst` Tá sé seo a leanas, fanacht SHOULD íosta agus NACH MUST dúblach fardal leathanach láimh a leigheas go soláthraíonn an t-innéacs uathoibríoch cheana féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD avoid jumping straight to repeated remote CI reruns when `make act-workflow` can validate the workflow locally and the user agreed to use it."
msgstr "SHOULD tú a sheachaint léim díreach a reruns CI iargúlta arís agus arís eile nuair `make act-workflow` Is féidir leis an sreabhadh oibre a bhailíochtú go háitiúil agus d'aontaigh an t-úsáideoir é a úsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD check what is actually consuming space before cleaning up:"
msgstr "Tá tú SHOULD seiceáil cad é i ndáiríre Tógann spás roimh ghlanadh suas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD cover edge cases: empty inputs, missing keys, and boundary values, not only the happy path."
msgstr "Clúdaíonn tú cásanna imeall SHOULD: ionchuir folamh, eochracha ar iarraidh, agus luachanna teorann, ní hamháin ar an cosán sásta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD group them by dependency family such as `tests/external/update/` or `tests/external/github/` when more than one test exists."
msgstr "Tá tú grúpa SHOULD iad ag teaghlach dependency, mar shampla `tests/external/update/` nó `tests/external/github/` nuair atá níos mó ná tástáil amháin ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep each test focused on one integration boundary."
msgstr "Coinníonn tú SHOULD gach tástáil dírithe ar theorainn comhtháthú amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep external tests focused, advisory, and easy to run on demand."
msgstr "SHOULD tú a choinneáil tástálacha seachtracha dírithe, comhairleach, agus éasca a reáchtáil ar éileamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep messages concise and on-topic."
msgstr "Cóipeáil nasc leis an tweet Leabaigh an Tweet ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD keep network traffic narrow and query each external dependency only as much as needed for a meaningful result."
msgstr "Tá tú SHOULD choinneáil tráchta líonra caol agus ceist gach spleáchas seachtrach ach oiread agus is gá le haghaidh toradh brí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD name test methods after the behavior they verify, not the function name alone (e.g. `test_needed_false_when_disabled`)."
msgstr "Tá tú modhanna tástála ainm SHOULD tar éis an t-iompar a fhíorú siad, ní an t-ainm fheidhm ina n-aonar (e.g. `test_needed_false_when_disabled`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD open a Pull Request as a **draft** while your change is still in progress. CI will not run and no reviewer time is spent until you mark it ready."
msgstr "Tá tú SHOULD oscailt Iarratas Tarraing mar **dréacht-tuarascáil** cé go bhfuil do athrú fós ar siúl. Ní rithfidh CI agus ní chaitear aon am athbhreithnithe go dtí go marcálfaidh tú é réidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD place emojis after the headline text to visually highlight headings and improve scannability."
msgstr "Tá tú emojis áit SHOULD tar éis an téacs ceannlíne chun béim a chur ar ceannteidil amhairc agus scannability a fheabhsú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer `Dockerfile` over `Dockerfile.j2`; only use `Dockerfile.j2` when build-time templating is genuinely required."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD `Dockerfile` os cionn os cionn `Dockerfile.j2`; ach úsáid `Dockerfile.j2` nuair a thógáil-am templating ag teastáil i ndáiríre."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer `README.md` for directory-level documentation when a human-facing entry point already exists."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD `README.md` le haghaidh doiciméadú ar leibhéal an eolaire nuair atá pointe iontrála daonna-facing ann cheana féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer explicit version pinning over drifting tags when the role depends on stable, reproducible deploys."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD leagan sainráite pinning thar clibeanna drifting nuair a bhíonn an ról ag brath ar cobhsaí, imscaradh inspreagtha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer semantic improvements that reduce maintenance effort."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD feabhsuithe shéimeantacha a laghdú iarracht cothabhála."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer smaller, more focused folders over dumping many unrelated files into one directory."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD níos lú, fillteáin níos dírithe thar dumpáil go leor comhaid nach bhfuil i eolaire amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer targets that compose smaller scripts instead of embedding large shell fragments in the `Makefile`."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD spriocanna a chumadh scripteanna níos lú in ionad embedding blúirí bhlaosc mór sa `Makefile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD prefer the explicit cached getter over re-implementing the same memoisation in a calling module."
msgstr "Is fearr leat SHOULD an getter sainráite taisce thar ath-chur chun feidhme an gcuimhne céanna i modúl glaoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD run `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<role>` for the redeploy."
msgstr "Tá tú ag rith SHOULD `make compose-deploy mode=update apps=<role>` don ath-imlonnú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD run sandbox-confined commands directly on the host. The sandbox bounds what they can read, write, and reach. See [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."
msgstr "Tá tú SHOULD reáchtáil sandbox-confined orduithe go díreach ar an óstach. An bosca gainimh bounds cad is féidir leo a léamh, scríobh, agus a bhaint amach. Féach ar [sandbox.md](docs/contributing/tools/agents/claude/sandbox.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD separate mechanical cleanup from behavior changes when that lowers risk."
msgstr "SHOULD tú cleanup meicniúil ar leith ó athruithe iompair nuair a ísliú riosca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD set `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` to the same value as `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` to disable swap inflation. Allowing swap masks OOM conditions that the real runner would hit."
msgstr "Tú leagtha SHOULD `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` leis an luach céanna mar `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` boilsciú babhtála a dhíchumasú. Ag ligean maisc babhtála coinníollacha OOM go mbeadh an dara háit fíor bhuail."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD start a new thread for every distinct topic rather than continuing an unrelated conversation inline."
msgstr "Tá tú SHOULD tús a chur le snáithe nua do gach ábhar ar leith seachas leanúint ar aghaidh comhrá neamhghaolmhar inlíne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD test realistic inputs that match what Ansible would pass at runtime."
msgstr "Tá tú ionchur tástála SHOULD réadúil a mheaitseáil cad a bheadh Ansible pas a fháil ag runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use `make compose-deploy` (full discovery) only when you need broad coverage and have enough time and resources."
msgstr "Tá tú úsáid a bhaint as SHOULD `make compose-deploy` (bláthanna cumhra: cumhráin) ach amháin nuair is gá duit clúdach leathan agus go leor ama agus acmhainní."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use emojis when they make the text more visually appealing, improve the mood, and increase readability."
msgstr "Tá tú shampoo úsáid emojis nuair a dhéanann siad an téacs níos mó achomharc amhairc, feabhas a chur ar an giúmar, agus inléiteacht a mhéadú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD use targeted manual CI jobs instead of rerunning the full pipeline if you only need one focused check."
msgstr "Úsáideann tú SHOULD spriocdhírithe poist CI lámhleabhar in ionad rerunning an píblíne iomlán más gá duit ach seiceáil dírithe amháin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD write code so it is logical and self-explanatory and usually does not need comments."
msgstr "SHOULD tú cód scríobh mar sin tá sé loighciúil agus féin-míniú agus de ghnáth ní gá tuairimí."

