msgid "[ ] \"Sign in with Bluesky\" completes an AT Protocol OAuth round-trip against the platform PDS provided by [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), and an authenticated user can create a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record that is written to their PDS repo."
msgstr "[ ] \"Cláraigh le Bluesky\" PDS an t-ardán PDS arna sholáthar ag Prótacal AT OAuth [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), agus is féidir le úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe a chruthú `community.lexicon.calendar.event` taifead atá scríofa ar a n-PDS repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) A Flowise supervisor flow runs a cross-agent pipeline that hands a result from one agent to the other and returns a combined output; single-agent use still works without Flowise. **Blocked:** depends on the criterion above."
msgstr "[ ] (Céim na Céime 2) Amharc ar gach eolas Flowise Ritheann sreabhadh maoirseoir píblíne trasghníomhaí a lámha mar thoradh ar ghníomhaire amháin go dtí an ceann eile agus tuairisceáin aschur le chéile; úsáid aonair-gníomhaire oibríonn fós gan Flowise. **Blocáilte:** ag brath ar an critéar thuas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) Hermes' and OpenClaw's MCP-server mode is enabled; Flowise connects to both as MCP clients and delegates a task to each. **Blocked:** `stdio_only`, see [Blocked on hardware and on Phase 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."
msgstr "[ ] (Céim na Céime 2) Hermes 'agus OpenClaw's mód MCP-freastalaí ar chumas; Nascann Flowise leis an dá mar chliaint MCP agus toscairí tasc do gach. **Blocáilte:** `stdio_only`, féach [Bloc ar chrua-earraí agus ar Chéim 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. how the worker join tokens are persisted, exact NFS export options per distro, how the per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out is plumbed, exact placement-constraint shape for the swarm-without-nfs warning path, exact openresty `upstream` resolution syntax for swarm-internal DNS) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification. Additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the affected role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[ ] **ceisteanna a shoiléiriú ach amháin ag an tús.** Aon cheist oscailte, athbhrí, nó cinneadh ar iarraidh (e.g. conas a théann an t-oibrí le comharthaí fós, roghanna onnmhairithe NFS cruinn in aghaidh an distro, conas an in aghaidh an-ról `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` Is fearr-amach plumbed, cruth socrúcháin-snáithín cruinn don cosán rabhadh swarm-gan-nfs, openresty cruinn `upstream` syntax réiteach do DNS Swarm-internal) MÓR a ardú uair amháin ag tús an reáchtáil, i bhabhta ceist amháin baisce, BEFORE aon comhad a athrú. Chomh luath agus na ceisteanna sin a fhreagairt, an gníomhaire NÍ MÓR sos le haghaidh tuilleadh soiléirithe. D'aimsigh an gníomhaire débhríochtaí breise MUST lár-reáchtáil ag baint úsáide as a bhreithiúnas is fearr, a taifeadadh sa ról atá i gceist `README.md` nó cód comment, agus revisited ach amháin ag athbhreithniú PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Every ✅ cell is wired**: for each ✅ pair (row → column), the row role declares an addon in its `meta/addons/` that integrates the column role, with `mechanism` set appropriately and (when the column role is an in-repo role) a `bridges:` entry resolving to the row role's `meta/services.yml` service for that target."
msgstr "[ ] **Gach ✅ Tá cill wired**: do gach ✅ péire péire (a chéile → colún), Dearbhaíonn an ról as a chéile addon ina `meta/addons/` a chomhtháthaíonn an ról colún, le `mechanism` a shocrú go cuí agus (nuair is ról in-repo é an ról colún) a `bridges:` teacht réiteach ar an ról as a chéile ar `meta/services.yml` seirbhís don sprioc sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Feature** - Adds or extends CI/CD functionality"
