# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **No `ask` prompts mid-run.** The agent MUST NOT trigger any tool call that routes through `permissions.ask` in [.claude/settings.json](../../.claude/settings.json) during implementation. Where a tool would otherwise route through `ask`, the agent MUST select an equivalent already covered by `permissions.allow`, or rephrase the operation to fit the sandbox. The single permitted exception is the final commit at the end of the run."
msgstr "[ ] **Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil `ask` leideanna lár-rith.** NÍ MÓR an gníomhaire tús aon glaoch uirlis go bealaí trí `permissions.ask` i [.claude/settings.json](../../.claude/settings.json) le linn an chur chun feidhme. Sa chás go mbeadh uirlis bealach ar shlí eile trí `ask`, roghnaigh an gníomhaire MUST coibhéiseach atá clúdaithe cheana féin ag `permissions.allow`, nó rephrase an oibríocht a d'oirfeadh an bosca gainimh. Is é an eisceacht ceadaithe aonair an gealltanas deiridh ag deireadh an reáchtáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **No interruptions.** Bug fixes, deploy failures, lint failures, `make test` failures, healthcheck flaps, swarm-init flakes, NFS mount races, workflow reruns until green — every issue MUST be resolved at its root inside this same iteration without prompting the operator. Workarounds, ad-hoc skips, retry-until-green loops, or \"track in a follow-up\" deferrals MUST NOT be used."
msgstr "[ ] **Gan aon bhriseadh.** Socraíonn Bug, teipeanna imscaradh, teipeanna lint, `make test` teipeanna, flaps healthcheck, gcáithníní swarm-init, rásaí NFS mount, reruns sreabhadh oibre go dtí glas - gach MUST cheist a réiteach ag a fhréamh taobh istigh seo atriall céanna gan leideanna an t-oibreoir. Timpealláin oibre, scipeanna ad-hoc, lúba athfhriotail-go dtí glas, nó \"rian i ndiaidh-suas\" NÍ MÓRTHÓIRÍ a úsáid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **One commit at the end.** ALL changes (role, meta, Playwright spec, documentation, marketplace entry, and the ticked checkboxes in this document) MUST be combined into ONE commit, created only after every Acceptance Criterion above is checked off (`- [x]`) and `make test` is green. The agent MUST NOT push; the operator runs `git-sign-push` outside the sandbox per [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)."
msgstr "[ ] **One tiomantas ag an deireadh.** GACH athruithe (ról, meta, spec Playwright, doiciméadú, iontráil margadh, agus na seicliostaí tic sa doiciméad seo) MUST a chur le chéile isteach AMHÁIN tiomantas, a cruthaíodh ach amháin tar éis gach Critéar Glacadh thuas a sheiceáil amach (`- [x]`) agus `make test` tá sé glas. NÍ MÓR an gníomhaire a bhrú; Ritheann an t-oibreoir `git-sign-push` taobh amuigh den bhosca gainimh in aghaidh [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **One commit at the end.** The agent MUST NOT create any intermediate commit. ALL changes (the three new roles, the openresty swarm-mode adaptations, the pilot role updates, the CI workflow, schema entries, group_vars defaults, documentation, and the ticked checkboxes in this document) MUST be combined into ONE commit, created only after every Acceptance Criterion above is checked off (`- [x]`), `make test` is green, and `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` is green on its first scheduled run. Per-step commits, checkpoint commits, and partial commits MUST NOT be created. The agent MUST NOT push; the operator runs `git-sign-push` outside the sandbox per [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)."
msgstr "[ ] **One tiomantas ag an deireadh.** NÍ MÓR an gníomhaire a chruthú aon tiomantas idirmheánach. GACH athruithe (na trí ról nua, na hoiriúnuithe swarm-mode openresty, nuashonruithe ról píolótach, an sreabhadh oibre CI, iontrálacha scéimre, group_vars mainneachtainí, doiciméadú, agus na seicliostaí tic sa doiciméad seo) MUST a chur le chéile isteach AMHÁIN tiomantas, a cruthaíodh ach amháin tar éis gach Critéar Glacadh thuas a sheiceáil amach (`- [x]`), `make test` glas, agus `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` glas ar a chéad reáchtáil sceidealta. Tiomantas Per-step, tiomantas seicphointe, agus geallúintí páirteach NACH a chruthú. NÍ MÓR an gníomhaire a bhrú; Ritheann an t-oibreoir `git-sign-push` taobh amuigh den bhosca gainimh in aghaidh [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)."

