# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Tá cás séalaithe inbhraite: `/v1/sys/health` data recovery 503 (a dhearbhú ag `test-seal-status.js`) agus rialú foláireamh tinte ar an gcoinníoll sin. *An bhfuil `OpenBaoSealed` airdeall anois longa leis an ról féin, i `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, a bhfuil an `alert_rule_roles` concatenates Lookup isteach sa Prometheus comhad riail. Tá an conradh sláinte-cód dhearbhú ag an seomra spec agus an cosán sláintiúil deimhnithe beo (200 sa dá chumadh agus muc), ach an **lámhaigh** Riamh coinníoll breathnaíodh - go bhfuil gá le cás séalaithe d'aon ghnó, a dhéanann an tsamhail AppRole-amháin admin awkward a shocrú i dtástáil.* **Ceartú ón gcur chun feidhme:** Coinníonn OpenBao ainm spás méadrach Vault, mar sin tá an tomhas `vault_core_unsealed`, Níl, `openbao_core_unsealed` — agus tá sé neamh-inúsáidte mar fhoinse foláirimh anseo: ar nód sláintiúil, neamh-séalaithe, tá sé astaítear mar `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, mar sin `== 0` bheadh tine go buan. Bain úsáid as an gcríochphointe sláinte mar an comhartha bunscoile, le `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` mar an comhthacaíocht méadrach-taobh. Tá an riail foláirimh féin fós gan íoc."

