# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Compose and Swarm tests prove endpoint DNS/routing from each client and prove an adapter cannot reach unrelated application networks. **The isolation half is covered by the CLI test:** `run.sh` calls `isolation.sh` whenever `mcp.implementation` is `adapter`, and that reads from the engine which networks the sidecar is attached to and fails unless they are the role's own network plus the declared upstream one. `test_mcp_provider_cli_test.py` holds the test, so every enabled provider reaches it — a provider without a CLI test would also skip the isolation proof. What remains is the routing half: DNS resolution of each endpoint from each client, in both deploy modes, which only a running cluster can show."
msgstr "[ ] Múirín agus tástálacha Swarm chruthú endpoint DNS / ródú ó gach cliant agus ní féidir le adapter teacht ar líonraí iarratais nach mbaineann. **Tá an leath aonraithe clúdaithe ag an tástáil CLI:** `run.sh` Glaoigh orainn `isolation.sh` aon uair `mcp.implementation` Is maith liom `adapter`, agus a léann as an inneall a líonraí an sidecar ceangailte agus go mainneoidh mura bhfuil siad an ról líonra féin móide an ceann réamhtheachtach dearbhaithe. `test_mcp_provider_cli_test.py` Tá an tástáil, mar sin sroicheann gach soláthraí cumasaithe é - bheadh soláthraí gan tástáil CLI skip freisin an cruthúnas leithlisiú. Cad é fós an leath ródú: rún DNS de gach críochphointe ó gach cliant, sa dá modhanna imscaradh, nach féidir ach braisle ag rith a thaispeáint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Compose mode brings up an isolated agent via the compose `runtime:` key; swarm mode brings up an isolated agent via the node-default runtime on a placement-labelled node. Both modes are green end to end."
msgstr "[ ] Tugann modh múirín gníomhaire iargúlta tríd an gcomhdhéanamh `runtime:` eochair; Tugann mód swarm suas gníomhaire iargúlta tríd an runtime node-default ar nód socrúcháin-lipéadaithe. Tá an dá modhanna deireadh glas go deireadh."

