# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating a calendar event on the atmo instance results, within a bounded delay, in a matching event published by [`web-app-mobilizon`](../../roles/web-app-mobilizon/) at `event.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` and thus federated over ActivityPub."
msgstr "[ ] Ag cruthú ócáid féilire ar na torthaí ar nós agmo, laistigh de mhoill faoi cheangal, in imeacht meaitseála foilsithe ag [`web-app-mobilizon`](../../roles/web-app-mobilizon/) ag an `event.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` agus dá bhrí sin chothaithe thar ActionPub."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Gníomhaire a chruthú forálacha roghnacha cuntas úsáideora ardán tiomnaithe tríd an atá ann cheana `users`/ LDAP /Keycloak meicníocht; fíoraíonn an gníomhaire mar an gcuntas sin (Logáil isteach Painéal na nIonstraimí OIDC, MCP `auth_subject: user`), agus imscaradh i gcoinne cuntas atá ann cheana ina ionad sin oibríonn freisin. **Déanta go páirteach:** tá an leath cuntas i bhfeidhm agus linted (féach ar [Féiniúlacht Gníomhaire](#agent-identity)); Is é an leath MCP **blocáilte** ar aon soláthraí imscaradh ag tairiscint in aghaidh an-úsáideoir OAuth, a bhfuil an barra [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) tacair roimh `auth_subject: user` féadfar é a dhearbhú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Tá dintiúir agus comhpháirteanna URL rúnda as láthair ó logs, cumraíocht neamh-rúnda a ghintear, API freagraí, aschur tasc, rianta Playwright, agus téacs eisceacht. **Tionóltar triúr de na sé dhromchla go suntasach:** logs agus aschur tasc ag [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), a éilíonn `no_log` nó `mask_values` ar aon chúram MCP go láimhseálann an dá rúnda agus priontaí; rianta Playwright ag [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), a forbids a `playwright.env.j2` ó déanamh `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` rúnda nó `key_credential` URL comhpháirt. Riachtanais chumraíocht neamh-rúnaithe aicmiú rúnda / neamh-rún de chomhaid a rinneadh nach bhfuil ann go fóill; Tá freagraí API agus téacs eisceacht tuairimí runtime don chéim imscaradh."

