msgid "[ ] `svc-ai-agent-broker` deploys in compose and swarm mode and passes the repository lint suite."
msgstr ""

msgid "[ ] `svc-ai-s1` builds, serves `/healthz`, and answers the gateway's choice question with an alias the router offered."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `tasks/flavor/ansible/03_run_playbook.yml` invokes `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ services.matrix.playbook_tags }}` from `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/` and exits cleanly on all three ansible-flavor variants (V1 / V2 / V3) in a fresh-host matrix deploy."
msgstr "[ ] `tasks/flavor/ansible/03_run_playbook.yml` agairt `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ services.matrix.playbook_tags }}` ó `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/` agus bealaí amach cleanly ar gach trí leaganacha ansible-flavor (VV VV1 / V2 / V3) i maitrís úr-óstach imscaradh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `templates/playwright.env.j2` exposes every env var the specs read; service flags carry `# nocheck` rationale where applicable."
msgstr "[ ] `templates/playwright.env.j2` nochtann gach env var na specs a léamh; bratacha seirbhíse a iompar `# nocheck` réasúnaíocht i gcás inarb infheidhme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `tests/external/update/addons/` contains a warn-only external test that checks every addon with `update.monitored=true` for newer upstream versions."
msgstr "[ ] `tests/external/update/addons/` Tá tástáil seachtrach rabhadh-amháin a seiceálacha gach addon le `update.monitored=true` le haghaidh leaganacha níos nuaí upstream."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `tls.py` unit tests: onion→forced off; foreign→app-level flavor; unset→`TLS_MODE`."
