# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] web-app-docs builds the deployed working tree as the unlisted version `deployed`, because the git mirror only holds what is pushed to `main`."
msgstr "[ ] web-app-docs Tógann an crann oibre imscaradh mar an leagan neamhliostaithe `deployed`, toisc go bhfuil an scáthán git ach an méid atá bhrú chun `main`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] ☑️ cells (infinito-native service flags already declared in `meta/services.yml`) are NOT re-declared as `meta/addons/` addons; they remain service integrations, and only ✅/🪙 cells become new addons."
