# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive) established the `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` contract: scenarios gate on `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` flags so a deploy with `disable=<service>` reports `skipped` instead of `failed`. [004 - Generic RBAC auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) plus [017 - Biber RBAC coverage](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) extend that contract to RBAC-aware non-admin scenarios."
msgstr "[006 - Seirbhís-gated tástálacha Playwright](README.md#archive) bunaithe ar an `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` conradh: cásanna geata ar `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` bratacha sin a imscaradh le `disable=<service>` Tuarascálacha agus tuarascálacha `skipped` in ionad `failed`. [004 - Cineálach RBAC auto-sholáthar](README.md#archive) móide móide [017 - clúdach Biber RBAC](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) an conradh sin a leathnú chuig cásanna neamh-admin RBAC-aware."

