# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) at the repository root holds the most recent releases inline. Older releases live one-file-per-version under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/), linked from the `## Older Releases` section at the bottom of the active changelog."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) ag an fhréamh stór an scaoileadh is déanaí inlíne. Scaoileann níos sine beo aon-comhad-in aghaidh-leagan faoi [docs / athrú /](../../changelog/), nasctha ón `## Older Releases` alt ag bun an ChangeLog gníomhach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) is trimmed; every older entry is written to its own file under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/) named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, and the `## Older Releases` index at the bottom of the active changelog is rebuilt from the archive directory listing so it never drifts away from what is on disk."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) Tá bearrtha; Tá gach iontráil níos sine scríofa ar a comhad féin faoi [docs / athrú /](../../changelog/) ainmnithe ainmnithe `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, agus an `## Older Releases` innéacs ag bun an Changelog gníomhach atógadh as an liosta eolaire cartlann mar sin ní sruthanna sé ar shiúl ó cad atá ar diosca."

