# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Kata Containers](https://katacontainers.io/) is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single `runsc` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
