msgstr "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) astaíonn `auth_type: system_oauth` le folamh `key` do na freastalaithe, mar sin Open WebUI réitíonn sé dearbhán an ghlaoitheora féin in aghaidh na hiarrata."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the Prometheus administrator RBAC group through the oauth2-proxy gate, so the `biber` persona is denied before it ever reaches a Prometheus page: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. That denial is not lost coverage — this role's own spec asserts it for every consumer, together with the admin reach and scrape-target parity checks. The `administrator` persona is blocked only when `services.sso.enabled` is false: without the co-deployed Keycloak there is no proxy in front of Prometheus, hence no login round-trip and no logout control to drive. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admhaíonn ach an Prometheus riarthóir grúpa RBAC tríd an oauth2-proxy geata, mar sin an `biber` persona é a dhiúltú sula sroicheann sé riamh Prometheus leathanach: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) a dhearbhú `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. Nach bhfuil séanadh caillte clúdach - an ról seo specs féin Dearbhaíonn sé do gach tomhaltóir, mar aon leis an admin a bhaint amach agus scrape-target seiceálacha parity. An bhfuil `administrator` persona bac ach amháin nuair a `services.sso.enabled` Is bréagach: gan an comh-imscartha Keycloak níl aon seachfhreastalaí os comhair Prometheus, dá bhrí sin, aon logáil isteach bhabhta-turas agus aon rialú logout a thiomáint. An bhfuil `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe insroichte baseline reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list in the development inventory. The proxy denies `biber` before LAM is ever reached, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admhaíonn ach an `web-app-lam` riarthóir grúpa RBAC chuig an oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), agus `biber` Déanann liosta ról folamh san fhardal forbartha. An seachfhreastalaí denies `biber` roimh LAM Tá bainte amach riamh, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) a dhearbhú `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) declares no `sso` service, so this role is never registered as a Keycloak client. Its only HTTP surface is the anonymous logout conductor and the `/logout` endpoints proxied by [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — there is no login form, no account and no session to end. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The service's real coverage is per consumer: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) parameterises the injected logout JS over `roles_with_service('logout')`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) Dearbhaíonn aon `sso` seirbhís, mar sin tá an ról seo riamh cláraithe mar Keycloak cliant. Is é an t-aon dromchla HTTP an seoltóir logout anaithnid agus an `/logout` endpoints proxied ag [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — níl aon fhoirm logála isteach ann, gan aon chuntas ná aon seisiún chun deireadh a chur leis. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) dá bhrí sin, dearbhaíonn `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Tá clúdach fíor na seirbhíse in aghaidh an tomhaltóra: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) paraiméadar an logáil isteach instealladh JS thar `roles_with_service('logout')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`, and the role seeds no chess account — [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) renders only the `APP_ADMIN_URL` / `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` contact pair. Neither the `biber` nor the `administrator` persona has a login surface here, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) bioráin `sso.enabled` agus `logout.enabled` go dtí `false`, agus na síolta ról aon chuntas fichille - [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) rindreáil ach an `APP_ADMIN_URL` / Baile `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` péire teagmhála. Ní an `biber` ná an `administrator` Tá dromchla logáil isteach ag persona anseo, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) a dhearbhú `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. An `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe insroichte baseline reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`; the navigator is a read-only front-end over the role graph with no accounts and no auth layer. There is nothing for the `biber` or `administrator` persona to log in to, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) bioráin `sso.enabled` agus `logout.enabled` go dtí `false`; Is é an seoltóir a léamh-amháin tosaigh-deireadh thar an graf ról gan aon chuntais agus aon ciseal auth. Níl aon rud le haghaidh an `biber` nó `administrator` persona chun logáil isteach, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) a dhearbhú `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. An `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe insroichte baseline reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

