# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) provisions only the administrator in Shopware's user table. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, so no oauth2-proxy fronts the role and the storefront carries no authenticated surface at all; the Keycloak login provider that [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) configures covers the administration backend alone. `biber` therefore has no account in any matrix variant and [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` unconditionally."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) forálacha ach amháin an riarthóir i Shopware's tábla úsáideora. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) bioráin `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, mar sin níl aon oauth2-proxy os comhair an ról agus an storefront ndéanann aon dromchla fíordheimhnithe ar chor ar bith; an Keycloak soláthróir logáil isteach [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) clúdaíonn cumraithe an ceann riaracháin ina n-aonar. `biber` dá bhrí sin níl aon chuntas in aon mhalairt maitrís agus [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) seeds only the administrator into Magento's admin table (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, credentials from [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` reaches the backend solely through the oauth2-proxy declared in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that proxy is absent and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) síolta ach amháin an riarthóir isteach Magento's tábla admin (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, dintiúir ó [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` sroicheann an chúl amháin tríd an oauth2-proxy dearbhaithe i [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Sa `services.sso.enabled: false` leaganacha maitrís go bhfuil seachfhreastalaí as láthair agus `biber` Níl aon chuntas dúchais, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. An `administrator` Coinníonn persona a logáil isteach dúchais trí `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` agus ritheann i ngach leagan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) Cruthaíonn an cuntas leis `tootctl accounts create` agus ní leagann nó gabhálacha focal faire, mar sin `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — Keycloak rún - ní féidir a thiomáint Mastodon's natives `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` Níl aon Mastodon cuntas a thabhairt ar chor ar bith, ós rud é OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) Is é an cosán amháin a bheadh a chruthú amháin. I an `services.sso.enabled: false` leaganacha maitrís go bhfuil cosán a bhaint, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. An SeaweedFS scéal compánach ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) thiomáineann an turas admin céanna agus scipeanna ar an bhratach chéanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) Ritheann tar éis `update.php`. Áirítear leis an gconradh tomhaltóra geata roinnte, ansin léann an dá domhanda ar ais as an gcoimeádán ag rith le `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` agus Dearbhaíonn an soláthraí, an URL bonn agus an tsamhail, mar sin ní féidir le dromchla unconfigured teacht ar imscaradh glas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Cruthaíonn úinéir neamh-Superuser tiomnaithe (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, pasfhocal unusable) móide a spás oibre féin, agus cuireann sé deireadh leis an péire sin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Waits for the ExApp heartbeat, cláir an daemon imscaradh agus an ExApp (bealach bealaigh `^/mcp`, briathra `POST,GET,DELETE`, leibhéal rochtana `1`), ar chumas an ExApp, mints focal faire app don chuntas MCP tiomnaithe trí `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, leanann sé trí `sys-token-store` faoi bhun `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, agus Dearbhaíonn go bhfuil fíordheimhnithe `initialize` freagraí glaoch `200`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) creates no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) additionally closes the database login whenever LDAP is on. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants neither persona has credentials, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) sreanga Keycloak mar an t-aon soláthraí logáil isteach an ról seo cumraithe, agus [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) Cruthaíonn aon Mobilizon cuntas; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) Chomh maith leis sin dúnann an logáil isteach bunachar sonraí aon uair a bhfuil LDAP ar. I an `services.sso.enabled: false` Tá leaganacha maitrís nach persona dintiúir, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. An `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe bonnlíne reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) seeds only the administrator into SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` reaches the app through SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, where `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints the account on first assertion. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants there is no SAML entry point and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` for the generic persona journeys (the LDAP spec still signs `biber` in from the directory). The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) síolta ach amháin an riarthóir isteach SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / Baile `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` sroicheann an app tríd SuiteCRM's féin SAML logáil isteach i gcoinne Keycloak, i gcás `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints an cuntas ar an gcéad dearbhú. I an `services.sso.enabled: false` leaganacha maitrís nach bhfuil aon phointe iontrála SAML agus `biber` Níl aon chuntas dúchais, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` do na turais persona cineálach (an spec LDAP comharthaí fós `biber` i ón eolaire). An `administrator` Coinníonn persona a logáil isteach dúchais trí `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` agus ritheann i ngach leagan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` i ngach malairt maitrís, toisc nach féidir leis an gcúntóir persona roinnte tiomáint an ról seo comhartha-in in aon cheann acu. Trí chúis neamhspleách, gach leor ar a chuid féin:"

