msgid "`GH_TOKEN` must be available on the Ansible control node (`delegate_to: localhost`) for the `gh api` registration call to succeed. In CI this is forwarded into the DinD container by `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` ní mór a bheith ar fáil ar an nód rialaithe Ansible (`delegate_to: localhost`) do na `gh api` glaoch clárúcháin go n-éireoidh. I CI seo ar aghaidh isteach i gcoimeádán DinD ag `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), from `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` in [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) belongs to GitLab's built-in `root` account, not to the Keycloak `administrator` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for `biber` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), ó `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` i [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) bhaineann le GitLab's tógtha isteach `root` cuntas, gan an Keycloak `administrator` ainm úsáideora na comharthaí persona i le, agus gan aon GitLab Tá cuntas ar fáil `biber` ar chor ar bith - Is é an comhartha OmniAuth-i an cosán amháin a bheadh a chruthú amháin. I an `services.sso.enabled: false` leaganacha maitrís go bhfuil cosán a bhaint, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. An `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe bonnlíne reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` keeps OpenCloud from modifying the directory. User lifecycle is owned by the LDAP and Keycloak side."
msgstr "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` Coinníonn OpenCloud ó mhodhnú an eolaire. Tá saolré úsáideora faoi úinéireacht ag an LDAP agus Keycloak taobh."

