msgid "`Generate app token` step"
msgstr "`Generate app token` céim chéim"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (optional), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"
msgstr "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (roghnach), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an agent runtime from Nous Research that runs tool-using agent sessions against OpenAI-compatible model backends. In gateway mode it serves an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, where clients address the agent with the same request shape they use for a plain model."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ Is gníomhaire runtime ó Nous Taighde a ritheann seisiúin gníomhaire uirlis-úsáid i gcoinne OpenAI-compatible backends samhail. I mód geata feidhmíonn sé OpenAI-comhoiriúnach HTTP API, i gcás cliaint aghaidh a thabhairt ar an ngníomhaire leis an cruth iarrata céanna a úsáideann siad le haghaidh múnla plain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ Is runtime gníomhaire uathrialach. Ritheann an ról seo i mód chorpraithe: ar mheaisín atá tiomanta dó, le rochtain dhíreach ar chrua-earraí an mheaisín sin. Sa chás go gcuireann na róil coimeádáin teorainn eithne idir an gníomhaire agus a óstach, is é an teorainn an gléas féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ Is ardán uathoibriú bhaile foinse oscailte a nascann feistí cliste-baile ó díoltóirí go leor taobh thiar de comhéadan áitiúil amháin. Coinníonn sé stát gléas, dashboards, agus rialacha uathoibriú ar an meaisín a ritheann sé, agus nochtann siad trí comhéadan gréasáin, a REST API, agus freastalaí MCP tógtha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ Is gineadóir suíomh statach tapa, singil-binary scríofa i Go. Tógann an ról seo a Hugo suíomh ó aon sruth Git stór lárnach (cineál gas: in airde `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) ag an am íomhá-tógáil agus feidhmíonn an rinneadh HTML/CSS/JS trí nginx. Níl aon bhunachar sonraí, aon fhreastalaí iarratais, agus aon chúllíne dinimiciúil ag runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — bealaí sreabhadh oibre nua-líne deighilte, tá tacaíocht á tabhairt do chomhaltaí an ghrúpa concurrency. Gan é a bheadh na cúntóirí ar ceal freisin ritheann an grúpa riamh rialú, mar shampla an `cron-*` sreabhadh oibre a éisteann ar `push`. Díorthaigh an liosta ó `concurrency:` bloic, ní ó cad a bhreathnaíonn a bhaineann le: `entry-delete-branch.yml` eochracha a ghrúpa ar *scriostar* ref, mar sin nach bhfuil sé ina bhall de ghrúpa bhrú ar, agus liostú bheadh sé a dhéanamh a bhrú a `main` cuir glanadh brainse neamhghaolmhar ar ceal. Luach go liostaí aon cosán ar gach aborts seachas adh meaitseáil rud ar bith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var for the inner compose wrapper"
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var le haghaidh an fillteán inmheánach chumadh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (default `8640` = 6 days) controls how long every Nexus proxy repo holds an upstream response before revalidating. The bootstrap helper applies it as `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, and `negativeCache.timeToLive`. The default is intentionally one day below the 7-day `Valid-Until` window Debian and Ubuntu generate in their apt `Release` files, so Nexus always refreshes the manifest before `apt-get update` would see it expired. Raise it for slow-moving upstreams when staleness is preferable to upstream load; lower it further for fast-moving feeds (`apt-debian-security`, branch-pinned tarballs) when staleness becomes visible."
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (cineál gas: in airde `8640` = = = 6 laethanta saoire) rialuithe cé chomh fada is a repo seachfhreastalaí Nexus freagra in aghaidh srutha roimh athluacháil. Feidhmíonn an cúntóir buataisítrap é mar `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, agus `negativeCache.timeToLive`. Is é an réamhshocraithe aon lá amháin faoi bhun an 7- lá an lae `Valid-Until` fuinneog Debian agus Ubuntu ghiniúint ina n-apt `Release` comhaid, mar sin Nexus athnuachan i gcónaí ar an léiriú roimh `apt-get update` bheadh sé in éag. Ardaigh é le haghaidh sruthanna a bhaint go mall nuair is fearr an t-ualach srutha; níos ísle é a thuilleadh le haghaidh beatha a bhaint go tapa (`apt-debian-security`, tarballs brainse-bioráin) nuair a thiocfaidh chun bheith staleness le feiceáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, optional `INSPECT_CMD` or positional args"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, roghnach `INSPECT_CMD` nó stua suite"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` can still override the generated list explicitly"
