msgid "`Integration tests` verify behavior across modules and runtime boundaries."
msgstr "`Integration tests` a fhíorú iompar ar fud modúil agus teorainneacha runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` resolves the root role's config via `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` so `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` sees the variant-merged `services` map and discovers every shared provider the variant enables."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` réitíonn an ról fhréamh ar config trí `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` amhlaidh `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` Feiceann an leagan-cumasc `services` léarscáil agus fionnachtana gach soláthraí roinnte ar chumas an leagan."

