msgstr "`LDAP.USER.OBJECTS` liostaí na ranganna réad struchtúrtha agus cúnta ceangailte le hiontrálacha úsáideora:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, user/admin emails, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, CA identity: all onion, mutually consistent (users `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pass the oauth2-proxy email filter)"
msgstr "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, r-phoist úsáideora / admin, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, CA aitheantais: gach oinniún, comhsheasmhach (úsáideoirí `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pas a fháil sa oauth2-proxy scagaire r-phost)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ is a runtime for open large language models. Its headless server mode loads models from a local store and answers chat and completion requests over an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, so prompts and model weights stay on the machine that runs them."
msgstr "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ Is runtime do mhúnlaí teanga mór oscailte. A hualaí mód freastalaí headless samhlacha ó siopa áitiúil agus freagraí comhrá agus iarratais críochnaithe thar HTTP OpenAI-comhoiriúnach API, mar sin leideanna agus meáchain samhail fanacht ar an meaisín a ritheann iad."

msgid "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ is a local-first notification command center that aggregates Slack, mail, issue trackers and calendars into approvable action cards."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Lint and syntax checks` catch style, formatting, and Ansible syntax problems early."
msgstr "`Lint and syntax checks` stíl ghabháil, formáidiú, agus fadhbanna syntax Ansible luath."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that exposes an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API and forwards each request to a configured model backend, local or hosted. Clients authenticate with virtual API keys that the gateway issues and stores in its own database."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ Is geata LLM a nochtann HTTP OpenAI-comhoiriúnach API agus ar aghaidh gach iarratas ar ais samhail cumraithe, áitiúil nó óstáil. Cliaint fhíordheimhniú le fíorúil API eochracha a shaincheisteanna agus siopaí geata ina bhunachar sonraí féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway’s built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ Is geata LLM a chuireann amháin OpenAI-compatible API os comhair go leor soláthraithe múnla. Is é an Chomhéadain admin comhéadan gréasáin tógtha-i na tairsí le haghaidh fíorúil API eochracha, foirne, buiséid agus teorainneacha ráta, ródú samhail, agus logáil isteach a iarraidh agus a chaitheamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Local deploy and E2E validation` checks whether apps and deployment flows work in a realistic local stack."
msgstr "`Local deploy and E2E validation` seiceálacha an bhfuil apps agus sreabhadh imscaradh ag obair i chairn áitiúil réalaíoch."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Removes unused Docker containers, networks, images, and volumes."
msgstr "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Bain coimeádáin Docker neamhúsáidte, líonraí, íomhánna, agus méideanna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_RESET`: Performs cleanup and restarts the Docker service."
msgstr "`MODE_RESET`: Feidhmíonn cleanup agus restarts an tseirbhís Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ as a full-featured mail server (when available),"
msgstr "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ mar fhreastalaí poist lán-feiceáil (nuair atá siad ar fáil),"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Mirrors `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."
msgstr "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Scátháin `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemAvailable` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemAvailable` ó / proc / meminfo i MB. 0 ar mhainneachtain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemTotal` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemTotal` ó / proc / meminfo i MB. 0 ar mhainneachtain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Metadata`: **Read** (default, cannot be removed)."
msgstr "`Metadata`: **Léigh ar aghaidh** (réamhshocraithe, ní féidir a bhaint)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) is a kernel-level protocol for sharing files over a network. The server exports a directory tree under defined access rules; clients mount it as if it were a local filesystem."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Córas Comhad Líonra) Is prótacal eithne-leibhéal le haghaidh comhaid a roinnt thar líonra. onnmhairí an freastalaí crann eolaire faoi rialacha rochtana sainithe; cliaint mount sé amhail is dá mba córas comhaid áitiúil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) lets a host mount a directory exported by a remote server as if it were a local filesystem. The client packages provide the kernel helpers and userspace tools to perform that mount."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Córas Comhad Líonra) ligeann óstach mount eolaire a onnmhairiú ag freastalaí iargúlta amhail is dá mba córas comhaid áitiúil. Soláthraíonn na pacáistí cliant na cúntóirí eithne agus uirlisí spáis úsáideora a dhéanamh go mount."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`N` → route a share of deploy jobs to your `[self-hosted, linux]` runners."
msgstr "`N` → bealach sciar de phoist imscaradh chuig do `[self-hosted, linux]` rádala."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as a first-party mirror for the third-party assets other web applications declare in their CSP whitelists, so browsers fetch those assets from the deployment itself instead of contacting external hosts."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ freastalaí gréasáin ardfheidhmíochta agus seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. An ról seo wraps Nginx mar scáthán chéad pháirtí do na sócmhainní tríú páirtí iarratais gréasáin eile a dhearbhú ina whitelists CSP, mar sin a rachadh brabhsálaithe na sócmhainní as an imscaradh féin in ionad teagmháil a dhéanamh le hóstach seachtrach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as an internal Content Delivery Network that serves static assets such as CSS and JavaScript bundles for other web applications in the stack."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ freastalaí gréasáin ardfheidhmíochta agus seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais. Clúdaíonn an ról seo Nginx mar inmheánach Content Delivery Network a fhreastalaíonn ar shócmhainní statach ar nós CSS agus bundles JavaScript le haghaidh iarratais gréasáin eile sa chairn."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ is a free, open-source application for video recording and live streaming, widely used for screencasts, broadcasting, and content creation."
msgstr "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ Is iarratas saor in aisce, oscailte-foinse le haghaidh taifeadta físe agus sruthú beo, a úsáidtear go forleathan le haghaidh screencasts, craoladh, agus cruthú ábhar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` and `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` are paired on purpose. They MUST resolve to the same logical user on both sides so that an account created in OpenLDAP can sign in through Keycloak without an extra mapping step. Changing one without the other breaks LDAP-OIDC correlation."
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` agus `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` Tá péireáilte ar chuspóir. MUST siad réiteach leis an úsáideoir loighciúil céanna ar an dá thaobh ionas go cuntas a cruthaíodh i OpenLDAP Is féidir clárú trí Keycloak gan céim mapála breise. Athrú amháin gan an comhghaol LDAP-OIDC eile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` lists the claim names that downstream applications read out of the userinfo response and ID token:"
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` liostaí na hainmneacha éilimh a léamh iarratais downstream as an freagra úsáideora agus chomhartha aitheantais:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ is a local model server that runs open LLMs on your hardware and exposes a simple HTTP API. Prompts and data stay on your machines, making it the backbone for privacy-first AI."
msgstr "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ Is freastalaí múnla áitiúil a ritheann LLMs oscailte ar do crua-earraí agus nochtann HTTP simplí API. Cóipeáil nasc leis an tweet Leabaigh an Tweet ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Open PR if … changed` step"
msgstr "`Open PR if … changed` céim chéim"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ Is rúin aitheantais-bhunaithe agus bainisteoir criptithe rialú ag an Fondúireacht Linux. siopaí sé dintiúir iarratas, API eochracha, dintiúir seirbhíse agus bunachar sonraí, uathoibrithe agus céannachtaí gníomhaire, comharthaí gearr-cónaí agus eochracha criptithe taobh thiar de inneall polasaí, agus is féidir gníomhú mar údarás deimhniú inmheánach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ Is gníomhaire AI pearsanta foinse oscailte a ritheann ar crua-earraí tú rialú. Longa sé próiseas geata le Chomhéadain Rialaithe bhrabhsálaí in aice lena CLI agus TUI, Coinníonn cuimhne leanúnach agus spás oibre ar diosca, agus feidhmíonn sé tascanna bhrabhsálaí agus córas comhaid taobh istigh dá bhosca gainimh féin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ is a sovereign self-hosted file sync, share, and collaboration platform maintained by the Heinlein Group. It is a fork of the OpenCloud Infinite Scale codebase and is published as the ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` container image."
msgstr "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ Is ceannasach féin-óstach comhad sync, scair, agus ardán comhoibrithe a chothabháil ag an Ghrúpa Heinlein. Is maith liom é OpenCloud Bunachar Scála Infinite agus tá sé foilsithe mar ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` íomhá coimeádán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ is a sovereign open-source video conferencing platform developed by the Heinlein Group. It combines a Rust controller, a LiveKit-based WebRTC media server, and a React web frontend."
msgstr "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ Is ardán ceannasach oscailte-foinse comhroinnte físeán forbartha ag an nGrúpa Heinlein. Nascann sé rialtóir Rust, freastalaí meáin WebRTC LiveKit-bhunaithe, agus tosaigh gréasáin React."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Social Home 2026.6.16 imports `logout` from `client/src/store/auth.ts` in exactly one place —   `client/src/main.tsx` wires it as the 401 handler via `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. No   component renders a logout control, so `personas/utils/logout.js` has nothing to click and the   admin journey cannot complete. The alternative — injecting a `[data-injected-logout]` button via   `templates/javascript.js.j2` — was rejected: the model   (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) points the button at   `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, which only exists for OIDC-gated roles, and this role deliberately runs   without SSO. Path back: upstream ships a logout control (or an in-app logout endpoint we can   target), then drop the flag and keep the `adminInteraction` already wired in the spec."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Baile sóisialta 2026.6.16 allmhairithe `logout` ó `client/src/store/auth.ts` in áit amháin go díreach — `client/src/main.tsx` sreanga sé mar an 401 láimhseáil via `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. Ní dhéanann aon chomhpháirt rialú logout, mar sin `personas/utils/logout.js` Níl aon rud le cliceáil agus ní féidir leis an turas admin a chomhlánú. An rogha eile — instealladh `[data-injected-logout]` cnaipe via via `templates/javascript.js.j2` - diúltaíodh: an tsamhail (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) pointí an cnaipe ag `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, nach bhfuil ann ach do róil OIDC-gated, agus ritheann an ról seo d'aon ghnó gan SSO. Conair ar ais: long upstream rialú logout (nó in-app logout endpoint féidir linn díriú), ansin titim an bhratach agus a choinneáil ar an `adminInteraction` sreangaithe cheana féin sa spec."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared because the shared helper cannot reach Shopware's logout, not because the journey is untestable. The only logout control lives in `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, which the administration stylesheet keeps at `display: none` until its toggle is clicked, and that toggle is a bare `div` carrying no role, no `aria-haspopup` and no dropdown class — nothing in the helper's trigger set matches it. Its second fallback, following a same-origin settings link, misses as well because the administration is hash-routed and every settings target is `#/sw/settings/...`."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` a dhearbhú toisc nach féidir leis an gcúntóir roinnte teacht Shopware's logout, ní toisc go bhfuil an turas untestable. An t-aon saol rialaithe logout i `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, a gcoinníonn an bhileog stíle riaracháin ag `display: none` go dtí go bhfuil a scoránaigh cliceáil, agus go bhfuil scoránaigh lom `div` ag iompar aon ról, gan `aria-haspopup` agus gan aon rang dropdown - rud ar bith i truicir an chabhrach oireann sé. A dara fallback, tar éis an nasc céanna-tosaigh suímh, cailleann chomh maith toisc go bhfuil an riarachán hash-routed agus tá gach sprioc suímh `#/sw/settings/...`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared for a second, independent reason, and two separate obstacles justify it."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` a dhearbhú ar chúis dara, neamhspleách, agus dhá chonstaic ar leith údar é."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : The app authenticates against its own `platform_users` table. There is no OIDC client and no   auto-provisioning, so the biber account never exists inside Social Home. Path back: upstream   grows an OIDC/trusted-header auth path."
msgstr "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : An app fhíordheimhnithe i gcoinne a chuid féin `platform_users` tábla. Níl aon chliant OIDC agus gan aon uathoibríoch-sholáthar, mar sin an cuntas biber ann riamh taobh istigh Social Home. Conair ar ais: fásann sruth an cosán OIDC / iontaofa-ceannaire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` accepts a caller-supplied `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), and `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` accepts a caller-supplied `secret_id`. Both verified in [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (lines 889 and 1243)."
msgstr "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` Glacann glaoiteoir-fheidhmiúil `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), agus `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` Glacann glaoiteoir-fheidhmiúil `secret_id`. An dá fhíorú i [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (línte línte 889 agus 1243)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
