# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ Is ceann tosaigh do emulators, innill cluiche, agus imreoirí na meáin faoi thiomáint ag an `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ creat. Tacaíonn sé stíleanna Chomhéadain il lena n-áirítear `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ agus `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, agus soláthraíonn comhéadan aontaithe le haghaidh cluichíochta retro ar fud ardáin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ Is maith liom é Node.js--bhunaithe iarratas tosaigh a insamhail roth roulette sa bhrabhsálaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` síol an chéad admin (aon draoi thus)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `bolt` (comhad ag `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Úsáideann Iargres `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, móide mapaí tréith (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = léarscáil JSON. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (an t-eisitheoir), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Is cosán atreorú `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore Tá OIDC dúchais - gan aon `oauth2-proxy` sidecar ag teastáil.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` Leagann an URL bonn seachtrach-rochtana; ag teastáil le haghaidh ceart atreorú OIDC taobh thiar de `sys-svc-proxy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` Tá fholmhaithe mar sin ní bhfaigheann an coimeádán an chatalóg app ó github.com. Socraigh é chuig catalóg féin-óstáil nuair atá ceann ann."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` Is unset - tá an SPA céanna-origin. Ní gá ach amháin má ba chóir do chliant tríú páirtí labhairt leis an API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` Tá pinned 4 GiB i `vars/main.yml` mar sin fanann an app ar caipín meáin taobh istigh `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Déanann ardú amháin gan an ceann eile a ligeann don toirt a bhuiséad dearbhaithe a mhaolú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ Is prótacal líonra criptithe grafach le haghaidh seirbhísí líonra oibriúcháin go daingean thar líonra neamhurraithe. An bhfuil `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ Soláthraíonn tionscadal cur chun feidhme tagartha, lena n-áirítear ``ssh-agent`` le haghaidh eochracha fíordheimhnithe a bhainistiú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (teaghrán): stáit inmhianaithe (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"

msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ Is córas stórála a dháileadh go tapa do blobs, rudaí, agus comhaid. Nochtadh sé S3-comhoiriúnach API, mar sin a stóráil iarratais agus rudaí a aisghabháil le S caighdeánach3 SDKs agus CLIs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ Is Chomhéadain gréasáin nua-aimseartha agus API do leabhair spraoi Ansible reáchtáil, pleananna Terraform / OpenTofu, agus scripteanna bhlaosc ar sceideal nó ar éileamh. Imscaradh an ról seo an t-oifigeach ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>` coimeádán taobh thiar de na Infinito.Nexus seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais le lárnach PostgreSQL, dúchais Keycloak OIDC Aonair Cláraigh-Ar, agus logáil isteach LDAP roghnach."

