# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ Is ardán bainistíochta tionscadal cumhachtach agus iomasach oscailte-foinse in oiriúint d'fhoirne agile. Cibé an bhfuil tú ag cleachtadh Scrum, Kanban, nó sreabhadh oibre hibrideach saincheaptha, Taiga Cuireann timpeallacht saibhir, customizable a phleanáil, a rianú, agus comhoibriú ar do thionscadail, gan chastacht na n-uirlisí fiontraíochta nó an díoltóir glas-i na n-ardán SaaS."

