# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` réitíonn dearbhán an ghlaoiteora trí `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` agus cuireann sé mar an Bearer"

