# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "``%%`` is \"contains\" for a scalar string value and \"is a member of\" for a set value; ``==`` / ``!=`` against a set mean membership / non-membership. String comparisons (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) are case-insensitive; ``< > <= >=`` are numeric. A bare expression with no operator (e.g. ``nextcloud``) is shorthand for ``name %% nextcloud``."
msgstr "``%%`` Is maith liom \"contains\" le haghaidh luach teaghrán scalar agus \"is comhalta de\" le haghaidh luach socraithe; ``==`` / Baile ``!=`` i gcoinne sraith ciallóidh ballraíocht / neamh-comhalta. comparáidí teaghrán (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) tá cás-íogair; ``< > <= >=`` Tá uimhriúil. A léiriú lom gan aon oibreoir (e.g. ``nextcloud``) Tá gearrláimhe do ``name %% nextcloud``."

