# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``API`` is a plain mapping, so an inventory that configures three providers replaces the whole declaration instead of merging into it, and every provider it does not name disappears. Resolving a hidden provider then raises, and a raising lookup inside a value the applications renderer is templating leaves the raw ``{{ ... }}`` text in place: the consumer stores template text, and ``| bool`` coerces it to False with a deprecation warning that fails the deploy on the warning gate."
msgstr "``API`` Is mapáil plain, mar sin fardal a chumrú trí soláthraithe ionad an dearbhú ar fad in ionad a chumasc isteach ann, agus gach soláthraí nach ndéanann sé ainm imíonn. Réiteach soláthraí i bhfolach ardaíonn ansin, agus a ardú lookup taobh istigh de luach go bhfuil an t-iarratas rialtán duilleoga an amh ``{{ ... }}`` téacs i bhfeidhm: siopaí tomhaltóirí téacs teimpléad, agus ``| bool`` coerces é a Bréagach le rabhadh dímheas go mainneoidh an imscaradh ar an geata rabhadh."

