msgid "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` keeps the grant meaningful for administrators too; upstream defaults it to true, which would let every administrator past any grant. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` syncs the platform’s groups on login, so membership follows Keycloak."
msgstr "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` coimeádann an deontas brí le haghaidh riarthóirí freisin; réamhshocrú réamhtheachtach é a fíor, a ligfeadh gach riarthóir am atá caite aon deontas. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` syncs grúpaí an ardán ar logáil isteach, mar sin leanann comhaltas Keycloak."

