msgstr "``lookup('volume', application_id, name)`` — filleadh ar an dict normalised le haghaidh iontráil shéimeantach amháin. Déanann an deacht ar ais i gcónaí:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``main.yml``: The main task file that handles the installation of GnuCash."
msgstr "``main.yml``: An comhad tasc is mó a láimhseálann suiteáil GnuCash."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``main`` unless ``repo_root`` is a linked git worktree, whose branch is lowercased and every character outside ``[a-z0-9_-]`` replaced by ``-``; ``None`` when the worktree's git directory is not reachable, as inside a container that mounts only the checkout."
msgstr "``main`` mura rud é— ``repo_root`` Is crann oibre git nasctha, a bhfuil a brainse níos ísle agus gach carachtar taobh amuigh ``[a-z0-9_-]`` in ionad ``-``; ``None`` nuair nach bhfuil an t-eolaire git crainn oibre insroichte, mar atá taobh istigh de choimeádán a mounts ach an Seiceáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``make install-lint`` used to ask GitHub for each tool’s latest tag at install time. That made every installation depend on the network resolving ``api.github.com``, and it silently changed the linter version between two runs of the same commit. Pinning moves the version into the repository, where it is reviewable and reproducible."
msgstr "``make install-lint`` a úsáidtear a iarraidh GitHub do gach uirlis chlib is déanaí ag am a shuiteáil. A rinne gach suiteáil ag brath ar an líonra a réiteach ``api.github.com``, agus d'athraigh sé go ciúin an leagan linter idir dhá Ritheann an tiomantas céanna. Bogann Pinning an leagan isteach sa stór, áit a bhfuil sé inathbhreithnithe agus atáirgthe."

