msgstr "``mcp`` Dearbhaíonn an dromchla Prótacal Múnla comhthéacs GitLab feidhmíonn sé ó dhúchas óna Rails API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/addons/`` is also the download list: ``MEDIAWIKI_EXT_NAMES`` keeps only the addons whose ``enabled`` resolves true, so a deployment without the matching service never pulls that tarball or runs composer for it."
msgstr "``meta/addons/`` Is é an liosta íoslódáil freisin: ``MEDIAWIKI_EXT_NAMES`` coinníonn ach na addons a bhfuil a ``enabled`` réitíonn fíor, mar sin imlonnú gan an tseirbhís meaitseáil riamh pulls go tarball nó ritheann cumadóir dó."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/categories.yml`` at the repository root declares the nested category tree every role name is derived from: the dash-joined path of a node is the role's category prefix (``web`` -> ``app`` yields ``web-app-*``), and nodes carry the ``invokable``, ``stage``, ``modes`` and ``run_after`` policy the dispatcher, the stage lookup and the inventory generator read."
msgstr "``meta/categories.yml`` ag an fhréamh stór Dearbhaíonn an crann catagóir neadaithe gach ainm ról a dhíorthaítear ó: Is é an cosán na nIonstraimí-thaobh de nód an ról catagóir réimír (``web`` - ú ``app`` torthaí ``web-app-*``), agus nóid a dhéanamh ar an ``invokable``, ``stage``, ``modes`` agus ``run_after`` polasaí an dispatcher, an lookup stáitse agus an gineadóir fardal léamh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/categories.yml`` declares the ordered ``stages`` (constructor -> workstation -> server -> destructor, matching ``tasks/stages/0*.yml``) and a ``stage`` per top-level category. This module resolves a role to its stage and exposes the canonical stage order, so both the CLI (``cli.meta.roles.order``) and the ``stage_order`` / ``role_stage`` lookups read one source of truth."
msgstr "``meta/categories.yml`` Dearbhaíonn an t-ordú ``stages`` (tógálaí - lí stáisiún oibre - lí freastalaí - lí destructor, meaitseáil ``tasks/stages/0*.yml``) agus a ``stage`` in aghaidh an chatagóir ardleibhéil. Réitíonn an modúl seo ról ar a chéim agus nochtann sé an t-ordú céim Canonical, mar sin an CLI (``cli.meta.roles.order``) agus an ``stage_order`` / Baile ``role_stage`` lookups léamh foinse amháin na fírinne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``meta/distros.yml`` declares every distribution the project builds, tests and deploys on: the id used as ``INFINITO_DISTRO``, the ``os_family`` ansible reports for it, the Galaxy platform name, the upstream base image the development-environment matrix boots it from, and the templates the pkgmgr base image and the environment image references are rendered from."
msgstr "``meta/distros.yml`` Dearbhaíonn gach dáileadh a thógann an tionscadal, tástálacha agus imscaradh ar: an id a úsáidtear mar ``INFINITO_DISTRO``, an ``os_family`` tuarascálacha ansible chun é, an t-ainm ardán Réaltra, an íomhá bonn upstream an fhorbairt-comhshaoil maitrís buataisí sé ó, agus na teimpléid an íomhá bonn pkgmgr agus na tagairtí íomhá comhshaoil a dhéantar as."

