msgid "``provides`` matching runs in both directions, so a provider (e.g. openldap ``provides: ldap``) is picked up even when the consuming flag uses a ``groups[...]`` form the ``group_names`` regex cannot read."
msgstr "``provides`` Ritheann meaitseáil sa dá threo, mar sin soláthraí (e.g. oscailte ``provides: ldap``) Tá phiocadh suas fiú nuair a úsáideann an bhratach Tógann a ``groups[...]`` foirm an ``group_names`` Ní féidir regex léamh."

