msgstr "``set hostname to {{ inventory_hostname }}`` Comhlíonann sé an seanainm atá ag teastáil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``setdefault`` falls back to the supplied value only when the process env has no non-empty value for the key. ``set`` is unconditional. ``get`` reads from the builder, falling back to the process env so derived values (e.g. ``INFINITO_CONTAINER``) can be composed off previously-set keys."
msgstr "``setdefault`` titim ar ais go dtí an luach a sholáthraítear ach amháin nuair nach bhfuil an próiseas env aon luach neamh-empty don eochair. ``set`` gan choinníoll. ``get`` léann ón tógálaí, ag titim ar ais go dtí an próiseas env mar sin luachanna díorthaithe (e.g. ``INFINITO_CONTAINER``) Is féidir a chum amach eochracha a leagtar roimhe seo."

