# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``state`` is the raw effective outcome ('success' / 'failure' / 'running' / 'cancelled' / ...). Modes without a job are simply absent. A role's variant shards run as separate jobs per mode; the mode state aggregates them worst-first, so one green shard can never mask a failed sibling (gitlab swarm variant 1 red, variant 0 green -> swarm failure)."
msgstr "``state`` Is é an toradh éifeachtach amh ('success' / Baile 'failure' / Baile 'running' / Baile 'cancelled' /...). Tá modhanna gan post as láthair go simplí. Ritheann shards athraitheacha ról mar phoist ar leith in aghaidh an mhodha; comhiomlánaíonn an stát mód iad is measa-chéad, mar sin ní féidir le shard glas amháin a masc siblín theip (gitlab swarm leagan 1 dearg, malairt 0 glas - ^ teip swarm)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``str()`` drops the ``TrustedAsTemplate`` tag the loader attached, and the templar returns an untagged string unrendered. Re-tagging before templating is what every sibling lookup does; without it this function would trade the daemon's parse error for its own."
msgstr "``str()`` titeann an ``TrustedAsTemplate`` chlib an t-ualach ceangailte, agus tuairisceáin an templar teaghrán untagged gan staonadh. Re-tagging roimh templating cad a dhéanann gach Lookup deartháireacha; gan é a bheadh an fheidhm seo trádáil earráid parse an daemon ar dá chuid féin."

