# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``svc-swarm-manager`` (subset marker), ``svc-storage-nfs-client`` (no ``application_id``), ``svc-registry-docker`` (consumed by the swarm handler that pushes locally-built images, but not declared as a meta-dep so it stays out of compose-mode deploys) are added explicitly because the dep-walker only knows roles that are in the ``applications`` dict. The DR-drill backup roles arrive implicitly: the apps' ``container_backup`` service declaration pulls ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` into the closure, and ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` deploys via its group membership on the NFS server host (``extend_inventory``) through the group-driven role includes."
msgstr "``svc-swarm-manager`` (marcóir fothacar), ``svc-storage-nfs-client`` (Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil ``application_id``), ``svc-registry-docker`` (ithe ag an láimhseálaí swarm a pushes íomhánna go háitiúil-tógtha, ach ní dhearbhaítear mar meta-dep mar sin fanann sé amach as compose-mode imscaradhs) a leanas go sainráite mar gheall ar a fhios ag an dep-siúlóid ach róil atá sa ``applications`` dict. Na róil cúltaca DR-tiomáinte teacht intuigthe: na apps ' ``container_backup`` pulls dearbhú seirbhíse ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` isteach sa dúnadh, agus ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` imscaradh trína ballraíocht ghrúpa ar an óstach freastalaí NFS (``extend_inventory``) tríd an ról grúpa-tiomáinte áirítear."

