# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``systemctl list-units`` reports a forking unit as active/running while its guessed main process is gone, and the containers carry no ``ps``, so the unit table alone cannot answer whether a daemon is still there. MainPID and NRestarts can."
msgstr "``systemctl list-units`` tuarascálacha aonad forking mar gníomhach / reáchtáil cé go bhfuil a phróiseas guessed is mó imithe, agus na coimeádáin a dhéanamh ar aon ``ps``, mar sin ní féidir leis an tábla aonad amháin a fhreagairt cibé an bhfuil daemon fós ann. Is féidir MainPID agus NRestarts."

