msgid "``target``         the one container path this entry mounts at, present"
msgstr "``target`` an cosán coimeádán amháin mounts iontráil seo ag, i láthair"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``target`` is the host to restore onto (``localhost`` = local); a remote host makes the recover push over ssh (rsync target / docker host / secret paths gain the remote prefix)."
msgstr "``target`` Is é an óstach a chur ar ais isteach (``localhost`` = áitiúil); Déanann óstach iargúlta an bhrú a ghnóthú thar ssh (rsync sprioc / óstach docker / cosáin rúnda a fháil ar an réimír iargúlta)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``target`` is what lets ``meta/volumes.yml`` stay the single source of a container path: a role defines its constant from the registry"
msgstr "``target`` Is é an méid a ligeann ``meta/volumes.yml`` fanacht ar an fhoinse amháin de cosán coimeádán: ról a shainmhíníonn a tairiseach ón gclárlann"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``targets``        ``{service: container path}`` built from ``mounts``"
msgstr "``targets`` ``{service: container path}`` tógtha ó ``mounts``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` therefore rewrites ``curlsecurityblockedhosts`` to ``MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS`` and extends ``curlsecurityallowedport`` with the port of ``MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT`` when the ``litellm`` service is enabled. Loopback, ``0.0.0.0`` and the cloud metadata address stay blocked; the RFC1918 ranges are opened. The Docker address pool and the bridge gateway that serves the pinned Keycloak authority both live inside them."
msgstr "``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` dá bhrí sin rewrites ``curlsecurityblockedhosts`` go dtí ``MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS`` agus leathnaíonn ``curlsecurityallowedport`` leis an gcalafort ``MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT`` nuair a an ``litellm`` Tá seirbhís ar chumas. Aiseolas, ``0.0.0.0`` agus an seoladh meiteashonraí scamall fhan bac; an RFC1918 raonta oscailte. An linn snámha Seoladh Docker agus an geata droichead a fhreastalaíonn ar an pinned Keycloak údarás araon beo taobh istigh dóibh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``tasks/utils/`` is the repository’s home for unnumbered, includable task files, so the entrypoint carries no step number."
msgstr "``tasks/utils/`` Is é an stór baile le haghaidh unnumbered, comhaid tasc includable, mar sin ní dhéanann an pointe iontrála aon uimhir chéim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
