# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``templates/playwright.env.j2`` acts as the stable marker for discovery and as the source of environment configuration."
msgstr "``templates/playwright.env.j2`` gníomhartha mar an marcóir cobhsaí le haghaidh fionnachtana agus mar fhoinse na cumraíochta comhshaoil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``templates/roles/README.md.j2.tmpl`` is the single source of truth for the role-README structure. :mod:`cli.build.docs.readme.schema` derives the required/optional section set from it; the lint (``tests/lint/ansible/roles/test_readme.py``) and the generator (``python -m cli.build.docs.readme``) both consume that same schema so the three never drift."
msgstr "``templates/roles/README.md.j2.tmpl`` Is é an fhoinse amháin na fírinne don struchtúr ról-README. :mod:`cli.build.docs.readme.schema` díorthaíonn an t-alt riachtanach/roghnach a leagtar as é; an lint (``tests/lint/ansible/roles/test_readme.py``) agus an gineadóir (``python -m cli.build.docs.readme``) an dá ithe go scéimre céanna mar sin an trí riamh sruth."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "``templates/roles/README.md.j2.tmpl`` is the single source of truth. The required sections are the H2s the template emits with no optional context; the optional sections are the extra H2s that appear once every ``{% if ... %}``-guarded variable is supplied. Rendering the template both ways and diffing the H2 sets keeps the lint and the generator in lock-step with the template."
msgstr "``templates/roles/README.md.j2.tmpl`` Is é an fhoinse amháin na fírinne. Is iad na rannóga is gá an H2s an teimpléad astaíonn gan aon chomhthéacs roghnach; Is iad na hailt roghnacha an H breise2s atá le feiceáil uair amháin gach ``{% if ... %}``-Tá athróg cosanta ar fáil. Rendering an teimpléad araon bealaí agus diffing an H2 Leagann Coinníonn an lint agus an gineadóir i glas-chéim leis an teimpléad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``test-bridge-roster.js`` probes the Synapse ``/_matrix/client/v3/profile/{bot}`` endpoint for every enabled bridge and fails on 5xx (skipped when no bridge is enabled)."
msgstr "``test-bridge-roster.js`` probes an Synapse ``/_matrix/client/v3/profile/{bot}`` críochphointe do gach droichead cumasaithe agus go mainneoidh sé ar 5xx (sciobtha nuair nach bhfuil aon droichead ar chumas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``test-element-call.js`` opens the Element home view and verifies a call-widget control surfaces when ``services.matrix.conferencing.element_call=true`` (skipped otherwise)."
msgstr "``test-element-call.js`` Osclaíonn an dearcadh baile Element agus fíoraíonn sé dromchlaí rialaithe glaoch-brabús nuair ``services.matrix.conferencing.element_call=true`` (spúinseáilte ar shlí eile)."

