# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "`ansible` (cineál gas: in airde) timfhilleadh [maitrís-ddocker-inláimhsithe-imlonnú](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). Ritheann MDAD ~70 fo-ráillí upstream a sheachadadh Synapse, Element, gach droichead tacaíocht, Element Call, agus Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus bioráin MDAD trí chimiú, cuireann fardal MDAD ó `services.matrix.*` knobs, agus disables MDAD cuachta Traefik / Iarmhairtí / Redis mar sin na seirbhísí Infinito lárnach ar ais ar an Stack."

