# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`biber` only ever exists inside EspoCRM through OIDC auto-provisioning (`ESPOCRM_CONFIG_OIDC_CREATE_USER=true`, [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); the role itself seeds only the administrator account. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that provisioning path is gone and no native `biber` user exists, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` and `guest` personas run in every variant."
msgstr "`biber` ach riamh ann taobh istigh EspoCRM trí OIDC auto-provisioning (`ESPOCRM_CONFIG_OIDC_CREATE_USER=true`, [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); an ról féin síolta ach an cuntas riarthóir. I an `services.sso.enabled: false` Tá leaganacha maitrís a sholáthraíonn cosán imithe agus gan aon dúchais `biber` ann úsáideoir, mar sin [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) custom `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. An `administrator` agus `guest` personas reáchtáil i ngach leagan."

