msgid "`chunk_gate` (default `true`) decides whether the chain stops at its first failed chunk:"
msgstr "`chunk_gate` (cineál gas: in airde `true`) chinneann an stopann an slabhra ag a chéad smután theip:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ci.sh` exports `INFINITO_MAKE_DEPLOY=1` so `MODE_CI` (defined in `group_vars/all/01_modes.yml`) flips to `true` for the duration of a make-driven deploy. It is sourced by every deploy entry-point under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`. Sourcing it from `all.sh` would set the marker for unrelated `make test*` or `make build*` recipes too, which is exactly what the service-gating contract forbids."
msgstr "`ci.sh` onnmhairithe `INFINITO_MAKE_DEPLOY=1` amhlaidh `MODE_CI` (sainmhínithe i `group_vars/all/01_modes.yml`) smeach le `true` ar feadh ré a dhéanamh-tiomáinte imscaradh. Tá sé a fháil ag gach imlonnú iontráil-phointe faoi `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`. Sourcing sé ó `all.sh` bheadh leagtha an marcóir le haghaidh neamhghaolmhara `make test*` nó `make build*` oidis freisin, a bhfuil go díreach cad forbids an conradh seirbhíse-gating."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`classification` is required and MUST be deployable; all MCP-specific fields MUST be literals (only `enabled`/`shared` may carry Jinja)."
msgstr "`classification` ag teastáil agus MUST a imscaradh; gach MCP-sonrach réimsí MUST a bheith litriúil (ach amháin `enabled`/ Baile`shared` Is féidir a dhéanamh Jinja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`classification` is required and is one of `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`. A role that cannot serve declares no `mcp` block at all."
msgstr "`classification` ag teastáil agus tá sé ar cheann de `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`. Ról nach féidir a sheirbheáil Dearbhaíonn aon `mcp` bloc ar chor ar bith."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network address suggest` gap-first subnet allocation suggestions"
msgstr "`cli contributing network address suggest` bearna-chéad moltaí leithdháilte subnet"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network address suggest` proposes the next free per-role IPv4 subnet(s) based on the live role tree. It walks every `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, collects occupied `networks.local.subnet` assignments, picks the smallest CIDR prefix that fits the requested client count, and proposes free sub-blocks gap-first then by increment within the established umbrella blocks."
msgstr "`cli contributing network address suggest` Molann an chéad saor in aisce in aghaidh an-role IPv4 subnet(s s) bunaithe ar an crann ról beo. Sé siúlóidí gach `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, bailíonn áitiú `networks.local.subnet` tascanna, picks an réimír CIDR is lú go n-oireann an comhaireamh cliant iarrtha, agus molann fo-blocks saor in aisce bearna-chéad ansin trí incrimint laistigh de na bloic scáth bunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network address suggest`: propose free per-role subnets gap-first within established umbrella blocks."
msgstr "`cli contributing network address suggest`: a mholadh saor in aisce in aghaidh an-role subnets gap-first laistigh de scáthbhloic bunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network address suggest`: propose the next free per-role IPv4 subnet(s) gap-first within the established umbrella blocks."
msgstr "`cli contributing network address suggest`: a mholadh an chéad saor in aisce in aghaidh an-role IPv4 subnet(s s) bearna-chéad laistigh de na bloic scáth bunaithe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network ports suggest`   gap-first port allocation suggestions"
msgstr "`cli contributing network ports suggest` bearna-céad moltaí leithdháilte calafoirt"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`cli contributing network ports suggest` proposes the next free host-bound port(s) inside a `PORT_BANDS.<scope>.<category>` band defined in [group_vars/all/08_networks.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). It walks every `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, collects occupied `<entity>.ports.{local,public}.<category>` assignments across all roles and all entities, and proposes free slots gap-first then by increment."
msgstr "`cli contributing network ports suggest` Molann an chéad chalafort saor in aisce(s s) taobh istigh de `PORT_BANDS.<scope>.<category>` banda sainithe i [group_vars/all/08_networks.yml](../../../../group_vars/all/08_networks.yml). siúlóidí sé gach `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, bailíonn áitiú `<entity>.ports.{local,public}.<category>` tascanna ar fud gach ról agus gach eintiteas, agus molann sliotán saor in aisce bearna-chéad ansin trí incrimintí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli contributing network ports suggest`: propose free host-bound ports inside `PORT_BANDS.<scope>.<category>`."
msgstr "`cli contributing network ports suggest`: a mholadh calafoirt saor in aisce óstach-cheangal taobh istigh `PORT_BANDS.<scope>.<category>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli/contributing/mirror/providers.py` contains the `GHCRProvider` class, which computes the destination image name via `image_base(img)` and provides `add_args` / `from_args` so all CLI tools share a single argument definition (SPOT)."
msgstr "`cli/contributing/mirror/providers.py` Tá an `GHCRProvider` rang, a ríomhann an t-ainm íomhá ceann scríbe trí `image_base(img)` agus soláthraíonn `add_args` / Baile `from_args` mar sin go léir uirlisí CLI roinnt sainmhíniú argóint amháin (Plandaí faoi dhíon)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli/contributing/mirror/resolver/__main__.py` reads all role images and outputs a `mirrors.yml` file under a single `applications.<role>.services.<service>` map:"
msgstr "`cli/contributing/mirror/resolver/__main__.py` léann gach íomhánna ról agus aschuir a `mirrors.yml` comhad faoi aon `applications.<role>.services.<service>` léarscáil:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cli/contributing/mirror/sync/__main__.py` copies each image from the upstream source to the GHCR mirror destination using `skopeo copy`. Supports `--only-missing` to skip already-mirrored images and `--images-per-hour` for throttling."
msgstr "`cli/contributing/mirror/sync/__main__.py` cóipeanna gach íomhá ón bhfoinse upstream chuig an gceann scríbe scáthán GHCR ag baint úsáide as `skopeo copy`. Tacaíochtaí `--only-missing` a skip cheana féin-mirrored íomhánna agus `--images-per-hour` do throttling."

msgid "`cli/meta/env/` provides the CLI entry point invoked as `python -m cli.meta.env`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cluster_addr` MUST NOT be built from the container name. Compose sets `container_name:` explicitly, but swarm names every task `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, so a container-name-derived address renders differently per mode. With `replicas: 1` the node only ever advertises to itself, so a loopback cluster address is mode-independent; the HA follow-up story revisits it."
msgstr "`cluster_addr` NÍ MÓR a thógáil as an ainm coimeádán. Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `container_name:` go sainráite, ach ainmneacha swarm gach tasc `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, mar sin déanann seoladh coimeádán-ainmnithe difriúil in aghaidh an mhodha. Le haghaidh `replicas: 1` an nód ach advertises riamh a thabhairt dó féin, mar sin tá seoladh braisle ais lúb-neamhspleách; an HA leanúint-suas scéal revisits sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`compose build` re-bakes the static output whenever the cloned content changes, so deploys are content-driven without any runtime build step."
msgstr "`compose build` ath-bakes an t-aschur statach aon uair a athraíonn an t-ábhar cloned, mar sin tá imscaradh ábhar-tiomáinte gan aon chéim a thógáil runtime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`compose.volumes:` is **not** inlined into services. It lives in its own `meta/volumes.yml` (volumes are role-wide, not per-service)."
msgstr "`compose.volumes:` Is maith liom **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** inlined i seirbhísí. Tá sé ina chónaí ina chuid féin `meta/volumes.yml` (Tá méideanna róil ar fud, ní in aghaidh na seirbhíse)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
