# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`distros` (optional; empty spreads the rows over every declared distro), `filesystem` (optional; empty spreads them over `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (optional), `priority` (optional; app ids sorted to the head of the list and cut into chunks of their own, so every priority row is deployed before the first regular one starts, and deployed in every combination it can take: each variant × each offered mode × Tor and clearnet, in one sweep), `mode` (default `auto`), `sweep`, `resume_from_chunk` (default `0`), `chunk_gate` (default `true`), `image_wait_attempts` (default `1980`), `image_wait_sleep_seconds` (default `10`), `workspace` (default `auto`)"
msgstr "`distros` (roghnach; spreads folamh na sraitheanna thar gach distro dearbhaithe), `filesystem` (roghnach; spreads folamh iad thar `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (roghnach), `priority` (roghnach; ids app curtha in eagar chuig an ceann an liosta agus a ghearradh isteach smután dá gcuid féin, mar sin tá gach sraith tosaíochta imscaradh sula dtosaíonn an chéad cheann rialta, agus imscaradh i ngach meascán is féidir é a chur: gach leagan × gach modh ar fáil × Tor agus glan, i scuab amháin), `mode` (cineál gas: in airde `auto`), `sweep`, `resume_from_chunk` (cineál gas: in airde `0`), `chunk_gate` (cineál gas: in airde `true`), `image_wait_attempts` (cineál gas: in airde `1980`), `image_wait_sleep_seconds` (cineál gas: in airde `10`), `workspace` (cineál gas: in airde `auto`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`distros` (optional; empty spreads the rows over every declared distro), `filesystem` (optional; empty spreads them over `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (optional; `__ALL__` forces full deploy, empty triggers diff derivation, any other value is verbatim), `lifecycles`, `mode` (default `auto`), `priority` (optional; priority rows get chunks of their own, the regular chunks run after them), `offset` (default `0`; a row count or a selection token naming where the regular line resumes), `chunk_gate` (default `true`), `sweep` (optional; empty means the run number)"
msgstr "`distros` (roghnach; spreads folamh na sraitheanna thar gach distro dearbhaithe), `filesystem` (roghnach; spreads folamh iad thar `zfs`, `btrfs`, `ext4`), `whitelist` (roghnach; `__ALL__` fórsaí imscaradh go hiomlán, triggers folamh diff derivation, tá aon luach eile verbatim), `lifecycles`, `mode` (cineál gas: in airde `auto`), `priority` (roghnach; sraitheanna tosaíochta a fháil smutáin dá gcuid féin, reáchtáil na smutáin rialta tar éis dóibh), `offset` (cineál gas: in airde `0`; comhaireamh as a chéile nó ainmniú token rogha nuair atosaíonn an líne rialta), `chunk_gate` (cineál gas: in airde `true`), `sweep` (roghnach; ciallaíonn folamh an uimhir reáchtáil)"

