msgid "`docker --env-file` preserves the quotes emitted by the `dotenv_quote` Jinja filter. Specs MUST decode quoted values before building URLs or typing credentials. The recurring helpers `decodeDotenvQuotedValue(value)` and `normalizeBaseUrl(value)` live in [`personas/utils/dotenv.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/dotenv.js) and are re-exported through `require(\"./personas\")`. Specs that need them MUST import from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "`docker --env-file` Caomhnaíonn an Sleachta astaítear ag an `dotenv_quote` Jinja scagaire. Specs MUST decode luachanna luaite roimh URLanna tógála nó dintiúir clóscríobh. Cúntóirí athfhillteacha `decodeDotenvQuotedValue(value)` agus `normalizeBaseUrl(value)` beo i [`personas/utils/dotenv.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/dotenv.js) agus ath-onnmhairithe trí `require(\"./personas\")`. Specs gur gá dóibh MUST allmhairiú ó `./personas`; Tá cóipeanna inlíne forbidden agus gafa ag athbhreithniú."

