msgstr "`index`, `sweep` (ag teastáil), `distros` (linn snámha roghnach), `filesystem` (linn snámha roghnach), `whitelist` (roghnach; Bhuaigh luach follasach thar diff), `priority`, `lifecycles`, `modes` (cineál gas: in airde `auto`), `tor`, `marker`"

