msgid "`kept` are the members still reachable from a surviving primary app once every role in `disabled_app_ids` is cut from the graph; `pruned` are the orphaned remainder (the disabled roots themselves excluded). Reachability walks the same `dependencies` + `services` edges the round's closure was built from — `run_after` is NOT followed, matching ``CombinedResolver(follow_run_after=False)`` — using `services_overrides` so the variant-merged topology matches what the inventory bakes."
msgstr "`kept` go bhfuil na baill fós insroichte ó aip phríomhúil marthanach uair amháin gach ról i `disabled_app_ids` gearrtha as an graf; `pruned` go bhfuil an chuid eile dílleachtaí (na fréamhacha faoi mhíchumas iad féin eisiata). Reachability siúlóidí mar an gcéanna `dependencies` + + + + `services` imill tógadh dúnadh an bhabhta ó — `run_after` NACH dhiaidh sin, meaitseáil ``CombinedResolver(follow_run_after=False)`` — úsáid a bhaint as `services_overrides` mar sin oireann an topology athraitheach- chumasc cad bácálacha fardal."

