# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`nftables <https://www.netfilter.org/projects/nftables/>`__ is the packet filtering framework of the Linux kernel and the successor to ``iptables``. Its rules live in memory: a reboot drops them unless something loads them again."
msgstr "`nftables <https://www.netfilter.org/projects/nftables/>`__ Is é an creat scagtha paicéad de eithne Linux agus an comharba ar ``iptables``. A rialacha beo i gcuimhne: a reboot titeann iad mura ualaí rud éigin iad arís."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`no-reply` user's `web-app-mailu` token, else empty string"
msgstr "`no-reply` úsáideora `web-app-mailu` chomhartha, eile teaghrán folamh"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`noqa` and `nocheck` are case-insensitive synonyms in the parser. Every project rule MUST use `nocheck:` because `# noqa: <code>` is also parsed by ruff as a flake8 directive and warns on non-flake8 keys. Reserve `noqa:` for real flake8 / ruff codes (`E402`, `F401`, …). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) hard-rejects `# noqa: <code>` whose codes do not match `[A-Z]+\\d+`."
msgstr "`noqa` agus `nocheck` go bhfuil comhchiallaigh cás-íogair sa parsálaí. Gach tionscadal riail MUST úsáid `nocheck:` mar gheall ar `# noqa: <code>` Tá parsed freisin ag ruff mar gcáithníní8 treoir agus rabhaidh ar neamh-gcáithníní8 eochracha. Cúltaca an Gharda Síochána `noqa:` le haghaidh calóg fíor8 / Ruff cóid (`E402`, `F401`, ...). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) crua-rejects `# noqa: <code>` nach bhfuil a cóid mheaitseáil `[A-Z]+\\d+`."

