# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`oidc-authenticator` and `ldap-authenticator` are mutually exclusive auth backends (only one may be enabled; see [`tasks/01_validation.yml`](./tasks/01_validation.yml)), each deriving its enablement from its bridged service flag. The OIDC/LDAP runtime configuration (provider URLs, bind DN, secrets) lives in the XWiki property templates and is read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`; the addon `config:` carries only the installer coordinate."
msgstr "`oidc-authenticator` agus `ldap-authenticator` Tá cúlchríocha auth frithpháirteach eisiach (d'fhéadfadh ach duine amháin a chumasú; féach [`tasks/01_validation.yml`](./tasks/01_validation.yml)), gach iarracht a cumasú as a bhratach seirbhíse droichead. An OIDC/LDAP cumraíocht runtime (URLanna soláthraí, ceangal DN, rúin) saol sa XWiki teimpléid mhaoine agus léifear é trí `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`; an addon `config:` Déanann ach an comhordú suiteálaí."

