# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`plan_dev_inventory_matrix` → `_resolve_round_include` runs `CombinedResolver(follow_run_after=False)` over each primary app and unions the results."
msgstr "`plan_dev_inventory_matrix` → → `_resolve_round_include` Ritheann `CombinedResolver(follow_run_after=False)` thar gach aip agus ceardchumainn bunscoile na torthaí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`planned`, `pre-alpha`, `alpha`, `beta`, `stable`, `deprecated`. Unknown values fail the lint."
msgstr "`planned`, `pre-alpha`, `alpha`, `beta`, `stable`, `deprecated`. Ní theipeann luachanna aitheanta an lint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.config.js` MUST remain centralized in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/` and `package.json` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/templates/package.json.j2` (rendered per-deploy into the staging dir). You MUST NOT duplicate or override either per role."
msgstr "`playwright.config.js` MUST fós lárnach i `roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/` agus `package.json` i `roles/test-e2e-playwright/templates/package.json.j2` (rinneadh per-imscaradh isteach sa dir staging). NÍ MÓR duit dúblach nó override ceachtar in aghaidh an ról."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.config.js` and `package.json` are central, NOT per-role. See [Playwright Tests → Role-Local Files](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md#role-local-files-)."
msgstr "`playwright.config.js` agus `package.json` Tá lárnach, NACH per-role. Féach ar [Tástáil Playwright →](../../../actions/testing/playwright.md#role-local-files-)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.spec.js` — orchestrator: TLS baseline, project creation, image asset upload, and the `guest`/`biber`/`administrator` personas. The `biber` / `administrator` personas are declared blocked via `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (mirroring `web-app-taiga`): Penpot's in-app \"OpenID\" entry and SPA user-menu logout aren't driveable by the generic persona helper, so both users' real auth is exercised by the dedicated login companions above."
msgstr "`playwright.spec.js` — orchestrator: TLS baseline, chruthú tionscadail, uaslódáil sócmhainní íomhá, agus `guest`/ Baile`biber`/ Baile`administrator` duine. An bhfuil `biber` / Baile `administrator` personas a dhearbhaítear bac trí `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (scáthán `web-app-taiga`): Penpot ar in-app \"OpenID\" Ní iontráil agus SPA úsáideoir-menu logout in thiomáint ag an cúntóir persona cineálach, mar sin tá an dá úsáideoirí' fíor auth fheidhmiú ag na companions logáil isteach tiomnaithe thuas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.version` in `meta/services.yml` is the single source of truth for the default Playwright version; the central `templates/package.json.j2` pins it via the `image_version` filter."
msgstr "`playwright.version` i `meta/services.yml` Is é an fhoinse amháin na fírinne don leagan Playwright réamhshocraithe; an lárnach `templates/package.json.j2` bioráin sé tríd an `image_version` scagaire."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`plg_system_keycloak` is built imperatively inside the Joomla container and speaks OIDC against Keycloak. Its enablement derives directly from the `sso` service flag, and its OIDC runtime contract (issuer, client id/secret, redirect/end-session URLs, fallback toggle, and RBAC group paths) lives under the addon's `config:` block, which [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) renders into the `JOOMLA_OIDC_*` plugin environment."
msgstr "`plg_system_keycloak` tógtha go mór taobh istigh den Joomla coimeádán agus labhraíonn OIDC i gcoinne Keycloak. Tagann a cumasú go díreach ó na `sso` bratach seirbhíse, agus a chonradh runtime OIDC (eisitheoir, id cliant/rúnaí, URLanna atreorú/deireadh-seisiún, scoránaigh ar ais, agus bealaí grúpa RBAC) saol faoi an addon ar `config:` bloc, a [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) a thabhairt isteach sa `JOOMLA_OIDC_*` timpeallacht breiseán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`port` (**optional**, MAY be omitted) — SSH/connection port for the target host."
msgstr "`port` (**roghnach**, MAY a fhágáil ar lár) — calafort SSH/connection don sprioc-óstach."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`port` reads `external` and `tls`."
msgstr "`port` léamha `external` agus `tls`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` and `ports.public` are **always** category-keyed maps, even when the map has only one entry. Polymorphic int-or-map values are NOT supported. The category names are: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, plus the structured `relay` block under `public:`."
msgstr "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` agus `ports.public` Tá siad **i gcónaí** léarscáileanna chatagóir-eochairithe, fiú nuair a bhíonn an léarscáil ach iontráil amháin. NÍ luachanna int-nó-léarscáil polaiméireacha tacaíocht. Is iad na hainmneacha catagóire: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, móide an struchtúrtha `relay` bloc faoi `public:`."

