# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`required` (optional) defaults to `false`. When `required: true`, the addon is part of the role's baseline install contract, is treated as enabled even when `enabled` is omitted, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. `required` also gates install-failure handling: a failed install of a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play; a failed install of a `required: false` addon MUST emit a warning, skip the addon, and continue."
msgstr "`required` (roghnach) riachtanais uisce: measartha `false`. Nuair a `required: true`, tá an addon mar chuid de chonradh suiteála bunlíne an róil, déileálfar leis mar a chumasaítear fiú nuair `enabled` ar lár, agus NACH MÓR atá leagtha `enabled: false`. `required` freisin geataí a shuiteáil-teilure láimhseáil: a theip shuiteáil ar `required: true` addon MUST crua-fail an dráma; theip shuiteáil ar `required: false` addon MUST astaíonn rabhadh, skip an addon, agus leanúint ar aghaidh."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`required` is True when some deployed app has the service with both `enabled: true` AND `shared: true`, directly or transitively through its own enabled service dependencies. This is the flag consumers should gate on when deciding whether to load, integrate with, or configure the service. A plain `enabled` flag is not enough on its own, because a service that is enabled but never shared with another app is not actually contractually required by anyone."
msgstr "`required` Is True nuair a bhíonn an tseirbhís le roinnt app imscaradh `enabled: true` agus `shared: true`, go díreach nó go huathoibríoch trína spleáchas seirbhíse cumasaithe féin. Is é seo ba chóir do thomhaltóirí bratach geata ar nuair a chinneadh cibé acu a luchtú, a chomhtháthú leis, nó a chumrú an tseirbhís. A plain `enabled` Níl bratach go leor ar a chuid féin, toisc nach bhfuil seirbhís atá cumasaithe ach riamh roinnte le app eile ag teastáil iarbhír conarthach ag duine ar bith."

