# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`skipped` counts as passed, so an empty chunk never blocks the chain. After fixing what broke a sweep, `resume_from_chunk` re-enters at that index instead of re-running the green chunks. Both are inputs on `entry-manual-steer.yml`; the other entry points take the defaults. A retrigger carries the source run's `chunk_gate` over unless `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` overrides it; the `i8ciallon` alias is `i8ciall` with that override, for sweeps that should report every chunk before anyone looks."
msgstr "`skipped` comhaireamh mar a rith, mar sin ní smután folamh bloic an slabhra. Tar éis a shocrú cad a bhris sweep, `resume_from_chunk` ath-iontráil ag an innéacs in ionad ath-reáchtáil na smután glas. Tá an dá ionchuir ar `entry-manual-steer.yml`; glacann na pointí iontrála eile na mainneachtainí. Déanann retrigger an reáchtáil foinse ar `chunk_gate` os a chionn mura rud é `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` overrides sé; an `i8ciallon` Is maith liom é `i8ciall` leis an override, do scuabadh ba chóir a thuairisciú gach smután sula Breathnaíonn duine ar bith."

