# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`variants=None` returns the plan unchanged (full-matrix mode). This is the runner-split entry point: a role with more variants than one runner should iterate is sliced into bundles (e.g. ``0,1,2`` on one runner and ``3,4`` on the next), each bundle passed as `variants`. Out-of-range indices raise `ValueError` so the caller surfaces a clean operator error."
msgstr "`variants=None` tuairisceáin an plean gan athrú (modh maitrís iomlán). Is é seo an dara háit-split pointe iontrála: ról le leaganacha níos mó ná mar ba chóir rádala amháin slisnithe i bundles (e.g. ``0,1,2`` ar rádala amháin agus ``3,4`` ar an chéad cheann eile), gach bundle a rith mar `variants`. Out-de-raoin innéacsanna ardú `ValueError` mar sin dromchlaí an glaoiteoir earráid oibreoir glan."

