msgid "`web-app-n8n` MUST be added as `direction: both` for the exact pinned 1.100.1 behavior: an SSE client and a Streamable HTTP server (`transport: streamable_http`, MCP Server Trigger typeVersion 2). The deployment MUST use the public credential and workflow APIs through a least-scope API key persisted by the normal token store."
msgstr "`web-app-n8n` MUST a chur leis mar `direction: both` do na pinned cruinn 1.100.1 iompar: cliant SSE agus freastalaí HTTP Streamable (`transport: streamable_http`, MCP Freastalaí Trigger cineál 2). Bainfidh an t-imscaradh MUST úsáid as na APIanna inchreidte agus insreabhadh oibre poiblí trí shampla ar a laghad API eochair fós ag an siopa dearbhán gnáth."

