# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil `mod_admin` HTTP Chomhéadain Is é an t-aon dromchla Playwright-tástáil; Ritheann XMPP cliant féin thar 5222/ Baile5269 agus MUST a fheidhmiú ag XMPP- cliant earraí lasmuigh den lúb tástála Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Is dromchla HTTP amháin ejabberd `ejabberd_web_admin` ar aghaidh `/admin` (féach ar [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Fíoraíonn sé JID lom i gcoinne LDAP thar HTTP Bunúsach, mar sin níl aon Keycloak athdhíriú a dhéanamh ar leanúint agus gan aon rialú logála isteach i bhfeidhm a cliceáil; Ritheann fíordheimhniú cliant féin thar calafoirt 5222/ Baile5269 agus fanann taobh amuigh den lúb Playwright, mar a thugtar faoi deara faoi Pointí Watch. `acl.admin` chomh maith liostaí ach an riarthóir JID, mar sin diúltaíonn an admin gréasáin gach cuntas eile outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) dá bhrí sin, dearbhaíonn `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` agus `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; an `guest` persona agus na dearbhuithe insroichte baseline reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP Chomhéadain Is é an t-aon dromchla Playwright-tástáil; Ritheann XMPP cliant féin thar 5222/ Baile5269 agus MUST a fheidhmiú ag XMPP- cliant earraí lasmuigh den lúb tástála Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Is dromchla HTTP amháin ejabberd ``ejabberd_web_admin`` ar aghaidh ``/admin`` (féach ar ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona agus na dearbhuithe insroichte baseline reáchtáil gan choinníoll."

