# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "one entry per (row, mode, tor) the run deploys, each stamped with the distro and filesystem its rotation drew, carrying the row's discovery ``id`` and the ``covered`` id of the earlier row that already embeds it (``0``: nothing does), so a reader of the plan can tell a redundant row from a unique one without a second query. A regular row yields exactly one -- the rotation picks its combination for this sweep. A priority row yields every combination :func:`combinations` allows, so the roles a run is told to prove are proven everywhere at once rather than sampled over four sweeps. ``disable`` carries the provider tokens the deploy drill switches off; a row without tor disables the provider so no dependency edge can pull it back into the closure. The provider's own rows therefore never take the clearnet state: disabling tor there would strip the app under test out of its own deploy."
msgstr "iontráil amháin in aghaidh an (sraith, modh, tor) an rith imscaradhs, gach stampáilte leis an distro agus córas comhaid tharraing a rothlú, ag iompar an tsraith fionnachtana ``id`` agus an ``covered`` id an tsraith níos luaithe a leabú cheana féin é (``0``: rud ar bith a dhéanann), mar sin is féidir le léitheoir an phlean a rá as a chéile iomarcach ó cheann uathúil gan an dara ceist. Tá toradh rialta ar a chéile go díreach - déanann an rothlú a mheascán don scuab seo. Táirgeann sraith tosaíochta gach teaglaim :func:`combinations` Ceadaíonn, mar sin tá na róil a reáchtáil in iúl a chruthú go bhfuil siad cruthaithe i ngach áit ag an am céanna seachas a sampled thar ceithre scuab. ``disable`` iompraíonn an soláthraí comharthaí an lasca druil imscaradh amach; as a chéile gan tor disables an soláthraí mar sin ní féidir aon imeall spleáchas a tharraingt ar ais isteach sa dúnadh. Ní ghlacann sraitheanna an tsoláthraí féin, dá bhrí sin, an stát glanta: bheadh an t-aip faoi thástáil as a imscaradh féin a dhíchumasú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "one entry per (row, pin) the selection asks for, each carrying ``pin_mode``, ``pin_tor``, ``pin_distro`` and ``pin_filesystem`` for :func:`utils.github.variant.axes.assign` to honour. Order is the query's -- a selection narrows what runs, it never re-ranks it."
msgstr "iontráil amháin in aghaidh an (a chéile, bioráin) Iarrann an roghnú le haghaidh, gach iompar ``pin_mode``, ``pin_tor``, ``pin_distro`` agus ``pin_filesystem`` le haghaidh :func:`utils.github.variant.axes.assign` chun onóir. Is Ordú an cheist ar - a roghnú caol cad a ritheann, sé riamh ath-ranganna sé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "one entry per (row, pin) the selection asks for, each carrying ``pin_mode``, ``pin_tor``, ``pin_distro`` and ``pin_filesystem`` for :func:`utils.github.variant.axes.assign` to honour. Order is the query's -- a selection narrows what runs, it never re-ranks it.  A row several tokens name is emitted once per token, which is the whole point of the axes: ``role#1@compose+tor role#1@swarm+tor`` is one variant that failed in two modes, and it has to come back as two deploys. Two tokens narrowing a row the same way collapse into one, so a duplicate in the input cannot become two jobs racing for one artifact name.  A bare role name loses to any token that narrows the same row: writing ``role role#1@swarm`` asks for a specific deploy, not for that deploy plus a rotation-picked one on top."
msgstr "iontráil amháin in aghaidh an (a chéile, bioráin) Iarrann an roghnú le haghaidh, gach iompar ``pin_mode``, ``pin_tor``, ``pin_distro`` agus ``pin_filesystem`` le haghaidh :func:`utils.github.variant.axes.assign` chun onóir. Is Ordú an cheist ar - a roghnú caol cad a ritheann, sé riamh ath-ranganna sé. Tá as a chéile roinnt comharthaí ainm astaítear uair amháin in aghaidh an chomhartha, a bhfuil an pointe iomlán de na haiseanna: ``role#1@compose+tor role#1@swarm+tor`` Is malairt amháin a theip ar dhá mhodh, agus tá sé le teacht ar ais mar dhá imscaradh. Dhá tokens caolú as a chéile ar an mbealach céanna titim isteach i amháin, mar sin ní féidir le dúblach san ionchur a bheith dhá rásaíocht poist le haghaidh ainm artifact amháin. Cailleann ainm róil lom le haon chomhartha a laghdaíonn an tsraith chéanna: scríobh ``role role#1@swarm`` Iarrann sé le haghaidh imscaradh ar leith, ní le haghaidh a imscaradh móide rothlú-roghnaithe amháin ar bharr."

